# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:183
msgid "Broderick's Two-handed Sword"
msgstr "Espada de Dos Manos de Broderick"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:183
msgid ""
"There is a myth of a great Holy Warrior named Broderick, who was charged by the gods to destroy the demon Nodens for them. With his mighty sword he destroyed the demon and presented the gods with the trophy of the demon's ugly head. The gods were so pleased they infused his weapon and armor with a little of their power to protect him. This is thought to be the very sword he used to kill the great beast. Usable by Crusader and Paladin only.  (Effects: +2 Blade, +2 Learning (+40 to hit with complete set))"
msgstr ""
"Existe un mito sobre un gran guerrero sagrado llamado Broderick, a quien los dioses encomendaron destruir al demonio Nodens. Con su poderosa espada destruyó al demonio y ofreció a los dioses como trofeo su horrenda cabeza. Los dioses quedaron tan complacidos que imbuyeron su arma y su armadura con un poco de su poder para protegerlo. Se cree que esta es la misma espada que usó para matar a la gran bestia. Uso exclusivo del Cruzado y del Paladín. (Efectos: +2 Hoja, +2 Aprendizaje (+40 a la puntería con el conjunto completo))"

