# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC1.rude:11
msgid "Good.  In my hand, I have your destiny."
msgstr "Bien. En mi mano tengo vuestro destino."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC1.rude:11 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC198.rude:1 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC3.rude:11
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC90.rude:2
msgctxt "said by the party"
msgid "Very well."
msgstr "Muy bien."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC1.rude:12
msgid "Alright.  We will get this prize for you."
msgstr "De acuerdo. Conseguiremos ese premio para ti."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC1.rude:12
msgid ""
"When you've given the prize to my daughter, you can return here.  I'm sure they will be ready for you by then.  Farewell."
msgstr ""
"Cuando le hayáis dado el premio a mi hija, podréis volver aquí. Seguro que para entonces estarán listos para vosotros. Adiós."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC1.rude:13
msgid "Alright, what do you need done?"
msgstr "De acuerdo, ¿qué hay que hacer?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC1.rude:13
msgid ""
"You must travel to the Thing in Thjorgard.  Once there, you must win the Dragon Prize by winning in all the games, and take it to my daughter Bikki in Thronheim."
msgstr ""
"Debéis viajar al Thing de Thjorgard. Una vez allí, debéis ganar el Premio del Dragón venciendo en todos los juegos, y llevárselo a mi hija Bikki, en Thronheim."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC1.rude:14
msgid "What?  We're a little busy right now."
msgstr "¿Qué? Ahora mismo estamos un poco ocupados."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC1.rude:14
msgid ""
"You are never too busy for me!  As I recall, you agreed to do anything for me at a time of my choosing.  These people here can deal with this!  This must be done NOW!!  Leave your friend Forad behind and get busy!!"
msgstr ""
"¡Nunca estáis demasiado ocupados para mí! Si no recuerdo mal, aceptasteis hacer cualquier cosa por mí en el momento que yo eligiera. ¡Esta gente de aquí puede ocuparse de esto! ¡¡Hay que hacerlo AHORA!! ¡¡Dejad aquí a vuestro amigo Forad y poneos manos a la obra!!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC1.rude:15
msgid ""
"Do they not teach history any longer?  Jevar the Bastard was the illegitimate son of the Old Ursanian Emperor Trandis.  Twenty-three years before the Great Cataclysm he declared himself the true Emperor and set out to destroy his father's empire."
msgstr ""
"¿Es que ya no se enseña historia? Jevar el Bastardo era el hijo ilegítimo del antiguo emperador ursanio Trandis. Veintitrés años antes del Gran Cataclismo, se proclamó a sí mismo verdadero emperador y se propuso destruir el imperio de su padre."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC1.rude:15
msgid "Who is Jevar the Bastard?"
msgstr "¿Quién es Jevar el Bastardo?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC1.rude:16
msgid "No one controls our destiny.  Goodbye."
msgstr "Nadie controla nuestro destino. Adiós."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC1.rude:17
msgid ""
"Five hundred years ago, the Dark Mage Verhoffin stood atop his tower on this very island, and cast a spell that rent destruction throughout most of the Ursanian Empire.  Most believe that is what destroyed the Ursanian Empire."
msgstr ""
"Hace quinientos años, el Mago Oscuro Verhoffin se alzó en lo alto de su torre, en esta misma isla, y lanzó un hechizo que sembró la destrucción en la mayor parte del Imperio Ursanio. La mayoría cree que eso fue lo que destruyó el Imperio Ursanio."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC1.rude:17
msgid "What is the Great Cataclysm?"
msgstr "¿Qué es el Gran Cataclismo?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC1.rude:18
msgid "No, I don't think you will.  Goodbye."
msgstr "No, no creo que lo hagáis. Adiós."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC1.rude:18
msgid "We'll find another way off the island."
msgstr "Encontraremos otra forma de salir de la isla."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC1.rude:19 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC1.rude:22
msgid "How do we get off this island?"
msgstr "¿Cómo salimos de esta isla?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC1.rude:19
msgid ""
"I will help you leave this island, but you must agree to do something for me at any time of my choosing."
msgstr ""
"Os ayudaré a salir de esta isla, pero debéis aceptar hacer algo por mí en el momento que yo elija."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC1.rude:2
msgid "You spoke of a destiny.  Is this our fate?"
msgstr "Hablaste de un destino. ¿Es ese nuestro sino?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC1.rude:2
msgid ""
"Your fate, is to unite the six clans of the Chedian.  Unite them and lead them against Tamur Leng.  If you cannot stop him, we are all doomed."
msgstr ""
"Vuestro destino es unir a los seis clanes de Chedian. Unidlos y guiadlos contra Tamur Leng. Si no podéis detenerlo, estamos todos perdidos."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC1.rude:20
msgid "We will not do this!  No one controls our destiny!"
msgstr "¡No lo haremos! ¡Nadie controla nuestro destino!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC1.rude:20
msgid ""
"Whether you accept this or not, it is your destiny.  Go now and meet it."
msgstr "Lo aceptéis o no, es vuestro destino. Id ahora a su encuentro."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC1.rude:21
msgid ""
"I will tell you that all in good time, and will be more than willing to help you.  First though, you will help me.  There is a group of dragonflies who have been pestering me to no end, just through that tunnel there.  Go through it and kill them."
msgstr ""
"Os lo diré todo a su debido tiempo, y estaré más que dispuesta a ayudaros. Pero antes me ayudaréis vosotros a mí. Hay un grupo de libélulas que no dejan de fastidiarme, justo al otro lado de ese túnel. Atravesadlo y matadlas."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC1.rude:22
msgid "Perhaps you should speak to Forad Darre."
msgstr "Quizá deberíais hablar con Forad Darre."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC1.rude:23
msgid "There is something you must do for me immediately!"
msgstr "¡Hay algo que debéis hacer por mí inmediatamente!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC1.rude:23
msgid "Yrsa?  What do you want?"
msgstr "¿Yrsa? ¿Qué quieres?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC1.rude:24
msgid ""
"Those are the Verhoffin Ruins!  That is the tower where Verhoffin himself cast the spell that caused the Great Cataclysm.  Don't go in there!  It's very bad in there!  Unless of course, you want to be killed!"
msgstr ""
"¡Esas son las Ruinas de Verhoffin! Esa es la torre donde el propio Verhoffin lanzó el hechizo que causó el Gran Cataclismo. ¡No entréis ahí! ¡Ahí dentro está muy mal la cosa! ¡A menos, claro, que queráis que os maten!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC1.rude:24 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC2.rude:24
msgid "What do you know about that big tower?"
msgstr "¿Qué sabes de esa gran torre?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC1.rude:25
msgid "Eh?  Oh right.  That door.  Here, try this."
msgstr "¿Eh? Ah, claro. Esa puerta. Tomad, probad con esto."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC1.rude:25
msgid "How do we through that door?"
msgstr "¿Cómo cruzamos esa puerta?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC1.rude:26 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC1.rude:27 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC10.rude:1
