msgctxt "said by the party"
msgid "Alright."
msgstr "De acuerdo."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC10.rude:2
msgid "Here you go.  Happy shopping!"
msgstr "Aquí tenéis. ¡Felices compras!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC10.rude:3 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC12.rude:2
msgid "Any other news?"
msgstr "¿Alguna otra noticia?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC10.rude:3
msgid "Nope.  Why don't you buy something?"
msgstr "No. ¿Por qué no compráis algo?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC10.rude:4
msgid "Alright.  Goodbye."
msgstr "De acuerdo. Adiós."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC10.rude:5
msgid "Anything else you can tell me about them?"
msgstr "¿Puedes contarme algo más sobre ellos?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC10.rude:5 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC10.rude:6
msgid ""
"If you're so interested, why don't you go ask a member?  They're more than happy to tell you all about themselves."
msgstr ""
"Si tanto os interesa, ¿por qué no se lo preguntáis a uno de ellos? Estarán encantados de contaros todo sobre sí mismos."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC10.rude:6
msgid "Very funny.  Anything else you can tell us about them?"
msgstr "Muy gracioso. ¿Puedes contarnos algo más sobre ellos?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC10.rude:7
msgid "Tell me more about them."
msgstr "Cuéntame más sobre ellos."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC10.rude:7
msgid ""
"They prefer to be called Honk Worshippers, or Honkers rather than Honkies.  I've seen them get right honked off when they're called that.  HAW! HAW!"
msgstr ""
"Prefieren que los llamen Adoradores de Honk, u honkeros, antes que honkis. Los he visto ponerse hechos unos gansos rabiosos cuando los llaman así. ¡JA! ¡JA!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC10.rude:8
msgid "Honkies?  Who are they?"
msgstr "¿Los honkis? ¿Quiénes son?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC10.rude:8
msgid ""
"They are worshippers of the Temple of Honk.  They worship something called The Great Honk."
msgstr ""
"Son los fieles del Templo de Honk. Adoran a algo llamado el Gran Honk."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC10.rude:9
msgid "Here ya go!  Pleasant shopping"
msgstr "¡Aquí tenéis! Que disfrutéis de las compras."

# machine translation (Claude), review
