# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC133.rude:9
msgid ""
"The Gathering?  Well I've only been coming here for ten years!  What do you think I know about it?  Everything, that's what!"
msgstr ""
"¿La Reunión? ¡Bueno, solo llevo diez años viniendo! ¿Qué creéis que sé de ella? ¡Todo, eso es lo que sé!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC133.rude:9 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC135.rude:5 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC150.rude:10
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC151.rude:4 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC168.rude:3
msgid "What do you know about the Gathering?"
msgstr "¿Qué sabéis de la Reunión?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC134.rude:2
msgid ""
"Nutty Nurtigan used to be our strongest warrior.  It's a shame he went crazy.  I don't know what we'll do if we get attacked."
msgstr ""
"Nurtigan el Chiflado era nuestro guerrero más fuerte. Es una pena que se volviera loco. No sé qué haremos si nos atacan."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC134.rude:3 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC134.rude:4
msgid "We'd like to see your weapons."
msgstr "Nos gustaría ver vuestras armas."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC134.rude:4 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC15.rude:9
msgid "Sorry, We're closed."
msgstr "Lo siento, está cerrado."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC134.rude:5
msgid ""
"Not much, I'm afraid.  Nutty Nurtigan was the one who was supposed to protect us.  But now he's so crazy, they had to put him away just to protect him from himself!"
msgstr ""
"Poco, me temo. Nurtigan el Chiflado era quien debía protegernos. ¡Pero ahora está tan loco que tuvieron que encerrarlo para protegerlo de sí mismo!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC134.rude:5
msgid "What do you know about defense?"
msgstr "¿Qué sabéis de la defensa?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC134.rude:8 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC135.rude:8 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC255.rude:8
