#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC314.rude:4 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC50.rude:12 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC54.rude:5
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC56.rude:10 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC98.rude:4
msgid "Sorry, we're closed."
msgstr "Lo siento, está cerrado."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC135.rude:5
msgid ""
"It's the place where the wizards gather on the beach.  They go there and often challenge each other to contests.  Did I tell you about the prize I won at Ivan the Smart's booth?"
msgstr ""
"Es el lugar donde se reúnen los magos, en la playa. Van allí y a menudo se retan unos a otros a concursos. ¿Os he contado lo del premio que gané en la caseta de Ivan el Listo?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC135.rude:6 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC148.rude:2
msgid "Very well.  Ask your questions."
msgstr "Muy bien. Haced vuestras preguntas."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC135.rude:7
msgid "Come back when you're ready to spend some money."
msgstr "Volved cuando estéis dispuestos a gastar algo de dinero."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC136.rude:2
msgid ""
"What do I think he was?  A Lich!!  They say he lived for almost three hundred years!  How else could he do that?"
msgstr ""
"¿Qué creo que era? ¡¡Un liche!! Dicen que vivió casi trescientos años. ¿De qué otro modo podría haberlo hecho?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC136.rude:2
msgid "What do you think he was?"
msgstr "¿Qué creéis que era?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC136.rude:3
msgid ""
"I've heard that Verhoffin left a diary behind after the caused the Great Cataclysm.  What I wouldn't give to have that in my shop!"
msgstr ""
"He oído que Verhoffin dejó un diario después de causar el Gran Cataclismo. ¡Lo que daría por tenerlo en mi tienda!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC136.rude:4
msgid "Wonderful!  Have a look."
msgstr "¡Maravilloso! Echad un vistazo."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC136.rude:6
msgid ""
"He was one of the most powerful mages of all time.  He single handedly kept the Ursanian Empire at bay for years!  But if you want to know what I think, I think he wasn't a mage at all."
msgstr ""
"Fue uno de los magos más poderosos de todos los tiempos. ¡Él solo mantuvo a raya al Imperio de Ursana durante años! Pero si queréis saber lo que pienso, creo que no era un mago en absoluto."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC136.rude:6 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC44.rude:12 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC55.rude:30
msgid "What do you know about Verhoffin?"
msgstr "¿Qué sabéis de Verhoffin?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC136.rude:8
msgid "Maybe next time you could buy something."
msgstr "Quizá la próxima vez podáis comprar algo."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC136.rude:9 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC137.rude:8 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/TOPBLURB.rude:349
msgid "Have a look around."
msgstr "Echad un vistazo."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC137.rude:2
msgid ""
"I hear the Dook is recruiting soldiers into his army.  I've been thinking of selling my shop and joining!  He couldn't be half as bad as Markel is!"
msgstr ""
"He oído que el Dook está reclutando soldados para su ejército. ¡He estado pensando en vender mi tienda y alistarme! ¡No puede ser ni la mitad de malo que Markel!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC137.rude:3
msgid "Great.  Have a look."
msgstr "Estupendo. Echad un vistazo."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC137.rude:5
msgid ""
"That monkeyface?  I think he's probably the worst ruler we have had in a long time.  Maybe if he spent his time trying to improve Guberland's reputation instead of his own, we might be as prominent as Thjorgard!"
msgstr ""
"¿Ese cara de mono? Creo que probablemente es el peor gobernante que hemos tenido en mucho tiempo. ¡Si dedicara su tiempo a mejorar la reputación de Guberland en lugar de la suya propia, quizá seríamos tan importantes como Thjorgard!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC137.rude:5 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC3.rude:26
msgid "What do you know about Markel the Great?"
msgstr "¿Qué sabéis de Markel el Grande?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC137.rude:7
msgid "Come back when you're ready to buy something."
msgstr "Volved cuando estéis dispuestos a comprar algo."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC138.rude:2
msgid ""
"I spend too much of my time swabbing my decks at night.  I never get enough sleep!"
msgstr ""
"Paso demasiado tiempo fregando mis cubiertas por la noche. ¡Nunca duermo lo suficiente!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC138.rude:3
msgid "Alright!"
msgstr "¡Muy bien!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC138.rude:3
msgid "We'd like passage."
msgstr "Queremos un pasaje."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC138.rude:4
msgid ""
"I've been thinking about retiring there.  I've heard they are very poor there.  With all the money I have here, I'd be a king!"
msgstr ""
"He estado pensando en retirarme allí. He oído que allí son muy pobres. ¡Con todo el dinero que tengo aquí, sería un rey!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC138.rude:6
msgid "Come back when you have some money you're willing to spend."
msgstr "Volved cuando tengáis algo de dinero que estéis dispuestos a gastar."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC138.rude:7 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/TOPBLURB.rude:103 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/TOPBLURB.rude:209
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/TOPBLURB.rude:257
msgid "Looking for passage?"
msgstr "¿Buscáis pasaje?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC139.rude:2
msgid "I Haven't been out lately.  Why?  Is there any news I should know?"
msgstr ""
"Últimamente no he salido. ¿Por qué? ¿Hay alguna noticia que deba saber?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC139.rude:3
msgid "Very well.  Have a look."
msgstr "Muy bien. Echad un vistazo."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC139.rude:5
msgid ""
"How dare you say that name in my shop!!  He is called the Meddler.  He is the thorn in the side of all the gods.  It is said that one day he will bind Krohn.  When that happens, the Day of Reckoning will be at hand."
msgstr ""
"¡¡Cómo os atrevéis a pronunciar ese nombre en mi tienda!! Lo llaman el Entrometido. Es la espina clavada en el costado de todos los dioses. Se dice que un día atará a Krohn. Cuando eso ocurra, el Día del Ajuste de Cuentas estará cerca."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC139.rude:5 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC207.rude:5
msgid "What do you know about Njam?"
msgstr "¿Qué sabéis de Njam?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC139.rude:6
msgid "Perhaps you'd like to buy something?"
msgstr "¿Quizá queráis comprar algo?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC139.rude:8 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC314.rude:7
msgid "Cheapskate!"
msgstr "¡Tacaños!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC14.rude:1
msgid "Then why tell us?"
msgstr "Entonces, ¿por qué nos lo contáis?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC14.rude:1
msgid ""
"You look the sort of people who would believe such things.  Perhaps you should have a drink?"
msgstr ""
"Parecéis la clase de gente que se cree esas cosas. ¿Quizá deberíais tomar un trago?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC14.rude:2
msgid ""
"Nothing.  He looked quite taken with madness. I wouldn't pay much heed to the words of a madman."
msgstr ""
"Nada. Parecía presa de la locura. Yo no haría mucho caso a las palabras de un loco."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC14.rude:2
msgid "What else did he say?"
msgstr "¿Qué más dijo?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC14.rude:3
msgid ""
"He was Framish.  He said he saw an army large enough to swallow the world crossing the borders into Framon."
msgstr ""
"Era de Framon. Dijo que había visto un ejército lo bastante grande para tragarse el mundo cruzando las fronteras de Framon."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC14.rude:3
msgid "Who was he?"
msgstr "¿Quién era?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC14.rude:4 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC141.rude:7 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC184.rude:4
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC57.rude:19 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC57.rude:6
msgid "We'd like to do business."
msgstr "Nos gustaría hacer negocios."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC14.rude:5
msgid "Do you have any special advice?"
msgstr "¿Tenéis algún consejo especial?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC14.rude:5
msgid ""
"Shhhh!  If you're looking to train up, or buy some items a little cheaper than most places around here, head upstairs.  Don't tell anyone though!  If Sven found out, we'd be finished for sure!!"
msgstr ""
"¡Chsss! Si queréis entrenar, o comprar objetos un poco más baratos que en casi cualquier otro sitio de por aquí, subid al piso de arriba. ¡Pero no se lo digáis a nadie! ¡Si Sven se enterara, estaríamos acabados!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC14.rude:6
msgid ""
"A man came through here the other day preaching death and destruction."
msgstr ""
"El otro día pasó por aquí un hombre predicando la muerte y la destrucción."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC14.rude:6
msgid "Any news?"
msgstr "¿Alguna noticia?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC14.rude:7 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC25.rude:3 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC70.rude:1
msgid "Sorry.  Goodbye."
msgstr "Lo siento. Adiós."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC140.rude:10 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC56.rude:11
msgid "Would you like to do some banking?"
msgstr "¿Queréis hacer alguna operación bancaria?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC140.rude:2
msgid ""
"I've heard of these things called Orbs of Linking.  They would link my safety deposit boxes to all the banks across Chedian.  I sure wish I had one of those!"
msgstr ""
"He oído hablar de unas cosas llamadas Orbes de Enlace. Enlazarían mis cajas de seguridad con todos los bancos de Chedian. ¡Cómo me gustaría tener uno!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC140.rude:5
msgid ""
"I wish I knew where one was!  They were made during the Old Ursanian Empire.  I've heard that they were in some magical storehouse somewhere."
msgstr ""
"¡Ojalá supiera dónde hay uno! Se fabricaron en tiempos del Antiguo Imperio de Ursana. He oído que estaban en algún almacén mágico, en alguna parte."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC140.rude:5
msgid "What do you know about the Orb of Linking?"
msgstr "¿Qué sabéis del Orbe de Enlace?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC140.rude:7
msgid ""
"An Orb of Linking!  Of course you can install it, but I have to watch!"
msgstr ""
"¡Un Orbe de Enlace! Claro que podéis instalarlo, ¡pero tengo que verlo!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC140.rude:7
msgid "We have an Orb of Linking we'd like to install."
msgstr "Tenemos un Orbe de Enlace que nos gustaría instalar."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC140.rude:8
msgid "I don't have much time.  Ask your questions, but be quick about it."
msgstr "No tengo mucho tiempo. Haced vuestras preguntas, pero rápido."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC140.rude:9 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC243.rude:14
msgid "How are the Orbs of Linking working out?"
msgstr "¿Qué tal funcionan los Orbes de Enlace?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC140.rude:9
msgid "Wonderful!  Thank you!"
msgstr "¡De maravilla! ¡Gracias!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC141.rude:1
msgid "Yes.  No if you don't mind, I've got other customers to attend to."
msgstr "Sí. Y ahora, si no os importa, tengo otros clientes que atender."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC141.rude:1
msgid "You're sure?"
msgstr "¿Estáis seguro?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC141.rude:10
msgid "Oh!  Well in that case, I don't want to buy any.  Sorry."
msgstr "¡Oh! Bueno, en ese caso no quiero comprar ninguna. Lo siento."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC141.rude:10
msgid "Uh, no.  It was made by his apprentices."
msgstr "Eh, no. La hicieron sus aprendices."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC141.rude:11
msgid "Is that so?  And what makes you think that I want to buy your beer?"
msgstr "¿De veras? ¿Y qué os hace pensar que quiero comprar vuestra cerveza?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC141.rude:11
msgid "We have some beer we'd like to sell."
msgstr "Tenemos cerveza que nos gustaría vender."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC141.rude:12
msgid ""
"It's the place where I grew up!  My father used to say that we were actually descended from Ursanian Nobility.  Wouldn't that be great if it were true?  I could have been an emperor!"
msgstr ""
"¡Es el lugar donde me crie! Mi padre solía decir que en realidad descendíamos de la nobleza de Ursana. ¿No sería estupendo que fuera cierto? ¡Podría haber sido emperador!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC141.rude:12 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC66.rude:9
msgid "What do you know about Chedian?"
msgstr "¿Qué sabéis de Chedian?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC141.rude:15
msgid "Maybe you'd like to buy a drink?"
msgstr "¿Quizá queráis tomar un trago?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC141.rude:3
msgid "It's a deal then.  Thanks for doing business."
msgstr "Trato hecho, entonces. Gracias por hacer negocios conmigo."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC141.rude:3
msgid "Sounds good."
msgstr "Nos parece bien."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC141.rude:4
msgid "Er,..Yes."
msgstr "Eh... sí."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC141.rude:4
msgid ""
"In that case, I would be happy to purchase it from you!  Say 500 gold?"
msgstr "En ese caso, ¡estaré encantado de comprárosla! ¿Digamos 500 de oro?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC141.rude:5
msgid ""
"From Frosgard?  You mean it was made by the legendary Brewmaster Smith?"
msgstr ""
"¿De Frosgard? ¿Queréis decir que la hizo el legendario maestro cervecero Smith?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC141.rude:5 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC141.rude:8
msgid "It's a special brew from Frosgard."
msgstr "Es una cerveza especial de Frosgard."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC141.rude:6
msgid ""
"This is the place for news, that's for sure!  I've been looking for a new brew to try!  My clientele grow tired of my same old brews.  It would be wonderful if I could find something new to serve to them!"
msgstr ""
"Este es el sitio para las noticias, ¡eso seguro! ¡Llevo tiempo buscando una cerveza nueva que probar! Mi clientela se cansa de mis cervezas de siempre. ¡Sería maravilloso encontrar algo nuevo que servirles!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC141.rude:7 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC142.rude:9 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC184.rude:4
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC204.rude:2 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC207.rude:3 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC243.rude:2
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC248.rude:3 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC249.rude:3 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC250.rude:2
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC251.rude:2 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC256.rude:2 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC261.rude:7
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC306.rude:2 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC339.rude:10 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC339.rude:12
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC340.rude:2 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC341.rude:2 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC342.rude:2
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC57.rude:6 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC92.rude:4
msgid "Of course!"
msgstr "¡Por supuesto!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC141.rude:8
msgid ""
"You're not going to fool me.  I know you're trying to sell that same beer you were selling last time you were in here.  Now if you don't mind, I've got other customers."
msgstr ""
"No vais a engañarme. Sé que intentáis venderme la misma cerveza que vendíais la última vez que estuvisteis aquí. Y ahora, si no os importa, tengo otros clientes."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC141.rude:9
msgid "That's not enough."
msgstr "No es suficiente."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC141.rude:9
msgid "Well that's all I'm going to offer.  Take it or leave it."
msgstr "Pues es todo lo que voy a ofrecer. Lo tomáis o lo dejáis."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC142.rude:11
msgid ""
"Ah, so you did.  Come back in two hours, and I'll have the potion for you."
msgstr ""
"Ah, así es. Volved dentro de dos horas y tendré la poción para vosotros."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC142.rude:11
msgid "We've got a lock of the hag's hair."
msgstr "Tenemos un mechón del pelo de la bruja."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC142.rude:12
msgid "We've returned for the potion."
msgstr "Hemos vuelto a por la poción."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC142.rude:12
msgid ""
"Yes, here it is.  Just go use it on Nutty Nurtigan, and he should be good as new!"
msgstr ""
"Sí, aquí está. Id a usarla con Nurtigan el Chiflado, ¡y debería quedar como nuevo!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC142.rude:2
msgid ""
"If all goes well, I should be thanking you.  He's our strongest warrior, and we've been very vulnerable since he went crazy."
msgstr ""
"Si todo sale bien, debería ser yo quien os diera las gracias. Es nuestro guerrero más fuerte, y hemos estado muy indefensos desde que se volvió loco."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC142.rude:3
msgid "Don't thank me yet, we're still not sure it will work."
msgstr "No nos deis las gracias todavía; aún no sabemos si funcionará."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC142.rude:4
msgid ""
"That poor man in the pillory.  He's gone crazy, and there's nothing I can do to heal him."
msgstr ""
"Ese pobre hombre de la picota. Se ha vuelto loco y no puedo hacer nada para curarlo."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC142.rude:5
msgid "I hear she lives in a cave somewhere along the beach."
msgstr "He oído que vive en una cueva, en algún lugar de la playa."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC142.rude:5
msgid "It will be done.  Where can we find the Old Hag?"
msgstr "Así se hará. ¿Dónde podemos encontrar a la Vieja Bruja?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC142.rude:6
msgid ""
"I could have made a potion to cure him already, but I need a lock from the Old Hag's head.  If you can bring me that, I will give you the potion for free."
msgstr ""
"Ya podría haber preparado una poción para curarlo, pero necesito un mechón de la cabeza de la Vieja Bruja. Si me lo traéis, os daré la poción gratis."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC142.rude:6
msgid "We need a way to cure him. Tjolnir told us you might help."
msgstr ""
"Necesitamos una forma de curarlo. Tjolnir nos dijo que quizá podríais ayudar."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC142.rude:7
msgid "Ah yes, the crazy old soldier in the Idiot's Box.  What about him?"
msgstr ""
"Ah, sí, el viejo soldado loco de la Caja del Idiota. ¿Qué pasa con él?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC142.rude:7
msgid "We've come to speak to you about Nutty Nurtigan."
msgstr "Venimos a hablaros de Nurtigan el Chiflado."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC142.rude:8
msgid "What do you know about potions?"
msgstr "¿Qué sabéis de las pociones?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC142.rude:8
msgid ""
"You want to stay alive?  Get yourself a bunch of them.  They'll come in handy more often than you think!"
msgstr ""
"¿Queréis seguir con vida? Haceos con un buen puñado. ¡Os serán útiles más a menudo de lo que creéis!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC142.rude:10 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC142.rude:9 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC249.rude:3
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC249.rude:4 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC250.rude:2
msgid "We would like to see your wares."
msgstr "Nos gustaría ver vuestra mercancía."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC143.rude:1
msgid ""
"I'm afraid not.  I spend most of my time in worship, not at the tavern."
msgstr ""
"Me temo que no. Paso la mayor parte del tiempo rezando, no en la taberna."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC143.rude:2
msgid "We need healing."
msgstr "Necesitamos curación."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC143.rude:3
msgid ""
"The first temples in this area were dedicated to Igdrasa.  She was the nature goddess of earlier times.  There are still a few shrines dedicated to her scattered around Rysh."
msgstr ""
"Los primeros templos de esta zona estaban dedicados a Igdrasa. Era la diosa de la naturaleza de tiempos antiguos. Todavía quedan algunos santuarios dedicados a ella repartidos por Rysh."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC143.rude:4
msgid "The blessings of Fre upon you!"
msgstr "¡Que las bendiciones de Fre os acompañen!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC143.rude:4 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC208.rude:4 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC256.rude:4
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC348.rude:4
msgid "We'd like to make a donation."
msgstr "Nos gustaría hacer un donativo."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC143.rude:5 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC87.rude:17
msgid "Is there anything else I can help you with?"
msgstr "¿Puedo ayudaros en algo más?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC143.rude:6
msgid "I will try to answer your questions."
msgstr "Intentaré responder a vuestras preguntas."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC143.rude:7
msgid "Have a care, children.  It is a dangerous world out there."
msgstr "Tened cuidado, hijos. Ahí fuera el mundo es peligroso."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC144.rude:1
msgid ""
"The people in Lachmon Cove are infected with some sort of plague!  The last thing I wanted to do was to catch it!  Besides, if I stayed any longer, I could have brought it back here!"
msgstr ""
"¡La gente de la Cala de Lachmon está infectada con algún tipo de plaga! ¡Lo último que quería era contagiarme! Además, si me hubiera quedado más tiempo, ¡podría haberla traído hasta aquí!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC144.rude:1
msgid "Why did you leave so quickly?"
msgstr "¿Por qué os fuisteis tan deprisa?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC144.rude:2
msgid ""
"I hear one of my comrade-in-arms was attacked by pirates on his way to Frosgard.  He survived, but he had to dump his cargo to stop his boat from sinking!"
msgstr ""
"He oído que atacaron a uno de mis compañeros de armas unos piratas cuando iba camino de Frosgard. Sobrevivió, pero tuvo que tirar su carga por la borda para que su barco no se hundiera."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC144.rude:3
msgid "All aboard!"
msgstr "¡Todos a bordo!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC144.rude:3
msgid "I think we shall be traveling with you today."
msgstr "Creo que hoy viajaremos con vos."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC144.rude:5
msgid ""
"I've been in port there a few times.  The last time I was there, I left as quick as the easterly winds could take me!"
msgstr ""
"He atracado allí unas cuantas veces. ¡La última vez que estuve, me marché tan rápido como me lo permitieron los vientos del este!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC144.rude:6 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC144.rude:8
msgid "I'll be here for a spell, yet, if you change your mind."
msgstr "Seguiré por aquí un rato, por si cambiáis de opinión."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC144.rude:7
msgid "Only if you promise to buy me a drink the next time I'm in port."
msgstr ""
"Solo si prometéis invitarme a un trago la próxima vez que esté en puerto."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC144.rude:8
msgid "Maybe another time."
msgstr "Quizá en otra ocasión."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC145.rude:1
msgid ""
"Well, I heard that Markel is planning some sort of festival soon.  He'd better hurry up with it!  I think some of the people around here are starting to dislike him!"
msgstr ""
"Bueno, he oído que Markel está planeando algún tipo de festival dentro de poco. ¡Más le vale darse prisa! ¡Creo que a algunos de por aquí empieza a no caerles bien!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC145.rude:11
msgid "You can find the weapon shop in the southwestern section of town."
msgstr "La tienda de armas está en la parte suroeste de la ciudad."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC145.rude:15 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC147.rude:1 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC246.rude:6
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC88.rude:7
msgid "Very well"
msgstr "Muy bien."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC145.rude:19
msgid "The tavern is in the northwestern section of town."
msgstr "La taberna está en la parte noroeste de la ciudad."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC145.rude:20
msgid ""
"The Jarls are the clan leaders for each clan.  Ours is Markel Gusmundssen.  He calls himself Markel the Great all the time, but I don't really think he's that special."
msgstr ""
"Los jarls son los jefes de cada clan. El nuestro es Markel Gusmundssen. Siempre se hace llamar Markel el Grande, pero yo no creo que sea tan especial."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC145.rude:20
msgid "What do you know about the Jarls?"
msgstr "¿Qué sabéis de los jarls?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC145.rude:22
msgid "You can find the armor shop in the southwestern section of town."
msgstr "La tienda de armaduras está en la parte suroeste de la ciudad."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC145.rude:27
msgid "The magic shop is in the northeastern section of town."
msgstr "La tienda de magia está en la parte noreste de la ciudad."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC145.rude:28
msgid "Not especially."
msgstr "No especialmente."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC145.rude:30
msgid "The temple is in the northwestern section of town, near the tavern."
msgstr ""
"El templo está en la parte noroeste de la ciudad, cerca de la taberna."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC145.rude:33
msgid "The apothecary is in the southeastern section of town."
msgstr "El apotecario está en la parte sureste de la ciudad."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC145.rude:33 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC19.rude:36 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC210.rude:32
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC258.rude:32
msgid "The apothecary."
msgstr "El apotecario."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC145.rude:35
msgid "The training hall is in the sothern section of town."
msgstr "La sala de entrenamiento está en la parte sur de la ciudad."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC145.rude:39 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC61.rude:49
msgid "Go through the northern gates to find the dock."
msgstr "Cruzad las puertas del norte para llegar al muelle."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC145.rude:44
msgid "The library is in the southeastern section of town."
msgstr "La biblioteca está en la parte sureste de la ciudad."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC145.rude:44 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC19.rude:43 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC210.rude:43
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC258.rude:43 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC61.rude:52
msgid "The library."
msgstr "La biblioteca."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC145.rude:5
msgid "The bank is in the northeastern section of town."
msgstr "El banco está en la parte noreste de la ciudad."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC145.rude:7
msgid "You can find Markel the Great in the room behind me."
msgstr "Encontraréis a Markel el Grande en la sala que hay detrás de mí."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC146.rude:2 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC20.rude:4
msgid "I am a librarian.  I don't deal in rumors."
msgstr "Soy bibliotecario. No trafico con rumores."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC146.rude:3 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC146.rude:4
msgid "We'd like to look at your books."
msgstr "Nos gustaría ver vuestros libros."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC146.rude:5
msgid ""
"If you want to learn a skill, buy the books from me.  I have books that teach  all sorts of skills."
msgstr ""
"Si queréis aprender una habilidad, compradme los libros. Tengo libros que enseñan toda clase de habilidades."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC146.rude:5
msgid "What do you know about skills?"
msgstr "¿Qué sabéis de las habilidades?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC146.rude:6
msgid "I am very busy, but I have a few moments."
msgstr "Estoy muy ocupado, pero tengo unos momentos."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC147.rude:2
msgid "Sorry.  I don't have time for that."
msgstr "Lo siento. No tengo tiempo para eso."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC148.rude:3 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC148.rude:5
msgid "See that you don't do it again."
msgstr "Procurad no volver a hacerlo."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC148.rude:4
msgid ""
"I can tell you this much, They never conquered Chedian, that's for sure!"
msgstr "Os puedo decir esto: nunca conquistaron Chedian, ¡eso seguro!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC148.rude:4 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC149.rude:3 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC158.rude:3
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC160.rude:3 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC175.rude:3 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC85.rude:10
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC86.rude:10
msgid "What do you know about the Ursanian Empire?"
msgstr "¿Qué sabéis del Imperio de Ursana?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC149.rude:2
msgid "Well you've interrupted me already.  Might as well."
msgstr "Bueno, ya me habéis interrumpido. Qué más da."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC149.rude:3
msgid ""
"More than that monkey brain Muata, that's for sure!  He doesn't think that Chedian was ever conquered by the Ursanian Empire.  I don't understand how he can believe that!  The evidence is all around us!"
msgstr ""
"¡Más que ese cerebro de mono de Muata, eso seguro! Él cree que el Imperio de Ursana nunca conquistó Chedian. ¡No entiendo cómo puede creer eso! ¡Las pruebas están por todas partes!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC15.rude:10
msgid ""
"A Sil?  That's the clans within the Great Clans.  In the days before the Great Cataclysm, each Clan had a hundred Sils.  These days most clans have fewer than five.  Some have none.  Poor Devils."
msgstr ""
"¿Un Sil? Son los clanes que hay dentro de los Grandes Clanes. Antes del Gran Cataclismo, cada Clan tenía cien Sils. Hoy en día la mayoría de los clanes tienen menos de cinco. Algunos no tienen ninguno. Pobres diablos."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC15.rude:10
msgid "What is a Sil?"
msgstr "¿Qué es un Sil?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC15.rude:11
msgid "Destinies have a way of coming true."
msgstr "Los destinos suelen acabar cumpliéndose."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC15.rude:11
msgid ""
"If you say so.  Personally I don't believe in them.  Would you like to buy something?"
msgstr "Si vos lo decís. Yo no creo en ellos. ¿Queréis comprar algo?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC15.rude:12
msgid ""
"The Prophecy of the Elves, of course!  The great Elvish prophet Mairearad de Sitheag A'Tryht a'greatbow said the A'Rikdun Clan would carry the elves out of oppression."
msgstr ""
"¡La Profecía de los Elfos, por supuesto! El gran profeta élfico Mairearad de Sitheag A'Tryht a'greatbow dijo que el Clan A'Rikdun liberaría a los elfos de la opresión."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC15.rude:12
msgid "What Prophecy?"
msgstr "¿Qué profecía?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC15.rude:13
msgid ""
"My mother used to tell me stories of the lost 14th clan of the Elves.  How they survived the Great Cataclysm by moving south.  She said they had to have survived.  The Prophecy depends on them."
msgstr ""
"Mi madre me contaba historias del clan perdido de los elfos, el decimocuarto. De cómo sobrevivieron al Gran Cataclismo trasladándose al sur. Decía que tenían que haber sobrevivido. La Profecía depende de ellos."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC15.rude:2 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC50.rude:15
msgid "Perhaps you would like to buy something?"
msgstr "¿Quizá queráis comprar algo?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC15.rude:2
msgid "That is very interesting."
msgstr "Muy interesante."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC15.rude:3
msgid ""
"That's their First Name and their Clan.  Take me for instance.  My Regal Name is Muiredach de Cicilia A'Lanth a'relti.  But I usually only go by my Common Name, Muiredach A'Lanth"
msgstr ""
"Es su nombre de pila y su Clan. Mirad mi caso. Mi Nombre Regio es Muiredach de Cicilia A'Lanth a'relti. Pero normalmente solo uso mi Nombre Común, Muiredach A'Lanth."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC15.rude:3
msgid "What is a Common Name?"
msgstr "¿Qué es un Nombre Común?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC15.rude:4
msgid ""
"Oh!  That's her Regal Name.  All elves with traditional names have names like that.  All it means is that Mairearad was born to Sitheag, and is a member of the A'Tryht Clan, and the a'greatbow Sil.  Most Elves go by their Common Name."
msgstr ""
"¡Oh! Ese es su Nombre Regio. Todos los elfos con nombres tradicionales tienen nombres así. Solo significa que Mairearad es hijo de Sitheag y miembro del Clan A'Tryht y del Sil a'greatbow. La mayoría de los elfos usan su Nombre Común."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC15.rude:4
msgid "That's some name."
msgstr "Menudo nombre."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC15.rude:5
msgid "Krohn willing, they will.  Perhaps you would like to buy something?"
msgstr "Si Krohn quiere, así será. ¿Quizá queráis comprar algo?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC15.rude:5
msgid "Perhaps they will be found someday."
msgstr "Quizá algún día los encuentren."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC15.rude:6
msgid "Of course they survived."
msgstr "Claro que sobrevivieron."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC15.rude:6
msgid ""
"We don't know that.  Even if they did survive, I wonder if they know there are other elven clans."
msgstr ""
"Eso no lo sabemos. Incluso si sobrevivieron, me pregunto si sabrán que existen otros clanes élficos."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC15.rude:7
msgid "The Lost Clan?"
msgstr "¿El Clan Perdido?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC15.rude:7
msgid ""
"Yes.  The A'Rikdun Clan.  They were one of the most prominent clans before the Great Cataclysm.  After the Great Cataclysm, people said they fled to the south.  I wonder if they ever lived.  Poor souls."
msgstr ""
"Sí. El Clan A'Rikdun. Era uno de los clanes más destacados antes del Gran Cataclismo. Después del Gran Cataclismo, se dijo que huyeron al sur. Me pregunto si llegaron a sobrevivir. Pobres almas."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC15.rude:8 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC15.rude:9
msgid "Perhaps.  We would like to see your wares."
msgstr "Quizá. Nos gustaría ver vuestra mercancía."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC150.rude:1
msgid ""
"Oh, uhh, I guess you don't want to hear any more about my game.  Did you want to talk about something else?"
msgstr ""
"Oh, eh, supongo que no queréis oír nada más sobre mi juego. ¿Queríais hablar de otra cosa?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC150.rude:1
msgid "SHUT UP!"
msgstr "¡CÁLLATE!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC150.rude:10
msgid ""
"Those people think they know everything!  I told one of them about my game idea, and he said it was stupid!  Can you believe that?  He though MY idea was stupid.  Like his was any better!"
msgstr ""
"¡Esa gente se cree que lo sabe todo! Le conté a uno mi idea para un juego, ¡y me dijo que era estúpida! ¿Os lo podéis creer? ¡Pensaba que MI idea era estúpida! ¡Como si la suya fuera mejor!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC150.rude:12
msgid "Hey, no problem!  Any time!"
msgstr "¡Eh, no hay problema! ¡Cuando queráis!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC150.rude:2
msgid "We don't really have time for this."
msgstr "La verdad es que no tenemos tiempo para esto."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC150.rude:2
msgid ""
"When your piece gets on the same square as another piece, combat begins.  That's where the real fun begins.  You know why?  Because you and the other players can act out the real combat to decide who wins!  Isn't that cool?.."
msgstr ""
"Cuando vuestra ficha cae en la misma casilla que otra ficha, empieza el combate. Ahí es donde empieza la verdadera diversión. ¿Sabéis por qué? ¡Porque vosotros y los demás jugadores podéis representar el combate de verdad para decidir quién gana! ¿A que es genial?..."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC150.rude:3
msgid "Ummm, is that so?"
msgstr "Eh... ¿de veras?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC150.rude:3
msgid ""
"Yeah.  And they don't ever think I know what I'm talking about.  It's ridiculous!  Those idiots!  Anyway, back to the game.  The goal is to collect more Thjorad than anyone else in the game.  You do that by moving your pieces around the board."
msgstr ""
"Sí. Y nunca creen que sé de lo que hablo. ¡Es ridículo! ¡Esos idiotas! En fin, volvamos al juego. El objetivo es reunir más Thjorad que nadie en la partida. Se consigue moviendo las fichas por el tablero."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC150.rude:4
msgid "Then what?"
msgstr "¿Y luego qué?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC150.rude:4
msgid ""
"Then you get to pick your game piece.  It can be a sword, an axe, or a rock.  The rock is my favorite.  You know why?  Because it's not stupid like those other games.  You know, like the ones at the gathering?  Those are ridiculous."
msgstr ""
"Luego eliges tu ficha. Puede ser una espada, un hacha o una piedra. La piedra es mi favorita. ¿Sabéis por qué? Porque no es estúpida como esos otros juegos. Ya sabéis, como los de la Reunión. Esos son ridículos."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC150.rude:5
msgid "Are you sure?  It's a great idea!"
msgstr "¿Estáis seguros? ¡Es una idea genial!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC150.rude:5
msgid "Umm, no thanks."
msgstr "Eh, no, gracias."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC150.rude:6
msgid ""
"Of course I do!  Why I've been working on this design for a board game for fifteen years!  Would you like to hear about it?"
msgstr ""
"¡Claro que sí! ¡Llevo quince años trabajando en el diseño de este juego de tablero! ¿Queréis que os lo cuente?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC150.rude:7
msgid "Fire away!"
msgstr "¡Adelante!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC150.rude:8
msgid ""
"Yeah.  And they don't ever think I know what I'm talking about.   It's ridiculous!  Those idiots!    Anyway, back to the game.  The goal is to collect more Thjorad than anyone else in the game.  You do that by moving your pieces around the board."
msgstr ""
"Sí. Y nunca creen que sé de lo que hablo. ¡Es ridículo! ¡Esos idiotas! En fin, volvamos al juego. El objetivo es reunir más Thjorad que nadie en la partida. Se consigue moviendo las fichas por el tablero."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC150.rude:8
msgid "You know, we're kind of busy."
msgstr "Veréis, estamos algo ocupados."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC150.rude:9
msgid ""
"Okay, so it starts out at the beginning, where you get to pick the player you want to play.  You can either be A Framon, who aren't very good, a Thjorgardian who are the worst, a Guberlandian, who are the best, an elf, or a dragon."
msgstr ""
"Bueno, todo empieza al principio, cuando elegís el personaje con el que queréis jugar. Podéis ser uno de Framon, que no son muy buenos, uno de Thjorgard, que son los peores, uno de Guberland, que son los mejores, un elfo o un dragón."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC150.rude:9
msgid "Sure, go ahead."
msgstr "Claro, adelante."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC151.rude:1
msgid ""
"Okay.  But I'm telling you you're talking to the next Sidfre Meirssen!"
msgstr ""
"Vale. ¡Pero os digo que estáis hablando con el próximo Sidfre Meirssen!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC151.rude:1
msgid "Uhh, maybe some other time."
msgstr "Eh, quizá en otro momento."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC151.rude:2
msgid ""
"Those jerks at the Gathering threw me out!  Can you believe that!  They don't know that one day, I will be the next Halfdan the Game-wise!  Would you like to hear about my game?"
msgstr ""
"¡Esos imbéciles de la Reunión me echaron! ¿Os lo podéis creer? ¡No saben que un día seré el próximo Halfdan el Sabio de los Juegos! ¿Queréis que os hable de mi juego?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC151.rude:3 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC213.rude:2 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC215.rude:8
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC222.rude:3 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC49.rude:14
msgid "Okay"
msgstr "Vale."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC151.rude:4
msgid ""
"They're all as dumb as Scandlan!  That guy just will not shut up and let anyone else talk!"
msgstr ""
"¡Son todos tan tontos como Scandlan! ¡Ese tipo no se calla nunca ni deja hablar a nadie!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC152.rude:1
msgid "I got to kiss Tort'l Pau'hk last night!  Wow!  What a great night."
msgstr "¡Anoche pude besar a Tort'l Pau'hk! ¡Vaya! Qué noche tan estupenda."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC152.rude:2
msgid ""
"Last night I went out with Tort'l Pau'hk.  I took her to the Gathering!  It was an expensive night, but it was worth it!  I got to kiss her!!"
msgstr ""
"Anoche salí con Tort'l Pau'hk. ¡La llevé a la Reunión! Fue una noche cara, ¡pero mereció la pena! ¡¡Pude besarla!!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC152.rude:2 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC2.rude:11
msgctxt "said by the party"
msgid "What is that?"
msgstr "¿Qué es eso?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC152.rude:3
msgid ""
"He's the guy in charge.  I wish I was him!  I bet he gets lots of girls!"
msgstr "Es el que manda. ¡Ojalá fuera él! ¡Seguro que tiene a muchas chicas!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC152.rude:3
msgid "What do you know about the Jarl?"
msgstr "¿Qué sabéis del jarl?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC153.rude:1
msgid ""
"Have I?  Of course I do!  Why last night I went out with Hekja Bjarnidotir, Ragnara Leifdotir, and Helga the Hands!  I tell you what, it was a long night!"
msgstr ""
"¿Que si tengo? ¡Claro que sí! ¡Anoche salí con Hekja Bjarnidotir, Ragnara Leifdotir y Helga la Manos! Os lo aseguro, ¡fue una noche muy larga!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC153.rude:1
msgid "Have you got any news?"
msgstr "¿Tenéis alguna noticia?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC153.rude:3
msgid ""
"Not much!  I hardly get any at all!  What with all the girls I've been out with.  But if you want my advice, don't go to long without it!  If you do, you'll be sorry!"
msgstr ""
"¡No mucho! ¡Apenas descanso! Con todas las chicas con las que he salido... Pero si queréis un consejo, no paséis mucho tiempo sin descansar. ¡Si lo hacéis, lo lamentaréis!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC153.rude:3
msgid "What do you know about resting?"
msgstr "¿Qué sabéis del descanso?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC154.rude:1
msgid ""
"Well, what news Haven't I got?  Last night I had to turn down dates with three girls, just to get some sleep!"
msgstr ""
"Bueno, ¿qué noticia no tengo? ¡Anoche tuve que rechazar citas con tres chicas solo para poder dormir un poco!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC154.rude:2
msgid ""
"Well, It's mostly because I'm irresistible to girls.  They just can't seem to get enough of me.  I'm in a whole other league than these two guys."
msgstr ""
"Bueno, es sobre todo porque soy irresistible para las chicas. Parece que nunca tienen bastante de mí. Juego en otra liga que estos dos."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC154.rude:2 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC206.rude:3 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC28.rude:7
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC30.rude:5 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC33.rude:4 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC36.rude:4
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC39.rude:5 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC51.rude:3 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC56.rude:7
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC8.rude:7
msgid "Why is that?"
msgstr "¿Y eso por qué?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC154.rude:3
msgid ""
"This is the place to be, that's it!  Around here, I'm well known, that's for sure!  There isn't anywhere else I'd rather be!"
msgstr ""
"¡Este es el sitio donde hay que estar, así de claro! Por aquí soy muy conocido, ¡eso seguro! ¡No hay ningún otro sitio donde preferiría estar!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC154.rude:5
msgid ""
"Oh, her?  Um, er, yeah, uhh, we went out before.  She wasn't quite my type."
msgstr ""
"¿Ah, ella? Eh, esto, sí, eh... salimos una vez. No era exactamente mi tipo."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC154.rude:5
msgid "What do you know about Lina Friggdotir?"
msgstr "¿Qué sabéis de Lina Friggdotir?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC155.rude:1
msgid ""
"Did you see my wonderful performance?  I am an actor!  I play Emperor Trislan!"
msgstr ""
"¿Habéis visto mi maravillosa actuación? ¡Soy actor! ¡Interpreto al emperador Trislan!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC155.rude:3
msgid ""
"I am a wonderful actor!  Come back at 2:30 or 4:30.  You can see me perform!"
msgstr ""
"¡Soy un actor maravilloso! Volved a las 2:30 o a las 4:30. ¡Podréis verme actuar!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC155.rude:3
msgid "What do you know about acting?"
msgstr "¿Qué sabéis de la interpretación?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC156.rude:1
msgid "I'm afraid I can't!  I've got to rehearse for my audition!"
msgstr "¡Me temo que no puedo! ¡Tengo que ensayar para mi audición!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC157.rude:1
msgid ""
"I heard that Eyjolf has been trying to get an audition with the Guild of Thjoradric Actors.  I Haven't the heart to tell him it's hopeless.  He's a hack!"
msgstr ""
"He oído que Eyjolf lleva tiempo intentando conseguir una audición con el Gremio de Actores de Thjoradric. No tengo valor para decirle que no tiene remedio. ¡Es un mal actor!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC157.rude:3
msgid ""
"That's where the Guild of Thjoradric Actors are!  That's where anyone who's anyone goes when they've become someone!  I hope to get there someday!"
msgstr ""
"¡Allí está el Gremio de Actores de Thjoradric! ¡Allí va todo el que es alguien cuando llega a ser alguien! ¡Espero llegar allí algún día!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC157.rude:3 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC230.rude:5 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC250.rude:3
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC251.rude:3 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC79.rude:5
msgid "What do you know about Thjorgard?"
msgstr "¿Qué sabéis de Thjorgard?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC158.rude:1
msgid ""
"Just last week I was the understudy to Hralof Boldtalker.  But he got himself into a fight and broke his jaw!  Now here I am!  My mamma would be so proud."
msgstr ""
"La semana pasada era el suplente de Hralof Lenguaosada. ¡Pero se metió en una pelea y se rompió la mandíbula! ¡Y aquí estoy! Mi madre estaría muy orgullosa."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC158.rude:3
msgid ""
"Have you seen the play?  Our writer did a lot of research to get everything right.  From what I understand, Captain Ralof really did kill Emperor Trislan."
msgstr ""
"¿Habéis visto la obra? Nuestro autor investigó mucho para que todo fuera fiel. Por lo que tengo entendido, el capitán Ralof de verdad mató al emperador Trislan."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC159.rude:1
msgid ""
"I've got some advice for you.  Stay away from the fish.  It'll make you sick up something fierce!"
msgstr ""
"Tengo un consejo para vosotros. No os acerquéis al pescado. ¡Os pondrá malos de mala manera!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC159.rude:2
msgid "Uh-huh.  Ask away."
msgstr "Ajá. Preguntad lo que queráis."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC159.rude:3
msgid "I don't think I know much about that."
msgstr "No creo que sepa mucho de eso."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC16.rude:1 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC58.rude:8
msgid "We would like some healing."
msgstr "Querríamos que nos curarais."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC16.rude:2
msgid "We thank you, my children."
msgstr "Os lo agradecemos, hijos míos."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC16.rude:3
msgid "The gods look kindly on a penitent heart."
msgstr "Los dioses miran con buenos ojos a un corazón penitente."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC16.rude:4
msgid "I wish I could help you, my children, but we do not have any extra."
msgstr "Ojalá pudiera ayudaros, hijos míos, pero no nos sobra ninguno."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC16.rude:4
msgid "We are looking for a priest to take to a new church."
msgstr "Buscamos un sacerdote para llevarlo a una nueva iglesia."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC160.rude:2
msgid ""
"Did you like the play?  I commissioned the famous playwright Woolan Sheer to write it right!"
msgstr ""
"¿Os ha gustado la obra? ¡Encargué al famoso dramaturgo Woolan Sheer que la escribiera bien!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC160.rude:3
msgid ""
"Woolan was the real expert when writing the play.  I did have him add a few things for the play's sake, you understand.  A pure history lesson would have been boring!  It's our job to entertain first, and educate second."
msgstr ""
"Woolan era el auténtico experto cuando escribió la obra. Eso sí, le hice añadir algunas cosas por el bien de la obra, ya me entendéis. ¡Una lección de historia pura habría sido aburrida! Nuestro trabajo es primero entretener y después educar."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC161.rude:1
msgid ""
"Do you believe that you are ready?  Very well, here is your task:  There is a rare creature in this region known as the Magreeb.  You must find one and study it.  Return to me when you are finished and give a report."
msgstr ""
"¿Creéis que estáis preparados? Muy bien, esta es vuestra tarea: en esta región hay una criatura rara conocida como el Magreeb. Debéis encontrar una y estudiarla. Volved conmigo cuando hayáis terminado y dadme un informe."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC161.rude:10 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC18.rude:10 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC181.rude:13
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC248.rude:7 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC3.rude:28 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC4.rude:13
msgid "Perhaps later."
msgstr "Quizá más tarde."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC161.rude:10
msgid "Very well.  Come back when you think you are ready."
msgstr "Muy bien. Volved cuando creáis que estáis preparados."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC161.rude:11
msgid ""
"Have you now?  Well, perhaps you can answer some questions I've had of it.  And this is for posterity, so please, be honest."
msgstr ""
"¿De verdad? Bien, quizá podáis responder a algunas preguntas que tengo sobre ella. Y esto es para la posteridad, así que, por favor, sed sinceros."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC161.rude:11
msgid "We studied the Magreeb."
msgstr "Hemos estudiado al Magreeb."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC161.rude:12
msgid "Very well.  Was there anything else?"
msgstr "Muy bien. ¿Había algo más?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC161.rude:13
msgid ""
"It is not my time, but yours.  Perhaps there is something else you need guidance in?"
msgstr ""
"No es mi tiempo, sino el vuestro. ¿Quizá necesitéis consejo en alguna otra cosa?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC161.rude:14
msgid "Green"
msgstr "Verde."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC161.rude:14
msgid ""
"Green?  Are you sure?  That means the ancient texts were wrong!  I will have to correct those.  Thank you for your help.  You are now promoted to Scholars."
msgstr ""
"¿Verde? ¿Estáis seguros? ¡Eso significa que los textos antiguos estaban equivocados! Tendré que corregirlos. Gracias por vuestra ayuda. Ahora quedáis ascendidos a Eruditos."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC161.rude:15
msgid "How do we get to Hallenhalt?"
msgstr "¿Cómo llegamos a Hallenhalt?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC161.rude:15
msgid "The only people who get to Hallenhalt are dead heroes."
msgstr "Los únicos que llegan a Hallenhalt son los héroes muertos."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC161.rude:16
msgid "They carve the Fatestones.  It is they who create Writs of Fate."
msgstr ""
"Ellas tallan las Piedras del Destino. Son ellas quienes crean los Escritos del Destino."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC161.rude:16
msgid "What do you know about the three Wyrdes?"
msgstr "¿Qué sabéis de las tres Wyrdes?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC161.rude:17
msgid "Perhaps there is something else you need guidance on?"
msgstr "¿Quizá necesitéis consejo sobre alguna otra cosa?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC161.rude:18
msgid ""
"Here are some words of advice.  He starts to stink, who outstays his welcome in a hall that is not his own."
msgstr ""
"Aquí tenéis unas palabras de consejo. Empieza a apestar quien abusa de la hospitalidad en una sala que no es la suya."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC161.rude:18
msgid "We need your advice."
msgstr "Necesitamos vuestro consejo."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC161.rude:19
msgid "We'd like you to answer some questions."
msgstr "Querríamos que respondierais a algunas preguntas."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC161.rude:19
msgid "What questions would you like answered?"
msgstr "¿Qué preguntas queréis que os responda?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC161.rude:2
msgid "The 11th direct descendant of Jevar the Bastard"
msgstr "El undécimo descendiente directo de Jevar el Bastardo."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC161.rude:2
msgid "Who is Tamur Leng?"
msgstr "¿Quién es Tamur Leng?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC161.rude:20
msgid "Do you have any words of wisdom?"
msgstr "¿Tenéis alguna palabra de sabiduría?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC161.rude:20
msgid ""
"When faced with overwhelming odds, remember this: Cattle die, kindred die, death comes to us all.  The one thing that will never die is the glory of a great deed."
msgstr ""
"Cuando os enfrentéis a fuerzas abrumadoras, recordad esto: muere el ganado, mueren los parientes, la muerte nos llega a todos. Lo único que jamás muere es la gloria de una gran hazaña."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC161.rude:21 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC256.rude:7 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC256.rude:8
msgid "Go in peace."
msgstr "Id en paz."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC161.rude:21
msgid "We don't need anything right now."
msgstr "Ahora mismo no necesitamos nada."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC161.rude:3 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC49.rude:6 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC50.rude:6
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC55.rude:15 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC56.rude:1 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC57.rude:4
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC76.rude:2 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC77.rude:2 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC78.rude:2
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC81.rude:2 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC82.rude:1 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC83.rude:1
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC84.rude:2 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC86.rude:5 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC91.rude:1
msgid "Can we ask you something else?"
msgstr "¿Podemos preguntaros otra cosa?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC161.rude:3
msgid "You may ask.  The answers you seek are within."
msgstr ""
"Podéis preguntar. Las respuestas que buscáis están en vuestro interior."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC161.rude:4
msgid "We are seeking promotion to Scholar"
msgstr "Queremos ascender a Erudito."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC161.rude:4
msgid "We shall see.  Have you any initiates amongst your group?"
msgstr "Ya veremos. ¿Tenéis algún iniciado en vuestro grupo?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC161.rude:6
msgid "If you want your promotion, of course you will!"
msgstr "Si queréis vuestro ascenso, ¡por supuesto que lo haréis!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC161.rude:6 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC181.rude:4 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC181.rude:5
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC181.rude:8 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC240.rude:4 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC282.rude:10
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC336.rude:1 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC87.rude:10 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC88.rude:12
msgid "We will do this."
msgstr "Lo haremos."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC161.rude:7
msgid "Firstly, what color was this creature?"
msgstr "En primer lugar, ¿de qué color era esa criatura?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC161.rude:8
msgid ""
"Ah, red!  That is exactly what was said in the texts.  Wonderful.  Thank you for your help.  You are now promoted to Scholars."
msgstr ""
"¡Ah, roja! Es exactamente lo que decían los textos. Maravilloso. Gracias por vuestra ayuda. Ahora quedáis ascendidos a Eruditos."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC161.rude:8
msgid "Red"
msgstr "Roja."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC161.rude:9
msgid "You are welcome.  Now I've work to do.  Farewell."
msgstr "De nada. Ahora tengo trabajo que hacer. Adiós."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC162.rude:1
msgid "Not really."
msgstr "La verdad es que no."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC162.rude:2 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC166.rude:2
msgid "Hello.  We'd like to ask you some questions."
msgstr "Hola. Nos gustaría haceros algunas preguntas."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC162.rude:3
msgid "What do you know about Jevar the Bastard?"
msgstr "¿Qué sabéis de Jevar el Bastardo?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC163.rude:1
msgid ""
"I've been working real hard to try and get myself into the play at the Akl'ai's tavern.  I think I'm really close.  The director has seen me, and I think he likes my work.  Of course he isn't paying me lip service.  No one of my talent gets that!"
msgstr ""
"Me estoy esforzando muchísimo por conseguir un papel en la obra de la taberna de Akl'ai. Creo que estoy muy cerca. El director me ha visto y creo que le gusta mi trabajo. Claro que no me regala los oídos. ¡Nadie con mi talento recibe eso!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC163.rude:2
msgid "Well alright.  Go ahead, ask your questions."
msgstr "Bueno, de acuerdo. Adelante, haced vuestras preguntas."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC163.rude:3
msgid ""
"Well I know a lot about that.  But I don't have time to get into it right now.  Maybe some other time when We can sit around for hours, I can share my thoughts on that."
msgstr ""
"Bueno, sé mucho de eso. Pero ahora mismo no tengo tiempo para entrar en el tema. Quizá en otra ocasión, cuando podamos sentarnos durante horas, os cuente lo que pienso."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC163.rude:3 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC222.rude:5 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC339.rude:9
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC340.rude:3 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC342.rude:3 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC343.rude:3
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC344.rude:3 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC345.rude:3 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC348.rude:3
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC349.rude:3 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC354.rude:3 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC359.rude:3
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC360.rude:3 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC364.rude:3 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC365.rude:3
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC368.rude:3 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC371.rude:3 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC374.rude:3
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC376.rude:3 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC40.rude:13 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC43.rude:1
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC43.rude:2 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC50.rude:10 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC55.rude:25
msgid "What do you know about Arslegard?"
msgstr "¿Qué sabéis de Arslegard?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC163.rude:4
msgid "No, it was no bother at all, really!"
msgstr "¡No, no fue ninguna molestia, de verdad!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC163.rude:5
msgid "Sure, certainly.  It was no problem."
msgstr "Claro, por supuesto. No fue ningún problema."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC164.rude:1
msgid ""
"I dropped my boom boom on my toe yesterday.  It ouched very bad.  Daddy says I only 'upposed to use the boom boom for pounding nails, but it's fun to play with."
msgstr ""
"Ayer se me cayó el pum-pum en el dedo del pie. Me hizo mucha pupa. Papi dice que el pum-pum solo es pa' clavar clavos, pero es muy divertido jugar con él."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC164.rude:3
msgid "Nuthin'"
msgstr "Naa."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC164.rude:3
msgid "What do you know about hammers?"
msgstr "¿Qué sabes de los martillos?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC164.rude:4 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC164.rude:5
msgid "Okay.  Bye-bye."
msgstr "Vale. Adiós, adiós."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC165.rude:1
msgid ""
"Find yourself a partner.  If you do, love them well!  If everyone in the world did this, the world would be a better place!"
msgstr ""
"Buscaos una pareja. Y si la encontráis, ¡amadla bien! ¡Si todo el mundo lo hiciera, el mundo sería un lugar mejor!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC165.rude:2
msgid "Hello!  We'd like to ask you some questions."
msgstr "¡Hola! Nos gustaría haceros algunas preguntas."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC165.rude:2
msgid "Of course!  That you may certainly do!"
msgstr "¡Por supuesto! ¡Eso sí que podéis hacerlo!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC165.rude:3
msgid ""
"If you couldn't tell, I love food!  My favorite dish is the stew over at Akl'ai's Spirits.  I could eat a hundred pounds of that stuff in one day!  He won't sell that much to me, though.  He says I need to watch my weight."
msgstr ""
"Por si no se nota, ¡me encanta la comida! Mi plato favorito es el estofado de los Licores de Akl'ai. ¡Podría comerme cien libras en un solo día! Aunque no me vende tanto. Dice que tengo que vigilar mi peso."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC165.rude:3
msgid "What do you know about food?"
msgstr "¿Qué sabéis de la comida?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC165.rude:4
msgid "No trouble at all!"
msgstr "¡Ninguna molestia!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC165.rude:5
msgid "It was my pleasure.  Farewell."
msgstr "Ha sido un placer. Adiós."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC166.rude:1
msgid ""
"I asked Lina Friggdotir out the other day.  She turned me down, though.  She handed me a stick with bristles on it, and said she might consider going out if I used it.  I don't know what it's for, though."
msgstr ""
"El otro día le pedí a Lina Friggdotir que saliera conmigo. Pero me rechazó. Me dio un palito con cerdas y me dijo que a lo mejor se lo pensaba si lo usaba. Aunque no sé para qué sirve."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC166.rude:3
msgid ""
"My Dad was an adventurer.  He did a lot of things for the last Jarl of Guberland.  His boat sank on the way to Thronheim.  I didn't want to follow in his footsteps.  Drowning is no way to live!"
msgstr ""
"Mi padre era aventurero. Hizo muchas cosas para el último jarl de Guberland. Su barco se hundió de camino a Thronheim. Yo no quise seguir sus pasos. ¡Ahogarse no es forma de vivir!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC166.rude:3
msgid "What do you know about quests?"
msgstr "¿Qué sabéis de las misiones?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC166.rude:5
msgid "Have you ever washed your teeth?"
msgstr "¿Alguna vez os habéis lavado los dientes?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC166.rude:5
msgid "Why do you ask?"
msgstr "¿Por qué lo preguntáis?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC167.rude:1
msgid ""
"This place is just creepy.  I think it's getting time for me to leave.  The men around here are just so gross!  I mean, they hardly bathe, they don't brush their teeth, and then they come over and ask me for a date!  I really need to get out of here."
msgstr ""
"Este sitio da escalofríos. Creo que ya va siendo hora de que me vaya. ¡Los hombres de por aquí son asquerosos! Quiero decir, apenas se bañan, no se cepillan los dientes, ¡y luego vienen a pedirme una cita! De verdad que tengo que irme de aquí."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC167.rude:3
msgid ""
"That boy is a jerk!  Can you believe that he told his friends that we went to the Gathering together?  Only in his dreams, I can tell you that!  If he does it again, my brother is going to give him the what for!"
msgstr ""
"¡Ese chico es un imbécil! ¿Os podéis creer que les dijo a sus amigos que fuimos juntos a la Reunión? ¡Solo en sus sueños, os lo aseguro! ¡Si lo vuelve a hacer, mi hermano le va a dar su merecido!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC167.rude:3
msgid "What do you know about Aso Stinkshirt?"
msgstr "¿Qué sabéis de Aso Camisapestosa?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC168.rude:1
msgid "I won a prize at the Gathering!"
msgstr "¡Gané un premio en la Reunión!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC168.rude:3
msgid "It's a fun place to go to win prizes!"
msgstr "¡Es un sitio divertido para ir a ganar premios!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC169.rude:1
msgid ""
"The Guberland Players are a fine bunch of actors, but sometimes I wonder if they're accurately portraying Ursanian History."
msgstr ""
"Los Comediantes de Guberland son una buena compañía de actores, pero a veces me pregunto si representan con exactitud la Historia de Ursana."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC169.rude:3
msgid "Not very much.  Probably as much as any other person."
msgstr "No mucho. Probablemente lo mismo que cualquier otra persona."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC169.rude:3
msgid "What do you know about Ursanian History?"
msgstr "¿Qué sabéis de la Historia de Ursana?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC17.rude:1
msgid "Goodbybe."
msgstr "Adiós."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC17.rude:10
msgid "I would recommend that you do.  Would you like to buy something?"
msgstr "Os lo recomiendo. ¿Queréis comprar algo?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC17.rude:10
msgid "Sounds like a bad place to be.  We'll try to avoid it."
msgstr "Parece un mal sitio para estar. Intentaremos evitarlo."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC17.rude:11
msgid ""
"Hallenhalt is the exalted place where the worthy go when they die.  From what I've heard about it, Skraelos keeps them fit and happy.  They stay in Hallenhalt until the time comes when Krohn needs his army."
msgstr ""
"Hallenhalt es el lugar excelso adonde van los dignos cuando mueren. Por lo que he oído, Skraelos los mantiene en forma y contentos. Permanecen en Hallenhalt hasta que llegue el momento en que Krohn necesite su ejército."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC17.rude:11
msgid "What is Hallenhalt?"
msgstr "¿Qué es Hallenhalt?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC17.rude:12
msgid "Of course.  Please, have a look around!"
msgstr "Por supuesto. ¡Por favor, echad un vistazo!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC17.rude:12 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC215.rude:2
msgid "Thanks for the tip."
msgstr "Gracias por el consejo."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC17.rude:13
msgid ""
"Watch where you sleep!  You never know when Skraelos will come for you."
msgstr ""
"¡Cuidado con dónde dormís! Nunca se sabe cuándo vendrá Skraelos a por vosotros."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC17.rude:14 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC18.rude:12 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC57.rude:24
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC60.rude:6
msgid "No thanks."
msgstr "No, gracias."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC17.rude:2
msgid ""
"For the day of the Great Reckoning!  The day when even the gods must atone for their lives."
msgstr ""
"¡Para el día del Gran Ajuste de Cuentas! El día en que incluso los dioses tendrán que expiar sus vidas."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC17.rude:2
msgid "What would Krohn need with an army?"
msgstr "¿Para qué querría Krohn un ejército?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC17.rude:3
msgid "Thanks for the info!"
msgstr "¡Gracias por la información!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC17.rude:3
msgid "You're welcome.  Perhaps you would like to buy something?"
msgstr "De nada. ¿Quizá queráis comprar algo?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC17.rude:4
msgid ""
"Well I am no theologian, but as I understand it, they are Guilt, Confession, Suffering, Retribution, Absolution, Rebirth.  Once they are lit, you are free to choose your destination."
msgstr ""
"Bueno, no soy teólogo, pero según tengo entendido son la Culpa, la Confesión, el Sufrimiento, el Castigo, la Absolución y el Renacimiento. Una vez encendidos, sois libres de elegir vuestro destino."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC17.rude:4 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC336.rude:9
msgid "What are the Six Fires of Penance?"
msgstr "¿Qué son los Seis Fuegos de la Penitencia?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC17.rude:5
msgid ""
"Did you not learn your religion?  They must light the Six Fires of Penance.  If they can manage that, Skraelos will deem them worthy to ascend to Hallenhalt."
msgstr ""
"¿Es que no aprendisteis vuestra religión? Deben encender los Seis Fuegos de la Penitencia. Si lo consiguen, Skraelos los considerará dignos de ascender a Hallenhalt."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC17.rude:5
msgid "How do they work off their debts?"
msgstr "¿Cómo saldan sus deudas?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC17.rude:6
msgid ""
"The Afterworld is where the unworthy go when they die.  It is a troublesome place, where the fallen souls work off the debts they earned in life."
msgstr ""
"El Más Allá es adonde van los indignos cuando mueren. Es un lugar penoso, donde las almas caídas saldan las deudas que contrajeron en vida."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC17.rude:6
msgid "What is the Afterworld?"
msgstr "¿Qué es el Más Allá?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC17.rude:7
msgid ""
"Skraelos is the god of the Afterworld.  He is the one who decides whether someone goes to the Afterworld, or if they are worthy of Hallenhalt."
msgstr ""
"Skraelos es el dios del Más Allá. Es él quien decide si alguien va al Más Allá o si es digno de Hallenhalt."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC17.rude:7
msgid "Who is Skraelos?"
msgstr "¿Quién es Skraelos?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC17.rude:8
msgid "Certainly.  Please take a look"
msgstr "Por supuesto. Echad un vistazo."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC17.rude:8 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC17.rude:9
msgid "We would like to look at your wares."
msgstr "Nos gustaría ver vuestra mercancía."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC17.rude:9
msgid "We're closed."
msgstr "Está cerrado."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC170.rude:1 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC170.rude:3
msgid "IF you are skilled enough, I might help you."
msgstr "SI tenéis suficiente habilidad, quizá os ayude."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC170.rude:1 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC273.rude:1
msgid "We'd like to become Experts in Elemental Magic."
msgstr "Queremos llegar a Expertos en Magia Elemental."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC170.rude:2
msgid ""
"Magic is the glue of life.  Without it, the whole world would unravel."
msgstr ""
"La magia es el pegamento de la vida. Sin ella, el mundo entero se desharía."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC170.rude:3 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC273.rude:3
msgid "We'd like to become Masters in Elemental Magic."
msgstr "Queremos llegar a Maestros en Magia Elemental."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC170.rude:4
msgid "I am a mage.  Why would I know anything about swords?"
msgstr "Soy mago. ¿Por qué iba a saber nada de espadas?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC170.rude:4
msgid "What do you know about swordmastery?"
msgstr "¿Qué sabéis del manejo de la espada?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC170.rude:5
msgid "Seek Gudlaug Eitrissen in Lindisfare."
msgstr "Buscad a Gudlaug Eitrissen en Lindisfarne."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC170.rude:5 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC273.rude:5
msgid "Where can we become Grandmasters in Elemental Magic?"
msgstr "¿Dónde podemos llegar a Grandes Maestros en Magia Elemental?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC171.rude:1 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC171.rude:3
msgid "Possess you the skill?"
msgstr "¿Poseéis la habilidad?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC171.rude:1 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC274.rude:1
msgid "We'd like to become Experts in Light Magic."
msgstr "Queremos llegar a Expertos en Magia de la Luz."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC171.rude:2
msgid ""
"I'm not sure, but I think I had a vision of Hallenhalt during yesterday's meditation."
msgstr ""
"No estoy seguro, pero creo que tuve una visión de Hallenhalt durante la meditación de ayer."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC171.rude:3 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC274.rude:3
msgid "We'd like to become Masters in Light Magic."
msgstr "Queremos llegar a Maestros en Magia de la Luz."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC171.rude:4
msgid ""
"It's a valuable skill to know!  The more practice you have, the more spells you can cast."
msgstr ""
"¡Es una habilidad valiosa! Cuanta más práctica tengáis, más hechizos podréis lanzar."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC171.rude:4
msgid "What do you know about meditation?"
msgstr "¿Qué sabéis de la meditación?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC171.rude:5 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC274.rude:5
msgid ""
"In Lindisfarne, seek one named Annabel A'Tryht.  She will put you on the right course."
msgstr ""
"En Lindisfarne, buscad a una tal Annabel A'Tryht. Ella os pondrá en el buen camino."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC171.rude:5 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC274.rude:5
msgid "Where can we become Grandmasters in Light Magic?"
msgstr "¿Dónde podemos llegar a Grandes Maestros en Magia de la Luz?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC172.rude:1 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC172.rude:3
msgid "And you think you are skilled enough?"
msgstr "¿Y creéis que tenéis suficiente habilidad?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC172.rude:1 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC275.rude:1
msgid "We'd like to become Experts in Dark Magic."
msgstr "Queremos llegar a Expertos en Magia de la Oscuridad."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC172.rude:3 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC275.rude:3
msgid "We'd like to become Masters in Dark Magic."
msgstr "Queremos llegar a Maestros en Magia de la Oscuridad."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC172.rude:4
msgid "Nothing I wish to share with you."
msgstr "Nada que desee compartir con vosotros."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC172.rude:5 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC275.rude:5
msgid ""
"Go to Lindisfarne.  There is one named Alanna Etzeldotir who can help you."
msgstr "Id a Lindisfarne. Hay una tal Alanna Etzeldotir que puede ayudaros."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC172.rude:5 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC275.rude:5
msgid "Where can we become Grandmasters in Dark Magic?"
msgstr "¿Dónde podemos llegar a Grandes Maestros en Magia de la Oscuridad?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC172.rude:6 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC180.rude:40 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC239.rude:40
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC320.rude:10
msgid "If you must."
msgstr "Si no hay más remedio."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC173.rude:1 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC173.rude:3
msgid "Very well.  If you have the skills, I will train you."
msgstr "Muy bien. Si tenéis las habilidades, os entrenaré."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC173.rude:1 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC276.rude:1
msgid "We'd like to become Experts in Spirit Magic."
msgstr "Queremos ser Expertos en Magia del Espíritu."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC173.rude:2
msgid ""
"Spirit is the key to the self.  Take care to learn it, and you will find yourself rewarded."
msgstr ""
"El Espíritu es la clave del propio ser. Esforzaos en aprenderlo y os veréis recompensados."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC173.rude:3
msgid "We'd like to become Master in Spirit Magic."
msgstr "Queremos ser Maestros en Magia del Espíritu."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC173.rude:4
msgid ""
"If you choose the path of magic, do not stray from it.  Your studies will bring you greatness."
msgstr ""
"Si elegís el camino de la magia, no os apartéis de él. Vuestros estudios os traerán la grandeza."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC173.rude:4 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC183.rude:8 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC273.rude:4
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC275.rude:4 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC276.rude:4
msgid "What do you know about magic?"
msgstr "¿Qué sabes de la magia?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC173.rude:5 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC276.rude:5
msgid "Find Gymir Lokissen in Lindisfarne."
msgstr "Buscad a Gymir Lokissen en Lindisfarne."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC173.rude:5 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC276.rude:5
msgid "Where can we become Grandmasters in Spirit Magic?"
msgstr "¿Dónde podemos ser Grandes Maestros en Magia del Espíritu?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC174.rude:1 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC174.rude:3
msgid ""
"Many seek such training.  I ask you, do you possess the skill to become so?"
msgstr ""
"Muchos buscan ese adiestramiento. Os lo pregunto: ¿poseéis la habilidad necesaria para lograrlo?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC174.rude:1 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC277.rude:1
msgid "We'd like to become Experts in Meditation."
msgstr "Queremos ser Expertos en Meditación."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC174.rude:2
msgid ""
"Look inward for your answers, children.  For the external quest only matters as a reflection of inner growth."
msgstr ""
"Buscad las respuestas en vuestro interior, hijos. Pues la búsqueda exterior solo importa como reflejo del crecimiento interior."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC174.rude:3 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC277.rude:3
msgid "We'd like to become Masters in Meditation."
msgstr "Queremos ser Maestros en Meditación."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC174.rude:4
msgid ""
"That is a place to the south of us.  For more answers, you should consult with a cartographer."
msgstr ""
"Es un lugar que está al sur de aquí. Si queréis saber más, deberíais consultar a un cartógrafo."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC174.rude:5 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC277.rude:5
msgid ""
"Seek out Lindisfarne.  There is one who can help you there named Delano A'Lanth."
msgstr ""
"Buscad Lindisfarne. Allí hay alguien que puede ayudaros, llamado Delano A'Lanth."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC174.rude:5 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC277.rude:5
msgid "Where can we become Grandmasters in Meditation?"
msgstr "¿Dónde podemos ser Grandes Maestros en Meditación?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC174.rude:6
msgid "Many people seek answers.  Perhaps I can help you find yours."
msgstr ""
"Mucha gente busca respuestas. Quizá yo pueda ayudaros a encontrar las vuestras."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC174.rude:7
msgid "It was not a bother enough to be sorry for."
msgstr "No ha sido tanta molestia como para disculparse."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC174.rude:8
msgid "May you fare well on your journeys, friend."
msgstr "Que os vaya bien en vuestros viajes, amigo."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC175.rude:1
msgid ""
"The actors.  That's not how it really happened.  I have evidence to prove it, too.  But the actors say, \"it's all craft!\"  And don't listen to my advice.  I don't understand this desire to change history based on \"artistic license\"!"
msgstr ""
"Los actores. No es así como ocurrió de verdad. Y además tengo pruebas que lo demuestran. Pero los actores dicen: \"¡Todo es oficio!\" Y no escuchan mis consejos. ¡No entiendo ese afán de cambiar la historia en nombre de la \"licencia artística\"!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC175.rude:1
msgid "What do you mean, get it right?"
msgstr "¿Qué quieres decir con hacerlo bien?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC175.rude:3
msgid ""
"I've spent years researching it!  In fact, it wasn't Captain Ralof who killed Trislan at all!  It was Aklan'dor!  The one who conquered the Xisis!  At least they got that part right!"
msgstr ""
"¡Llevo años investigándolo! De hecho, ¡no fue el Capitán Ralof quien mató a Trislan, en absoluto! ¡Fue Aklan'dor! ¡El que conquistó a los Xisis! ¡Al menos esa parte sí la han contado bien!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC175.rude:4 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC178.rude:11 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC231.rude:6
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC231.rude:7 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC233.rude:7 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC233.rude:8
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC265.rude:5 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC380.rude:4 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC49.rude:20
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC72.rude:4 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC72.rude:5 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC91.rude:4
msgid "Bye."
msgstr "Adiós."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC176.rude:1
msgid ""
"I really like spending my time watching the plays.  It takes my mind off the work I do.  They let me escape into a world of adventure and excitement!"
msgstr ""
"Me encanta pasar el rato viendo las obras de teatro. Me ayudan a olvidarme del trabajo. ¡Me dejan escapar a un mundo de aventura y emoción!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC176.rude:2 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC187.rude:2 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC247.rude:6
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC252.rude:2 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC257.rude:18 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC332.rude:2
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC343.rude:4 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC344.rude:4 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC345.rude:4
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC420.rude:7 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC93.rude:6
msgid "Sure!"
msgstr "¡Claro!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC176.rude:3
msgid ""
"That's what I do!  Whenever someone asks for a rock, I go and get it for them.  It's hard work!  Those rocks can be heavy!"
msgstr ""
"¡Eso es lo que hago! Cuando alguien pide una piedra, voy y se la traigo. ¡Es un trabajo duro! ¡Esas piedras pueden pesar mucho!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC176.rude:3
msgid "What do you know about getting rocks?"
msgstr "¿Qué sabes de traer piedras?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC177.rude:1
msgid ""
"I'm ready to get out of here.  These Guberlandians are driving me crazy!"
msgstr ""
"Estoy listo para largarme de aquí. ¡Estos guberlandeses me están volviendo loco!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC177.rude:10
msgid "Very well.  See you later."
msgstr "Muy bien. Hasta luego."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC177.rude:2
msgid "Great!  Get me off this rock!"
msgstr "¡Estupendo! ¡Sacadme de esta roca!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC177.rude:2
msgid "Sounds good.  You're hired."
msgstr "Nos parece bien. Estás contratado."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC177.rude:3
msgid "My fee is 500 gold per month plus 2% of all the gold we find."
msgstr ""
"Mis honorarios son 500 de oro al mes más el 2% de todo el oro que encontremos."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC177.rude:4
msgid "So you're for hire?"
msgstr "¿Así que te ofreces para contratar?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC177.rude:4
msgid ""
"Yes.  As I said, I'm a merchant.  I have a keen eye for quality, and a quick tongue.  I could help you get better prices for all the things you buy and sell."
msgstr ""
"Sí. Como ya os he dicho, soy mercader. Tengo buen ojo para la calidad y una lengua rápida. Podría ayudaros a conseguir mejores precios en todo lo que compréis y vendáis."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC177.rude:5
msgid ""
"I seem to have lost all my money in a bar bet.  I've been trying to hire out my services to raise some cash."
msgstr ""
"Parece que perdí todo mi dinero en una apuesta en la taberna. He intentado ofrecer mis servicios para reunir algo de dinero."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC177.rude:5
msgid "Why Haven't you left?"
msgstr "¿Por qué no te has ido?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC177.rude:7
msgid "I know I've seen enough of it!  These people are making me nuts!"
msgstr ""
"¡Desde luego, ya he visto bastante de este sitio! ¡Esta gente me está sacando de quicio!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC177.rude:8
msgid "Alright, but you're losing money as long as I'm not around."
msgstr "De acuerdo, pero perdéis dinero mientras yo no esté con vosotros."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC177.rude:8 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC240.rude:8 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC430.rude:8
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC5.rude:14 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC5.rude:9 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC66.rude:6
msgctxt "said by the party"
msgid "Maybe some other time."
msgstr "Quizá en otra ocasión."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC177.rude:9
msgid ""
"I'm a merchant.  I've been stranded here in Guberland for weeks.  It's beginning driving me crazy."
msgstr ""
"Soy mercader. Llevo semanas atrapado aquí, en Guberland. Está empezando a volverme loco."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC177.rude:9 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC221.rude:1 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC414.rude:19
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC418.rude:1 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC42.rude:14 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC423.rude:1
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC43.rude:10 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC44.rude:2 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC85.rude:4
msgid "What are you doing here?"
msgstr "¿Qué haces aquí?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC178.rude:1
msgid ""
"Alfrigg Halfdanssen asked me to mend his sword, but before he gave it to me he changed his mind.  I still don't know why."
msgstr ""
"Alfrigg Halfdanssen me pidió que le arreglara la espada, pero antes de dármela cambió de idea. Todavía no sé por qué."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC178.rude:2
msgid "Alright.  You're hired!"
msgstr "De acuerdo. ¡Estás contratado!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC178.rude:2 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC253.rude:2
msgid "Great!  I won't let you down!"
msgstr "¡Estupendo! ¡No os defraudaré!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC178.rude:3
msgid ""
"For the price of 600 gold per month, I would be willing to be your traveling repairman.  I'd go where you go, and fix all your stuff for free."
msgstr ""
"Por 600 de oro al mes estaría dispuesto a ser vuestro reparador ambulante. Iría a donde fuerais y os arreglaría todas vuestras cosas gratis."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC178.rude:3
msgid "How much do you charge?"
msgstr "¿Cuánto cobras?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC178.rude:4 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC18.rude:14 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC186.rude:8
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC35.rude:5
msgid "How's business?"
msgstr "¿Qué tal el negocio?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC178.rude:4
msgid ""
"Slow.  People around here never want to let me fix their things.  They usually would rather do it themselves."
msgstr ""
"Flojo. La gente de por aquí nunca quiere que le arregle sus cosas. Normalmente prefieren hacerlo ellos mismos."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC178.rude:6
msgid "I can fix just about anything you give me, that's all!"
msgstr "¡Puedo arreglar casi cualquier cosa que me deis, eso es todo!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC178.rude:6
msgid "What do you know about mending things?"
msgstr "¿Qué sabes de reparar cosas?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC178.rude:7
msgid "Okay.  Bye."
msgstr "Vale. Adiós."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC178.rude:7
msgid "Sorry, we don't need anyone to fix our things."
msgstr "Lo siento, no necesitamos que nadie nos arregle nada."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC178.rude:8
msgid "I'm a tinker.  I mend things."
msgstr "Soy calderero. Reparo cosas."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC178.rude:8 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC418.rude:6
msgid "What do you do here?"
msgstr "¿A qué te dedicas aquí?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC178.rude:9
msgid "Alright.  I'll be around if you need me."
msgstr "De acuerdo. Estaré por aquí si me necesitáis."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC178.rude:9 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC179.rude:10 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC308.rude:8
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC85.rude:14
msgid "We no longer need your services."
msgstr "Ya no necesitamos tus servicios."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC179.rude:10
msgid "I understand, friends.  May the gods bless your endeavors."
msgstr "Lo comprendo, amigos. Que los dioses bendigan vuestros esfuerzos."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC179.rude:11
msgid "Did you call it my time?  What a strange way to put it!"
msgstr "¿Lo habéis llamado mi tiempo? ¡Qué forma más extraña de decirlo!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC179.rude:12
msgid "My time?  Why should I own time?"
msgstr "¿Mi tiempo? ¿Por qué iba a ser yo dueño del tiempo?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC179.rude:2
msgid ""
"I have heard that on the plains of Grimknak, the Oozli have started a coup against the Hatoi.  I pray that the Hatoi sqorl their Narfti and not give in."
msgstr ""
"He oído que en las llanuras de Grimknak los Oozli han dado un golpe contra los Hatoi. Ruego que los Hatoi sqorlen a sus Narfti y no se rindan."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC179.rude:3
msgid "A bargain.  You're hired."
msgstr "Una ganga. Estás contratado."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC179.rude:3
msgid "Your travel just got much easier."
msgstr "Vuestros viajes acaban de volverse mucho más fáciles."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC179.rude:4
msgid "Yes.  I charge 1000 gold per month plus 15% of the gold you find."
msgstr "Sí. Cobro 1000 de oro al mes más el 15% del oro que encontréis."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC179.rude:4
msgid "You're for hire?"
msgstr "¿Te ofreces para contratar?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC179.rude:5
msgid "Gods willing, I will have your answers."
msgstr "Si los dioses quieren, tendré vuestras respuestas."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC179.rude:6
msgid "A strange place this is.  I often long for my home in the Tizkak."
msgstr "Este es un lugar extraño. A menudo añoro mi hogar en el Tizkak."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC179.rude:6 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC2.rude:6
msgid "What do you know about Chedian"
msgstr "¿Qué sabes de Chedian?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC179.rude:7
msgid "Perhaps you will find a time when money isn't so important."
msgstr "Quizá encontréis un momento en que el dinero no sea tan importante."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC179.rude:7
msgid "That's too deep for our pockets."
msgstr "Es demasiado para nuestros bolsillos."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC179.rude:8
msgid ""
"In your language I am called a Gate Master.  I can teleport you to any nearby city in Chedian, for a price."
msgstr ""
"En vuestra lengua me llaman Maestro de la Puerta. Puedo teletransportaros a cualquier ciudad cercana de Chedian, por un precio."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC179.rude:8 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC190.rude:6
msgid "What do you do?"
msgstr "¿A qué te dedicas?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC179.rude:9
msgid "We'd like you to cast Town Portal."
msgstr "Queremos que lances Portal a Ciudad."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC18.rude:1
msgid "Glad to hear it.  Were you looking for passage?"
msgstr "Me alegra oírlo. ¿Buscabais pasaje?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC18.rude:1
msgid "Perhaps we will."
msgstr "Quizá sí."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC18.rude:11
msgid "And what sort of info would that be?"
msgstr "¿Y qué clase de información sería esa?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC18.rude:11 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC60.rude:4
msgid "No thanks, I was hoping you might have some information."
msgstr "No, gracias. Esperaba que tuvieras algo de información."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC18.rude:13
msgid ""
"He is the Jarl of the Thjorgard Clan.  As long as he keeps the Thjoradric Mines running, I'll never know starvation."
msgstr ""
"Es el Jarl del clan Thjorgard. Mientras mantenga en marcha las Minas Thjoradric, yo nunca pasaré hambre."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC18.rude:13 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC180.rude:27 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC34.rude:10
msgid "What do you know about Sven Forkbeard?"
msgstr "¿Qué sabes de Sven Forkbeard?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC18.rude:14
msgid ""
"Good and bad.  Ever since the mountain pass between Thjorgard and Thronheim has been lost, we ship captains have made a great deal of money."
msgstr ""
"Cosas buenas y malas. Desde que se perdió el paso de montaña entre Thjorgard y Thronheim, los capitanes de barco hemos ganado muchísimo dinero."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC18.rude:15
msgid "Certainly.  Anything else?"
msgstr "Por supuesto. ¿Algo más?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC18.rude:2
msgid ""
"If there was something to be done about it, Tryygva Ravenlocks would have found it by now.  He wouldn't let his people starve.  Perhaps you should talk to him about it."
msgstr ""
"Si se pudiera hacer algo, Tryygva Ravenlocks ya lo habría encontrado. No dejaría que su gente pasara hambre. Quizá deberíais hablar con él del asunto."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC18.rude:2
msgid "No one can do anything about it?"
msgstr "¿Nadie puede hacer nada?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC18.rude:3
msgid ""
"The port in Frosgard has been frozen solid.  It used to be a lucrative place to put in, but now, no ship captain in their right mind would try to brave those treacherous waters.  The poor souls who live there must be starving by now."
msgstr ""
"El puerto de Frosgard se ha congelado por completo. Antes era un sitio muy lucrativo donde atracar, pero ahora ningún capitán en su sano juicio se atrevería con esas aguas traicioneras. Las pobres almas que viven allí ya deben de estar muriéndose de hambre."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC18.rude:3
msgid "What's bad then?"
msgstr "¿Y qué es lo malo?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC18.rude:4
msgid "Could you take us there?"
msgstr "¿Podrías llevarnos allí?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC18.rude:4
msgid ""
"I don't know why you would be wanting me to take you there.  It's somewhere in the hills of Thjorgard.  That's all I know."
msgstr ""
"No sé por qué querríais que os llevara allí. Está en algún lugar de las colinas de Thjorgard. Es todo lo que sé."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC18.rude:5 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC32.rude:1
msgid "And what would that be?"
msgstr "¿Y qué sería eso?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC18.rude:5
msgid "Perhaps we should ask you about something else."
msgstr "Quizá deberíamos preguntarte por otra cosa."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC18.rude:6
msgid "Nothing.  Who is that?"
msgstr "Nada. ¿Quién es ese?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC18.rude:7
msgid "I think that we will."
msgstr "Creo que sí."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC18.rude:8
msgid "Yes, please."
msgstr "Sí, por favor."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC18.rude:9
msgid "Aye, I've heard of that place."
msgstr "Sí, he oído hablar de ese lugar."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC18.rude:9
msgid "Have you heard of a place known as The Training Hall?"
msgstr "¿Has oído hablar de un lugar llamado la Sala de Entrenamiento?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC180.rude:1 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC3.rude:5
msgid "Tell them we will be meeting in Thronheim in two weeks."
msgstr "Decidles que nos reuniremos en Thronheim dentro de dos semanas."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC180.rude:1
msgid "The message is as good as sent!  I will see you at the war council."
msgstr "¡Considerad el mensaje enviado! Os veré en el consejo de guerra."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC180.rude:10
msgid ""
"Farewell, adventures, and thank you.  You have raised the hearts and saved the lives of thousands."
msgstr ""
"Adiós, aventureros, y gracias. Habéis levantado los corazones y salvado las vidas de miles de personas."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC180.rude:10
msgid "We have more to do, but when that is done, we shall."
msgstr "Aún nos queda trabajo, pero cuando hayamos terminado, lo haremos."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC180.rude:11
msgid ""
"That is indeed good news.  Here is a small reward.  It may not be much, but behind it is the thanks and love of the thousands of lives you have saved."
msgstr ""
"Son buenas noticias, sin duda. Aquí tenéis una pequeña recompensa. Puede que no sea mucho, pero lleva consigo el agradecimiento y el cariño de los miles de vidas que habéis salvado."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC180.rude:11
msgid "The boats should be coming very soon."
msgstr "Los barcos llegarán muy pronto."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC180.rude:12
msgid "A promise?  What sort of promise?"
msgstr "¿Una promesa? ¿Qué clase de promesa?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC180.rude:12
msgid "He wants you to make a promise."
msgstr "Quiere que le hagáis una promesa."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC180.rude:13
msgid ""
"For as long as anyone can remember, there has been a frost giant who lives in Yanmir's Sky Fort.  When we were young we all heard stories of how he would come down at night and eat children.  Well the stories have turned out to be true."
msgstr ""
"Desde tiempos inmemoriales, un gigante de hielo vive en el Fuerte Celeste de Yanmir. De niños todos oíamos historias de cómo bajaba por la noche a comerse a los niños. Pues bien, las historias han resultado ser ciertas."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC180.rude:13
msgid "Tell us about the frost giant."
msgstr "Habladnos del gigante de hielo."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC180.rude:14
msgid ""
"Only if you could defeat the Frost Giant, or somehow break up the ice so the ships can put in to our port."
msgstr ""
"Solo si lograrais derrotar al Gigante de Hielo, o de algún modo romper el hielo para que los barcos puedan atracar en nuestro puerto."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC180.rude:14
msgid "Perhaps we could help?"
msgstr "¿Quizá podríamos ayudar?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC180.rude:15
msgid "But without your help, the Chedian will perish!"
msgstr "¡Pero sin vuestra ayuda, los chedianos perecerán!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC180.rude:15
msgid ""
"We are already perishing up here.  I have done all I can, and it is still not enough."
msgstr ""
"Aquí arriba ya estamos pereciendo. He hecho todo lo que he podido, y aún no basta."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC180.rude:16
msgid ""
"I am sorry.  I have no more help to give.  My nation is in shambles.  The people are starving because the boats can't get through.  Yanmir the Frost Giant is eating our children.  I have my hands full.  I cannot give any more."
msgstr ""
"Lo siento. No tengo más ayuda que dar. Mi nación está en ruinas. La gente pasa hambre porque los barcos no pueden llegar. Yanmir el Gigante de Hielo se está comiendo a nuestros hijos. Tengo las manos llenas. No puedo dar más."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC180.rude:17
msgid "A promise to remember to celebrate him."
msgstr "Una promesa de que os acordaréis de celebrarlo."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC180.rude:17
msgid ""
"If he brings the crops back, of course I will make that promise.  How does he want it?  A declaration?  I PROMISE!!  Is that good enough?"
msgstr ""
"Si devuelve las cosechas, por supuesto que haré esa promesa. ¿Cómo la quiere? ¿Una declaración? ¡LO PROMETO! ¿Basta con eso?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC180.rude:18
msgid ""
"A runestone promise?  I can think of nothing more binding than that.  If it brings my people back from the brink of starvation, I shall carve that runestone myself!"
msgstr ""
"¿Una promesa en una piedra rúnica? No se me ocurre nada más vinculante. Si con ello mi pueblo se salva de morir de hambre, ¡tallaré esa piedra rúnica yo mismo!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC180.rude:18
msgid "He wants you to carve it on a runestone."
msgstr "Quiere que la talléis en una piedra rúnica."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC180.rude:19
msgid "I appreciate that.  Thank you for all your help."
msgstr "Os lo agradezco. Gracias por toda vuestra ayuda."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC180.rude:19
msgid "We will tell him that for you."
msgstr "Se lo diremos de vuestra parte."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC180.rude:2
msgid ""
"News?  I only seem to deal in bad news.  My people are starving, and our children are being eaten by the Frost Giant.  How could things get any worse?"
msgstr ""
"¿Noticias? Parece que solo me llegan malas noticias. Mi gente se muere de hambre y el Gigante de Hielo se está comiendo a nuestros hijos. ¿Cómo podrían ir peor las cosas?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC180.rude:20
msgid ""
"No, I mean it!  You have done more for Frosgard than I ever have.  Perhaps it is you who should be Jarls.  I'm sorry; I shouldn't put that weight on you.  Was there anything else?"
msgstr ""
"¡No, lo digo en serio! Habéis hecho por Frosgard más de lo que yo he hecho nunca. Quizá deberíais ser vosotros los Jarls. Lo siento; no debería cargaros con ese peso. ¿Había algo más?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC180.rude:20 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC435.rude:3 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC46.rude:16
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC47.rude:7
msgctxt "said by the party"
msgid "You're welcome."
msgstr "De nada."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC180.rude:22
msgid ""
"I've heard that an army is marching towards us.  Good.  I won't put up a fight.  Maybe they will be able to rule Frosgard better than I have."
msgstr ""
"He oído que un ejército marcha hacia nosotros. Bien. No opondré resistencia. Quizá ellos sepan gobernar Frosgard mejor que yo."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC180.rude:22 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC278.rude:5
msgid "What do you know about the hordes?"
msgstr "¿Qué sabéis de las hordas?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC180.rude:23
msgid ""
"Frosgard used to have a thriving port, but in the last few years, the ice that comes in the winter has never gone away.  Since the boats can't get through, they can't bring enough food to feed our people."
msgstr ""
"Frosgard tenía antes un puerto próspero, pero en los últimos años el hielo que llega en invierno ya no se ha ido nunca. Como los barcos no pueden pasar, no pueden traer comida suficiente para alimentar a nuestra gente."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC180.rude:23
msgid "Tell us about the frozen sea."
msgstr "Habladnos del mar helado."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC180.rude:24
msgid "Is there anything else you needed?"
msgstr "¿Necesitabais algo más?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC180.rude:25 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC180.rude:37
msgid ""
"Great!  You have done a wonderful thing!  I shall send word to all the Jarls immediately!"
msgstr ""
"¡Estupendo! ¡Habéis hecho algo maravilloso! ¡Enviaré aviso a todos los Jarls de inmediato!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC180.rude:26
msgid "About those things you need done...."
msgstr "Sobre esas cosas que necesitáis que hagamos..."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC180.rude:27
msgid ""
"Sven Svenssen you mean?  He's the Jarl of Thjorgard.  I wish I were in his shoes.  Maybe I should talk to him for some advice.  He's the most powerful man in Chedian!"
msgstr ""
"¿Os referís a Sven Svenssen? Es el Jarl de Thjorgard. Ojalá estuviera yo en su lugar. Quizá debería pedirle consejo. ¡Es el hombre más poderoso de Chedian!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC180.rude:28
msgid "Good luck in your travels."
msgstr "Buena suerte en vuestros viajes."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC180.rude:29 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC180.rude:30 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC45.rude:39
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC87.rude:33
msgid "We've already done that."
msgstr "Ya lo hemos hecho."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC180.rude:29
msgid ""
"You have?  Wonderful!  You have put the first smile on this old face in many years!"
msgstr ""
"¿De verdad? ¡Maravilloso! ¡Habéis puesto la primera sonrisa en esta vieja cara en muchos años!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC180.rude:3
msgid "May Krohn himself take an interest in your success!  Good luck!"
msgstr "¡Que el mismísimo Krohn vele por vuestro éxito! ¡Buena suerte!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC180.rude:30
msgid "What?  How?  Even my strongest men couldn't do such a feat!"
msgstr ""
"¿Qué? ¿Cómo? ¡Ni mis hombres más fuertes podrían lograr semejante hazaña!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC180.rude:31
msgid "Yanmir the Frost Giant is dead."
msgstr "Yanmir el Gigante de Hielo ha muerto."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC180.rude:31
msgid ""
"You have slain him?  How can that be?  He has killed some of my best soldiers before you?"
msgstr ""
"¿Lo habéis matado? ¿Cómo es posible? ¿No mató a algunos de mis mejores soldados antes que vosotros?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC180.rude:32
msgid "I don't blame you.  It's an impossible task."
msgstr "No os culpo. Es una tarea imposible."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC180.rude:32
msgid "We need more time before we can take that on."
msgstr "Necesitamos más tiempo antes de enfrentarnos a eso."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC180.rude:33
msgid ""
"I have heard!!  What wonderful news!  You have put a smile on this old face for the first time in years!"
msgstr ""
"¡Ya me he enterado! ¡Qué noticia tan maravillosa! ¡Habéis puesto una sonrisa en esta vieja cara por primera vez en años!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC180.rude:33
msgid "The ice has been cleared from the docks."
msgstr "Ya no hay hielo en los muelles."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC180.rude:34
msgid "I know it's an impossible task.  I don't blame you for not taking it."
msgstr "Sé que es una tarea imposible. No os culpo por no aceptarla."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC180.rude:34
msgid "We can't do that right now."
msgstr "Ahora mismo no podemos hacerlo."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC180.rude:35
msgid "We have done as you asked.  Will you help us now?"
msgstr "Hemos hecho lo que pedisteis. ¿Nos ayudaréis ahora?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC180.rude:36
msgid "It's running out for me you know.  Time that is."
msgstr "Se me está acabando, ¿sabéis? El tiempo, digo."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC180.rude:37
msgid "The Clans have united.  It is time for the war council."
msgstr "Los clanes se han unido. Es hora del consejo de guerra."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC180.rude:38
msgid ""
"Maybe you should talk to Soxolf Tryygvassen.  He built the one we have in the first place.  I'm sure he'll be able to help."
msgstr ""
"Quizá deberíais hablar con Soxolf Tryygvassen. Él construyó el que tenemos. Seguro que podrá ayudaros."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC180.rude:38
msgid "The Green Man asked us to fix the maypole."
msgstr "El Hombre Verde nos pidió que arregláramos el palo de mayo."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC180.rude:39
msgid "The Green Man asked you to do something for him."
msgstr "El Hombre Verde os pide que hagáis algo por él."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC180.rude:39 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC32.rude:10 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC32.rude:11
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC32.rude:14 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC34.rude:3 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC34.rude:6
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC35.rude:3
msgid "What is that?"
msgstr "¿Qué es eso?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC180.rude:4
msgid ""
"If you could help me, you would find a way to break up that ice, so the boats could travel again.  If you would do that, the skalds would make sure your names lived forever!"
msgstr ""
"Si queréis ayudarme, encontrad la manera de romper ese hielo para que los barcos puedan volver a navegar. Si lo hacéis, ¡los escaldos se asegurarán de que vuestros nombres vivan para siempre!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC180.rude:4
msgid "What can we do?"
msgstr "¿Qué podemos hacer?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC180.rude:41
msgid "We failed you Tryygva, and we are sorry."
msgstr "Os hemos fallado, Tryygva, y lo sentimos."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC180.rude:41
msgid ""
"You may yet have the chance to save my people again, warriors.  Go, and rescue us."
msgstr ""
"Puede que aún tengáis ocasión de salvar de nuevo a mi pueblo, guerreros. Id y rescatadnos."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC180.rude:5
msgid "May the gods look kindly upon you for all your days!"
msgstr ""
"¡Que los dioses os miren con buenos ojos todos los días de vuestra vida!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC180.rude:6
msgid ""
"But I see you were.  That is great news!  I am certain all the families throughout Frosgard will be thanking you!  Here is a reward.  It is a pittance, I know, but we are poor here.  Think of it more as a symbol of our gratitude."
msgstr ""
"Pero veo que sí lo erais. ¡Es una gran noticia! ¡Estoy seguro de que todas las familias de Frosgard os lo agradecerán! Aquí tenéis una recompensa. Ya sé que es una miseria, pero aquí somos pobres. Tomadla más bien como un símbolo de nuestra gratitud."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC180.rude:6
msgid "Perhaps they were not strong enough."
msgstr "Quizá no eran lo bastante fuertes."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC180.rude:35 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC180.rude:7
msgid ""
"It would seem there is nothing you cannot accomplish.  I would be proud to call you allies."
msgstr ""
"Parece que no hay nada que no podáis lograr. Me enorgullecería llamaros aliados."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC180.rude:7
msgid "Now that we have done as you asked, will you join us?"
msgstr "Ahora que hemos hecho lo que pedisteis, ¿os uniréis a nosotros?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC180.rude:8
msgid ""
"If you are to help me, find a way into the Sky Fort, and slay the Frost Giant.  As far as I know, it would be impossible to kill him outright.  But the Sky Fort is old and rickety.  I'm sure there is a way you could trick him into killing himself."
msgstr ""
"Si queréis ayudarme, encontrad la manera de entrar en el Fuerte Celeste y matad al Gigante de Hielo. Que yo sepa, sería imposible matarlo sin más. Pero el Fuerte Celeste es viejo y destartalado. Seguro que hay una forma de engañarlo para que se mate él mismo."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC180.rude:8 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC241.rude:4
msgid "What can we do to help?"
msgstr "¿Qué podemos hacer para ayudar?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC180.rude:9
msgid "Send the word, and Frosgard shall be ready."
msgstr "Mandad aviso, y Frosgard estará preparada."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC180.rude:9
msgid "We shall be having a war council soon."
msgstr "Pronto celebraremos un consejo de guerra."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC181.rude:1
msgid "The Ranger's Trial consist of two separate tasks."
msgstr "La Prueba del Forestal consta de dos tareas distintas."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC181.rude:11
msgid "Come back to me when you do."
msgstr "Volved a verme cuando lo hayáis hecho."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC181.rude:12
msgid "Tell us about the second task."
msgstr "Habladnos de la segunda tarea."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC181.rude:12
msgid ""
"There is a place in Frosgard known as the Dungeon of Secrets.  To pass the second test, you must go from one end of the dungeon to the other.  If you survive, you pass."
msgstr ""
"En Frosgard hay un lugar conocido como la Mazmorra de los Secretos. Para superar la segunda prueba, debéis ir de un extremo de la mazmorra al otro. Si sobrevivís, la superáis."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC181.rude:13
msgid "Perhaps you are not yet worthy."
msgstr "Quizá aún no seáis dignos."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC181.rude:14
msgid "Maybe you are not worthy just yet."
msgstr "Puede que todavía no seáis dignos."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC181.rude:15
msgid ""
"All of Frosgard has neglected nature.  It's no wonder the people are starving!"
msgstr ""
"Todo Frosgard ha descuidado la naturaleza. ¡No es de extrañar que la gente pase hambre!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC181.rude:16 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC420.rude:5 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC88.rude:13
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC88.rude:7
msgctxt "said by the party"
msgid "Perhaps another time."
msgstr "Quizá en otra ocasión."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC181.rude:16
msgid "You will return when you are braver."
msgstr "Volveréis cuando seáis más valientes."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC181.rude:17
msgid "About the Ranger's Trial."
msgstr "Sobre la Prueba del Forestal."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC181.rude:18
msgid ""
"Chadwick already informed me of your success.  Congratulations.  I hereby promote you to Rangers."
msgstr ""
"Chadwick ya me ha informado de vuestro éxito. Felicidades. Por la presente os asciendo a Forestales."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC181.rude:18
msgid "We've completed the Ranger's Trial."
msgstr "Hemos completado la Prueba del Forestal."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC181.rude:19
msgid "Good Luck"
msgstr "Buena suerte"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC181.rude:19
msgid "We will do these tasks"
msgstr "Haremos esas tareas"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC181.rude:2
msgid "Carry yourselves with pride and honor.  Farewell."
msgstr "Comportaos con orgullo y honor. Adiós."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC181.rude:3
msgid "Tell us about the first task."
msgstr "Habladnos de la primera tarea."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC181.rude:3
msgid ""
"There is a bow known as Everstrike.  It is the greatest bow ever made.  It never misses.  To pass the first test, you need to find this bow.  The last I heard, someone named the Dook had been looking for it also.  You'd better find it before he does."
msgstr ""
"Existe un arco conocido como Golpe Eterno. Es el mejor arco jamás fabricado. Nunca falla. Para superar la primera prueba, tenéis que encontrar ese arco. Lo último que supe es que alguien llamado el Dook también lo andaba buscando. Más os vale encontrarlo antes que él."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC181.rude:5
msgid "Very good."
msgstr "Muy bien."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC181.rude:6
msgid ""
"Frosgard is facing a plight of nature.  It's horrible.  I wish Tryygva would do something about it!"
msgstr ""
"Frosgard sufre una plaga de la naturaleza. Es horrible. ¡Ojalá Tryygva hiciera algo al respecto!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC181.rude:8
msgid "Very well.  Good luck."
msgstr "Muy bien. Buena suerte."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC181.rude:9
msgid ""
"The Ranger's Test is quite an ordeal.  Do you have any that are worthy?"
msgstr ""
"La Prueba del Forestal es todo un calvario. ¿Tenéis a alguien que sea digno?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC181.rude:9
msgid "We've heard you can promote Crusaders to Rangers."
msgstr "Hemos oído que podéis ascender a los Cruzados a Forestales."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC182.rude:2
msgid "How do we find the Green Man?"
msgstr "¿Cómo encontramos al Hombre Verde?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC182.rude:2
msgid ""
"There is a man who might be able to help you.  He is a tracker named Fland de Allasan A'Lanth a'rysha.  The last I saw of him, he was hanging around Frosgard City."
msgstr ""
"Hay un hombre que quizá pueda ayudaros. Es un rastreador llamado Fland de Allasan A'Lanth a'rysha. La última vez que lo vi rondaba por la Ciudad de Frosgard."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC182.rude:3
msgid ""
"It's a travesty how the people here have neglected the Green Man!  It's no wonder he's abandon us!"
msgstr ""
"¡Es una vergüenza cómo la gente de aquí ha descuidado al Hombre Verde! ¡No es de extrañar que nos haya abandonado!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC182.rude:4 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC3.rude:15 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC3.rude:20
msgid "I wish you luck."
msgstr "Os deseo suerte."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC182.rude:4
msgid "We will find the Green Man."
msgstr "Encontraremos al Hombre Verde."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC182.rude:5
msgid ""
"To have your worth truly measured, you must find the Green Man.  The people of Frosgard have long neglected him, and he has not been seen much anymore.  If you can find the Green Man and gain his approval, you will not need me to promote you."
msgstr ""
"Para que vuestra valía se mida de verdad, debéis encontrar al Hombre Verde. La gente de Frosgard lo ha descuidado durante mucho tiempo, y ya apenas se le ve. Si encontráis al Hombre Verde y obtenéis su aprobación, no necesitaréis que yo os ascienda."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC182.rude:6
msgid "Our Healers are looking for promotion."
msgstr "Nuestros Curanderos buscan un ascenso."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC182.rude:6
msgid ""
"The Druidical Endeavor is not for the weak.  Not all Healers are worthy of becoming Druids.  Do you have any who are worthy of this promotion?"
msgstr ""
"La Empresa Druídica no es para los débiles. No todos los Curanderos son dignos de convertirse en Druidas. ¿Tenéis a alguien digno de este ascenso?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC182.rude:7
msgid "He's a very difficult person to find!"
msgstr "¡Es una persona muy difícil de encontrar!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC182.rude:7 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC189.rude:7
msgid "What do you know about the Green Man?"
msgstr "¿Qué sabéis del Hombre Verde?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC182.rude:8
msgid "Maybe you are not as worthy as you thought you were."
msgstr "Quizá no seáis tan dignos como creíais."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC182.rude:8
msgid "Perhaps we will do this later."
msgstr "Quizá lo hagamos más tarde."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC182.rude:9
msgid "Come back when you have."
msgstr "Volved cuando lo hayáis hecho."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC183.rude:1
msgid "Thanks for the advice."
msgstr "Gracias por el consejo."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC183.rude:2
msgid ""
"Only if you wish to become a Lich.  Here, I have the first half of it.  Only by finding the second half will you be able to become a lich."
msgstr ""
"Solo si deseáis convertiros en Liche. Tomad, tengo la primera mitad. Solo si encontráis la segunda mitad podréis convertiros en liche."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC183.rude:2
msgid "We have to get this document?"
msgstr "¿Tenemos que conseguir ese documento?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC183.rude:3
msgid ""
"Then I shall tell you of the Lich's Transmutation.  In the place known as Chasm of the Dead, an ancient burial ground in Drangheim lies a parchment that contains the instructions on how to become a Lich."
msgstr ""
"Entonces os hablaré de la Transmutación del Liche. En el lugar conocido como Abismo de los Muertos, un antiguo cementerio de Drangheim, yace un pergamino con las instrucciones para convertirse en Liche."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC183.rude:4
msgid ""
"Perhaps one day there will be a Scholar among you who will wish to become a Lich?"
msgstr ""
"¿Quizá algún día haya entre vosotros un Erudito que desee convertirse en Liche?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC183.rude:4
msgid "What sort of information is that?"
msgstr "¿Qué clase de información es esa?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC183.rude:5
msgid ""
"You have the look of someone who might be interested in the information I have."
msgstr "Tenéis aspecto de estar interesados en la información que poseo."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC183.rude:6 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC388.rude:4 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC83.rude:3
msgid "Ask your questions."
msgstr "Haced vuestras preguntas."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC183.rude:7
msgid "That is too bad.  There is gold to be had there, also."
msgstr "Es una lástima. Allí también hay oro que conseguir."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC183.rude:8
msgid "More than I shall share with you."
msgstr "Más de lo que voy a compartir con vosotros."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC184.rude:1
msgid "Sorry"
msgstr "Lo sentimos"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC184.rude:1
msgid ""
"Well no sense in getting upset over it.  Here's a little bit for your effort.  I appreciate you trying at least.  Farewell."
msgstr ""
"Bueno, no tiene sentido enfadarse por ello. Aquí tenéis un poco por vuestro esfuerzo. Al menos os agradezco que lo hayáis intentado. Adiós."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC184.rude:10
msgid ""
"As a matter of fact, there is.  You see my apprentices have created a new brew that doesn't seem to be popular here.  It's a strange color, and there's not much of the foam on it, but I have a feeling the Guberlandians will like it."
msgstr ""
"Pues sí, lo hay. Veréis, mis aprendices han creado una cerveza nueva que no parece gustar por aquí. Tiene un color raro y apenas hace espuma, pero tengo el presentimiento de que a los guberlandeses les gustará."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC184.rude:11
msgid "Alright.  Ask your questions."
msgstr "De acuerdo. Haced vuestras preguntas."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC184.rude:12
msgid "That's great news!  How much did you get for it?"
msgstr "¡Es una gran noticia! ¿Cuánto os han dado por ella?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC184.rude:12
msgid "We sold the beer."
msgstr "Hemos vendido la cerveza."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC184.rude:13
msgid "We couldn't sell the beer."
msgstr "No hemos podido vender la cerveza."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC184.rude:13
msgid ""
"You dolts!  I bet you told them my apprentices made it, didn't you!  Now what am I going to do with all this stuff?  I'll have to throw it out!"
msgstr ""
"¡Zoquetes! Apuesto a que les dijisteis que la habían hecho mis aprendices, ¿verdad? ¿Y ahora qué hago yo con todo esto? ¡Tendré que tirarlo!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC184.rude:2
msgid "500 gold."
msgstr "500 de oro."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC184.rude:2
msgid ""
"Great!  Tell you what, why don't you keep that.  If they like it, I'm sure they'll want to order more.  Thanks for your help.  I really appreciate it."
msgstr ""
"¡Estupendo! ¿Sabéis qué? Quedáoslo. Si les gusta, seguro que querrán pedir más. Gracias por vuestra ayuda. Os lo agradezco de verdad."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC184.rude:5
msgid ""
"Two of my apprentices have come up with a new concoction, and it's horrible!  Just the thing I can sell to the Guberland Clan."
msgstr ""
"Dos de mis aprendices han inventado un brebaje nuevo, ¡y es horrible! Justo lo que puedo vender al clan Guberland."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC184.rude:6
msgid "Very good.  Once you've sold the keg, return to me for your reward."
msgstr ""
"Muy bien. Cuando hayáis vendido el tonel, volved a verme para recibir vuestra recompensa."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC184.rude:6
msgid "We will be happy to do that for you."
msgstr "Lo haremos encantados."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC184.rude:7
msgid ""
"I want you to go to the tavern in Guberland and convince them to purchase this brew.  If they like what you give them, tell them there will be more where that came from!"
msgstr ""
"Quiero que vayáis a la taberna de Guberland y los convenzáis de que compren esta cerveza. Si les gusta lo que les dais, ¡decidles que hay más de donde salió!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC184.rude:8
msgid ""
"They're all pretty much suckers.  If I find a brew I've had for too long, or something that's gone bad, I can usually sell it in Guberland for outrageous profits."
msgstr ""
"Son todos bastante ingenuos. Si tengo una cerveza que lleva demasiado tiempo guardada o algo que se ha echado a perder, normalmente puedo venderlo en Guberland con unos beneficios escandalosos."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC184.rude:9
msgid "Alright.  Well I guess I'll hang on to it a little longer then."
msgstr "De acuerdo. Bueno, supongo que lo guardaré un poco más, entonces."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC184.rude:9
msgid "We don't have time to peddle beer."
msgstr "No tenemos tiempo para ir vendiendo cerveza."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC185.rude:1 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC240.rude:4 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC282.rude:10
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC378.rude:2
msgid "Good luck!"
msgstr "¡Buena suerte!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC185.rude:1 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC36.rude:1 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC5.rude:3
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC57.rude:8
msgid "Thanks for the tip!"
msgstr "¡Gracias por el consejo!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC185.rude:2
msgid "Of course you may."
msgstr "Por supuesto que podéis."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC185.rude:3
msgid ""
"Find yourself a healer.  They will save your behind more often than any plain old fighter could!"
msgstr ""
"Buscaos un curandero. ¡Os salvará el pellejo más a menudo que cualquier simple luchador!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC185.rude:4 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC337.rude:20
msgid "Go in peace, children."
msgstr "Id en paz, hijos."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC185.rude:5 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC187.rude:5 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC189.rude:9
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC190.rude:15 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC192.rude:7
msgid "Have you heard anything interesting?"
msgstr "¿Has oído algo interesante?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC185.rude:5
msgid "I heard Skulkil the Dark knows how to become a lich."
msgstr "He oído que Skulkil el Oscuro sabe cómo convertirse en liche."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC186.rude:2
msgid "Well thanks for your help.  Farewell."
msgstr "Bueno, gracias por vuestra ayuda. Adiós."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC186.rude:2
msgctxt "said by the party"
msgid "Yeah."
msgstr "Sí."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC186.rude:3
msgid ""
"Business has been pretty bad around here.  It's time for me to move on to greener pastures, I think.  I'd like to go to Thronheim, but it is a dangerous journey, and I couldn't do it alone."
msgstr ""
"Los negocios van bastante mal por aquí. Creo que es hora de buscar pastos más verdes. Me gustaría ir a Thronheim, pero es un viaje peligroso y no podría hacerlo solo."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC186.rude:4
msgid "We've come to guard your boat."
msgstr "Venimos a vigilar tu barco."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC186.rude:4
msgid ""
"You have?!  Great! I plan on leaving at six tomorrow morning.  Show up at the dock at 3 am and relieve the late guard.  I'll come and relieve you myself around 6."
msgstr ""
"¿De verdad? ¡Estupendo! Pienso zarpar mañana a las seis de la mañana. Presentaos en el muelle a las 3 de la madrugada y relevad al guardia del turno de noche. Yo mismo iré a relevaros hacia las 6."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC186.rude:5
msgid "Thronheim is a wonderful place!  I'm sure it will make me a fortune!"
msgstr "¡Thronheim es un lugar maravilloso! ¡Seguro que allí haré fortuna!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC186.rude:5 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC187.rude:3 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC241.rude:10
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC242.rude:8 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC252.rude:3 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC255.rude:5
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC272.rude:8 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC280.rude:3
msgid "What do you know about Thronheim?"
msgstr "¿Qué sabes de Thronheim?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC186.rude:7
msgid "Three to six AM!"
msgstr "¡De tres a seis de la madrugada!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC186.rude:7
msgid "When is our shift again?"
msgstr "¿Cuándo era nuestro turno?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC186.rude:8
msgid "Great, thanks to you!"
msgstr "¡Muy bien, gracias a vosotros!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC186.rude:9
msgid "Good luck on your journey."
msgstr "Buena suerte en tu viaje."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC186.rude:9
msgid ""
"Thank you!  Thorfinn told me to pay you this gold for your help.  I guess this makes you a Mercenary now?"
msgstr ""
"¡Gracias! Thorfinn me dijo que os pagara este oro por vuestra ayuda. Supongo que esto os convierte en Mercenarios, ¿no?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC187.rude:1
msgid ""
"My father's business is not doing well.  We want to move to Thronheim."
msgstr "El negocio de mi padre no va bien. Queremos mudarnos a Thronheim."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC187.rude:3
msgid "My father says that moving there will make us rich!"
msgstr "¡Mi padre dice que mudarnos allí nos hará ricos!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC187.rude:5
msgid ""
"I heard Skulkil the Dark in Frosgard teaches people how to become Liches."
msgstr ""
"He oído que Skulkil el Oscuro, en Frosgard, enseña a la gente a convertirse en Liche."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC188.rude:2
msgid ""
"Good luck!  It's been a long time since there was a temple to Igdrasa in Guberland."
msgstr ""
"¡Buena suerte! Hace mucho tiempo que no hay un templo de Igdrasa en Guberland."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC188.rude:3 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC3.rude:9
msgctxt "said by the party"
msgid "Great!"
msgstr "¡Estupendo!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC188.rude:3
msgid ""
"Here, that should do it.  Now don't lose it, I don't want you to keep bothering me!"
msgstr ""
"Tomad, con esto bastará. Y no lo perdáis, ¡no quiero que sigáis molestándome!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC188.rude:4
msgid "News?  Me?  What sort of news do you think an old priest has?"
msgstr ""
"¿Noticias? ¿Yo? ¿Qué clase de noticias creéis que tiene un viejo sacerdote?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC188.rude:5
msgid ""
"Ahh never mind.  You'll just forget it if I teach it to you.  Let me write it down."
msgstr ""
"Ah, da igual. Si os lo enseño, lo olvidaréis enseguida. Dejad que os lo escriba."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC188.rude:5
msgid "Yes, please teach us."
msgstr "Sí, enseñádnoslo, por favor."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC188.rude:6
msgid ""
"Ah, is that so?  Someone's finally replacing that Guberland Temple, eh?  I suppose I could teach you."
msgstr ""
"Ah, ¿conque sí? Por fin alguien va a reemplazar ese Templo de Guberland, ¿eh? Supongo que podría enseñaros."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC188.rude:6 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC208.rude:2
msgid "We need to learn the Ritual of Consecration."
msgstr "Necesitamos aprender el Ritual de Consagración."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC188.rude:7
msgid "We're looking for a priest."
msgstr "Buscamos un sacerdote."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC188.rude:7
msgid ""
"Well I'd say you found one.  An old one, but I've still got enough rocks in this braincase to do."
msgstr ""
"Pues yo diría que lo habéis encontrado. Uno viejo, pero todavía me quedan bastantes luces en esta mollera para hacerlo."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC188.rude:8
msgid ""
"If you are seeking to be promoted to priest, seek out Gray Slemnir in Guberland."
msgstr ""
"Si queréis ascender a Sacerdote, buscad a Slemnir el Gris en Guberland."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC188.rude:8
msgid "What do you know about priests?"
msgstr "¿Qué sabéis de los sacerdotes?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC189.rude:2
msgid ""
"Great!  Just remember these things.  Follow the path you had been going, always go left, and don't enter the tunnel.  Good luck."
msgstr ""
"¡Estupendo! Recordad solo estas cosas: seguid el camino por el que ibais, girad siempre a la izquierda y no entréis en el túnel. Buena suerte."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC189.rude:3
msgid ""
"You're in luck.  I've tracked him before.  It shouldn't be too hard to find him again.  Unfortunately, I am unable to lead you to him.  I could tell you the path I took though.  Would that be alright?"
msgstr ""
"Estáis de suerte. Ya le he seguido el rastro antes. No debería ser muy difícil encontrarlo otra vez. Por desgracia, no puedo guiaros hasta él. Pero sí podría deciros el camino que seguí. ¿Os parece bien?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC189.rude:4
msgid "Not that I'm willing to share."
msgstr "Nada que esté dispuesto a compartir."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC189.rude:5
msgid "Ah, and you need a tracker.  Very well.  I think I can help you."
msgstr "Ah, y necesitáis un rastreador. Muy bien. Creo que puedo ayudaros."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC189.rude:5
msgid "We've been charged with finding the Green Man."
msgstr "Nos han encargado encontrar al Hombre Verde."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC189.rude:6
msgid "How is that?"
msgstr "¿Cómo es eso?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC189.rude:7
msgid ""
"He is the spirit of the forest.  Maybe if people around here paid more attention to him, we might not be starving."
msgstr ""
"Es el espíritu del bosque. Quizá si la gente de por aquí le prestara más atención, no estaríamos pasando hambre."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC189.rude:9
msgid "I heard Skulkil the Dark knows how to become a Lich."
msgstr "He oído que Skulkil el Oscuro sabe cómo convertirse en Liche."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC19.rude:12
msgid ""
"Isn't that the truth.  Those two clans had better put aside their differences."
msgstr ""
"Y tanto que sí. Más les vale a esos dos clanes dejar a un lado sus diferencias."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC19.rude:12
msgid "The world has worse things to worry about."
msgstr "El mundo tiene cosas peores de las que preocuparse."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC19.rude:2
msgid ""
"Johannes Bem right here in Thjorgard can help you.  You can find him in the Bembridge University."
msgstr ""
"Johannes Bem, aquí mismo en Thjorgard, puede ayudaros. Lo encontraréis en la Universidad de Bembridge."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC19.rude:20
msgid "The tavern is the first building south of the eastern entrance."
msgstr "La taberna es el primer edificio al sur de la entrada este."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC19.rude:21
msgid ""
"You can find the armor shop just east of the training hall in the western part of town."
msgstr ""
"La tienda de armaduras está justo al este de la Sala de Entrenamiento, en la parte oeste de la ciudad."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC19.rude:22
msgid ""
"I've heard that Sturmford and Drangheim have not spoken to each other in at least ten years.  It's a wonder they don't go to war!"
msgstr ""
"He oído que Sturmford y Drangheim llevan por lo menos diez años sin dirigirse la palabra. ¡Es un milagro que no hayan ido a la guerra!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC19.rude:25
msgid "The magic shop is on the very next street to the west of us."
msgstr "La tienda de magia está en la calle de al lado, al oeste de aquí."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC19.rude:27
msgid "Not anymore than usual."
msgstr "No más de lo habitual."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC19.rude:28
msgid "The temple is in the most southeasterly part of town."
msgstr "El templo está en el extremo sureste de la ciudad."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC19.rude:29
msgid ""
"Seek out Tymon the Nord right here in Thjorgard.  He can be found in the Bembridge University."
msgstr ""
"Buscad a Tymon el Nórdico, aquí mismo en Thjorgard. Lo encontraréis en la Universidad de Bembridge."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC19.rude:3
msgid ""
"Sven lives in the castle on the hill in the westernmost section of town."
msgstr ""
"Sven vive en el castillo de la colina, en el extremo oeste de la ciudad."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC19.rude:32 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC308.rude:5 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC308.rude:9
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC35.rude:13 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC50.rude:18
msgid "No thank you."
msgstr "No, gracias."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC19.rude:35
msgid ""
"The training hall is in the western section of town, to the north of the gates to Sven's Hall."
msgstr ""
"La Sala de Entrenamiento está en la parte oeste de la ciudad, al norte de las puertas de la Sala de Sven."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC19.rude:36
msgid ""
"The apothecary is between the armor shop and the magic shop, west of here."
msgstr ""
"El apotecario está entre la tienda de armaduras y la tienda de magia, al oeste de aquí."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC19.rude:39
msgid "The general store is just east of the weapon shop, west of here."
msgstr ""
"La Tienda General está justo al este de la tienda de armas, al oeste de aquí."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC19.rude:39 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC61.rude:50
msgid "The general store."
msgstr "La Tienda General."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC19.rude:4
msgid "Do you have any other news?"
msgstr "¿Tienes alguna otra noticia?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC19.rude:4
msgid "I'm afraid not.  Was there anything I could help you with?"
msgstr "Me temo que no. ¿Puedo ayudaros en algo?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC19.rude:43
msgid "The library is in the southwest section of town, next to the bank."
msgstr "La biblioteca está en la parte suroeste de la ciudad, junto al banco."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC19.rude:44
msgid ""
"The Arena is in the northwest section of town, just north of the Bembridge University."
msgstr ""
"La Arena está en la parte noroeste de la ciudad, justo al norte de la Universidad de Bembridge."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC19.rude:44
msgid "We're looking for The Arena."
msgstr "Buscamos la Arena."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC19.rude:5
msgid ""
"You can find the weapon shop just east of the training hall in the western part of town."
msgstr ""
"La tienda de armas está justo al este de la Sala de Entrenamiento, en la parte oeste de la ciudad."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC19.rude:6
msgid ""
"You can find the bank in the southwest section of town, next to the library.  It is near the gates to Sven's Hall."
msgstr ""
"El banco está en la parte suroeste de la ciudad, junto a la biblioteca. Está cerca de las puertas de la Sala de Sven."

# imported from SP (MMMerge localization)
# address made plural (Claude)
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC190.rude:1
msgid "Thank you."
msgstr "Gracias."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC190.rude:11
msgid ""
"That's that awful place floating above Frosgard.  There's a big bad giant who lives in there.  If you're not careful, he'll eat your small children!  I've heard that he can't be killed!"
msgstr ""
"Es ese lugar espantoso que flota sobre Frosgard. Allí dentro vive un gigante grande y malo. Si no tenéis cuidado, ¡se comerá a vuestros niños! ¡He oído que no se le puede matar!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC190.rude:11
msgid "What do you know about the Sky Fort?"
msgstr "¿Qué sabes del Fuerte Celeste?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC190.rude:13
msgid "That's okay.  Come back when you do."
msgstr "No pasa nada. Volved cuando lo tengáis."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC190.rude:13
msgid "We don't have that much right now."
msgstr "Ahora mismo no tenemos tanto."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC190.rude:14 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC223.rude:5
msgid "Frosgard needs your help."
msgstr "Frosgard necesita vuestra ayuda."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC190.rude:14
msgid "Huh?"
msgstr "¿Eh?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC190.rude:15
msgid ""
"Skulkil the Dark got into another tavern fight.  If you ask me, he spends too much time in the tavern."
msgstr ""
"Skulkil el Oscuro se ha metido en otra pelea de taberna. Si me lo preguntáis, pasa demasiado tiempo en la taberna."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC190.rude:2
msgid "The Green Man requires a pledge from Frosgard."
msgstr "El Hombre Verde exige una promesa de Frosgard."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC190.rude:2 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC193.rude:5
msgid "What sort of pledge?"
msgstr "¿Qué clase de promesa?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC190.rude:3
msgid ""
"Great!  I've got a few orders to take care of first, but as soon as those are done, I'll get right on the maypole."
msgstr ""
"¡Estupendo! Tengo que atender antes unos cuantos encargos, pero en cuanto termine me pondré con el palo de mayo."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC190.rude:3
msgid "Sure.  That's no problem."
msgstr "Claro. No hay problema."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC190.rude:4
msgid "A pledge to not neglect him again."
msgstr "Una promesa de no volver a descuidarlo."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC190.rude:4
msgid ""
"If it will help our harvests return to normal, I'll give you that pledge!"
msgstr ""
"Si eso ayuda a que nuestras cosechas vuelvan a la normalidad, ¡os doy mi promesa!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC190.rude:5
msgid "We'd like you to fix it."
msgstr "Queremos que lo arregles."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC190.rude:5
msgid ""
"You would?  I'd be happy to!  I'll have to charge you 500 gold for materials."
msgstr ""
"¿De verdad? ¡Lo haré encantado! Tendré que cobraros 500 de oro por los materiales."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC190.rude:6
msgid ""
"I am a poster.  I make posts.  You know the maypole in the center of town?  I made that a few years ago.  It's a little worse for the wear these days, but no one has asked me to fix it."
msgstr ""
"Soy postero. Hago postes. ¿Conocéis el palo de mayo del centro del pueblo? Lo hice yo hace unos años. Hoy en día está algo deteriorado, pero nadie me ha pedido que lo arregle."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC190.rude:8
msgid "Tell the Green Man something for us.  Tell him we're sorry."
msgstr ""
"Decidle algo al Hombre Verde de nuestra parte. Decidle que lo sentimos."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC190.rude:9
msgid ""
"Our harvests have been horrible lately.  If nothing is done soon, we'll all starve!"
msgstr ""
"Últimamente nuestras cosechas han sido horribles. Si no se hace algo pronto, ¡moriremos todos de hambre!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC191.rude:2
msgid "News?  Yes!  My crops are failing!"
msgstr "¿Noticias? ¡Sí! ¡Mis cosechas se están echando a perder!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC191.rude:3
msgid ""
"If I remember him?  I suppose that's better than starving.  Alright.  I'll give you my pledge."
msgstr ""
"¿Que me acuerde de él? Supongo que es mejor que morir de hambre. De acuerdo. Os doy mi promesa."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC191.rude:3
msgid "The Green Man will fix your crops."
msgstr "El Hombre Verde salvará tus cosechas."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC191.rude:4
msgid "My crops are already failing."
msgstr "Mis cosechas ya se están echando a perder."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC191.rude:4
msgid "Without him, your crops will fail."
msgstr "Sin él, tus cosechas se echarán a perder."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC191.rude:5
msgid "That you will remember the Green Man."
msgstr "Que te acordarás del Hombre Verde."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC191.rude:5
msgid "The Green Man?  Why would we need to remember him?"
msgstr "¿El Hombre Verde? ¿Por qué tendríamos que acordarnos de él?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC191.rude:6 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC199.rude:4
msgid "A pledge?  What sort of pledge?"
msgstr "¿Una promesa? ¿Qué clase de promesa?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC191.rude:6
msgid "We need a pledge from you."
msgstr "Necesitamos que nos hagas una promesa."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC191.rude:7
msgid "What do you need?"
msgstr "¿Qué necesitáis?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC191.rude:8
msgid "What do I know about it?  Here's what:  it's making my crops fail!"
msgstr "¿Que qué sé? Pues esto: ¡está echando a perder mis cosechas!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC191.rude:8
msgid "What do you know about weather?"
msgstr "¿Qué sabes del tiempo?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC192.rude:1
msgid "If you succeed, we'll have you to thank.  Farewell."
msgstr "Si lo lográis, tendremos que agradecéroslo a vosotros. Adiós."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC192.rude:2
msgid ""
"I went out to pray to Fre last night to help my crops.  Do you know what happened?  That darned frost giant in the Sky Fort dumped his bucket out on my head!  I wish someone would do something about him!"
msgstr ""
"Anoche salí a rezar a Fre para que ayudara a mis cosechas. ¿Sabéis qué pasó? ¡Ese maldito gigante de hielo del Fuerte Celeste me vació su cubo en la cabeza! ¡Ojalá alguien hiciera algo con él!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC192.rude:3
msgid "The Green Man does not wish to be forgotten again."
msgstr "El Hombre Verde no desea que se le vuelva a olvidar."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC192.rude:3
msgid ""
"The Green Man spoke to you?  He wants a pledge from me?  Of course!  I will give it right now!"
msgstr ""
"¿El Hombre Verde os ha hablado? ¿Quiere una promesa mía? ¡Por supuesto! ¡Os la doy ahora mismo!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC192.rude:4
msgid "We've come to get a pledge from you."
msgstr "Hemos venido a pedirte una promesa."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC192.rude:4
msgid "What for?"
msgstr "¿Para qué?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC192.rude:5
msgid "She's my favorite goddess!  I wish she would help us!"
msgstr "¡Es mi diosa favorita! ¡Ojalá nos ayudara!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC192.rude:5
msgid "What do you know about Fre?"
msgstr "¿Qué sabes de Fre?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC192.rude:7
msgid ""
"I'm afraid of going to the tavern.  That Skulkil the Dark is always in there.  He scares me."
msgstr ""
"Me da miedo ir a la taberna. Ese Skulkil el Oscuro siempre está allí. Me asusta."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC193.rude:2
msgid "I'm hungry.  Got a sandwich?"
msgstr "Tengo hambre. ¿Tenéis un bocadillo?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC193.rude:3
msgid ""
"Oh!  Well, I've never liked going hungry.  I will give you that pledge."
msgstr "¡Oh! Bueno, nunca me ha gustado pasar hambre. Os daré esa promesa."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC193.rude:3
msgid "You won't starve anymore."
msgstr "Ya no pasarás más hambre."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC193.rude:4
msgid "To not forget to celebrate him again."
msgstr "Que no te olvidarás de volver a celebrarlo."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC193.rude:4
msgid "What do we get in return?"
msgstr "¿Y qué recibimos a cambio?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC193.rude:5 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC222.rude:4 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC227.rude:4
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC228.rude:4 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC229.rude:4 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC232.rude:4
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC236.rude:4
msgid "The Green Man needs a pledge from you."
msgstr "El Hombre Verde necesita una promesa tuya."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC193.rude:6 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC197.rude:5 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC199.rude:6
msgid "What sort of help do you need?"
msgstr "¿Qué clase de ayuda necesitáis?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC193.rude:7
msgid ""
"It's been getting harder to find food around here.  I'm going to have to move soon just to find something to eat!"
msgstr ""
"Cada vez cuesta más encontrar comida por aquí. ¡Pronto tendré que mudarme solo para tener algo que comer!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC193.rude:7
msgid "What do you know about starving?"
msgstr "¿Qué sabes de pasar hambre?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC194.rude:2
msgid ""
"Starve?  Hah!  I doubt that's going to happen.  And I think I don't like the attitude you've been giving me.  This conversation is over."
msgstr ""
"¿Morir de hambre? ¡Ja! Dudo mucho que eso vaya a pasar. Y creo que no me gusta la actitud que tenéis conmigo. Esta conversación se ha terminado."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC194.rude:2 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC198.rude:2
msgid "You'd rather starve?"
msgstr "¿Prefieres morir de hambre?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC194.rude:3
msgid "The Green Man wants a promise from you!"
msgstr "¡El Hombre Verde quiere que le hagas una promesa!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC194.rude:3
msgid ""
"What has he done for me?  Oh yeah!  Nothing!  He's not going to get a promise from me."
msgstr ""
"¿Qué ha hecho él por mí? ¡Ah, sí! ¡Nada! De mí no va a conseguir ninguna promesa."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC194.rude:4
msgid "We need your help!"
msgstr "¡Necesitamos tu ayuda!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC194.rude:4
msgid "Well you're not going to get it!"
msgstr "¡Pues no la vais a tener!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC194.rude:5
msgid "No!"
msgstr "¡No!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC194.rude:6
msgid "Well then leave me alone!"
msgstr "¡Pues entonces dejadme en paz!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC195.rude:1
msgid "You are a brave and noble group.  You are most welcome.  Farewell."
msgstr "Sois un grupo valiente y noble. No hay de qué. Adiós."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC195.rude:2
msgid "I will give that pledge!"
msgstr "¡Daré esa promesa!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC195.rude:2
msgid "That you will continue to have the festivals."
msgstr "Que seguiréis celebrando las fiestas."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC195.rude:3
msgid "A pledge?  For what?"
msgstr "¿Una promesa? ¿Para qué?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC195.rude:3
msgid "It's time for another one.  He wants a pledge."
msgstr "Ya toca otra. Quiere una promesa."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC195.rude:4 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC196.rude:4 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC199.rude:5
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC218.rude:5
msgid "The Green Man needs your help."
msgstr "El Hombre Verde necesita tu ayuda."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC195.rude:4
msgid ""
"Why would the Green Man need our help?  Or want it?  We Haven't had a festival in years!"
msgstr ""
"¿Por qué iba a necesitar nuestra ayuda el Hombre Verde? ¿O a quererla? ¡Hace años que no celebramos una fiesta!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC195.rude:5
msgid ""
"I am searching for a fair maiden to rescue.  Then I can marry her and settle down like a proper warrior!"
msgstr ""
"Busco una bella doncella a la que rescatar. ¡Así podré casarme con ella y sentar la cabeza como un auténtico guerrero!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC195.rude:6
msgid ""
"Is there a fair maiden that needs to be rescued?  I shall fetch my sword and get right on it!"
msgstr ""
"¿Hay alguna bella doncella que necesite ser rescatada? ¡Voy a por mi espada y me pongo a ello enseguida!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC195.rude:7
msgid "What do you know about rescuing fair maidens?"
msgstr "¿Qué sabes de rescatar bellas doncellas?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC195.rude:7
msgid ""
"When a young warrior is ready to hang up his sword and settle down, he must find a fair maiden to rescue."
msgstr ""
"Cuando un joven guerrero está listo para colgar la espada y sentar la cabeza, debe encontrar una bella doncella a la que rescatar."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC196.rude:2
msgid ""
"My cabbage froze solid last night.  I don't think I'll be able to harvest it at all."
msgstr ""
"Anoche se me congeló la col por completo. No creo que pueda cosecharla."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC196.rude:3
msgid "He needs a pledge that we won't forget him again."
msgstr "Necesita la promesa de que no volveremos a olvidarlo."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC196.rude:3
msgid ""
"Yes, of course!  I will give that pledge.  We have neglected him for far too long!"
msgstr ""
"¡Sí, por supuesto! Daré esa promesa. ¡Lo hemos descuidado durante demasiado tiempo!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC196.rude:4
msgid "The Green Man?  How can I help?"
msgstr "¿El Hombre Verde? ¿Cómo puedo ayudar?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC196.rude:5
msgid ""
"I know that if things don't get better soon, I'm going to have to move!"
msgstr "Sé que si las cosas no mejoran pronto, ¡tendré que mudarme!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC197.rude:2
msgid ""
"Yesterday my cat caught a rat in my pantry!  You know what he did then?  He left it on my pillow!"
msgstr ""
"¡Ayer mi gato cazó una rata en la despensa! ¿Sabéis qué hizo después? ¡Me la dejó en la almohada!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC197.rude:3
msgid "He wants a pledge that he won't be forgotten again."
msgstr "Quiere la promesa de que no volverá a ser olvidado."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC197.rude:3
msgid "You spoke to him?  He's come back?  Of course I'll give a pledge!"
msgstr ""
"¿Habéis hablado con él? ¿Ha vuelto? ¡Por supuesto que daré mi promesa!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC197.rude:4
msgid "It's about the Green Man."
msgstr "Se trata del Hombre Verde."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC197.rude:4
msgid ""
"The Green Man?  He abandon us long ago, and I don't blame him!  In fact, we abandon him, more like!"
msgstr ""
"¿El Hombre Verde? Nos abandonó hace mucho tiempo, ¡y no lo culpo! De hecho, ¡más bien fuimos nosotros quienes lo abandonamos!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC197.rude:6
msgid "I know the farmers are having some trouble with their crops!"
msgstr "¡Sé que los granjeros tienen problemas con sus cosechas!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC197.rude:6
msgid "What do you know about harvesting?"
msgstr "¿Qué sabes de la cosecha?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC197.rude:9 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC98.rude:6
msgid "Thanks for you time."
msgstr "Gracias por tu tiempo."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC198.rude:1
msgid "Don't bother me again."
msgstr "No volváis a molestarme."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC198.rude:2
msgid ""
"Maybe if these farmers would get out of the taverns and back to work, there wouldn't be a food shortage!"
msgstr ""
"¡Quizá si estos granjeros salieran de las tabernas y volvieran al trabajo, no faltaría comida!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC198.rude:3
msgid ""
"Now you're just deluding yourself.  He's not real, and you're not going to make a fool of me.  Now be off with you!"
msgstr ""
"Ahora os estáis engañando a vosotros mismos. No es real, y no vais a dejarme en ridículo. ¡Y ahora largaos!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC198.rude:3
msgid "We spoke to him.  He needs a pledge."
msgstr "Hemos hablado con él. Necesita una promesa."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC198.rude:4
msgid "The Green Man needs it."
msgstr "La necesita el Hombre Verde."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC198.rude:4
msgid "The Green Man?  Ha!  He doesn't even exist."
msgstr "¿El Hombre Verde? ¡Ja! Ni siquiera existe."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC198.rude:5
msgid "My help?  Why should I give you my help?"
msgstr "¿Mi ayuda? ¿Por qué iba a daros mi ayuda?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC198.rude:6
msgid "I don't have time for those things."
msgstr "No tengo tiempo para esas cosas."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC198.rude:7
msgid "See that it doesn't happen again."
msgstr "Procurad que no vuelva a ocurrir."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC199.rude:1
msgid ""
"When I was younger, a playmate of mine pulled a fish from a stream.  He said it looked like me.  Ever since then they've called me Erik the Fish-head."
msgstr ""
"Cuando era más joven, un compañero de juegos sacó un pez de un arroyo. Dijo que se parecía a mí. Desde entonces me llaman Erik Cabeza de Pez."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC199.rude:3
msgid "A pledge to have a party?  Of course!  I will give that."
msgstr "¿La promesa de dar una fiesta? ¡Por supuesto! Esa la daré."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC199.rude:3
msgid "That he won't be forgotten again.  To celebrate him again."
msgstr "Que no volverá a ser olvidado. Que volveréis a celebrarlo."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC199.rude:4
msgid "He needs a pledge."
msgstr "Necesita una promesa."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC199.rude:5
msgid ""
"The Green Man has returned?  Frankly I was beginning to think he didn't exist anymore.  What does he need of us?  A sword?  Is there a man I need to kill?"
msgstr ""
"¿El Hombre Verde ha vuelto? Francamente, empezaba a pensar que ya no existía. ¿Qué necesita de nosotros? ¿Una espada? ¿Hay algún hombre al que deba matar?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC199.rude:7
msgid "Nothing.  I'm a soldier, not a farmer."
msgstr "Nada. Soy soldado, no granjero."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC199.rude:7
msgid "What do you know about farming?"
msgstr "¿Qué sabes de agricultura?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC2.rude:1
msgid ""
"Very well.  If you intend to stand in the way of the Beldonian conquest, then there is nothing more we have to say to each other."
msgstr ""
"Muy bien. Si pretendéis interponeros en la conquista beldoniana, no tenemos nada más que decirnos."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC2.rude:1
msgid "We could never rule alongside a traitor!"
msgstr "¡Jamás podríamos gobernar junto a un traidor!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC2.rude:11
msgid ""
"There is only one lane in which boats can reach this dock.  Unfortunately, Bone Thrashers have been coming from one of those islands and are preventing the boat from leaving.  If we are to get off this island, we'll have to take care of them first."
msgstr ""
"Solo hay un canal por el que los barcos pueden llegar a este muelle. Por desgracia, los Trilladores de Huesos vienen de una de esas islas y no dejan zarpar al barco. Si queremos salir de esta isla, primero tendremos que encargarnos de ellos."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC2.rude:12
msgid "Fair enough.  We'll take care of them then."
msgstr "Me parece justo. Entonces nos encargaremos de ellos."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC2.rude:12
msgid ""
"Great.  I would be more than happy to come with you on this quest.  And you know what?  I bet there's something behind that locked door that will help us!"
msgstr ""
"Estupendo. Me encantaría acompañaros en esta misión. ¿Y sabéis qué? ¡Apuesto a que detrás de esa puerta cerrada hay algo que nos ayudará!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC2.rude:13
msgid "Welcome Aboard."
msgstr "Bienvenido a bordo."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC2.rude:14
msgid ""
"It is not as bad a place as people make it out.  In the summer time, it's actually quite nice."
msgstr ""
"No es un lugar tan malo como dice la gente. En verano, de hecho, es bastante agradable."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC2.rude:15
msgid "No.  Who is that?"
msgstr "No. ¿Quién es esa?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC2.rude:15
msgid ""
"She is the sage who lives on one of these islands.  She may want to speak to you."
msgstr ""
"Es la sabia que vive en una de estas islas. Puede que quiera hablar con vosotros."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC2.rude:16
msgid "It is our destiny to unite the six clans against Tamur Leng."
msgstr "Nuestro destino es unir a los seis clanes contra Tamur Leng."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC2.rude:16
msgid ""
"Tamur Leng?  The leader of the Beldonian Hordes sweeping across Rysh?  If it is your job to kill him, then I am at your disposal.  I would like to leave as soon as you are ready, however, there is something that must be done first."
msgstr ""
"¿Tamur Leng? ¿El caudillo de las Hordas Beldonianas que arrasan Rysh? Si vuestra tarea es matarlo, estoy a vuestra disposición. Me gustaría partir en cuanto estéis listos, pero antes hay algo que debe hacerse."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC2.rude:17
msgid "See you soon."
msgstr "Hasta pronto."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC2.rude:17
msgid "We have a few things to do first."
msgstr "Antes tenemos que hacer unas cuantas cosas."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC2.rude:19
msgid "Not much, really.  He is the Prince of Beldonia."
msgstr "No mucho, la verdad. Es el Príncipe de Beldonia."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC2.rude:20
msgid ""
"As I recall, Bjarni is quite taken with Kira the Cold.  If she asked, I'm certain that he would put his sword into his own chest, and smile while doing it."
msgstr ""
"Si no recuerdo mal, Bjarni está prendado de Kira la Fría. Si ella se lo pidiera, estoy seguro de que se clavaría la espada en el pecho, y lo haría sonriendo."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC2.rude:20
msgid "Where are we going to find someone to write a treaty?"
msgstr "¿Dónde vamos a encontrar a alguien que redacte un tratado?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC2.rude:21
msgid ""
"This is Thjorgard, the seat of power for Clan Thjorgard.  Without at doubt, they are the most powerful clan in Chedian.  Their Jarl, Sven Forkbeard makes most of his money off of taxing the production, refining, and smithing of Elemental Thjorad."
msgstr ""
"Esto es Thjorgard, la sede del poder del clan Thjorgard. Sin duda, es el clan más poderoso de Chedian. Su Jarl, Sven Forkbeard, obtiene la mayor parte de su dinero de los impuestos sobre la extracción, el refinado y la forja del Thjorad Elemental."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC2.rude:21 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC2.rude:22 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC2.rude:25
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC2.rude:27 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC2.rude:28 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC2.rude:29
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC2.rude:30 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC2.rude:31 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC2.rude:32
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC2.rude:33 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC35.rude:2 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC66.rude:1
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC76.rude:10
msgid "What do you know about this place?"
msgstr "¿Qué sabes de este lugar?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC2.rude:22
msgid ""
"This is Sturmford, the seat for Clan Sturmford.  The Jarl of this region is named Bjarni Thorvaldssen, a straightforward, if a bit simple man.  Sturmford and their neighbor Drangheim have been fighting for centuries."
msgstr ""
"Esto es Sturmford, la sede del clan Sturmford. El Jarl de esta región se llama Bjarni Thorvaldssen, un hombre franco, aunque algo simple. Sturmford y su vecino Drangheim llevan siglos enfrentados."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC2.rude:23
msgid ""
"I think you have misjudged me.  In the eyes of my master, Tamur Leng, I have just done a great service to my nation!  He has rewarded me by making me Lord of Chedian!"
msgstr ""
"Creo que me habéis juzgado mal. ¡A ojos de mi amo, Tamur Leng, acabo de prestar un gran servicio a mi nación! ¡Me ha recompensado nombrándome Señor de Chedian!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC2.rude:23
msgid "There you are, Traitor!!!"
msgstr "¡¡¡Ahí estás, traidor!!!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC2.rude:24
msgid ""
"Those are the Verhoffin Ruins.  I wouldn't advise you to enter them.  All that's in there for you is your death."
msgstr ""
"Son las Ruinas de Verhoffin. No os aconsejo entrar. Lo único que os espera allí dentro es la muerte."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC2.rude:25
msgid ""
"This is the seat for Clan Drangheim.  Their Jarl, Sigmund the Stressed while perhaps not the most elegant of men is a competent ruler.  They have been at odds with Sturmford ever since they broke off from them to start their own clan centuries ago."
msgstr ""
"Esta es la sede del clan Drangheim. Su Jarl, Sigmund el Estresado, quizá no sea el más elegante de los hombres, pero es un gobernante competente. Están enfrentados con Sturmford desde que se separaron de ellos hace siglos para fundar su propio clan."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC2.rude:26
msgid ""
"I bet that there's a way to beat the skeletoids behind it.  Maybe we should ask Yrsa."
msgstr ""
"Apuesto a que hay una forma de vencer a los esqueletoides que hay detrás. Quizá deberíamos preguntar a Yrsa."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC2.rude:26
msgid "What was that you said about a locked door?"
msgstr "¿Qué decías de una puerta cerrada?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC2.rude:27
msgid ""
"This is Guberland, probably the most unpopular Clan in Chedian.  Their Jarl, a man named Markel, chose for himself the nickname \"the Great\" however unproven that title may be.  He is a somewhat abrasive man with a flair for self-flattery."
msgstr ""
"Esto es Guberland, probablemente el clan menos apreciado de Chedian. Su Jarl, un hombre llamado Markel, se puso a sí mismo el apodo de \"el Grande\", por poco demostrado que esté ese título. Es un hombre algo áspero con un don para el autobombo."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC2.rude:28
msgid ""
"Frosgard is in bad shape.  Their ruler, Tryygva Ravenlocks, has been unable to cope with the region's problems no matter how hard he tries.  I'm fairly certain that it would take little effort to encourage the citizens to revolt."
msgstr ""
"Frosgard está en mal estado. Su gobernante, Tryygva Ravenlocks, no ha sido capaz de hacer frente a los problemas de la región por mucho que lo intente. Estoy casi seguro de que costaría poco animar a sus habitantes a rebelarse."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC2.rude:29
msgid ""
"Thronheim is probably the second most powerful clan in Chedian, after Thjorgard.  Kira the Cold is a competent, no-nonsense ruler.  She has it in her the potential to make Thronheim more successful than it has been in a hundred years."
msgstr ""
"Thronheim es probablemente el segundo clan más poderoso de Chedian, después de Thjorgard. Kira la Fría es una gobernante competente y sin rodeos. Tiene en sus manos el potencial para que Thronheim prospere como no lo ha hecho en cien años."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC2.rude:3
msgid "A quest?  What sort of quest?"
msgstr "¿Una misión? ¿Qué clase de misión?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC2.rude:3
msgid "She has charged us with a quest, and we need your help."
msgstr "Nos ha encomendado una misión, y necesitamos tu ayuda."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC2.rude:30
msgid ""
"Lindisfarne is a remote monastic village that is technically part of the Nation of Framon.  Its seclusion from the mainland and ready sea access has made it a popular target for the Chedian raiders."
msgstr ""
"Lindisfarne es una remota aldea monástica que, en teoría, forma parte de la Nación de Framon. Su aislamiento del continente y su fácil acceso al mar la han convertido en un objetivo predilecto de los invasores chedianos."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC2.rude:31
msgid ""
"This is the region of Yorwick, the most easterly part of the Nation of Framon.  There has been increasing emigration from Thronheim to this region, and the mixing of cultures has created tension between the residents."
msgstr ""
"Esta es la región de Yorwick, la parte más oriental de la Nación de Framon. Cada vez emigra más gente de Thronheim a esta región, y la mezcla de culturas ha creado tensiones entre sus habitantes."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC2.rude:32
msgid ""
"This is the Isle of Ashes.  This is where Verhoffin's Tower stood.  Now it is all a mess of ruins, and a dangerous place to boot."
msgstr ""
"Esta es la Isla de las Cenizas. Aquí se alzaba la Torre de Verhoffin. Ahora no es más que un montón de ruinas, y un lugar peligroso, para colmo."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC2.rude:33
msgid "I don't know anything.  I've never been here before."
msgstr "No sé nada. Nunca había estado aquí."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC2.rude:36
msgid "Welcome aboard."
msgstr "Bienvenidos a bordo."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC2.rude:4
msgid "Climb Aboard!"
msgstr "¡Subid a bordo!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC2.rude:4
msgid "We are ready to go now."
msgstr "Ya estamos listos para partir."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC2.rude:5
msgid "Have you seen Yrsa the Troll?  You may want to speak to her."
msgstr "¿Habéis visto a Yrsa la Troll? Quizá queráis hablar con ella."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC2.rude:5
msgid "Our boat crashed on its way to Mendossus."
msgstr "Nuestro barco naufragó cuando iba a Mendossus."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC2.rude:6
msgid "I am a sailor who has traveled much.  I am new to Chedian."
msgstr "Soy un marinero que ha viajado mucho. Soy nuevo en Chedian."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC2.rude:7
msgid "Yes, Kira!  Great thinking, Forad!"
msgstr "¡Sí, Kira! ¡Bien pensado, Forad!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC2.rude:7
msgid "You're welcome.  I am here to help."
msgstr "No hay de qué. Estoy aquí para ayudar."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC2.rude:8
msgid "She did?  What for?"
msgstr "¿Ah, sí? ¿Para qué?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC2.rude:8
msgid "Yes.  Yrsa sent us to find you"
msgstr "Sí. Yrsa nos envió a buscarte"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC2.rude:9
msgid "Not without killing us, he hasn't!"
msgstr "¡No sin matarnos antes!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC2.rude:9
msgid ""
"Why waste your time on such things?  Join us!  We can rule all of Chedian together!"
msgstr ""
"¿Por qué perder el tiempo en esas cosas? ¡Uníos a nosotros! ¡Juntos podemos gobernar todo Chedian!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC20.rude:2 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC20.rude:3
msgid "We would like to look at your books"
msgstr "Queremos ver tus libros"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC20.rude:3
msgid "Sorry, We're closed"
msgstr "Lo siento, está cerrado"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC200.rude:1
msgid ""
"I heard that Eva A'Washadi lost one of her children to the Frost Giant a couple nights ago.  Darn that Tryygva Ravenlocks!  He should be doing something about that!"
msgstr ""
"He oído que Eva A'Washadi perdió a uno de sus hijos a manos del Gigante de Hielo hace un par de noches. ¡Maldito Tryygva Ravenlocks! ¡Debería hacer algo al respecto!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC200.rude:2 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC200.rude:4
msgid "Yes.  We'd like to see your weapons."
msgstr "Sí. Queremos ver tus armas."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC200.rude:3
msgctxt "said by the party"
msgid "Anything else?"
msgstr "¿Algo más?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC200.rude:3
msgid ""
"I've heard that he can't be killed.  If you're thinking of trying to get rid of him, you'd better think of another way!"
msgstr ""
"He oído que no se le puede matar. Si estáis pensando en libraros de él, ¡más os vale buscar otra forma!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC200.rude:5
msgid ""
"They call him Yanmir the Frost Giant.  From what I've heard, he's the last of the frost giants who lived in the city called the Sky Fort.  After the Great Cataclysm, the Sky Fort plunged from the sky and almost landed right on top of Frosgard!"
msgstr ""
"Lo llaman Yanmir el Gigante de Hielo. Por lo que he oído, es el último de los gigantes de hielo que vivían en la ciudad llamada el Fuerte Celeste. Después del Gran Cataclismo, el Fuerte Celeste se desplomó del cielo y estuvo a punto de caer justo encima de Frosgard."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC200.rude:5
msgid "What do you know about the frost giant?"
msgstr "¿Qué sabes del gigante de hielo?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC200.rude:8 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC201.rude:8
msgid "Would you like to see a weapon?"
msgstr "¿Queréis ver alguna arma?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC201.rude:2
msgid ""
"Business has been bad since the docks froze over.  I don't understand why Tryygva hasn't done anything about it yet!"
msgstr ""
"El negocio va mal desde que se congelaron los muelles. ¡No entiendo por qué Tryygva todavía no ha hecho nada al respecto!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC201.rude:3 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC201.rude:4
msgid "Yes.  We'd like to see your wares."
msgstr "Sí. Queremos ver tu mercancía."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC201.rude:5
msgid ""
"I've been barely scraping by.  I've had to pay people to bring stuff through the mountains just to keep my stock up!"
msgstr ""
"Apenas consigo salir adelante. ¡He tenido que pagar a gente para que traiga cosas a través de las montañas solo para mantener las existencias!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC201.rude:5
msgid "What do you know about trade?"
msgstr "¿Qué sabes del comercio?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC201.rude:7
msgid "Next time, why don't you buy something."
msgstr "La próxima vez, ¿por qué no compráis algo?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC202.rude:2
msgid ""
"My sister's son in Frosgard hasn't been home in two days.  She's afraid that the Frost Giant got him!"
msgstr ""
"El hijo de mi hermana, en Frosgard, lleva dos días sin volver a casa. ¡Teme que se lo haya llevado el Gigante de Hielo!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC202.rude:5
msgid ""
"The frost giant in Frosgard?  He eats small children!  I heard Tryygva sent some soldiers to try and kill him.  One of them came back saying he can't be killed!"
msgstr ""
"¿El gigante de hielo de Frosgard? ¡Se come a los niños! He oído que Tryygva envió a unos soldados a intentar matarlo. ¡Uno de ellos volvió diciendo que no se le puede matar!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC202.rude:5
msgid "What do you know about  Yanmir?"
msgstr "¿Qué sabes de Yanmir?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC202.rude:7 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC249.rude:7
msgid "Come back soon."
msgstr "Volved pronto."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC202.rude:8 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC203.rude:8 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC205.rude:6
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC251.rude:6 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC260.rude:6 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC286.rude:8
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC307.rude:4 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC307.rude:5
msgid "You're welcome."
msgstr "De nada."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC203.rude:2
msgid ""
"I've heard there are instructions on how to become a lich buried somewhere in Chasm of the Dead."
msgstr ""
"He oído que en algún lugar del Abismo de los Muertos hay enterradas unas instrucciones para convertirse en liche."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC203.rude:3 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC203.rude:4 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC344.rude:2
msgid "We'd like to see your stuff."
msgstr "Queremos ver lo que tienes."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC203.rude:4
msgid "Sorry, but we're closed for the evening."
msgstr "Lo siento, pero por esta noche está cerrado."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC203.rude:5
msgid ""
"The best way to keep yourself alive is to get the best spells you can afford.  If your enemy is dead, how are they supposed to fight?"
msgstr ""
"La mejor forma de seguir con vida es conseguir los mejores hechizos que podáis permitiros. Si vuestro enemigo está muerto, ¿cómo va a luchar?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC204.rude:1
msgid ""
"No!  They went to raid a place called Farndale.  Apparently the Mendossian army was waiting for them there and..well you can guess the rest."
msgstr ""
"¡No! Fueron a saquear un lugar llamado Farndale. Por lo visto, el ejército de Mendossus los esperaba allí y... bueno, podéis imaginaros el resto."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC204.rude:1
msgid "They didn't?"
msgstr "¿No volvieron?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC204.rude:3
msgid ""
"Ravensford will be a lonely place without you here.  I'm going to miss you."
msgstr ""
"Ravensford será un lugar muy solitario sin vosotros. Os voy a echar de menos."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC204.rude:4
msgid ""
"Watch your spell points carefully.  There is nothing more dangerous than being attacked when you are out of them!"
msgstr ""
"Vigilad bien vuestros puntos de hechizo. ¡No hay nada más peligroso que sufrir un ataque cuando se os han agotado!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC204.rude:5
msgid ""
"That's where the next raid is going.  I'd be careful, the last time a raiding party went there, they didn't come back!"
msgstr ""
"Allí irá el próximo saqueo. Yo tendría cuidado: ¡la última vez que fue allí un grupo de saqueo, no volvió!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC204.rude:8
msgid "You're welcome"
msgstr "De nada"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC205.rude:1
msgid ""
"Watch out for the undead.  They can do more to you than just hurt you."
msgstr ""
"Cuidado con los no muertos. Pueden haceros mucho más que simplemente heriros."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC205.rude:2 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC342.rude:2
msgid "We'd like to see some spells."
msgstr "Queremos ver algunos hechizos."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC205.rude:2
msgid "Yes, of course."
msgstr "Sí, por supuesto."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC205.rude:3
msgid ""
"My friend claims to have been to there.  She says she swam up a backwards waterfall to get there.  I think she's lying.  How can a waterfall go backwards?"
msgstr ""
"Una amiga mía dice que ha estado allí. Dice que subió a nado por una cascada al revés para llegar. Creo que miente. ¿Cómo puede una cascada ir al revés?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC205.rude:3
msgid "What do you know about Yanmir's Fort?"
msgstr "¿Qué sabes del Fuerte de Yanmir?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC206.rude:10
msgid ""
"It's dangerous business, that's what!  If I were you, I'd stay away from it!"
msgstr ""
"¡Es un asunto peligroso, eso es lo que es! ¡Yo que vosotros me mantendría alejado!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC206.rude:11
msgid "An Orb of Linking?  Great!  Go ahead and install it!"
msgstr "¿Un Orbe de Enlace? ¡Estupendo! ¡Adelante, instaladlo!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC206.rude:11
msgid "We have an Orb of Linking."
msgstr "Tenemos un Orbe de Enlace."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC206.rude:12
msgid ""
"I think it's high time we sent another raiding party to Farndale!  It's time for revenge!  That's what I say!"
msgstr ""
"¡Creo que ya va siendo hora de enviar otro grupo de saqueo a Farndale! ¡Es hora de vengarse! ¡Eso digo yo!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC206.rude:3
msgid ""
"Apparently Hanndl charges quite a penny to cross the bridge to the Great Gate."
msgstr ""
"Por lo visto, Hanndl cobra un buen pico por cruzar el puente hasta la Gran Puerta."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC206.rude:4
msgid ""
"I've heard rumors of a place called the Inventa Storca where there are many wonderful things!"
msgstr ""
"¡He oído rumores sobre un lugar llamado la Inventa Storca donde hay muchas cosas maravillosas!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC206.rude:7
msgid ""
"Not much, I'm afraid.  I spend most of my time here.  I can tell you this, however.  Many of my customers have been pleased as tickles when they got kicked out of Arslegard, because I still had all their money."
msgstr ""
"No mucho, me temo. Paso aquí la mayor parte del tiempo. Pero sí os puedo decir una cosa: muchos de mis clientes se pusieron contentísimos cuando los echaron de Arslegard, porque yo todavía guardaba todo su dinero."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC206.rude:9
msgid ""
"Well, I don't really think that you're ready to go off on some adventure, but if the old man thinks so, good luck!"
msgstr ""
"Bueno, la verdad es que no creo que estéis preparados para correr aventuras, pero si el viejo lo cree, ¡buena suerte!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC207.rude:2
msgid ""
"I warned him not to, but my brother invoked the name of Njam last month.  He's been cursed ever since!"
msgstr ""
"Se lo advertí, pero el mes pasado mi hermano invocó el nombre de Njam. ¡Desde entonces está maldito!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC207.rude:5
msgid "Shhh!  Don't say that name!  You're liable to become cursed!"
msgstr "¡Chist! ¡No digáis ese nombre! ¡Podríais acabar malditos!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC208.rude:1
msgid "Good luck, children."
msgstr "Buena suerte, hijos."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC208.rude:2
msgid ""
"The Ritual of Consecration?  I've never heard of that.  It must be one of those strange Igdrasa rituals.  You'll need to find him.  He lives around here somewhere."
msgstr ""
"¿El Ritual de Consagración? Nunca he oído hablar de él. Debe de ser uno de esos extraños rituales de Igdrasa. Tendréis que encontrarlo a él. Vive por aquí, en alguna parte."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC208.rude:3
msgid "Of course, children."
msgstr "Por supuesto, hijos."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC208.rude:3 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC256.rude:2
msgid "We need some healing."
msgstr "Necesitamos que nos curen."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC208.rude:4
msgid "Fre's blessing upon you, my children."
msgstr "Que la bendición de Fre os acompañe, hijos míos."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC208.rude:5
msgid ""
"I have others to attend to, children.  I don't have time for questions."
msgstr "Tengo que atender a otros, hijos. No tengo tiempo para preguntas."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC208.rude:6
msgid "I am sorry, my children.  We do not have any."
msgstr "Lo siento, hijos míos. No tenemos ninguno."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC208.rude:6
msgid "We are looking for a priest for a new church."
msgstr "Buscamos un sacerdote para una nueva iglesia."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC208.rude:7
msgid ""
"That old freak?  I'm sorry, children but he's retired.  Was there something I could help you with?"
msgstr ""
"¿Ese viejo chiflado? Lo siento, hijos, pero se ha retirado. ¿Puedo ayudaros en algo?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC208.rude:7
msgid "We're looking for a priest named Nath'I A'Mor"
msgstr "Buscamos a un sacerdote llamado Nath'I A'Mor"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC208.rude:8
msgid "Farewell, my children."
msgstr "Adiós, hijos míos."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC209.rude:1
msgid "Thanks!"
msgstr "¡Gracias!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC209.rude:2
msgid ""
"A friend of mine sailed through Hanndl's Grasp.  He said he was attacked by a giant sea monster that sunk his boat.  I think he just doesn't know how to navigate the shallows!"
msgstr ""
"Un amigo mío navegó por la Garra de Hanndl. Dice que lo atacó un monstruo marino gigante que le hundió el barco. ¡Yo creo que simplemente no sabe navegar por los bajíos!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC209.rude:3
msgid "Yes, I think we will."
msgstr "Sí, creo que sí."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC209.rude:5
msgid ""
"Well I'm afraid I can't help you.  You see, I'm frozen in.  If someone were to clear all the ice out from the docks, I would be glad to take you anywhere you want to go."
msgstr ""
"Bueno, me temo que no puedo ayudaros. Veréis, estoy atrapado por el hielo. Si alguien despejara todo el hielo de los muelles, os llevaría encantado a donde quisierais."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC209.rude:6
msgid ""
"Hanndl's Grasp is the name our fathers gave to the collection of islands that surround the Verhoffin Sea.  The islands Guberland and Sturmford are on are part of it.  The islands from eastern Thjorgard all the way to Lachmon Cove in Mendossus."
msgstr ""
"La Garra de Hanndl es el nombre que nuestros padres dieron al conjunto de islas que rodean el Mar de Verhoffin. Las islas donde están Guberland y Sturmford forman parte de ella. Son las islas que van desde el este de Thjorgard hasta la Cala de Lachmon, en Mendossus."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC209.rude:6
msgid "What do you know about Hanndl's Grasp?"
msgstr "¿Qué sabes de la Garra de Hanndl?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC209.rude:8
msgid ""
"I see that!  I really appreciate all that you've done.  Here, take this dock schedule as my gift for helping me out like that!"
msgstr ""
"¡Ya lo veo! Os agradezco de verdad todo lo que habéis hecho. ¡Tomad, quedaos este horario del puerto como regalo por haberme ayudado así!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC209.rude:8
msgid "The ice is clear from the docks."
msgstr "Ya no hay hielo en los muelles."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC209.rude:9
msgid "We're looking for some information."
msgstr "Buscamos algo de información."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC21.rude:2
msgid ""
"I think I could make it worth your while.  Did you need training or not?"
msgstr ""
"Creo que podría hacer que os valiera la pena. ¿Necesitabais entrenamiento o no?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC21.rude:2
msgid "Well if we had it, we wouldn't give it to you!"
msgstr "¡Pues si la tuviéramos, no te la daríamos!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC21.rude:3
msgid "Do you know where it could be found?"
msgstr "¿Sabes dónde se podría encontrar?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC21.rude:3
msgid ""
"HA!  If I knew where it could be found, I wouldn't be sitting here dreaming about it, that's for sure.  And trust me, if I knew where it was, I wouldn't tell you!"
msgstr ""
"¡JA! Si supiera dónde encontrarla, no estaría aquí sentado soñando con ella, eso seguro. Y creedme, si supiera dónde está, ¡no os lo diría!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC21.rude:4
msgid ""
"I've heard rumors about a sword known as the Sing Sword.  It is supposed to make its wearer stronger in battle.  What I would give to have that sword in my hands!"
msgstr ""
"He oído rumores sobre una espada conocida como la Espada Cantora. Dicen que hace más fuerte en combate a quien la empuña. ¡Lo que daría yo por tener esa espada en mis manos!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC21.rude:5
msgid "Not today, thank you."
msgstr "Hoy no, gracias."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC210.rude:10
msgid ""
"Tryygva is looking for brave men to take on the Frost Giant.  If you thing you have the courage, you can find him in the Palace."
msgstr ""
"Tryygva busca hombres valientes que se enfrenten al Gigante de Hielo. Si creéis tener el valor, lo encontraréis en el Palacio."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC210.rude:17 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC58.rude:7 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC89.rude:11
msgid "We would like to ask you some questions."
msgstr "Queremos hacerte unas preguntas."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC210.rude:19
msgid ""
"You can find the armor shop on the western end of town, just north of the training yard."
msgstr ""
"La tienda de armaduras está en el extremo oeste de la ciudad, justo al norte del patio de entrenamiento."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC210.rude:21
msgid "The tavern is just northeast of the maypole."
msgstr "La taberna está justo al noreste del palo de mayo."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC210.rude:22
msgid ""
"That poor man!  He's having such a hard time being in charge right now!  It's no wonder he's so depressed."
msgstr ""
"¡Pobre hombre! ¡Lo está pasando fatal teniendo que gobernar ahora mismo! No es de extrañar que esté tan deprimido."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC210.rude:22
msgid "What do you know about Tryygva"
msgstr "¿Qué sabes de Tryygva?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC210.rude:26
msgid ""
"The magic shop is on the western end of town, just east of the training yard."
msgstr ""
"La tienda de magia está en el extremo oeste de la ciudad, justo al este del patio de entrenamiento."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC210.rude:27
msgid "No, not really."
msgstr "No, la verdad es que no."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC210.rude:28
msgid "The temple is just south of the maypole."
msgstr "El templo está justo al sur del palo de mayo."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC210.rude:3
msgid ""
"You can find the weapon shop on the western end of town, just north of the training yard."
msgstr ""
"La tienda de armas está en el extremo oeste de la ciudad, justo al norte del patio de entrenamiento."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC210.rude:32
msgid ""
"The apothecary is on the southwestern section of town.  It is one of the hovels built into the hill."
msgstr ""
"El apotecario está en la parte suroeste de la ciudad. Es una de las chozas excavadas en la colina."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC210.rude:34
msgid ""
"The training hall is in the westerly section of town, south of the weapon shop."
msgstr ""
"La Sala de Entrenamiento está en la parte oeste de la ciudad, al sur de la tienda de armas."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC210.rude:38
msgid "The dock is the northernmost point from the maypole."
msgstr "El muelle es el punto más al norte desde el palo de mayo."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC210.rude:43
msgid ""
"The library is in the southern section of town.  It is one of the hovels built into the hill."
msgstr ""
"La biblioteca está en la parte sur de la ciudad. Es una de las chozas excavadas en la colina."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC210.rude:6
msgid "If you're looking for Tryygva, you can find him behind me."
msgstr "Si buscáis a Tryygva, lo encontraréis detrás de mí."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC210.rude:8
msgid ""
"You can find the bank in the southern section of town.  It is one of the hovels built into the hill."
msgstr ""
"El banco está en la parte sur de la ciudad. Es una de las chozas excavadas en la colina."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC211.rude:2
msgid ""
"I am a collector of old tomes, friends.  Nothing I am interested in has happened in the last three hundred years."
msgstr ""
"Colecciono tomos antiguos, amigos. En los últimos trescientos años no ha pasado nada que me interese."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC211.rude:3 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC211.rude:4 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC350.rude:2
msgid "We'd like to see some books."
msgstr "Queremos ver algunos libros."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC211.rude:5
msgid ""
"They say you have to swim up a waterfall to get to the Sky Fort.  They also say he's invincible.  But I'm convinced there is another way to kill him."
msgstr ""
"Dicen que hay que subir a nado por una cascada para llegar al Fuerte Celeste. También dicen que él es invencible. Pero estoy convencido de que hay otra forma de matarlo."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC211.rude:5
msgid "what do you know about the frost giant?"
msgstr "¿Qué sabes del gigante de hielo?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC211.rude:6
msgid "Very well, but be quiet about it."
msgstr "Muy bien, pero no hagáis ruido."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC212.rude:1
msgid ""
"Tryygva asked me to step up the training of his solders.  I wonder why?"
msgstr ""
"Tryygva me ha pedido que intensifique el entrenamiento de sus soldados. ¿Por qué será?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC212.rude:3
msgid ""
"There's not many of them around any more.  I'd say they're nearly extinct.  If you somehow found one to fight, I wouldn't go against it directly.  They're too powerful.  I'd find some way to trick it into killing itself."
msgstr ""
"Ya no quedan muchos. Yo diría que están casi extinguidos. Si por casualidad encontrarais uno con el que luchar, yo no me enfrentaría a él directamente. Son demasiado poderosos. Buscaría la forma de engañarlo para que se matara él solo."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC212.rude:3
msgid "What do you know about fighting frost giants?"
msgstr "¿Qué sabes de luchar contra gigantes de hielo?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC213.rude:1
msgid ""
"My brother and I came up with a great new brew!  I don't know why Brewmaster Smith isn't selling it.  I'm sure he could make a fortune!"
msgstr ""
"¡Mi hermano y yo hemos inventado una nueva cerveza estupenda! No sé por qué el Maestro cervecero Smith no la vende. ¡Seguro que podría hacer una fortuna!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC213.rude:3
msgid ""
"Look out for the fleshy headed mutants.  Radiation has made them enemies to civilization."
msgstr ""
"Cuidado con los mutantes de cabeza carnosa. La radiación los ha convertido en enemigos de la civilización."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC213.rude:4 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC85.rude:16
msgid "See ya."
msgstr "Hasta luego."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC213.rude:5
msgid "See ya!"
msgstr "¡Hasta luego!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC214.rude:1
msgid ""
"Yeah, don't listen to my brother.  I was the one who came up with the recipe!  He just watched.  He drank most of the first batch, too."
msgstr ""
"Sí, no hagáis caso a mi hermano. ¡Fui yo quien inventó la receta! Él solo miraba. Y además se bebió casi toda la primera tanda."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC214.rude:3
msgid "Yeah, oh.  See you"
msgstr "Sí, vaya. Hasta luego"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC214.rude:4
msgid "Don't listen to my brother.  He doesn't know what he's talking about."
msgstr "No hagáis caso a mi hermano. No sabe de lo que habla."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC214.rude:5
msgid "Yeah, ok.  See you"
msgstr "Sí, vale. Hasta luego"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC215.rude:2
msgid "I'll have the barrel sent right over!"
msgstr "¡Haré que os envíen el barril enseguida!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC215.rude:3
msgid "On the ice just outside the dock."
msgstr "En el hielo, justo a la salida del muelle."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC215.rude:3
msgid ""
"On the ice?  Okay, but here's some advice:  If you're planning a special show, the sunflowers shine the brightest at night."
msgstr ""
"¿En el hielo? De acuerdo, pero os daré un consejo: si estáis preparando un espectáculo especial, los girasoles brillan más de noche."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC215.rude:4
msgid ""
"I make sunflowers!  They're barrels of magic powder that explode when you shoot them!  I have a demonstration rigged up if you would like to see one!  Just go ahead and shoot that barrel."
msgstr ""
"¡Fabrico girasoles! ¡Son barriles de pólvora mágica que explotan cuando les disparáis! ¡Tengo una demostración preparada, por si queréis ver uno! Adelante, disparad a ese barril."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC215.rude:4
msgid "What do you do all the way out here?"
msgstr "¿Qué haces tan lejos de todo?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC215.rude:5
msgid ""
"Watch out for your children!  The Frost Giant that lives in the sky will come down at night and eat them!  It happened to me!"
msgstr ""
"¡Cuidad de vuestros hijos! ¡El Gigante de Hielo que vive en el cielo baja de noche y se los come! ¡A mí me pasó!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC215.rude:6
msgid "Certainly!  Where would you like it delivered?"
msgstr "¡Por supuesto! ¿Dónde queréis que lo entreguen?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC215.rude:6
msgid "Say, you wouldn't mind making a delivery would you?"
msgstr "Oye, ¿no te importaría hacer una entrega?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC215.rude:7
msgid "Watch out for him.  He can't be killed."
msgstr "Tened cuidado con él. No se le puede matar."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC215.rude:7
msgid "What do you know about the Frost Giant?"
msgstr "¿Qué sabes del Gigante de Hielo?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC216.rude:1
msgid ""
"My children told me that the Frost Giant came for them, and threw them back!  Can you believe that?  They said the giant thought they taste bad!"
msgstr ""
"¡Mis hijos me dijeron que el Gigante de Hielo vino a por ellos y los volvió a soltar! ¿Os lo podéis creer? ¡Dijeron que al gigante le parecía que sabían mal!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC216.rude:3
msgid ""
"They're frozen over.  I wish there was someone who was strong enough to break up all the ice."
msgstr ""
"Están congelados. Ojalá hubiera alguien lo bastante fuerte para romper todo ese hielo."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC216.rude:3 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC217.rude:7
msgid "What do you know about the docks?"
msgstr "¿Qué sabes de los muelles?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC217.rude:2
msgid ""
"A pledge?   That's it?  If that's all that is required, then you have it!"
msgstr ""
"¿Una promesa? ¿Nada más? Si eso es todo lo que hace falta, ¡la tenéis!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC217.rude:2
msgid "Give us your pledge."
msgstr "Danos tu promesa."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC217.rude:3
msgid "How?  If there is a way, I shall do it!"
msgstr "¿Cómo? Si hay una manera, ¡lo haré!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC217.rude:3
msgid "You could bring back the Green Man."
msgstr "Podrías ayudar a que vuelva el Hombre Verde."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC217.rude:4
msgid ""
"The docks are all frozen!  I don't know what we're going to do!  Without the docks, the boats can't dock!  We're all going to starve!"
msgstr ""
"¡Los muelles están todos congelados! ¡No sé qué vamos a hacer! ¡Sin los muelles, los barcos no pueden atracar! ¡Vamos a morir todos de hambre!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC217.rude:6
msgid "What sort of help could I give?"
msgstr "¿Qué clase de ayuda podría dar yo?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC217.rude:7
msgid ""
"They are all frozen over.  Maybe we could get a big battering ram and break up all the ice!  Oh!  What are we going to do?"
msgstr ""
"Están todos congelados. ¡Quizá podríamos conseguir un gran ariete y romper todo el hielo! ¡Oh! ¿Qué vamos a hacer?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC218.rude:2
msgid "Give him a pledge that you won't forget to celebrate him."
msgstr "Prométele que no olvidarás celebrarlo."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC218.rude:2
msgid "I will not ever forget to celebrate him again!  You have my word!"
msgstr "¡Nunca más volveré a olvidar celebrarlo! ¡Tenéis mi palabra!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC218.rude:3
msgid ""
"Without the boats coming in, we'll all starve!  Our crops are failing, and our farmers can't seem to produce enough food for us all to eat!  What are we going to eat?"
msgstr ""
"¡Si no llegan los barcos, moriremos todos de hambre! ¡Las cosechas se pierden y nuestros granjeros no consiguen producir comida suficiente para todos! ¿Qué vamos a comer?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC218.rude:5
msgid "My help?  How can I help the Green Man?"
msgstr "¿Mi ayuda? ¿Cómo puedo ayudar yo al Hombre Verde?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC218.rude:6
msgid "I don't know how we're going to break up all that ice!"
msgstr "¡No sé cómo vamos a romper todo ese hielo!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC218.rude:6
msgid "What do you know about breaking up the ice?"
msgstr "¿Qué sabes de romper el hielo?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC219.rude:1
msgid "The army is coming, I tell you!  It will mean destruction for us all!"
msgstr ""
"¡Os digo que viene el ejército! ¡Será la destrucción de todos nosotros!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC219.rude:3
msgid ""
"I know that I heard someone talking about the invading army to the west.  Once they conquer Thronheim, it will be destruction for us all!"
msgstr ""
"Sé que oí a alguien hablar del ejército invasor que viene del oeste. ¡En cuanto conquisten Thronheim, será la destrucción de todos nosotros!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC219.rude:3
msgid "What do you know about invasions?"
msgstr "¿Qué sabes de invasiones?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC22.rude:1
msgid ""
"From what I have heard an army  is supposedly marching in the west.   That's trouble for certain.  I'm not sure I would call it a war, though.  More like a slaughter."
msgstr ""
"Por lo que he oído, se supone que un ejército avanza por el oeste. Eso traerá problemas, sin duda. Aunque no sé si yo lo llamaría guerra. Más bien una matanza."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC22.rude:2
msgid "Good day to you sir."
msgstr "Buenos días, señor."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC22.rude:3
msgid "All one could ask is that you fight."
msgstr "Lo único que se os puede pedir es que luchéis."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC22.rude:3
msgid "I have but only my life to give."
msgstr "No tengo más que mi vida para dar."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC22.rude:4
msgid ""
"I would fight, for sure.  But I am a farmer, not a soldier.  The word is, this is the largest army since before the Great Cataclysm.  In the face of that,  I'm sure that I wouldn't be the only one to end up dead."
msgstr ""
"Lucharía, desde luego. Pero soy granjero, no soldado. Dicen que es el mayor ejército desde antes del Gran Cataclismo. Frente a algo así, seguro que no sería el único en acabar muerto."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC22.rude:4
msgid "Would you not take up arms in defense of your homeland?"
msgstr "¿No tomarías las armas para defender tu patria?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC22.rude:6
msgid ""
"Well, I know that Framon is the nearest nation to us, not counting Thronheim, that is.  I've heard that they are not in the best shape.  I guess they don't have much left after all the raids we've done there."
msgstr ""
"Bueno, sé que Framon es la nación más cercana a nosotros, sin contar Thronheim, claro. He oído que no están en su mejor momento. Supongo que no les queda mucho después de todas las incursiones que hemos hecho allí."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC22.rude:6
msgid "What do you know about the west?"
msgstr "¿Qué sabes del oeste?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC22.rude:7 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC334.rude:16 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC67.rude:2
msgid "Nothing, sorry."
msgstr "Nada, lo siento."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC220.rude:1
msgid ""
"I don't put much faith in rumors.  Like the one about the army coming to conquer us all.  I haven't seen any evidence of this!  How do we know that the army even exists?"
msgstr ""
"No me fío mucho de los rumores. Como ese del ejército que viene a conquistarnos a todos. ¡Yo no he visto ninguna prueba! ¿Cómo sabemos siquiera que ese ejército existe?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC220.rude:4
msgid ""
"Tjorvi seems to think that they're going to hit Thronheim first.  But I think Thronheim is too well defended.  My first target would be Thjorgard.  Once I secured a foothold in the least defended city in Chedian, I'd..wait!  That's Frosgard!  Oh no!"
msgstr ""
"Tjorvi parece pensar que atacarán Thronheim primero. Pero yo creo que Thronheim está demasiado bien defendida. Mi primer objetivo sería Thjorgard. Una vez asegurada una posición en la ciudad peor defendida de Chedian, yo... ¡un momento! ¡Esa es Frosgard! ¡Oh, no!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC220.rude:4
msgid "What do you know about invaders?"
msgstr "¿Qué sabes de los invasores?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC221.rude:1
msgid ""
"This place is my home.  When I am not restoring nature, I take pleasure in taking walks here."
msgstr ""
"Este lugar es mi hogar. Cuando no estoy restaurando la naturaleza, disfruto paseando por aquí."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC221.rude:10
msgid ""
"I mourn for Frosgard, for they have forgotten me.  Perhaps one day, someone will remind them of that."
msgstr ""
"Lloro por Frosgard, pues me han olvidado. Quizá algún día alguien se lo recuerde."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC221.rude:11
msgid ""
"That is indeed good news!  I thank you for your help.  You have saved more lives than you know.  I have a gift for you, so that all who come upon you know you have received the blessings of the green man."
msgstr ""
"¡Son buenas noticias, sin duda! Os agradezco vuestra ayuda. Habéis salvado más vidas de las que imagináis. Tengo un regalo para vosotros, para que todo el que os encuentre sepa que habéis recibido las bendiciones del Hombre Verde."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC221.rude:11 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC88.rude:11
msgid "We have completed your tasks."
msgstr "Hemos cumplido tus encargos."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC221.rude:13
msgid "Of course, friends."
msgstr "Por supuesto, amigos."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC221.rude:14
msgid "Farewell.  Come back soon!"
msgstr "Adiós. ¡Volved pronto!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC221.rude:2
msgid "You are welcome, visitors.  Farewell."
msgstr "Sed bienvenidos, visitantes. Adiós."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC221.rude:4
msgid ""
"Once those things are all done, I will return.  I thank you for your visit, friends."
msgstr ""
"Cuando todo eso esté hecho, volveré. Os agradezco vuestra visita, amigos."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC221.rude:4
msgid "We will do that."
msgstr "Lo haremos."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC221.rude:5
msgid ""
"And finally, as a symbol of their pledge to me, the Frosgard leader has to carve and place a runestone near the maypole.  The stone should declare the promise made, and the Frosgardian's intent to keep it."
msgstr ""
"Y, por último, como símbolo de su promesa, el líder de Frosgard debe tallar una piedra rúnica y colocarla cerca del mayo. La piedra debe proclamar la promesa hecha y la intención de los frosgardianos de cumplirla."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC221.rude:5
msgid "That can be done."
msgstr "Eso se puede hacer."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC221.rude:6
msgid ""
"I also need a promise from the Frosgardians that they will not neglect the festivals.  I think promises from six townsfolk would be enough."
msgstr ""
"También necesito que los frosgardianos prometan que no descuidarán las fiestas. Creo que bastaría con las promesas de seis vecinos."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC221.rude:6
msgid "We can do that."
msgstr "Podemos hacerlo."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC221.rude:7
msgid "How can we help?"
msgstr "¿Cómo podemos ayudar?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC221.rude:7
msgid ""
"There are three things that must be done.  Firstly, the maypole in the center of town is in a sad state of repair.  If I am to return, the maypole needs to be repaired."
msgstr ""
"Hay que hacer tres cosas. Primero, el mayo del centro del pueblo está en un estado lamentable. Si he de volver, hay que reparar el mayo."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC221.rude:8
msgid ""
"I'm afraid that they will have one celebration in my honor, and then forget about me again."
msgstr ""
"Me temo que celebrarán una fiesta en mi honor y luego volverán a olvidarse de mí."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC221.rude:8
msgid "We think the Frosgardians are eager for your return."
msgstr "Creemos que los frosgardianos desean tu regreso."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC221.rude:9
msgid ""
"It has been a long time since someone from Frosgard remembered who I was.  It pleases me to know that they have not totally forgotten me.  I long to return to Frosgard."
msgstr ""
"Hacía mucho tiempo que nadie de Frosgard recordaba quién era yo. Me alegra saber que no me han olvidado del todo. Anhelo volver a Frosgard."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC221.rude:9
msgid "We've come on behalf of Frosgard."
msgstr "Venimos en nombre de Frosgard."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC222.rude:2
msgid ""
"I've heard that Brewmaster Smith is looking for someone to take a shipment of ale over to Guberland."
msgstr ""
"He oído que el Maestro cervecero Smith busca a alguien que lleve un cargamento de cerveza a Guberland."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC222.rude:4
msgid "He does?  If that will bring back the harvests, I will give it!"
msgstr "¿De verdad? Si eso hace que vuelvan las cosechas, ¡la daré!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC222.rude:5
msgid "That's the city of the gods.  That's where Hallenhalt is."
msgstr "Es la ciudad de los dioses. Allí está Hallenhalt."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC223.rude:2
msgid ""
"A pledge?  You mean one that would bring him back?  I will give that for certain!"
msgstr "¿Una promesa? ¿Una que lo haga volver? ¡Claro que la daré!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC223.rude:2
msgid "Give a pledge for the Green Man."
msgstr "Haz una promesa al Hombre Verde."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC223.rude:3
msgid ""
"Robert and Douglas have come up with a new concoction.  I tasted it, and it's awful!"
msgstr ""
"Robert y Douglas han inventado un nuevo brebaje. Lo probé, ¡y es horrible!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC223.rude:5
msgid "Frosgard?  What can I do for Frosgard that the Jarl can't do?"
msgstr ""
"¿Frosgard? ¿Qué puedo hacer yo por Frosgard que no pueda hacer el Jarl?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC223.rude:6
msgid "I am an expert at it!  I spend a lot of time practicing!"
msgstr "¡Soy todo un experto! ¡Paso mucho tiempo practicando!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC223.rude:6
msgid "What do you know about drinking?"
msgstr "¿Qué sabes de beber?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC224.rude:2
msgid ""
"I wonder what happened to the Green Man.  He used give us great bounty!"
msgstr ""
"Me pregunto qué habrá sido del Hombre Verde. ¡Antes nos daba grandes cosechas!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC224.rude:4
msgid "The Green Man wants a pledge from you."
msgstr "El Hombre Verde quiere tu promesa."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC224.rude:4
msgid ""
"The Green Man?  Will it bring him back?  Of course it will.  Very well.  I will give that pledge."
msgstr ""
"¿El Hombre Verde? ¿Servirá para que vuelva? Claro que sí. Muy bien. Haré esa promesa."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC224.rude:5
msgid "He hasn't come around in a long time.  I wonder what happened to him?"
msgstr "Hace mucho que no viene por aquí. ¿Qué le habrá pasado?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC224.rude:5
msgid "What do you know about The Green Man?"
msgstr "¿Qué sabes del Hombre Verde?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC225.rude:2
msgid ""
"I wish my wife would let me go adventuring again.  I long to have those days back again."
msgstr ""
"Ojalá mi mujer me dejara volver a correr aventuras. Echo de menos aquellos días."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC225.rude:4
msgid "A Pledge?  For the Green Man, I would give any pledge"
msgstr "¿Una promesa? Por el Hombre Verde, haría cualquier promesa"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC225.rude:4
msgid "We need your pledge for the Green Man."
msgstr "Necesitamos tu promesa para el Hombre Verde."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC225.rude:5
msgid ""
"Get yourself the repair skill.  That'll save your hide more than a heal spell ever could."
msgstr ""
"Aprended la habilidad de Reparar. Os salvará el pellejo más que cualquier hechizo de Curar Heridas."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC225.rude:7 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC226.rude:6 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC226.rude:7
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC49.rude:2 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC5.rude:3 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC69.rude:5
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC71.rude:2 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC74.rude:7 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC75.rude:6
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC92.rude:9
msgid "Bye!"
msgstr "¡Adiós!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC226.rude:2
msgid ""
"I long for the days Brand and I used to spend on adventures.  He's married these days, and his wife hardly lets him go out any more."
msgstr ""
"Echo de menos los días en que Brand y yo corríamos aventuras. Ahora está casado, y su mujer casi no le deja salir."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC226.rude:4
msgid ""
"If I can do anything that will bring him back, I shall.  I will give you that pledge."
msgstr "Si puedo hacer algo para que vuelva, lo haré. Os doy mi promesa."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC226.rude:4 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC230.rude:4
msgid "We are collecting pledges for the Green Man."
msgstr "Estamos reuniendo promesas para el Hombre Verde."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC226.rude:5
msgid ""
"Make sure you have someone who can cast spells in your group.  They're worth their weight in Thjorad!"
msgstr ""
"Aseguraos de tener en el grupo a alguien que sepa lanzar hechizos. ¡Valen su peso en Thjorad!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC227.rude:1
msgid "blka"
msgstr "blka"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC227.rude:2
msgid ""
"Where's that no good husband of mine?  He's always running around trying to go on adventures again."
msgstr ""
"¿Dónde está el inútil de mi marido? Siempre anda por ahí intentando volver a correr aventuras."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC227.rude:4
msgid "A pledge?  Of course!  We have neglected him for too long."
msgstr "¿Una promesa? ¡Por supuesto! Lo hemos descuidado demasiado tiempo."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC227.rude:5
msgid ""
"I know I don't like it!  Too many of my friends have not come back from it!"
msgstr "¡Lo que sé es que no me gusta! ¡Demasiados amigos míos no han vuelto!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC228.rude:2
msgid ""
"I've been sick lately.  I finally got enough money to go to the temple to get healed."
msgstr ""
"He estado enfermo últimamente. Por fin he reunido dinero suficiente para ir al templo a que me curen."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC228.rude:4
msgid ""
"The Green Man?  Of course!  Should he need my help, I shall always be around to answer his call!"
msgstr ""
"¿El Hombre Verde? ¡Por supuesto! Si necesita mi ayuda, ¡siempre estaré ahí para acudir a su llamada!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC228.rude:5
msgid "They are good places to get healed if you have the money."
msgstr "Son buenos sitios para curarse si tenéis dinero."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC228.rude:5
msgid "What do you know about temples."
msgstr "¿Qué sabes de los templos?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC229.rude:2
msgid "I've been studying how to repair items with Hervor Etzeldotir."
msgstr "He estado aprendiendo a reparar objetos con Hervor Etzeldotir."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC229.rude:4
msgid "A pledge?  Of course!  If you ask, I shall give it!"
msgstr "¿Una promesa? ¡Por supuesto! Si me la pedís, ¡os la daré!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC229.rude:5
msgid ""
"Hervor Etzeldotir is the one to go to if you want to be an expert in it!"
msgstr ""
"¡Hervor Etzeldotir es a quien debéis acudir si queréis ser expertos en ello!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC229.rude:5
msgid "What do you know about repairing items?"
msgstr "¿Qué sabes de reparar objetos?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC23.rude:1
msgid ""
"If there is an army marching towards Thjorgard, then there is going to be a war.  It as simple as that."
msgstr ""
"Si hay un ejército marchando hacia Thjorgard, habrá guerra. Así de sencillo."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC23.rude:10
msgid "Would you fight?"
msgstr "¿Lucharías?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC23.rude:11
msgid ""
"For the Elemental Thjorad, of course!  Any army with the weapons Elemental Thjorad could make would be invincible."
msgstr ""
"¡Por el Thjorad Elemental, claro! Cualquier ejército con las armas que se pueden fabricar con Thjorad Elemental sería invencible."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC23.rude:11
msgid "Why do you think this army is marching towards Chedian?"
msgstr "¿Por qué crees que este ejército marcha hacia Chedian?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC23.rude:12
msgid "Nothing, Sorry"
msgstr "Nada, lo siento"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC23.rude:2
msgid ""
"Me?  I am not a soldier.  That is what I pay taxes to Sven Forkbeard for!"
msgstr "¿Yo? Yo no soy soldado. ¡Para eso le pago impuestos a Sven Forkbeard!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC23.rude:2
msgid "Perhaps you should do something about it."
msgstr "Quizá deberías hacer algo al respecto."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC23.rude:3
msgid "He's the leader of the army."
msgstr "Es el jefe del ejército."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC23.rude:3
msgid ""
"The army really is marching?  Oh!  Does Sven know?  He should be preparing our defenses!"
msgstr ""
"¿De verdad marcha el ejército? ¡Oh! ¿Lo sabe Sven? ¡Debería estar preparando nuestras defensas!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC23.rude:4 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC3.rude:4
msgid "Tamur Leng?  Who is that?"
msgstr "¿Tamur Leng? ¿Quién es ese?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC23.rude:4
msgid "You think that his army is strong enough to defeat Tamur Leng?"
msgstr ""
"¿Crees que su ejército es lo bastante fuerte para derrotar a Tamur Leng?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC23.rude:5
msgid "May you and your fear be long lived."
msgstr "Que tú y tu miedo viváis muchos años."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC23.rude:5
msgid "Thank you!  Wait a minute!  I think that might have been an insult!"
msgstr "¡Gracias! ¡Un momento! ¡Creo que eso ha podido ser un insulto!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC23.rude:6
msgid ""
"If his army were defeated, you mean?  I am an intelligent person.  I am sure that the new Jarl would spare someone like me."
msgstr ""
"¿Si derrotaran a su ejército, queréis decir? Soy una persona inteligente. Seguro que el nuevo Jarl perdonaría a alguien como yo."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC23.rude:6
msgid "What if Sven's army isn't large enough?"
msgstr "¿Y si el ejército de Sven no es lo bastante grande?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC23.rude:10 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC23.rude:7
msgid ""
"Of course not.  Sven Forkbeard has a strong army.  I am certain that he could defeat any army that would attack Thjorgard."
msgstr ""
"Claro que no. Sven Forkbeard tiene un ejército fuerte. Estoy seguro de que podría derrotar a cualquier ejército que atacara Thjorgard."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC23.rude:7
msgid "Will you fight?"
msgstr "¿Lucharás?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC23.rude:9
msgid ""
"I'm not really the one to ask.  I'm not much of a fighter.  There's plenty of teachers around here, if you're looking for them to show you a thing or two."
msgstr ""
"No soy el más indicado para preguntarle. No soy gran luchador. Por aquí hay muchos maestros, si buscáis a alguien que os enseñe un par de cosas."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC23.rude:9
msgid "What do you know about fighting?"
msgstr "¿Qué sabes de luchar?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC230.rude:2
msgid ""
"Nope.  Well, except I heard my brother stopped working.  According to him, the condition in the Thjorad mines are getting worse.  I told him he should just quit and come out here!"
msgstr ""
"No. Bueno, salvo que he oído que mi hermano ha dejado de trabajar. Según él, las condiciones en las minas de Thjorad van a peor. ¡Le dije que lo dejara y se viniera aquí!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC230.rude:4
msgid ""
"The Green Man has come back?  He needs a pledge?  I shall be happy to give it."
msgstr ""
"¿El Hombre Verde ha vuelto? ¿Necesita una promesa? Estaré encantado de dársela."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC230.rude:5
msgid ""
"My brother works in the mines there.  He says it's very difficult work.  He's always complaining about the bad conditions for the workers and the low pay."
msgstr ""
"Mi hermano trabaja en las minas de allí. Dice que es un trabajo muy duro. Siempre se queja de las malas condiciones de los trabajadores y de la mala paga."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC231.rude:2
msgid ""
"I was out looking at the ice covering our docks the other day.  It doesn't look that bad.  I bet a resourceful individual could find a way to break it all up."
msgstr ""
"El otro día salí a ver el hielo que cubre nuestros muelles. No tiene tan mal aspecto. Seguro que alguien ingenioso encontraría la manera de romperlo todo."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC231.rude:4
msgid ""
"The Green Man wants a pledge from me?  Wow!  Of course I'll give a pledge."
msgstr ""
"¿El Hombre Verde quiere una promesa mía? ¡Vaya! Claro que haré una promesa."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC231.rude:4
msgid "We need a pledge for the Green Man."
msgstr "Necesitamos una promesa para el Hombre Verde."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC231.rude:5
msgid ""
"I think the only way to break up ice is to find something large enough to chop at it with."
msgstr ""
"Creo que la única forma de romper el hielo es encontrar algo lo bastante grande para golpearlo."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC231.rude:5
msgid "What do you know about breaking up ice."
msgstr "¿Qué sabes de romper el hielo?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC232.rude:1 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC431.rude:1
msgid "asd"
msgstr "asd"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC232.rude:2
msgid "It will keep your people from starving."
msgstr "Evitará que tu pueblo muera de hambre."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC232.rude:2
msgid ""
"Sure it will.  Very well.  If giving it will make you leave me alone, I will give it to you."
msgstr ""
"Seguro que sí. Muy bien. Si dándola me vais a dejar en paz, os la daré."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC232.rude:4
msgid ""
"From me?  What does the Green Man do for me?  Why should I give him my pledge."
msgstr ""
"¿Mía? ¿Qué hace el Hombre Verde por mí? ¿Por qué debería darle mi promesa?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC232.rude:5 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC79.rude:7
msgid "Don't do it again."
msgstr "No lo volváis a hacer."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC233.rude:1 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC233.rude:3 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC38.rude:2
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC38.rude:7
msgid "If you are ready, I can help you with that."
msgstr "Si estáis preparados, puedo ayudaros con eso."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC233.rude:1 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC38.rude:2
msgid "We'd like to become Experts in Bodybuilding."
msgstr "Queremos ser Expertos en Culturismo."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC233.rude:2 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC401.rude:1
msgid "Nope."
msgstr "No."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC233.rude:3 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC38.rude:7
msgid "We'd like to become Masters in Bodybuilding."
msgstr "Queremos ser Maestros en Culturismo."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC233.rude:4
msgid "Nothing"
msgstr "Nada"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC233.rude:4
msgid "What do you know about Yanmir?"
msgstr "¿Qué sabes de Yanmir?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC233.rude:5 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC38.rude:1
msgid ""
"To become Grandmasters, you must be taught by Stev Palac.  Seek him out in Yorwick."
msgstr ""
"Para ser Grandes Maestros, debe enseñaros Stev Palac. Buscadlo en Yorwick."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC233.rude:5 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC38.rude:1
msgid "Where can we become Grandmasters in Bodybuilding?"
msgstr "¿Dónde podemos ser Grandes Maestros en Culturismo?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC233.rude:6
msgid "Why?"
msgstr "¿Por qué?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC234.rude:1 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC295.rude:2 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC61.rude:22
msgid "I can help you with that."
msgstr "Puedo ayudaros con eso."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC234.rude:1 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC295.rude:2
msgid "We'd like to improve our Merchant skill to Expert."
msgstr "Queremos mejorar nuestra habilidad de Mercader a Experto."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC234.rude:2
msgid "One day, I shall find the lost elvish clan."
msgstr "Algún día encontraré el clan élfico perdido."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC234.rude:3 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC295.rude:4
msgid "If you are able, I can help you with that."
msgstr "Si sois capaces, puedo ayudaros con eso."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC234.rude:3 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC295.rude:4
msgid "We'd like to improve our Merchant skill to Master."
msgstr "Queremos mejorar nuestra habilidad de Mercader a Maestro."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC234.rude:4
msgid ""
"I know that after the Great Cataclysm, one clan of elves escaped, and are hidden somewhere in bondage.  One day I will find them and free them."
msgstr ""
"Sé que tras el Gran Cataclismo un clan de elfos escapó y está escondido en algún lugar, cautivo. Algún día los encontraré y los liberaré."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC234.rude:4
msgid "What do you know about elves?"
msgstr "¿Qué sabes de los elfos?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC234.rude:5 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC295.rude:3
msgid "If you are able, you must seek out Bren Haukdotir in Yorwick."
msgstr "Si sois capaces, debéis buscar a Bren Haukdotir en Yorwick."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC234.rude:5 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC295.rude:3
msgid "Where can we become Grandmasters in Merchant?"
msgstr "¿Dónde podemos ser Grandes Maestros en Mercader?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC235.rude:1 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC235.rude:3 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC310.rude:2
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC310.rude:4
msgid "If you have the required skill, I can help you."
msgstr "Si tenéis la habilidad necesaria, puedo ayudaros."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC235.rude:1 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC310.rude:2
msgid "We'd like to become Experts in our Perception Skill."
msgstr "Queremos ser Expertos en nuestra habilidad de Percepción."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC235.rude:2
msgid ""
"Well, let me tell you about my husband.  He was exploring an abandon cave, and wasn't paying attention.  He fell into a pit and nearly got speared to death!"
msgstr ""
"Bueno, dejad que os cuente lo de mi marido. Estaba explorando una cueva abandonada y no prestaba atención. ¡Se cayó a un foso y casi muere ensartado!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC235.rude:3 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC310.rude:4
msgid "We'd like to become Masters in our Perception Skill."
msgstr "Queremos ser Maestros en nuestra habilidad de Percepción."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC235.rude:4
msgid "Keep your eyes peeled.  A watchful eye beats quick reflexes any day."
msgstr ""
"Mantened los ojos bien abiertos. Un ojo atento vale más que unos reflejos rápidos."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC235.rude:5 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC310.rude:3
msgid ""
"If you fit the requirements, you must go to Yorwick and find Broccan A'Ghrie.  She will help you become Grandmasters."
msgstr ""
"Si cumplís los requisitos, debéis ir a Yorwick y buscar a Broccan A'Ghrie. Ella os ayudará a ser Grandes Maestros."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC235.rude:5 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC310.rude:3
msgid "Where can we become Grandmasters in Perception?"
msgstr "¿Dónde podemos ser Grandes Maestros en Percepción?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC236.rude:4
msgid "A pledge?  Sure!  I'll give him a pledge."
msgstr "¿Una promesa? ¡Claro! Le haré una promesa."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC236.rude:5
msgid ""
"Go to Thjorgard and find yourself some goat's milk tea.  It will protect you from being turned to stone."
msgstr ""
"Id a Thjorgard y conseguid algo de té de leche de cabra. Os protegerá de convertiros en piedra."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC237.rude:1 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC267.rude:2
msgid "If you are able, I can train you."
msgstr "Si sois capaces, puedo entrenaros."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC237.rude:1 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC267.rude:2
msgid "We'd like to improve our Disarm Trap Skill to Expert."
msgstr "Queremos mejorar nuestra habilidad de Desarmar Trampa a Experto."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC237.rude:2
msgid "I nearly lost my hand trying to disarm a trap once."
msgstr "Una vez casi pierdo la mano intentando desarmar una trampa."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC237.rude:3 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC267.rude:4
msgid "If you are capable I can help you with that."
msgstr "Si estáis capacitados, puedo ayudaros con eso."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC237.rude:3 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC267.rude:4
msgid "We'd like to improve our Disarm Trap Skill to Master."
msgstr "Queremos mejorar nuestra habilidad de Desarmar Trampa a Maestro."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC237.rude:4
msgid ""
"There is no better thing to have in your group than someone who can disable traps.  It'll save your life more often than a brainsmasher any day."
msgstr ""
"No hay nada mejor en un grupo que alguien capaz de desactivar trampas. Os salvará la vida más a menudo que cualquier machacacráneos."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC237.rude:5 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC267.rude:3
msgid ""
"If you possess the necessary requirements, you must find Marshall Hanford in Yorwick."
msgstr ""
"Si cumplís los requisitos necesarios, debéis buscar a Marshall Hanford en Yorwick."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC237.rude:5 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC267.rude:3
msgid "Where can we become Grandmasters in Disarm Trap?"
msgstr "¿Dónde podemos ser Grandes Maestros en Desarmar Trampa?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC238.rude:10 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC308.rude:8
msgid "Very well.  Farewell."
msgstr "Muy bien. Adiós."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC238.rude:10
msgid "We no longer require your help."
msgstr "Ya no necesitamos tu ayuda."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC238.rude:2
msgid "I will be happy to accompany you."
msgstr "Estaré encantada de acompañaros."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC238.rude:2
msgid "We want to take advantage of Fre's blessings.  You're hired."
msgstr "Queremos aprovechar las bendiciones de Fre. Estás contratada."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC238.rude:3
msgid ""
"For a small donation of 1000 gold per month plus a tithe of 10% of all gold you find, I can travel with you and heal your of all your injuries and conditions once per day."
msgstr ""
"Por un pequeño donativo de 1000 de oro al mes más un diezmo del 10% de todo el oro que encontréis, puedo viajar con vosotros y curaros de todas vuestras heridas y condiciones una vez al día."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC238.rude:3
msgid "What sort of services?"
msgstr "¿Qué clase de servicios?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC238.rude:4
msgid "Fre smiles kindly upon the penitent."
msgstr "Fre sonríe con bondad a los penitentes."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC238.rude:5
msgid "And what else did Fre say?"
msgstr "¿Y qué más dijo Fre?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC238.rude:5
msgid ""
"She has commanded me to be available for you, should you require my services."
msgstr ""
"Me ha ordenado que esté a vuestra disposición, por si necesitáis mis servicios."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC238.rude:6
msgid "Very well.  Should you need me, I will be available."
msgstr "Muy bien. Si me necesitáis, estaré disponible."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC238.rude:6
msgid "We don't need a healer right now."
msgstr "Ahora mismo no necesitamos un curandero."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC238.rude:7
msgid ""
"Fre is the wife of Krohn, who is the king of the gods.  It is said that he will die on the day of the Great Reckoning."
msgstr ""
"Fre es la esposa de Krohn, el rey de los dioses. Se dice que él morirá el día del Gran Ajuste de Cuentas."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC238.rude:7 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC341.rude:3 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC350.rude:3
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC363.rude:3 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC370.rude:3
msgid "What do you know about the gods?"
msgstr "¿Qué sabes de los dioses?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC238.rude:9 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC308.rude:7
msgid "We'd like to be healed"
msgstr "Queremos que nos cures"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC239.rude:1
msgid ""
"She told you that, did she.  Then I guess you're not just subjects looking for reassurance.  She's right.  They'll be here soon, and despite the fight we put up, they will overrun us.  Perhaps you'd like to lend your swords to the battle?"
msgstr ""
"Eso os dijo, ¿eh? Entonces supongo que no sois simples súbditos que buscan consuelo. Tiene razón. Pronto estarán aquí y, por mucho que luchemos, nos arrollarán. ¿Quizá queráis prestar vuestras espadas a la batalla?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC239.rude:1
msgid "We've been to see Yrsa the Troll on the Isle of Ashes."
msgstr "Hemos visitado a Yrsa la Troll en la Isla de las Cenizas."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC239.rude:10
msgid ""
"Oh dear.  Bjarni's been enamored with me for some time.  He's a good Jarl and a strong warrior, but not my type.  This sort of thing can be very touchy, especially with Bjarni.  He's had some people's hides for dancing around the bush with him."
msgstr ""
"Vaya por Dios. Bjarni lleva tiempo enamorado de mí. Es un buen Jarl y un guerrero fuerte, pero no es mi tipo. Este tipo de asuntos puede ser muy delicado, sobre todo con Bjarni. Ya ha despellejado a más de uno por andarse con rodeos con él."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC239.rude:10
msgid "What should we tell him for you?"
msgstr "¿Qué quieres que le digamos de tu parte?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC239.rude:11
msgctxt "said by the party"
msgid "How?"
msgstr "¿Cómo?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC239.rude:11
msgid "I don't know.  Just don't kill them."
msgstr "No lo sé. Pero no los matéis."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC239.rude:12
msgid ""
"Is that so?  Yes, I suppose that all of us fighting together would be enough to stop them, drive them back to the hole they came from.  Who's going to lead this army?"
msgstr ""
"¿De veras? Sí, supongo que si luchamos todos juntos bastaría para detenerlos y devolverlos al agujero del que salieron. ¿Quién va a dirigir ese ejército?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC239.rude:12
msgid "Yrsa sent us to unite the Six Clans against them."
msgstr "Yrsa nos ha enviado a unir a los Seis Clanes contra ellos."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC239.rude:13
msgid ""
"Great!  I'm sure it is somewhere to the east.  For people as skilled as you, it shouldn't be too difficult to find."
msgstr ""
"¡Estupendo! Estoy segura de que está en algún lugar al este. Para gente tan hábil como vosotros, no debería ser muy difícil encontrarlo."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC239.rude:13
msgid "We will find the Mountain Pass for you."
msgstr "Encontraremos el Paso de Montaña para ti."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC239.rude:14
msgid "They are too strong for you."
msgstr "Son demasiado fuertes para ti."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC239.rude:14
msgid "Who are you?  What makes you think such things."
msgstr "¿Quiénes sois? ¿Qué os hace pensar esas cosas?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC239.rude:15
msgid ""
"I have heard the reports.  Fear not, I have been preparing our defenses.  They'll not catch us off guard."
msgstr ""
"He oído los informes. No temáis, he estado preparando nuestras defensas. No nos pillarán desprevenidos."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC239.rude:15
msgid "There is an army marching towards Thronheim as we speak."
msgstr "Ahora mismo hay un ejército marchando hacia Thronheim."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC239.rude:16
msgid "Tell them to meet here in two weeks."
msgstr "Diles que se reúnan aquí dentro de dos semanas."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC239.rude:16
msgid "That I shall.  We will see you then."
msgstr "Así lo haré. Nos veremos entonces."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC239.rude:17
msgid ""
"Let me guess who that would be for.  That's pretty crafty of you!  Have me compose it so you will be assured that Bjarni will sign it.    Very well, I shall write the peace treaty."
msgstr ""
"Dejadme adivinar para quién sería. ¡Qué astutos! Que lo redacte yo para aseguraros de que Bjarni lo firme. Muy bien, escribiré el tratado de paz."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC239.rude:17
msgid "We need someone to write a peace treaty."
msgstr "Necesitamos a alguien que redacte un tratado de paz."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC239.rude:18
msgid ""
"You and I shall bring peace to Sturmford and Drangheim for the first time in a hundred years!  Come back tomorrow, and I shall have the treaty for you."
msgstr ""
"¡Vosotros y yo traeremos la paz a Sturmford y Drangheim por primera vez en cien años! Volved mañana y tendré el tratado listo."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC239.rude:19
msgid "We appreciate your hospitality."
msgstr "Agradecemos tu hospitalidad."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC239.rude:19
msgid ""
"You're welcome.  I'm not so sure about letting that Jarl from Guberland in, but if you say I must, so I shall.  Farewell."
msgstr ""
"No hay de qué. No estoy muy segura de dejar entrar a ese Jarl de Guberland, pero si decís que debo hacerlo, lo haré. Adiós."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC239.rude:2
msgid "Excellent!  Many of the Thronish will thank you, I can assure you."
msgstr "¡Excelente! Muchos throneses os lo agradecerán, os lo aseguro."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC239.rude:20
msgid "Thank you.  We will be back very soon."
msgstr "Gracias. Volveremos muy pronto."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC239.rude:20
msgid ""
"They are not very trusting of each other, so I would recommend you have them sign it in a neutral place.  If you wish, they may come here to sign it before all the Jarls.  Good luck!"
msgstr ""
"No se fían mucho el uno del otro, así que os recomiendo que lo firmen en un lugar neutral. Si queréis, pueden venir aquí a firmarlo ante todos los Jarls. ¡Buena suerte!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC239.rude:21
msgid "We will see you tomorrow."
msgstr "Nos veremos mañana."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC239.rude:22
msgid ""
"I will be happy to host it.  When you are ready, bring all the Jarls here."
msgstr ""
"Estaré encantada de acogerlo. Cuando estéis listos, traed aquí a todos los Jarls."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC239.rude:22
msgid "We will be having a war council soon."
msgstr "Pronto celebraremos un consejo de guerra."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC239.rude:24
msgid "Alright.  So we should tell him the truth."
msgstr "De acuerdo. Así que debemos decirle la verdad."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC239.rude:24
msgid ""
"If you break his heart that abruptly, that could start a war!  Tell him whatever you want, just be careful.  Try not to offend him.  Is there anything else you've come here for?"
msgstr ""
"¡Si le rompéis el corazón tan bruscamente, podría estallar una guerra! Decidle lo que queráis, pero con cuidado. Intentad no ofenderlo. ¿Habéis venido por algo más?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC239.rude:25
msgid ""
"In some of the historical books, there are stories of a mountain pass that used to connect Thronheim with Thjorgard.  It is said to have made the Thronish very rich at the time.  I want you to find this pass, and reopen it for trade."
msgstr ""
"En algunos libros de historia hay relatos de un paso de montaña que antiguamente unía Thronheim con Thjorgard. Se dice que en aquella época enriqueció mucho a los throneses. Quiero que encontréis ese paso y lo reabráis al comercio."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC239.rude:25
msgid "What is the second task?"
msgstr "¿Cuál es la segunda tarea?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC239.rude:26
msgid "Was there anything else I can help with?"
msgstr "¿Puedo ayudaros en algo más?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC239.rude:27
msgid "I understand.  The Honkies are unpleasant to deal with."
msgstr "Lo entiendo. Tratar con los honkies es desagradable."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC239.rude:27
msgid "Perhaps we could do that later."
msgstr "Quizá podamos hacerlo más tarde."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC239.rude:28
msgid ""
"Wonderful.  I shall be happy to host it.  I shall send word to the other Jarls immediately."
msgstr ""
"Maravilloso. Estaré encantada de acogerlo. Enviaré aviso a los demás Jarls de inmediato."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC239.rude:29
msgid ""
"I think that is the man who is leading the army marching on us.  He will be the first to get it, I assure you."
msgstr ""
"Creo que es el hombre que dirige el ejército que marcha contra nosotros. Será el primero en recibirlo, os lo aseguro."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC239.rude:3
msgid "We have done as you asked.  Now will you join us?"
msgstr "Hemos hecho lo que pediste. ¿Te unirás ahora a nosotros?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC239.rude:3
msgid "You have proven your worth to me.  I will join you."
msgstr "Me habéis demostrado vuestra valía. Me uniré a vosotros."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC239.rude:30 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC45.rude:48
msgid "About those things you asked us to do.."
msgstr "Sobre lo que nos pediste que hiciéramos..."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC239.rude:31
msgid "We've already found it!"
msgstr "¡Ya lo hemos encontrado!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC239.rude:31
msgid ""
"You have?  That is wonderful news.  Here is a small token of my appreciation."
msgstr ""
"¿De verdad? Es una noticia maravillosa. Aquí tenéis una pequeña muestra de mi gratitud."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC239.rude:32
msgid ""
"So I have heard.  You have done a fine job.  Here is something for your troubles."
msgstr ""
"Eso he oído. Habéis hecho un buen trabajo. Aquí tenéis algo por las molestias."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC239.rude:32
msgid "The Honkies have left."
msgstr "Los honkies se han ido."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC239.rude:34
msgid ""
"I understand.  The mountain pass is said to be a very dangerous place.  Not at all for the squeamish."
msgstr ""
"Lo entiendo. Se dice que el paso de montaña es un lugar muy peligroso. Nada apto para los aprensivos."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC239.rude:34
msgid "Perhaps we can find it another time."
msgstr "Quizá podamos encontrarlo en otro momento."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC239.rude:35
msgid ""
"That is what I am told.  You have done a great service to Thronheim.  Thank you.  Here is a little reward for your efforts."
msgstr ""
"Eso me han dicho. Habéis prestado un gran servicio a Thronheim. Gracias. Aquí tenéis una pequeña recompensa por vuestros esfuerzos."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC239.rude:35
msgid "We have found the Mountain Pass."
msgstr "Hemos encontrado el Paso de Montaña."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC239.rude:36
msgid "We've done as you asked.  Now will you join us?"
msgstr "Hemos hecho lo que pediste. ¿Te unirás ahora a nosotros?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC239.rude:36
msgid ""
"You have proven your worth and loyalty.  I shall be honored to join you."
msgstr ""
"Habéis demostrado vuestra valía y vuestra lealtad. Será un honor unirme a vosotros."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC239.rude:37
msgid "Bjarni?  What does he want?"
msgstr "¿Bjarni? ¿Qué quiere?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC239.rude:37
msgid "We've been sent by Bjarni Thorvaldssen"
msgstr "Nos envía Bjarni Thorvaldssen"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC239.rude:38 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC308.rude:9
msgid "You are welcome."
msgstr "No hay de qué."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC239.rude:39
msgid "Wonderful.  I shall send word to summon all the clans."
msgstr "Maravilloso. Enviaré aviso para convocar a todos los clanes."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC239.rude:4
msgid ""
"Lately the Honkies have been getting more forceful in their attempts to convert people.  It's been causing a ruckus, and upsetting many of the Thronish.  I want you to get rid of them."
msgstr ""
"Últimamente los honkies se han vuelto más insistentes en sus intentos de convertir a la gente. Están armando mucho alboroto y molestando a muchos throneses. Quiero que os libréis de ellos."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC239.rude:4 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC88.rude:4
msgid "What is the first task?"
msgstr "¿Cuál es la primera tarea?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC239.rude:41
msgid "What, again?  What do you need this time?"
msgstr "¿Qué, otra vez? ¿Qué necesitáis esta vez?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC239.rude:42
msgid ""
"As promised, here it is.  All the other Jarls are here awaiting the start of the war council.  As soon  as Bjarni and Sigmund have signed it, we shall convene for the war council"
msgstr ""
"Como os prometí, aquí lo tenéis. Todos los demás Jarls están aquí esperando el comienzo del consejo de guerra. En cuanto Bjarni y Sigmund lo hayan firmado, nos reuniremos en consejo de guerra"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC239.rude:42
msgid "We've returned for the treaty."
msgstr "Hemos vuelto a por el tratado."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC239.rude:43
msgid "Do not be too distraught, friends.  Perservere, and you will succeed."
msgstr "No os aflijáis demasiado, amigos. Perseverad y lo lograréis."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC239.rude:43
msgid "Kira, you are dead, and we are responsible for it."
msgstr "Kira, estás muerta, y es culpa nuestra."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC239.rude:44 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC34.rude:9 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC37.rude:5
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC4.rude:11 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC82.rude:6
msgid "Sorry to bother you"
msgstr "Perdona la molestia"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC239.rude:5
msgid ""
"I really wish that Bjarni would just leave me alone, but I can't just tell him off!  It's a very delicate situation, and I don't want to start a war with Sturmford.  My soldiers have their hands full already."
msgstr ""
"Ojalá Bjarni me dejara en paz, ¡pero no puedo mandarlo a paseo sin más! Es una situación muy delicada y no quiero empezar una guerra con Sturmford. Mis soldados ya tienen bastante trabajo."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC239.rude:6
msgid "Name your task.  We shall prove our worth."
msgstr "Di cuál es la tarea. Demostraremos nuestra valía."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC239.rude:6
msgid ""
"Very well.  I do have two things that I wish were done.  If you succeed in completing both of them, I will trust you to lead my soldiers."
msgstr ""
"Muy bien. Hay dos cosas que me gustaría que se hicieran. Si conseguís completar ambas, os confiaré el mando de mis soldados."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC239.rude:7
msgid ""
"And you think that I will just automatically trust your leadership?  That's doubtful.  You'd have to prove your worth, first."
msgstr ""
"¿Y creéis que voy a confiar sin más en vuestro liderazgo? Lo dudo. Primero tendréis que demostrar vuestra valía."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC239.rude:7
msgid "We will."
msgstr "Lo haremos."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC239.rude:8
msgid "A letter?  Let me see it.  Hmmm.  Ha!  He's written me a poem!"
msgstr "¿Una carta? Dejadme verla. Mmm. ¡Ja! ¡Me ha escrito un poema!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC239.rude:8
msgid "He gave us this letter to give to you."
msgstr "Nos dio esta carta para que te la entregáramos."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC239.rude:9
msgid "He seems quite taken with you."
msgstr "Parece bastante prendado de ti."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC239.rude:9
msgid ""
"Yeah.   Kiss a tree?  What's wrong with him?  Looks better than his horse?  He couldn't woo a lion out of a cage with this stuff!"
msgstr ""
"Ya. ¿Besar un árbol? ¿Qué le pasa? ¿Más guapa que su caballo? ¡Con esto no conseguiría sacar a un león de una jaula!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC24.rude:1
msgid ""
"The miners have stopped working.  If Sven Forkbeard does not get them working soon, we'll starve!"
msgstr ""
"Los mineros han dejado de trabajar. Si Sven Forkbeard no consigue que vuelvan pronto al trabajo, ¡nos moriremos de hambre!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC24.rude:3
msgid "Perhaps we will go talk to Sven Forkbeard about it."
msgstr "Quizá vayamos a hablar con Sven Forkbeard del asunto."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC24.rude:3
msgid "What a grand idea!  I hope you are successful"
msgstr "¡Qué gran idea! Espero que tengáis éxito"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC24.rude:4
msgid "That's terrible."
msgstr "Es terrible."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC24.rude:4
msgid "Yes.  I wish someone would do something about it!"
msgstr "Sí. ¡Ojalá alguien hiciera algo al respecto!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC24.rude:5
msgid ""
"Most of our economy is based on the exportation of magical good created by the Thjoradric Smiths, that's why!  With no Elemental Thjorad, the smiths will have nothing to make their goods with!"
msgstr ""
"¡Porque casi toda nuestra economía se basa en exportar los objetos mágicos que fabrican los herreros de Thjoradric! ¡Sin Thjorad Elemental, los herreros no tendrán con qué fabricar sus productos!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC24.rude:7
msgid ""
"Nothing, really.  That's the stuff they pull out of the mines.  They send it to the smiths, and it becomes magic items!"
msgstr ""
"Nada, la verdad. Es lo que sacan de las minas. Lo envían a los herreros, ¡y se convierte en objetos mágicos!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC24.rude:7 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC3.rude:31 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC35.rude:9
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC37.rude:6 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC43.rude:11
msgid "What do you know about Elemental Thjorad?"
msgstr "¿Qué sabes del Thjorad Elemental?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC24.rude:8
msgid "Sven has already told us to inspect the mines."
msgstr "Sven ya nos ha encargado inspeccionar las minas."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC24.rude:8
msgid "Well it's about time!  Go make sure those miners get back to work!"
msgstr "¡Ya era hora! ¡Id y aseguraos de que esos mineros vuelvan al trabajo!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC240.rude:11
msgid "About the promotion?"
msgstr "¿Sobre el ascenso?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC240.rude:12
msgid "Atli's on his way to Thronheim."
msgstr "Atli va de camino a Thronheim."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC240.rude:12
msgid "So I've heard.  Congratulations!"
msgstr "Eso he oído. ¡Felicidades!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC240.rude:2
msgid ""
"Find Atli Sigmundssen in Guberland and guard his caravan until he's ready to leave."
msgstr ""
"Buscad a Atli Sigmundssen en Guberland y proteged su caravana hasta que esté listo para partir."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC240.rude:2
msgid "What were we supposed to do again?"
msgstr "¿Qué teníamos que hacer?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC240.rude:3
msgid ""
"When I was younger, I took a trip to Framon.  Those people really worship their queen, I can tell you that!"
msgstr ""
"De joven hice un viaje a Framon. ¡Os aseguro que esa gente adora de verdad a su reina!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC240.rude:5
msgid ""
"Great!  There is a merchant in Guberland by the name of Atli Sigmundssen who wishes to move to Thronheim.  He's packing up, and needs someone to guard bis boat until he leaves.  To gain your promotion, find him in Guberland.  He'll tell you what to do."
msgstr ""
"¡Estupendo! Hay un mercader en Guberland llamado Atli Sigmundssen que quiere trasladarse a Thronheim. Está recogiendo sus cosas y necesita a alguien que vigile su barco hasta que se marche. Para conseguir vuestro ascenso, buscadlo en Guberland. Él os dirá qué hacer."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC240.rude:5
msgid "We have."
msgstr "Sí."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC240.rude:6
msgid ""
"I can promote any worthy Fighters you have to Mercenaries.  Do you have anyone who fits that description?"
msgstr ""
"Puedo ascender a Mercenario a cualquier Luchador digno que tengáis. ¿Tenéis a alguien que encaje en esa descripción?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC240.rude:6
msgid "We'd like to know about promotions."
msgstr "Queremos saber sobre los ascensos."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC240.rude:7
msgid "It's the nation to the west of us.  They have very strange customs."
msgstr "Es la nación que está al oeste. Tienen costumbres muy extrañas."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC240.rude:9
msgid "Perhaps you will."
msgstr "Quizá algún día."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC240.rude:9
msgid "We don't."
msgstr "No."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC241.rude:1
msgid ""
"My mentor passed on before she could teach me everything she knew.  I could have been the best midwife in years!"
msgstr ""
"Mi mentora murió antes de poder enseñarme todo lo que sabía. ¡Podría haber sido la mejor comadrona en años!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC241.rude:10
msgid ""
"Kira the Cold is a wonderful ruler.  She is an inspiration to women everywhere!"
msgstr ""
"Kira la Fría es una gobernante maravillosa. ¡Es una inspiración para las mujeres de todas partes!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC241.rude:11
msgid "Okay.  Come back when you do!"
msgstr "De acuerdo. ¡Volved cuando lo tengáis!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC241.rude:11
msgid "We haven't found the Black Orb yet."
msgstr "Aún no hemos encontrado el Orbe Negro."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC241.rude:12
msgid "Mad Wizard Robinsson had it?"
msgstr "¿Lo tenía el Mago Loco Robinssen?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC241.rude:12
msgid "We've got the Black Orb."
msgstr "Tenemos el Orbe Negro."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC241.rude:13
msgid "Oh, alright.  Thanks anyway."
msgstr "Oh, está bien. Gracias de todos modos."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC241.rude:14 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC414.rude:14 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC414.rude:9
msgid "Okay!"
msgstr "¡De acuerdo!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC241.rude:2
msgid ""
"Well, I'm afraid my mentor passed on before I could complete my training.  My training was nearly finished, and she said I could be the best midwife Thronheim has had in years!"
msgstr ""
"Bueno, me temo que mi mentora murió antes de que pudiera completar mi formación. Estaba casi terminada, ¡y ella decía que yo podría ser la mejor comadrona que Thronheim había tenido en años!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC241.rude:2 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC419.rude:5 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC42.rude:5
msgid "Why not?"
msgstr "¿Por qué no?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC241.rude:3
msgid ""
"There are some gaps in my knowledge.  I don't want to begin working and making mistakes."
msgstr ""
"Hay algunas lagunas en mis conocimientos. No quiero empezar a trabajar y cometer errores."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC241.rude:3
msgid "What's stopping you?"
msgstr "¿Qué te lo impide?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC241.rude:4
msgid ""
"There is a device called the Black Orb of Knowledge.  All you have to do is ask it a question, and it will give you a correct answer."
msgstr ""
"Hay un artefacto llamado el Orbe Negro del Conocimiento. Basta con hacerle una pregunta y te da la respuesta correcta."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC241.rude:5
msgid ""
"I think the Mad Wizard Robinssen in Yorwick has one.  If you find one and bring it to me, I will reward you well!"
msgstr ""
"Creo que el Mago Loco Robinssen de Yorwick tiene uno. Si lo encontráis y me lo traéis, ¡os recompensaré bien!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC241.rude:5 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC57.rude:5
msgid "Where can we find one?"
msgstr "¿Dónde podemos encontrar uno?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC241.rude:6
msgid "I'm afraid that I can't do that right now."
msgstr "Me temo que ahora mismo no podemos hacerlo."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC241.rude:7
msgid "Oh, wonderful!  Thank you!"
msgstr "¡Oh, maravilloso! ¡Gracias!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC241.rude:7
msgid "We will find it for you."
msgstr "Lo encontraremos para ti."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC241.rude:9
msgid "Not only did he have it, he invented it."
msgstr "No solo lo tenía, sino que lo inventó él."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC241.rude:9
msgid ""
"Thank you so much!  You don't know what wonderful news this is!  Thank you!"
msgstr ""
"¡Muchísimas gracias! ¡No sabéis qué noticia tan maravillosa es esta! ¡Gracias!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC242.rude:11
msgid "The Temple of Honk and I thank you.  Here is your reward.  Farewell."
msgstr ""
"El Templo de Honk y yo os lo agradecemos. Aquí tenéis vuestra recompensa. Adiós."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC242.rude:11
msgid "We delivered the message."
msgstr "Hemos entregado el mensaje."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC242.rude:13
msgid "Bye"
msgstr "Adiós"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC242.rude:2
msgid "No.  In fact, forget that I allowed you to ask me any questions."
msgstr "No. De hecho, olvidad que os he dejado hacerme preguntas."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC242.rude:3
msgid "Great!  Come back when you've finished."
msgstr "¡Estupendo! Volved cuando hayáis terminado."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC242.rude:3
msgid "We can handle it.  Give us the message."
msgstr "Podemos encargarnos. Danos el mensaje."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC242.rude:4
msgid ""
"It may not be as easy as you think.  If the Temple of Ratatosk discovers your intent, they will probably become hostile towards you."
msgstr ""
"Puede que no sea tan fácil como creéis. Si el Templo de Ratatosk descubre vuestras intenciones, probablemente se volverán hostiles contra vosotros."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC242.rude:4
msgid "Sounds easy."
msgstr "Parece fácil."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC242.rude:5 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC243.rude:3 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC283.rude:12
msgid "So what's the problem?"
msgstr "¿Y cuál es el problema?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC242.rude:5
msgid ""
"The problem is, the Temple of Ratatosk doesn't want the message.  They've barred me, and any member of the Temple of Honk from entering their temple.  I will pay you to go into the Temple of Ratatosk and deliver this message to them."
msgstr ""
"El problema es que el Templo de Ratatosk no quiere el mensaje. Nos han prohibido la entrada en su templo a mí y a cualquier miembro del Templo de Honk. Os pagaré por entrar en el Templo de Ratatosk y entregarles este mensaje."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC242.rude:6
msgid ""
"Have you heard of the Temple of Honk?  I've been asked by them to deliver a message to the Temple of Ratatosk."
msgstr ""
"¿Habéis oído hablar del Templo de Honk? Me han pedido que entregue un mensaje al Templo de Ratatosk."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC242.rude:6
msgid "What sort of favor?"
msgstr "¿Qué clase de favor?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC242.rude:7
msgid "I need someone to do me a favor."
msgstr "Necesito que alguien me haga un favor."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC242.rude:7 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC243.rude:10
msgid "What can we help you with?"
msgstr "¿En qué podemos ayudarte?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC242.rude:8
msgid "It's an okay place."
msgstr "No es mal sitio."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC242.rude:9
msgid "Sounds too dangerous for our blood."
msgstr "Parece demasiado peligroso para nosotros."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC242.rude:9
msgid "Very well.  Come back when you've got a spine."
msgstr "Muy bien. Volved cuando tengáis agallas."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC243.rude:1
msgid ""
"Great!  Just remember that you have to install them in the banks, also!"
msgstr ""
"¡Estupendo! ¡Solo recordad que también tenéis que instalarlos en los bancos!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC243.rude:1
msgid "We will find these orbs for you."
msgstr "Encontraremos esos orbes para ti."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC243.rude:10
msgid ""
"Well, I have this problem.  You see, the banks of all the major cities of the Chedian are linked together so that a customer of my bank can get their money in Frosgard, or Guberland, and vise versa."
msgstr ""
"Bueno, tengo un problema. Veréis, los bancos de todas las grandes ciudades de Chedian están conectados, de modo que un cliente de mi banco puede sacar su dinero en Frosgard o en Guberland, y viceversa."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC243.rude:11
msgid "You found them?  Wonderful!  Please, be my guest!"
msgstr "¿Los habéis encontrado? ¡Maravilloso! ¡Por favor, adelante!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC243.rude:14
msgid "Wonderfully, thanks to you!"
msgstr "¡De maravilla, gracias a vosotros!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC243.rude:3
msgid ""
"Many of my customers have asked to be able to do the same thing with their deposit boxes.  Unfortunately, in order to do that, I would need someone to find six devices known as Orbs of Linking."
msgstr ""
"Muchos de mis clientes me han pedido poder hacer lo mismo con sus cajas de depósito. Por desgracia, para ello necesitaría que alguien encontrara seis artefactos conocidos como Orbes de Enlace."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC243.rude:4
msgid "Sounds easy.  Where are these Orbs of Linking?"
msgstr "Parece fácil. ¿Dónde están esos Orbes de Enlace?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC243.rude:4
msgid ""
"The only place they've ever been found in Chedian is in a place known as the Inventa Storca, here in Thronheim."
msgstr ""
"El único lugar de Chedian donde se han encontrado es un sitio llamado Inventa Storca, aquí en Thronheim."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC243.rude:5
msgid "I sure wish someone could put an Orb of Linking in this bank!"
msgstr "¡Ojalá alguien pudiera poner un Orbe de Enlace en este banco!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC243.rude:7
msgid ""
"If I had an Orb of Linking, I could sell space in my bank for storage of all sorts of items, and then people could go to any bank in the land and pick them up!"
msgstr ""
"Si tuviera un Orbe de Enlace, podría vender espacio en mi banco para guardar toda clase de objetos, ¡y la gente podría ir a cualquier banco del país a recogerlos!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC243.rude:9
msgid "Perhaps we will be able to do this later."
msgstr "Quizá podamos hacerlo más adelante."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC243.rude:9
msgid ""
"The Inventa Storca is certainly a dangerous place.  I myself am also afraid to go there."
msgstr ""
"La Inventa Storca es sin duda un lugar peligroso. A mí también me da miedo ir allí."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC244.rude:2
msgid "Not too well behaved, are you?"
msgstr "No eres muy educado, ¿eh?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC244.rude:2
msgid "Shush!  Go away."
msgstr "¡Chist! Largaos."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC244.rude:3
msgid "Gimme gimme!!"
msgstr "¡¡Dámelo, dámelo!!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC244.rude:3
msgid "We've got all the stuff you asked for."
msgstr "Tenemos todo lo que pediste."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC244.rude:4
msgid "Go away, then!!"
msgstr "¡¡Pues largaos!!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC244.rude:4 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC245.rude:8 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC416.rude:5
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC61.rude:63
msgctxt "said by the party"
msgid "Nothing."
msgstr "Nada."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC245.rude:2
msgid "A dying messenger."
msgstr "Un mensajero moribundo."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC245.rude:2
msgid ""
"What do you plan to do, then?  I'll not be wearing a rope necklace!  You'll have to kill me first!"
msgstr ""
"¿Y qué pensáis hacer, entonces? ¡No pienso llevar un collar de soga! ¡Tendréis que matarme primero!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC245.rude:3
msgid "Sven is going to find out about this.  We suggest leaving town."
msgstr "Sven se va a enterar de esto. Te sugerimos que te vayas de la ciudad."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC245.rude:3
msgid ""
"The best assassins can always disappear.  I assure you, you will never see me again.  Farwell."
msgstr ""
"Los mejores asesinos siempre saben desaparecer. Os aseguro que no volveréis a verme. Adiós."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC245.rude:4
msgid ""
"I don't really know.  Something about raising the import taxes, I think."
msgstr "No lo sé muy bien. Algo de subir los impuestos de importación, creo."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC245.rude:4
msgid "Why did he want Sven dead?"
msgstr "¿Por qué quería ver muerto a Sven?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC245.rude:5
msgid ""
"I can't tell you that!  He'll kill me!..Well, I guess so will you, won't you.  His name is Harris Willington.  He lives in Thjorgard, but I don't know exactly where."
msgstr ""
"¡No puedo decíroslo! ¡Me matará!... Bueno, supongo que vosotros también, ¿verdad? Se llama Harris Willington. Vive en Thjorgard, pero no sé dónde exactamente."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC245.rude:5
msgid "Who put you up to this?"
msgstr "¿Quién te ha metido en esto?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC245.rude:6
msgid "How?"
msgstr "¿Cómo?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC245.rude:6
msgid "I'm sure we could come to an arrangement."
msgstr "Seguro que podemos llegar a un acuerdo."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC245.rude:7
msgid "How did you get that?"
msgstr "¿Cómo habéis conseguido eso?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC245.rude:7
msgid "This letter."
msgstr "Esta carta."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC245.rude:8 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC95.rude:1
msgid "Then leave me alone."
msgstr "Entonces dejadme en paz."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC245.rude:9
msgid "We're not going to allow you to murder Sven."
msgstr "No vamos a permitir que asesines a Sven."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC245.rude:9
msgid "What?  How could you know that?"
msgstr "¿Qué? ¿Cómo podéis saber eso?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC246.rude:2
msgid ""
"Thankfully, no.  I do not like to receive bad news, and the news I usually receive is always bad!"
msgstr ""
"Por suerte, no. No me gusta recibir malas noticias, ¡y las noticias que recibo siempre son malas!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC246.rude:3
msgid ""
"Fine, let me see.  Oh!  This is terrible news!  Why did you bring this to me?  Leave at once!"
msgstr ""
"Está bien, dejadme ver. ¡Oh! ¡Es una noticia terrible! ¿Por qué me habéis traído esto? ¡Marchaos ahora mismo!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC246.rude:3
msgid "We don't care if you want it.  You will take it."
msgstr "Nos da igual si lo quieres. Lo vas a aceptar."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC246.rude:4
msgid "We've come to deliver this message."
msgstr "Venimos a entregar este mensaje."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC246.rude:4
msgid "What message?  What makes you think I want this message?"
msgstr "¿Qué mensaje? ¿Qué os hace pensar que quiero ese mensaje?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC246.rude:5
msgid ""
"I do not like them very much.  They are usually the ones who send us bad news!"
msgstr ""
"No me caen muy bien. ¡Suelen ser ellos los que nos mandan malas noticias!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC246.rude:5
msgid "What do you know about Honkies?"
msgstr "¿Qué sabes de los honkies?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC247.rude:2
msgid ""
"I moved here from Framon a few years ago.  I am glad to be away from that place, I can tell you!  Those people there, they are getting crazy!"
msgstr ""
"Me vine aquí desde Framon hace unos años. ¡Os aseguro que me alegro de haber salido de allí! ¡La gente de allí se está volviendo loca!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC247.rude:3 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC247.rude:4
msgid "We'd like to look at your wares."
msgstr "Queremos ver tu mercancía."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC247.rude:5
msgid ""
"That's where I was born.  The king and queen are right off their rockers!  I could hardly sell my swords without some government official coming in to inspect all my swords for \"violations\".  I was glad when they exiled me!"
msgstr ""
"Allí nací yo. ¡El rey y la reina están como cabras! Apenas podía vender mis espadas sin que viniera algún funcionario del gobierno a inspeccionarlas todas en busca de «infracciones». ¡Me alegré cuando me desterraron!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC247.rude:7
msgid "Maybe you will buy something next time."
msgstr "Quizá la próxima vez compréis algo."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC247.rude:8
msgid "You look like you need a sword."
msgstr "Parece que os hace falta una espada."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC248.rude:2
msgid "I was having trouble killing the Lich King.  Do you have any tips?"
msgstr "Me estaba costando matar al Rey Liche. ¿Tenéis algún consejo?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC248.rude:5
msgid ""
"Once I visited Vishi Island, but I couldn't find the Lantern.  I even visited the Golden Dragon.  I wonder what I did wrong?"
msgstr ""
"Una vez visité la Isla Vishi, pero no encontré la Candela. Incluso visité al Dragón Dorado. ¿Qué haría mal?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC248.rude:7
msgid "Come back when you have money!"
msgstr "¡Volved cuando tengáis dinero!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC248.rude:8 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/TOPBLURB.rude:248
msgid "Do you want some armor?"
msgstr "¿Queréis alguna armadura?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC249.rude:2
msgid ""
"I've been very busy lately.  I haven't been able to keep up on all the news I've been getting.  Maybe you could come back later?"
msgstr ""
"Últimamente he estado muy ocupado. No he podido estar al día de todas las noticias que me llegan. ¿Quizá podríais volver más tarde?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC249.rude:5
msgid ""
"Have you seen the Scepter of Gaak?  I've been looking for it.  I don't think it really exists."
msgstr ""
"¿Habéis visto el Cetro de Gaak? Lo he estado buscando. No creo que exista de verdad."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC249.rude:8
msgid "Thanks for your time!"
msgstr "¡Gracias por tu tiempo!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC249.rude:8
msgid "You're welcome!"
msgstr "¡De nada!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC25.rude:1
msgid "The Refinery in the Thjorad Mine has shut down!"
msgstr "¡La Refinería de la Mina de Thjorad ha cerrado!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC25.rude:2
msgid "Perhaps we will.  Goodbye"
msgstr "Quizá lo hagamos. Adiós"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC25.rude:4
msgid ""
"I don't know!  Why don't you go talk to Sven Forkbeard and get him to do something about it?"
msgstr ""
"¡No lo sé! ¿Por qué no vais a hablar con Sven Forkbeard y conseguís que haga algo?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC25.rude:4
msgid "Why isn't anyone doing anything about it?"
msgstr "¿Por qué nadie hace nada al respecto?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC25.rude:5
msgid ""
"If the Refinery isn't refining Elemental Thjorad, the Thjoradric Smiths will have nothing to work with and we'll all starve!!"
msgstr ""
"Si la Refinería no refina Thjorad Elemental, los herreros de Thjoradric no tendrán con qué trabajar, ¡y todos moriremos de hambre!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC25.rude:5
msgid "Why is that a problem?"
msgstr "¿Por qué es eso un problema?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC25.rude:7
msgid ""
"That's the place in the Thjorad Mine where they refine the Elemental Thjorad so that it can be used by the Thjoradric Smiths."
msgstr ""
"Es el lugar de la Mina de Thjorad donde refinan el Thjorad Elemental para que lo puedan usar los herreros de Thjoradric."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC25.rude:7 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC34.rude:5
msgid "What do you know about the refinery?"
msgstr "¿Qué sabes de la refinería?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC25.rude:8
msgid "Bless him!  Why are you wasting your time talking to me?"
msgstr "¡Bendito sea! ¿Por qué perdéis el tiempo hablando conmigo?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC25.rude:8
msgid "Sven Forkbeard has instructed us to inspect the Refinery."
msgstr "Sven Forkbeard nos ha ordenado inspeccionar la Refinería."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC250.rude:1
msgid ""
"Don't tell anyone where you found this merchandise.  Sven would have us hanged if he found out."
msgstr ""
"No le digáis a nadie dónde encontrasteis esta mercancía. Sven nos haría ahorcar si se enterara."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC250.rude:3
msgid "I kinow that everything here is way overpriced!!"
msgstr "¡¡Yo sé que aquí todo está carísimo!!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC251.rude:1
msgid ""
"While I was in the marketplace buying fruit the other day, I heard someone talking about Kira the Cold and Sven Forkbeard.  What on earth could she want with Sven?  Isn't she seeing Bjarni?"
msgstr ""
"El otro día, mientras compraba fruta en el mercado, oí a alguien hablar de Kira la Fría y de Sven Forkbeard. ¿Qué querrá ella de Sven? ¿No sale con Bjarni?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC251.rude:3
msgid ""
"It's a wonderful place to live.  I used to live in Frosgard, but things are getting real bad there.  It won't be long before everyone leaves Frosgard and comes here."
msgstr ""
"Es un lugar maravilloso para vivir. Antes vivía en Frosgard, pero allí las cosas están yendo muy mal. Dentro de poco todos se irán de Frosgard y vendrán aquí."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC252.rude:1
msgid ""
"My grandfather used to tell me about the Mountain Pass that ran from here to Thronheim.  One day, I am going to go find it."
msgstr ""
"Mi abuelo me hablaba del Paso de Montaña que iba de aquí a Thronheim. Algún día iré a buscarlo."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC252.rude:2
msgid "We'd like some training."
msgstr "Queremos entrenar."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC252.rude:3
msgid ""
"If you're looking for armor, Go visit Gunnar Thjorsmith.  He's get some of the best stuff around."
msgstr ""
"Si buscáis armadura, id a ver a Gunnar Thjorsmith. Tiene de lo mejor que hay por aquí."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC253.rude:1
msgid ""
"I once carried stuff for Kira the Cold's sister!  Oh, it was wonderful.  She was so kind."
msgstr ""
"¡Una vez le llevé las cosas a la hermana de Kira la Fría! Oh, fue maravilloso. Era muy amable."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC253.rude:2
msgid "With all the stuff we find, that's a bargain!  You're hired!"
msgstr "¡Con todo lo que encontramos, es una ganga! ¡Estás contratado!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC253.rude:3
msgid ""
"I can increase your carrying capacity by 30 things!  I charge 500 gold a month, plus 20% of all the gold you find!"
msgstr ""
"¡Puedo aumentar vuestra capacidad de carga en 30 cosas! Cobro 500 de oro al mes, ¡más el 20% de todo el oro que encontréis!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC253.rude:3
msgid "Sounds interesting.  What do you charge?"
msgstr "Suena interesante. ¿Cuánto cobras?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC253.rude:4
msgid ""
"If I say so myself, I am the most useful person you can hire.  There's nothing worse than finding something really neat and not being able to carry it back!"
msgstr ""
"Modestia aparte, soy la persona más útil que podéis contratar. ¡No hay nada peor que encontrar algo realmente estupendo y no poder llevároslo!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC253.rude:4
msgid "What do you know about items?"
msgstr "¿Qué sabes de objetos?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC253.rude:5
msgid "Sorry, we don't need your services."
msgstr "Lo siento, no necesitamos tus servicios."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC253.rude:5
msgid "Very well.  Come back when you're smarter!"
msgstr "Muy bien. ¡Volved cuando seáis más listos!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC254.rude:1
msgid ""
"I've heard that there is some guy named Nicolai running around Drangheim preaching disaster and destruction.  Poor soul.  He seems to think that he's a king and that devils are going to take over the world.  I wonder what happened to him?"
msgstr ""
"He oído que un tipo llamado Nicolai anda por Drangheim predicando desastres y destrucción. Pobre alma. Parece creer que es rey y que los demonios van a apoderarse del mundo. ¿Qué le habrá pasado?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC254.rude:2 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC417.rude:2 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC417.rude:5
msgctxt "said by the party"
msgid "Okay."
msgstr "Vale."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC254.rude:3
msgid ""
"Some kid named Nicolai came through here a while back.  Poor guy seems to be really afraid of the devils.  I really don't know what he's talking about.  Personally, I'd be more worried about the army coming from the west."
msgstr ""
"Hace un tiempo pasó por aquí un chaval llamado Nicolai. El pobre parece tenerles muchísimo miedo a los demonios. La verdad es que no sé de qué habla. Yo, personalmente, me preocuparía más por el ejército que viene del oeste."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC254.rude:3
msgid "What do you know about disaster?"
msgstr "¿Qué sabes del desastre?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC254.rude:4
msgid "Would you like a drink?"
msgstr "¿Queréis tomar algo?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC255.rude:2
msgid ""
"I recently got a sword from William the Framish.  Kira ordered all able bodied men to arm themselves.  I guess she's getting ready to fight the invaders."
msgstr ""
"Hace poco le compré una espada a William el Framés. Kira ordenó que todos los hombres capaces se armaran. Supongo que se está preparando para luchar contra los invasores."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC255.rude:5
msgid ""
"I'm not about to let the invaders take over here.  Kira's worked too hard to bring prosperity to us.  If they want to conquer someone, they'd better go to Frosgard, because they're not getting anything here!"
msgstr ""
"No pienso dejar que los invasores se apoderen de esto. Kira ha trabajado demasiado para traernos prosperidad. Si quieren conquistar a alguien, que vayan a Frosgard, ¡porque aquí no se van a llevar nada!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC255.rude:7
msgid "Why don't you buy something next time."
msgstr "¿Por qué no compráis algo la próxima vez?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC256.rude:1
msgid ""
"Kira came and visited me in person last week.  She said she may need to call upon me for my special skills soon.  I wonder why she would want that?"
msgstr ""
"La semana pasada Kira vino a visitarme en persona. Dijo que quizá pronto necesitaría recurrir a mis habilidades especiales. ¿Para qué querrá eso?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC256.rude:3
msgid ""
"Kira is a wonderful leader!  She actually cares about her subjects!  I hope that she marries Sven Forkbeard, and together they can give birth to a Chedian king!"
msgstr ""
"¡Kira es una líder maravillosa! ¡De verdad se preocupa por sus súbditos! ¡Espero que se case con Sven Forkbeard y que juntos den a luz a un rey de Chedian!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC256.rude:3 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC265.rude:3 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC269.rude:3
msgid "What do you know about Kira?"
msgstr "¿Qué sabes de Kira?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC256.rude:4
msgid "Blessings upon you, friends!"
msgstr "¡Bendiciones para vosotros, amigos!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC256.rude:6
msgid ""
"Gray Slemnir is finally retiring, eh?  I wish I could help.  Perhaps there is someone in Lindisfarne who could help."
msgstr ""
"Así que Slemnir el Gris por fin se retira, ¿eh? Ojalá pudiera ayudar. Quizá haya alguien en Lindisfarne que pueda ayudaros."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC256.rude:6
msgid "We are looking for a priest to take to Guberland."
msgstr "Buscamos un sacerdote para llevarlo a Guberland."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC257.rude:1
msgid "And where would you like to send these \"passengers\"?"
msgstr "¿Y adónde queréis enviar a esos «pasajeros»?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC257.rude:1
msgctxt "said by the party"
msgid "Perhaps."
msgstr "Quizá."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC257.rude:10
msgid ""
"I'm the best sailor that ever lived!  I've traveled unscathed through storms that would have wrecked ships ten times my size!"
msgstr ""
"¡Soy el mejor marinero que ha existido nunca! ¡He atravesado sin un rasguño tormentas que habrían hundido barcos diez veces más grandes que el mío!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC257.rude:12
msgid "Perhaps another time."
msgstr "Quizá en otra ocasión."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC257.rude:13
msgid ""
"That's just plain mean!  Those Mendossians don't deserve that!  Send all the honkies over here to the docks.  I'll take care of the rest."
msgstr ""
"¡Eso es pura maldad! ¡Los mendosianos no se merecen eso! Mandad a todos los honkies aquí, a los muelles. Yo me encargo del resto."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC257.rude:13
msgid "We'd like to send them to Mendossus."
msgstr "Queremos enviarlos a Mendossus."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC257.rude:14
msgid "We'd like to ask you a favor."
msgstr "Queremos pedirte un favor."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC257.rude:14 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC35.rude:11
msgid "What's that?"
msgstr "¿De qué se trata?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC257.rude:15 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC257.rude:16 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC257.rude:17
msgid "How'd that Honky thing work out?"
msgstr "¿Cómo salió lo de los honkies?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC257.rude:15
msgid ""
"They never knew what hit them!  They're well on their way to Beldonia.  I don't envy those Beldonians, that's for sure!"
msgstr ""
"¡Ni se enteraron de lo que les pasó! Ya van bien lejos, camino de Beldonia. ¡Desde luego, no envidio a los beldonianos!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC257.rude:16
msgid ""
"They never knew what hit them!  They're well on their way back to Guberland where they belong!"
msgstr ""
"¡Ni se enteraron de lo que les pasó! Ya van bien lejos, de vuelta a Guberland, ¡que es donde tienen que estar!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC257.rude:17
msgid ""
"They never knew what hit them!  They're well on their way to Mendossus.  That Mendossian king sure is going to hate us for that!  Heh, heh.  He might even declare war on us!"
msgstr ""
"¡Ni se enteraron de lo que les pasó! Ya van bien lejos, camino de Mendossus. ¡Seguro que el rey de Mendossus nos va a odiar por esto! Je, je. ¡Hasta podría declararnos la guerra!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC257.rude:3
msgid ""
"I got caught in a storm crossing the Verhoffin Sea recently.  I lost half my cargo!"
msgstr ""
"Hace poco me pilló una tormenta cruzando el Mar de Verhoffin. ¡Perdí la mitad de la carga!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC257.rude:4
msgid "Interested in leaving?"
msgstr "¿Os interesa marcharos?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC257.rude:4
msgid "Yes."
msgstr "Sí."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC257.rude:5
msgid ""
"Is that so?  And might these people worship a certain temple devoted to geese?"
msgstr ""
"¿Ah, sí? ¿Y no será que esa gente venera a cierto templo dedicado a los gansos?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC257.rude:5
msgid "We need to send some people away."
msgstr "Necesitamos enviar lejos a unas personas."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC257.rude:7
msgid ""
"If what I've heard about the army marching towards us is true, those Beldonians deserve it!  Just send them over here to the docks.  I'll take care of the rest."
msgstr ""
"Si es verdad lo que he oído del ejército que marcha hacia aquí, ¡los beldonianos se lo merecen! Mandadlos aquí, a los muelles. Yo me encargo del resto."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC257.rude:7
msgid "We'd like to send them to Beldonia."
msgstr "Queremos enviarlos a Beldonia."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC257.rude:8
msgid "Trust me.  You're doing us ALL a favor.  Farewell."
msgstr "Creedme. Nos estáis haciendo un favor a TODOS. Adiós."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC257.rude:9
msgid ""
"A fitting destination if any.  Just send them all over here to the docks.  I'll take care of the rest."
msgstr ""
"Un destino de lo más apropiado. Mandadlos a todos aquí, a los muelles. Yo me encargo del resto."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC257.rude:9
msgid "We'd like to send them back to Guberland."
msgstr "Queremos enviarlos de vuelta a Guberland."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC258.rude:10
msgid ""
"Kira has been very nervous lately.  I wonder if it has anything to do with Bjarni.  He's quite taken with her, I hear."
msgstr ""
"Kira está muy nerviosa últimamente. Me pregunto si tendrá algo que ver con Bjarni. Dicen que está muy prendado de ella."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC258.rude:19
msgid ""
"You can find the armor shop on the northern wall in the southern section of town."
msgstr ""
"La tienda de armaduras está junto a la muralla norte de la parte sur de la ciudad."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC258.rude:21
msgid ""
"The tavern is along the southern wall in the northern section of town, near the guard's barracks."
msgstr ""
"La taberna está junto a la muralla sur de la parte norte de la ciudad, cerca del cuartel de la guardia."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC258.rude:22
msgid ""
"He's the Jarl of Sturmford.  He's been trying to woo Kira the Cold for years.  I wonder why he hasn't gotten the hint yet?"
msgstr ""
"Es el Jarl de Sturmford. Lleva años intentando cortejar a Kira la Fría. ¿Cómo es que aún no ha captado la indirecta?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC258.rude:22 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC49.rude:13 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC59.rude:3
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC87.rude:34
msgid "What do you know about Bjarni?"
msgstr "¿Qué sabes de Bjarni?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC258.rude:26
msgid ""
"The magic shop is near the eastern gate.  Just take the alley behind this building."
msgstr ""
"La tienda de magia está cerca de la puerta este. Tomad el callejón que hay detrás de este edificio."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC258.rude:27
msgid "No.  Why do you ask?"
msgstr "No. ¿Por qué lo preguntáis?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC258.rude:28
msgid "The temple is in northwestern part of the western section of town."
msgstr "El templo está al noroeste de la parte oeste de la ciudad."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC258.rude:3
msgid ""
"You can find the weapon shop in the southeast corner of the middle section of town."
msgstr ""
"La tienda de armas está en la esquina sudeste de la parte central de la ciudad."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC258.rude:32
msgid "The apothecary is in the middle of the northern section of town."
msgstr "El apotecario está en el centro de la parte norte de la ciudad."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC258.rude:34
msgid ""
"The training hall is along the southern wall of the southern section of town."
msgstr ""
"La Sala de Entrenamiento está junto a la muralla sur de la parte sur de la ciudad."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC258.rude:43
msgid "The library is in the northeast corner of the middle section of town."
msgstr ""
"La biblioteca está en la esquina nordeste de la parte central de la ciudad."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC258.rude:45 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC76.rude:6
msgid "No problem."
msgstr "No hay problema."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC258.rude:6
msgid ""
"Kira the Cold lives in the castle in the southeasterly section of town."
msgstr "Kira la Fría vive en el castillo de la parte sudeste de la ciudad."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC258.rude:8
msgid ""
"You can find the bank on the northern wall in the northern section of town."
msgstr ""
"El banco está junto a la muralla norte de la parte norte de la ciudad."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC259.rude:2
msgid ""
"One day when I'm braver, I will go into the Inventa Storca.  The books that are in there must be unbelievably fabulous!"
msgstr ""
"Algún día, cuando sea más valiente, entraré en la Inventa Storca. ¡Los libros que hay allí deben de ser increíblemente fabulosos!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC259.rude:3 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC259.rude:4
msgid "We'd like to see your books."
msgstr "Queremos ver tus libros."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC259.rude:5
msgid ""
"That's my favorite subject!  I've found some text that date back to before the Great Cataclysm!  I just wish I could find some from before.  I'm sure they exist!  I can feel it in my bones!  They are out there!!"
msgstr ""
"¡Es mi tema favorito! ¡He encontrado textos que se remontan a antes del Gran Cataclismo! Ojalá encontrara alguno aún más antiguo. ¡Seguro que existen! ¡Lo noto en los huesos! ¡Están ahí fuera!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC259.rude:5
msgid "What do you know about ancient texts?"
msgstr "¿Qué sabes de textos antiguos?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC26.rude:2 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC28.rude:1 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC46.rude:8
msgctxt "said by the party"
msgid "Good luck."
msgstr "Buena suerte."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC26.rude:3
msgid "Hmm, that's not a bad idea.  Maybe I will do that."
msgstr "Mmm, no es mala idea. Quizá lo haga."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC26.rude:3
msgid "Why don't you go work at the East Mine, then?"
msgstr "Entonces, ¿por qué no vas a trabajar a la Mina Este?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC26.rude:4
msgid "Maybe you should have a look before you go preaching!"
msgstr "¡Quizá deberíais echar un vistazo antes de poneros a sermonear!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC26.rude:4
msgid "You don't care if the people here starve?"
msgstr "¿No te importa que la gente de aquí muera de hambre?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC26.rude:5
msgid "But people are depending on the Elemental Thjorad!"
msgstr "¡Pero la gente depende del Thjorad Elemental!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC26.rude:5
msgid ""
"They can depend on it all they want!  I'm not going risking my neck for a few greedy merchants!"
msgstr ""
"¡Que dependan de él todo lo que quieran! ¡No pienso jugarme el cuello por unos cuantos mercaderes codiciosos!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC26.rude:6
msgid ""
"The conditions are horrible!  In the Thjorad Mine there's certainly going to be a cave-in!  The workers are right to stop working!"
msgstr ""
"¡Las condiciones son horribles! ¡En la Mina de Thjorad seguro que habrá un derrumbe! ¡Los trabajadores hacen bien en dejar de trabajar!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC26.rude:7
msgid ""
"I don't know what they East Miners have to complain about, their necks aren't on the line!"
msgstr ""
"No sé de qué se quejan los mineros de la Mina Este, ¡ellos no se juegan el cuello!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC26.rude:7
msgid "What about the East Mine?"
msgstr "¿Y la Mina Este?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC26.rude:8
msgid "Sorry, goodbye."
msgstr "Lo siento, adiós."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC260.rude:1
msgid ""
"I competed in a strength competition at The Thing last year.  I won it by pulling a cart full of rocks!"
msgstr ""
"El año pasado participé en una competición de fuerza en el Thing. ¡La gané tirando de un carro lleno de rocas!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC260.rude:3
msgid ""
"Get as strong as you possibly can.  There's nothing more humiliating than watching a weakling swing a sword!"
msgstr ""
"Haceos tan fuertes como podáis. ¡No hay nada más humillante que ver a un alfeñique blandiendo una espada!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC261.rude:1 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC261.rude:8 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC261.rude:9
msgid "Carry on the fight, brother!"
msgstr "¡Sigue con la lucha, hermano!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC261.rude:1
msgid "Well, good luck."
msgstr "Bueno, buena suerte."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC261.rude:2
msgid ""
"Stop the rich few from using the backs of the working class to make themselves rich!  We should be making ourselves rich!  Down with the oppressors!  Down, down, down!!"
msgstr ""
"¡Impedir que unos pocos ricos se enriquezcan a costa de la clase trabajadora! ¡Los que deberíamos enriquecernos somos nosotros! ¡Abajo los opresores! ¡Abajo, abajo, abajo!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC261.rude:2
msgid "Stop what?"
msgstr "¿Impedir qué?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC261.rude:3
msgid ""
"Do you realize that a very few rich people own almost every bit of wealth here?  They own the stores, the lands, they have all the money!  And they use this power to control the people!  It's time to stop I say!"
msgstr ""
"¿Os dais cuenta de que unos pocos ricos poseen casi toda la riqueza de aquí? ¡Son dueños de las tiendas, de las tierras, tienen todo el dinero! ¡Y usan ese poder para controlar al pueblo! ¡Digo que ya es hora de acabar con esto!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC261.rude:3
msgctxt "said by the party"
msgid "What are you talking about?"
msgstr "¿De qué estás hablando?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC261.rude:4
msgid ""
"I am on a crusade to stop the oppressive controlling governments!  It is time the people rose up and joined together to run this nation!"
msgstr ""
"¡Estoy en una cruzada para acabar con los gobiernos opresores y controladores! ¡Es hora de que el pueblo se alce y se una para gobernar esta nación!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC261.rude:5
msgid "Those who have bound you blindly in your servitude!"
msgstr "¡Los que os han atado ciegamente a vuestra servidumbre!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC261.rude:5
msgid "What oppressors?"
msgstr "¿Qué opresores?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC261.rude:6
msgid ""
"I am the founder of the Chedian Liberation Party!  We only have two members, but we are growing!  And one day the CLP will be the ones in charge of Chedian!"
msgstr ""
"¡Soy el fundador del Partido de Liberación de Chedian! ¡Solo somos dos miembros, pero estamos creciendo! ¡Y un día el PLC gobernará Chedian!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC261.rude:6
msgid "What do you know about oppression?"
msgstr "¿Qué sabes de la opresión?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC262.rude:1
msgid ""
"I've heard Kira the Cold wants someone to reopen the mountain pass.  It's about time, I say!  She'll make us rich one day, I tell you!"
msgstr ""
"He oído que Kira la Fría quiere que alguien reabra el paso de montaña. ¡Ya era hora, digo yo! ¡Os aseguro que algún día nos hará ricos!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC262.rude:3
msgid ""
"It was built hundreds of years ago by the rulers of Thjorgard and Thronheim while they enjoyed a brief time of peace."
msgstr ""
"Lo construyeron hace cientos de años los gobernantes de Thjorgard y Thronheim durante un breve periodo de paz."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC262.rude:3
msgid "What do you know about the Mountain Pass?"
msgstr "¿Qué sabes del Paso de Montaña?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC263.rude:1
msgid ""
"If Kira manages to reopen the mountain pass, it's death for us all!  Who knows what sort of monsters lay on the other side!  Does it really go to Thjorgard?  Is Thjorgard really a place?  I bet it doesn't even exist!"
msgstr ""
"Si Kira consigue reabrir el paso de montaña, ¡será la muerte de todos! ¡Quién sabe qué clase de monstruos acechan al otro lado! ¿De verdad lleva a Thjorgard? ¿De verdad existe un lugar llamado Thjorgard? ¡Apuesto a que ni siquiera existe!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC263.rude:3
msgid ""
"Don't go anywhere!  How do we really know that those other places exist?  What if they don't?  What if the Verhoffin Sea is just a glass of water for a giant?  He'd drink us all to oblivion!"
msgstr ""
"¡No vayáis a ninguna parte! ¿Cómo sabemos de verdad que esos otros lugares existen? ¿Y si no existen? ¿Y si el Mar de Verhoffin no es más que el vaso de agua de un gigante? ¡Nos bebería a todos hasta el olvido!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC264.rude:2
msgid ""
"It's high time Kira the Cold got married.  She's single, you know!  She needs to provide Thronheim with an heir!  She may lead us to greatness, but without a successor, we'll be lost!  I've heard that Bjarni is a nice fellow!"
msgstr ""
"Ya va siendo hora de que Kira la Fría se case. Está soltera, ¿sabéis? ¡Tiene que dar un heredero a Thronheim! Puede que nos lleve a la grandeza, pero sin un sucesor, ¡estaremos perdidos! ¡He oído que Bjarni es un buen tipo!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC264.rude:4
msgid "Bjarni is their ruler.  I think he would be a fine match for Kira!"
msgstr "Bjarni es su gobernante. ¡Creo que haría muy buena pareja con Kira!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC264.rude:4 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC83.rude:7 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC97.rude:5
msgid "What do you know about Sturmford?"
msgstr "¿Qué sabes de Sturmford?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC265.rude:1
msgid ""
"Any man who wants to stay that way would be crazy to marry Kira!  Why, the minute he put his back to her, she would tear him to bits!  Crazy, I tell you!"
msgstr ""
"¡Cualquier hombre que quiera seguir entero estaría loco si se casara con Kira! ¡En cuanto le diera la espalda, ella lo haría pedazos! ¡Os digo que es una locura!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC265.rude:3
msgid ""
"I don't know how she's going to find a husband.  No Jarl in their right mind would give in to her, and everyone else is beneath her station.  There's going to be quite the trouble when she dies, that's for sure!"
msgstr ""
"No sé cómo va a encontrar marido. Ningún Jarl en su sano juicio se rendiría a ella, y todos los demás están por debajo de su rango. ¡Cuando muera habrá muchos problemas, eso seguro!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC266.rude:1
msgid ""
"That Knut is out of his mind!  Without the ruling class, this world would fall into anarchy!  The people just aren't smart or responsible enough to handle their own freedom!  If we controlled our own lives, all that would happen is starvation and death!"
msgstr ""
"¡Ese Knut ha perdido el juicio! ¡Sin la clase gobernante, este mundo caería en la anarquía! ¡La gente no es lo bastante lista ni responsable para manejar su propia libertad! ¡Si controláramos nuestras propias vidas, solo habría hambre y muerte!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC266.rude:3
msgid ""
"I think the Jarls are doing just fine, thank you!  They've all been educated, and have learned how to rule!  Besides that, they're just naturally smarter than the rest of us."
msgstr ""
"¡Pues yo creo que los Jarls lo hacen muy bien, gracias! ¡Todos han recibido educación y han aprendido a gobernar! Además, son más listos por naturaleza que el resto de nosotros."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC266.rude:3
msgid "What do you know about politics?"
msgstr "¿Qué sabes de política?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC267.rude:1
msgid ""
"Those miners better get back to work!  Why I haven't seen cowardice like that since Markel the Great was made Jarl of Guberland!"
msgstr ""
"¡Más vale que esos mineros vuelvan al trabajo! ¡No veía una cobardía así desde que nombraron a Markel el Grande Jarl de Guberland!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC267.rude:5
msgid ""
"It's a good time, if you are brave enough.  If you're careful enough, it can also be profitable."
msgstr ""
"Es un buen momento, si sois lo bastante valientes. Y si tenéis suficiente cuidado, también puede ser rentable."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC268.rude:1
msgid ""
"I heard from a friend that Sven Forkbeard sent a shipment of swords to Kira.  I wonder if he's trying to win her heart?  What a romantic gesture that is!"
msgstr ""
"Un amigo me ha contado que Sven Forkbeard envió un cargamento de espadas a Kira. ¿Estará intentando ganarse su corazón? ¡Qué gesto tan romántico!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC268.rude:3
msgid ""
"I think that Kira should marry Sven.  Not only is he better looking than Bjarni, but he's also in charge of Thjorgard.  What a great noble family that would make!"
msgstr ""
"Creo que Kira debería casarse con Sven. No solo es más guapo que Bjarni, sino que además gobierna Thjorgard. ¡Qué gran familia noble formarían!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC268.rude:3
msgid "What do you know about romance?"
msgstr "¿Qué sabes del amor?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC268.rude:5
msgid ""
"If I could have my way, I would tie them up, and put them on a ship bound anywhere but here!  I bet I would get away with it, too!  Moenach the Dockmaster dislikes them as much as anyone!"
msgstr ""
"¡Si por mí fuera, los ataría y los metería en un barco con destino a cualquier sitio menos aquí! ¡Y apuesto a que me saldría con la mía! ¡Moenach, el jefe del puerto, los detesta tanto como cualquiera!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC268.rude:5
msgid "What do you know about the Honkies?"
msgstr "¿Qué sabes de los honkies?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC269.rude:1
msgid ""
"Poor Bjarni.  I think he's really in love with Kira, and she really doesn't want anything to do with him.  A few months ago he came to visit, and she treated him like the greatest person on earth.  No wonder he's infatuated with her."
msgstr ""
"Pobre Bjarni. Creo que está enamorado de verdad de Kira, y ella no quiere saber nada de él. Hace unos meses vino de visita y ella lo trató como si fuera la persona más grande del mundo. No me extraña que esté encaprichado con ella."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC269.rude:3
msgid ""
"I wish she would make up her mind and settle down with a husband!  It's shameful that she's unmarried at her age!  She claims to be too busy running Thronheim, but I don't think that's it at all!"
msgstr ""
"¡Ojalá se decidiera de una vez y sentara la cabeza con un marido! ¡Es vergonzoso que siga soltera a su edad! Dice que está demasiado ocupada gobernando Thronheim, ¡pero yo no creo que sea eso en absoluto!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC269.rude:5
msgid ""
"I hate them!  I wish someone would send them away!  In fact, I bet that the Dockmaster would take them anywhere in the world but here.  All he'd need is for someone to convince them to go to the docks!"
msgstr ""
"¡Los odio! ¡Ojalá alguien los echara! De hecho, apuesto a que el jefe del puerto se los llevaría a cualquier parte del mundo menos aquí. ¡Solo necesitaría que alguien los convenciera de ir a los muelles!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC269.rude:5
msgid "What do you think of the Honkies?"
msgstr "¿Qué opinas de los honkies?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC27.rude:10
msgid "I'm sorry about your plight.  Goodbye."
msgstr "Lamento tu situación. Adiós."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC27.rude:2
msgid "Aright then.  Goodbye"
msgstr "Bueno, entonces adiós"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC27.rude:3
msgid ""
"And maybe Sven will admit to taking bribe money to release his prisoners!  I don't think you'll understand until you've been in the mines."
msgstr ""
"¡Y a lo mejor Sven reconoce que acepta sobornos por soltar a sus prisioneros! No creo que lo entendáis hasta que hayáis estado en las minas."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC27.rude:3
msgid "Maybe someday an ex-miner will become a Jarl."
msgstr "Quizá algún día un antiguo minero llegue a ser jarl."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC27.rude:4
msgid "I'm sure Sven cares about you men."
msgstr "Seguro que a Sven le importáis vosotros, sus hombres."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC27.rude:4
msgid ""
"You can be sure all you want.  But I know the truth.  Jarls never care about the miners.  We're just a resource for them to manage!  Maybe we should get them into the mines for a day."
msgstr ""
"Podéis estar todo lo seguros que queráis. Pero yo sé la verdad. A los jarls nunca les importan los mineros. ¡Para ellos solo somos un recurso que administrar! A lo mejor deberíamos meterlos a ellos en las minas un día."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC27.rude:5
msgid ""
"He just wants his ore to get to the refinery.  He doesn't care how many miner's lives are taken in the process."
msgstr ""
"Él solo quiere que su mineral llegue a la refinería. Le da igual cuántas vidas de mineros cueste."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC27.rude:5
msgid "Why wouldn't Sven pay for it?"
msgstr "¿Por qué no iba a pagarlo Sven?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC27.rude:6
msgid ""
"Now there is a fine idea!  Maybe Sven Forkbeard would even pay for it!  HA!"
msgstr ""
"¡Vaya, esa sí que es una buena idea! ¡A lo mejor Sven Barbapartida hasta la pagaría! ¡JA!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC27.rude:6
msgid "Why don't you have the Thjoradric Smiths make you something?"
msgstr "¿Por qué no pedís a los herreros de Thjoradric que os fabriquen algo?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC27.rude:7
msgid ""
"That's just the problem!  We don't just need new tools, we need new kinds of tools.  Something that will blow that rock to smithereens!"
msgstr ""
"¡Ese es justo el problema! No solo necesitamos herramientas nuevas, necesitamos herramientas de otra clase. ¡Algo que haga saltar esa roca en mil pedazos!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC27.rude:7
msgid "Why don't you get some new tools?"
msgstr "¿Por qué no conseguís herramientas nuevas?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC27.rude:8
msgid "The picks and shovels we have just won't cut through that new rock!"
msgstr "¡Los picos y las palas que tenemos no pueden con esa roca nueva!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC27.rude:8 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC281.rude:4 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC308.rude:3
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC322.rude:2 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC43.rude:6 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC51.rude:9
msgid "What do you mean?"
msgstr "¿Qué quieres decir?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC27.rude:9
msgid "Have you joined the United Group of Thjoradric Miners?"
msgstr "¿Te has unido al Grupo Unido de Mineros de Thjoradric?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC27.rude:9
msgid ""
"No!  Those people are gonna spell nothing but trouble for us honest miners!  You're with them, aren't you!  I'm not saying another word!"
msgstr ""
"¡No! ¡Esa gente no va a traer más que problemas a los mineros honrados como nosotros! Sois de los suyos, ¿verdad? ¡No pienso decir ni una palabra más!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC270.rude:1
msgid ""
"The Honkies have been around here for weeks!  I wish Kira would do something about them!"
msgstr ""
"¡Los Honkis llevan semanas rondando por aquí! ¡Ojalá Kira hiciera algo con ellos!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC270.rude:3
msgid ""
"Their worshippers have been coming around here lately.  They've been trying to get donations from us to build a church.  If they manage to get one built, I can guarantee it'll be burned down its first night open!"
msgstr ""
"Últimamente sus fieles vienen mucho por aquí. Intentan sacarnos donativos para construir una iglesia. Si consiguen levantar una, os garantizo que arderá la primera noche que abra sus puertas."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC271.rude:2
msgid "Oh!  Alright then.  I shall see you at the docks."
msgstr "¡Oh! Muy bien, entonces. Nos veremos en los muelles."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC271.rude:2
msgid "Some friends of ours also want to hear."
msgstr "Unos amigos nuestros también quieren oírlo."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC271.rude:3
msgid "Great! Why don't you meet us at the docks?"
msgstr "¡Estupendo! ¿Por qué no os reunís con nosotros en los muelles?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC271.rude:3
msgid "The docks?  Why can't you listen now?"
msgstr "¿Los muelles? ¿Por qué no podéis escucharlo ahora?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC271.rude:4
msgid "The Temple of Honk is the true path to rebirth!"
msgstr "¡El Templo de Honk es el verdadero camino hacia el renacimiento!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC271.rude:6
msgid "We'd like you to tell us about the Great Honk."
msgstr "Queremos que nos hables del Gran Honk."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC271.rude:6
msgid "Wonderful!  I can weave hours of enlightenment on that subject!"
msgstr "¡Maravilloso! ¡Puedo tejer horas de iluminación sobre ese asunto!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC271.rude:7
msgid ""
"There is no greater adventure than the path of the Great Honk!  Praise the Great Honk!  Praise Philacte Canagica!"
msgstr ""
"¡No hay aventura más grande que el camino del Gran Honk! ¡Alabado sea el Gran Honk! ¡Alabado sea Philacte Canagica!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC271.rude:8
msgid "May the Great Honk bless you!."
msgstr "¡Que el Gran Honk os bendiga!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC272.rude:2
msgid "The glory of Honk be praised to you for enlightening these souls!"
msgstr "¡Que la gloria de Honk os sea alabada por iluminar a esas almas!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC272.rude:3
msgid ""
"Ah, glorious hard labor.  I shall be happy to meet them there and breathe ease into their difficult lives."
msgstr ""
"Ah, el glorioso trabajo duro. Será un placer reunirme allí con ellos y llevar alivio a sus duras vidas."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC272.rude:3
msgid "They work on the docks."
msgstr "Trabajan en los muelles."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC272.rude:4
msgid "Our friends also would like to hear."
msgstr "Nuestros amigos también querrían oírlo."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC272.rude:4
msgid "That is wonderful news indeed.  Where, pray tell are these friends?"
msgstr ""
"Esas son noticias maravillosas, sin duda. ¿Y dónde están, decidme, esos amigos?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC272.rude:5
msgid ""
"I eagerly await the day I am reborn as a goose!  Did you know our prophet Philacte Canagica was reborn?  Praise the Great Honk!"
msgstr ""
"¡Espero con ansia el día en que renazca como ganso! ¿Sabíais que nuestro profeta Philacte Canagica renació? ¡Alabado sea el Gran Honk!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC272.rude:6
msgid "Should Honk wish it."
msgstr "Si Honk así lo quiere."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC272.rude:7
msgid ""
"If you please, we prefer to call ourselves Honkers!  I shall be happy to enlighten you."
msgstr ""
"Si no os importa, preferimos llamarnos Honkeros. Será un placer iluminaros."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC272.rude:7
msgid "We want to know more about the Honkies."
msgstr "Queremos saber más de los Honkis."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC272.rude:8
msgid ""
"We are here to raise the awareness of the Temple of Honk, and should Honk wish it, build a temple to him here."
msgstr ""
"Estamos aquí para dar a conocer el Templo de Honk y, si Honk así lo quiere, construirle aquí un templo."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC273.rude:1 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC273.rude:3
msgid "If you possess the skill, I shall help you."
msgstr "Si poseéis la habilidad, os ayudaré."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC273.rude:2
msgid ""
"I overheard the dockmaster complaining about the Honkies recently.  He said he wished he could conscript them to serve on one of the ships.  He said that would teach them some manners!"
msgstr ""
"Hace poco oí al capitán del puerto quejarse de los Honkis. Decía que ojalá pudiera reclutarlos a la fuerza para servir en uno de los barcos. ¡Decía que así aprenderían modales!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC273.rude:4
msgid "The elements surround us.  It is through their study we gain power."
msgstr "Los elementos nos rodean. Es estudiándolos como obtenemos el poder."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC273.rude:5
msgid "Seek Gudlaug Eitrissen in Lindisfarne."
msgstr "Buscad a Gudlaug Eitrissen en Lindisfarne."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC274.rude:1 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC274.rude:3
msgid "If you have the skills."
msgstr "Si tenéis las habilidades."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC274.rude:2
msgid ""
"Seek the light friend.  It is through its study we gain self-sovereignty."
msgstr ""
"Buscad la luz, amigo. Es estudiándola como alcanzamos el dominio de nosotros mismos."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC274.rude:4
msgid "Study hard.  An uneducated adventurer is a dead one."
msgstr "Estudiad mucho. Un aventurero sin formación es un aventurero muerto."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC275.rude:1 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC275.rude:3
msgid "Are you skillful enough?"
msgstr "¿Sois lo bastante hábiles?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC275.rude:2
msgid "Not that I shall share."
msgstr "Ninguna que vaya a compartir."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC275.rude:4
msgid "Dark is the way to power.  The only way to power."
msgstr "La Oscuridad es el camino al poder. El único camino al poder."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC276.rude:1 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC276.rude:3
msgid "Do you have the skills?"
msgstr "¿Tenéis las habilidades?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC276.rude:2
msgid ""
"I was in meditation, and I had a vision.  Two swords, touched each other, and then there was destruction.  I wonder what it means?"
msgstr ""
"Estaba meditando y tuve una visión. Dos espadas se tocaban y luego llegaba la destrucción. ¿Qué significará?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC276.rude:3
msgid "We'd like to become Masters in Spirit Magic."
msgstr "Queremos ser Maestros en Magia del Espíritu."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC276.rude:4
msgid ""
"Look for the spirit within.  For life may be varied and adventurous, but the true adventure is the journey of the spirit."
msgstr ""
"Buscad el espíritu en vuestro interior. Pues la vida puede ser variada y llena de aventuras, pero la verdadera aventura es el viaje del espíritu."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC277.rude:1 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC277.rude:3
msgid "Perhaps if you have the skills, you shall find what you seek."
msgstr "Quizá, si tenéis las habilidades, encontréis lo que buscáis."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC277.rude:2
msgid "Stay the course friends.  You will attain your destiny."
msgstr "Seguid vuestro rumbo, amigos. Alcanzaréis vuestro destino."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC277.rude:4
msgid ""
"Adventuring is a hollow activity.  It is both dangerous and foolhardy.  One cannot attain enlightenment while on the hard road.  If you are adventuring, I suggest you quit."
msgstr ""
"Las aventuras son una actividad vacía. Son peligrosas e insensatas. Nadie puede alcanzar la iluminación mientras recorre el duro camino. Si andáis de aventuras, os aconsejo que lo dejéis."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC278.rude:1
msgid "Goodbye!  Good luck!"
msgstr "¡Adiós! ¡Buena suerte!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC278.rude:1
msgid "We shall.  Farewell."
msgstr "Lo haremos. Adiós."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC278.rude:2
msgid "Which way were they headed?"
msgstr "¿Hacia dónde iban?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC278.rude:2
msgid ""
"Your man Forad said they were probably going to meet the army in Yorwick.  You must hurry!!  Take the Connecting Tunnels west of here.  It's dangerous, but it's the fastest way to Yorwick!"
msgstr ""
"Vuestro hombre, Forad, dijo que seguramente iban a reunirse con el ejército en Yorwick. ¡Tenéis que daros prisa! Tomad los Túneles de Conexión al oeste de aquí. Son peligrosos, ¡pero es el camino más rápido a Yorwick!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC278.rude:3
msgid ""
"Gone milords?  Why your man Forad claimed to know where the Beldonian army was camped!  He led them out of here days ago!  You must hurry if you are to catch them before the battle!"
msgstr ""
"¿Que se han ido, mis señores? ¡Pero si vuestro hombre, Forad, aseguraba saber dónde acampaba el ejército beldoniano! ¡Los sacó de aquí hace días! ¡Tenéis que daros prisa si queréis alcanzarlos antes de la batalla!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC278.rude:3
msgid "Where have they gone?"
msgstr "¿Adónde han ido?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC278.rude:4
msgid ""
"Only the words on the street, milords.  There is an army marching towards us.  We will be prepared to meet them, I assure you."
msgstr ""
"Solo lo que se dice por las calles, mis señores. Hay un ejército que marcha hacia nosotros. Estaremos preparados para recibirlo, os lo aseguro."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC278.rude:5
msgid ""
"They are large in numbers.  But we are prepared.  They shall not sneak up upon us like they did to Framon."
msgstr ""
"Son muy numerosos. Pero estamos preparados. No nos sorprenderán como hicieron con Framon."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC279.rude:2
msgid "May Honk bless your souls for your kindness, friends!"
msgstr "¡Que Honk bendiga vuestras almas por vuestra bondad, amigos!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC279.rude:3
msgid ""
"Glory be to Honk!  I shall be on my way immediately to those poor souls.  Fear not, they shall soon be saved!"
msgstr ""
"¡Gloria a Honk! Iré de inmediato a ver a esas pobres almas. No temáis, ¡pronto serán salvadas!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC279.rude:3
msgid "We have friends at the docks who would like to hear about you."
msgstr ""
"Tenemos unos amigos en los muelles a los que les gustaría oír hablar de vosotros."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC279.rude:4
msgid "Sorry.  I don't have time for that,"
msgstr "Lo siento. No tengo tiempo para eso."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC279.rude:5
msgid "Thanks for the answer.  A donation to what?"
msgstr "Gracias por la respuesta. ¿Un donativo para qué?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC279.rude:5
msgid ""
"To erect a temple to our glorious master!  Only through the glory of Honk will we be reborn!  That is what our Prophet says.  We shall praise the glory of Honk and be reborn."
msgstr ""
"¡Para erigir un templo a nuestro glorioso señor! ¡Solo mediante la gloria de Honk renaceremos! Eso es lo que dice nuestro Profeta. Alabaremos la gloria de Honk y renaceremos."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC279.rude:6
msgid "Why are you here?"
msgstr "¿Por qué estás aquí?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC279.rude:6
msgid "Would you care to make a donation?"
msgstr "¿Querríais hacer un donativo?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC279.rude:7
msgid ""
"My help?  May the Great Honk be praised!  I shall be honored to offer my assistance."
msgstr ""
"¿Mi ayuda? ¡Alabado sea el Gran Honk! Será un honor ofreceros mi ayuda."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC28.rude:2
msgid ""
"Of course!  I'm through with letting the linemen walk all over my brothers!  Down with the linemen!"
msgstr ""
"¡Claro! ¡Se acabó dejar que los jefes de línea pisoteen a mis hermanos! ¡Abajo los jefes de línea!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC28.rude:2
msgid "You're a member too?"
msgstr "¿Tú también eres miembro?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC28.rude:3
msgid "Alright.  Goodbye"
msgstr "Muy bien. Adiós."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC28.rude:4
msgid ""
"He took me on a long walk, and showed me the door.  Can you believe that?  He fired me!  Now leave me alone.  I want to forget the rest of this day."
msgstr ""
"Me llevó a dar un largo paseo y me enseñó la puerta. ¿Os lo podéis creer? ¡Me despidió! Ahora dejadme en paz. Quiero olvidar el resto de este día."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC28.rude:4 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC414.rude:11
msgid "What happened?"
msgstr "¿Qué pasó?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC28.rude:5
msgid ""
"I did!  That's why I'm here.  I went to the foreman and demanded to know why they fired our repair staff!"
msgstr ""
"¡Lo hice! Por eso estoy aquí. ¡Fui a ver al capataz y le exigí saber por qué habían despedido a nuestro personal de reparaciones!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC28.rude:5
msgid "Why don't you do something about it?"
msgstr "¿Por qué no haces algo al respecto?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC28.rude:6
msgid "It broke, didn't it?"
msgstr "Se estropeó, ¿verdad?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC28.rude:6
msgid ""
"Yes, and in a big way!  And now there's no one who remembers how to fix it.  How they expect us to work so understaffed is beyond me!  They just care about their profits."
msgstr ""
"¡Sí, y a lo grande! Y ahora no queda nadie que recuerde cómo arreglarlo. ¡No entiendo cómo esperan que trabajemos con tan poca gente! Solo les importan sus beneficios."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC28.rude:7
msgid ""
"They fired Hjarrand Fixer just because they thought the refiner would never break!"
msgstr ""
"¡Despidieron a Hjarrand el Reparador solo porque creían que la refinería nunca se estropearía!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC28.rude:8
msgid ""
"I can't.  I'm on strike!  The UGTM won't let me work until my brothers-in-arms are unoppressed!"
msgstr ""
"No puedo. ¡Estoy en huelga! ¡El GUMT no me dejará trabajar hasta que mis compañeros de armas dejen de estar oprimidos!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC28.rude:8
msgid "Why don't you do something?"
msgstr "¿Por qué no haces algo?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC280.rude:1
msgid ""
"I think reopening the Mountain Pass would be great for business!  I plan to go look for it as soon as I have enough money for supplies."
msgstr ""
"¡Creo que reabrir el Paso de Montaña sería estupendo para el negocio! Pienso ir a buscarlo en cuanto tenga dinero suficiente para provisiones."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC280.rude:3
msgid ""
"I think we could be as powerful as Thjorgard.  Kira the Cold is a great start, too!  She's smart enough, and strong enough, and she has the support of the people."
msgstr ""
"Creo que podríamos ser tan poderosos como Thjorgard. ¡Y Kira la Fría es un gran comienzo! Es lo bastante lista, lo bastante fuerte y cuenta con el apoyo del pueblo."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC281.rude:10
msgid "You will be sorry about that, for certain!"
msgstr "¡Os arrepentiréis de eso, sin duda!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC281.rude:2
msgid "Sounds good.  You're hired!"
msgstr "Nos parece bien. ¡Estás contratado!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC281.rude:2
msgid "You shall not regret it."
msgstr "No os arrepentiréis."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC281.rude:3
msgid ""
"I am an Illuminate.  For the price of 1000 gold per month and 20% of all gold we find, I will travel with you, identify anything, and add 10% to your experience."
msgstr ""
"Soy un Iluminado. Por 1000 de oro al mes y el 20% de todo el oro que encontremos, viajaré con vosotros, lo identificaré todo y sumaré un 10% a vuestra experiencia."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC281.rude:3
msgid "So you're for hire.  What do you do?"
msgstr "Así que te ofreces para contratar. ¿Qué sabes hacer?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC281.rude:4
msgid ""
"I do not share my knowledge for free.  If you wish, for a fee, I shall travel with you and share my knowledge."
msgstr ""
"No comparto mi saber gratis. Si queréis, a cambio de una tarifa, viajaré con vosotros y compartiré mi saber."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC281.rude:5
msgid "Perhaps you could bless us with some knowledge?"
msgstr "¿Quizá podrías bendecirnos con algo de saber?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC281.rude:5
msgid "That will cost you, my friend."
msgstr "Eso os costará, amigo mío."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC281.rude:6
msgid ""
"News is a relative term, friends.  What I would consider interesting news, you would no doubt consider it a trifle boring."
msgstr ""
"Las noticias son algo relativo, amigos. Lo que yo consideraría noticias interesantes, a vosotros sin duda os parecería algo aburrido."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC281.rude:7 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC287.rude:7
msgid "Perhaps some other time."
msgstr "Quizá en otro momento."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC281.rude:7
msgid "We don't really need an illuminate right now."
msgstr "Ahora mismo no nos hace falta un iluminado."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC281.rude:8
msgid "I am worth every penny you would spend on me."
msgstr "Valgo cada moneda que gastéis en mí."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC282.rude:1
msgid ""
"It is not too far from the Monastery. Be careful. May the Gods smile upon you as you go."
msgstr ""
"No está muy lejos del Monasterio. Tened cuidado. Que los dioses os sonrían en vuestro camino."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC282.rude:1
msgid "Where is this place?"
msgstr "¿Dónde está ese lugar?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC282.rude:11
msgid "Good luck out there, brothers.  Farewell."
msgstr "Buena suerte ahí fuera, hermanos. Adiós."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC282.rude:13
msgid "What family do I have to ruin?"
msgstr "¿Qué familia tengo que arruinar?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC282.rude:13
msgid ""
"You will know when the time has come. Perhaps you should consult with the clerks in the Town Halls of Chedian.  They may know of a troubled family.  Have strength candidates, you will need it."
msgstr ""
"Lo sabréis cuando llegue el momento. Quizá deberíais consultar a los escribientes de los Ayuntamientos de Chedian. Puede que sepan de alguna familia en apuros. Sed fuertes, candidatos; lo vais a necesitar."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC282.rude:15
msgid ""
"Do not be drawn to the easy path.  For true enlightenment comes through trials.  Face the trials with courage, honor, and nobility, and you shall come out rewarded."
msgstr ""
"No os dejéis atraer por el camino fácil. Pues la verdadera iluminación llega a través de las pruebas. Afrontad las pruebas con valor, honor y nobleza, y saldréis recompensados."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC282.rude:16
msgid "How are we going to do that?"
msgstr "¿Y cómo vamos a hacerlo?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC282.rude:16
msgid ""
"Take this letter.  It is all we have to go on right now.  We found it on the body of a dying raider.  He claimed to only be the messenger.  When we asked him where he was going, he only laughed.  We can only assume he was headed to Thjorgard."
msgstr ""
"Tomad esta carta. Es todo lo que tenemos por ahora. La encontramos en el cuerpo de un saqueador moribundo. Afirmó ser solo el mensajero. Cuando le preguntamos adónde iba, se limitó a reír. Solo podemos suponer que se dirigía a Thjorgard."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC282.rude:17
msgid ""
"A Crusader who wishes to go through the Three Crusades is on the path of the true Holy Warrior. All three tasks must be completed and then you must return here to receive the blessings of the Gods. Would you like to hear the first task?"
msgstr ""
"Un Cruzado que desee superar las Tres Cruzadas sigue el camino del verdadero Guerrero Santo. Debéis completar las tres tareas y luego volver aquí para recibir la bendición de los dioses. ¿Queréis oír la primera tarea?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC282.rude:17
msgid "Tell us of the Three Crusades."
msgstr "Habladnos de las Tres Cruzadas."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC282.rude:18
msgid "No. There are no Crusaders in our group"
msgstr "No. No hay Cruzados en nuestro grupo."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC282.rude:18
msgid ""
"Well, if you ever need to hear of them, I will be here to help you. Go with the gods."
msgstr ""
"Bien, si alguna vez necesitáis oír hablar de ellas, aquí estaré para ayudaros. Id con los dioses."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC282.rude:19
msgid "We have completed our Crusades."
msgstr "Hemos completado nuestras Cruzadas."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC282.rude:19
msgid ""
"You wear the experience on your faces like badges of honor.  I can tell already you will do the order proud.  It gives me great pleasure to promote you to Paladins!"
msgstr ""
"Lleváis la experiencia en el rostro como insignias de honor. Ya veo que honraréis a la orden. ¡Es un gran placer para mí ascenderos a Paladines!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC282.rude:2
msgid ""
"For those Crusaders who would wish to become Paladins, they must face the trials of the Three Crusades."
msgstr ""
"Los Cruzados que deseen convertirse en Paladines deben afrontar las pruebas de las Tres Cruzadas."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC282.rude:2
msgid "Yes. Please tell us what you have for us."
msgstr "Sí. Decidnos, por favor, qué tenéis para nosotros."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC282.rude:20
msgid ""
"The Gauntlet of Fire is an ancient place. Built before the great cataclysm to test the heart of the candidates for the rank of Paladin. We have other methods for that now.  The Gauntlet of Fire has been lost to time."
msgstr ""
"El Guantelete de Fuego es un lugar antiguo. Se construyó antes del gran cataclismo para poner a prueba el corazón de los candidatos al rango de Paladín. Ahora tenemos otros métodos para eso. El Guantelete de Fuego se ha perdido en el tiempo."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC282.rude:20
msgid "What do you know about  the Gauntlet of Fire?"
msgstr "¿Qué sabéis del Guantelete de Fuego?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC282.rude:21
msgid "No need to apologize."
msgstr "No hace falta que os disculpéis."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC282.rude:21
msgid "No thank you sir, sorry to have bothered you."
msgstr "No, gracias, señor. Perdonad la molestia."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC282.rude:22
msgid "Farewell.  May the gods smile upon you."
msgstr "Adiós. Que los dioses os sonrían."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC282.rude:3
msgid ""
"The first task is to save the life of a man. At this time, we have heard of a possible attempt to assassinate the Jarl of Thjorgard. He is a very important man, if he dies all hopes of a united Chedian die with him. You must save his life."
msgstr ""
"La primera tarea es salvar la vida de un hombre. En este momento nos han llegado noticias de un posible intento de asesinar al Jarl de Thjorgard. Es un hombre muy importante; si muere, toda esperanza de una Chedian unida morirá con él. Debéis salvarle la vida."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC282.rude:4
msgid "Alright, what are the other crusades?"
msgstr "Muy bien, ¿cuáles son las otras cruzadas?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC282.rude:4
msgid ""
"The other crusades are that you must damn a family, and then you must save them."
msgstr ""
"Las otras cruzadas consisten en que debéis condenar a una familia y luego salvarla."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC282.rude:5
msgid ""
"The life of a Paladin is made of very difficult decisions. You must prove that you have the power to do the right thing, even when it's not the best thing to do."
msgstr ""
"La vida de un Paladín está hecha de decisiones muy difíciles. Debéis demostrar que tenéis el poder de hacer lo correcto, incluso cuando no es lo más conveniente."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC282.rude:5
msgid "What? That's terrible!"
msgstr "¿Qué? ¡Eso es terrible!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC282.rude:6
msgid "Do you have any interesting tasks for a party of adventurers?"
msgstr "¿Tenéis alguna tarea interesante para un grupo de aventureros?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC282.rude:6
msgid ""
"Well, I have many tasks for any among you who are Crusaders. Are there any among your party?"
msgstr ""
"Bueno, tengo muchas tareas para quienes de vosotros sean Cruzados. ¿Hay alguno en vuestro grupo?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC282.rude:7
msgid ""
"A crusader who wishes to go through the three crusades is on the path of the true Holy Warrior. All three tasks must be completed and then you must return here to receive the blessings of the Gods. Would you like to hear the first task?"
msgstr ""
"Un Cruzado que desee superar las Tres Cruzadas sigue el camino del verdadero Guerrero Santo. Debéis completar las tres tareas y luego volver aquí para recibir la bendición de los dioses. ¿Queréis oír la primera tarea?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC282.rude:7
msgid "What other methods?"
msgstr "¿Qué otros métodos?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC282.rude:9
msgid ""
"I hear the abbot of the monastery is looking for someone to do a task for him."
msgstr ""
"He oído que el abad del monasterio busca a alguien que le haga un encargo."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC283.rude:1
msgid ""
"You are most welcome, my children.  Was there anything else you needed?"
msgstr "No hay de qué, hijos míos. ¿Necesitabais algo más?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC283.rude:12
msgid ""
"Well, a long time ago our Saint's relic went missing.  It was a very distressing time for us, but we were able to fool the pilgrim's by replacing it with a sheep's ankle bone.  No one gets close enough to be able to tell the difference anyway."
msgstr ""
"Veréis, hace mucho tiempo desapareció la reliquia de nuestro Santo. Fue una época muy angustiosa para nosotros, pero conseguimos engañar a los peregrinos sustituyéndola por un hueso del tobillo de una oveja. De todos modos, nadie se acerca lo suficiente para notar la diferencia."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC283.rude:13
msgid "No, thank you!  Was there anything else you needed?"
msgstr "¡No, gracias! ¿Necesitabais algo más?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC283.rude:14
msgid ""
"I see.  Gray Slemnir is finally going to retire, is he?  Well you may be in luck.  As I understand it, Robert Aefgil, though a pious soul, is not taking well to monastic life.  I will speak to him.  I believe he'll be returning from his penance tonight."
msgstr ""
"Ya veo. Así que Slemnir el Gris por fin va a retirarse, ¿eh? Pues puede que estéis de suerte. Por lo que sé, Robert Aefgil, aunque es un alma piadosa, no se está adaptando bien a la vida monástica. Hablaré con él. Creo que vuelve de su penitencia esta noche."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC283.rude:14
msgid "We need to take a priest to Guberland."
msgstr "Necesitamos llevar a un sacerdote a Guberland."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC283.rude:16
msgid "No I don't think so.  Good luck!"
msgstr "No, creo que no. ¡Buena suerte!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC283.rude:17
msgid "No, we don't want to get involved in this crazy mix-up."
msgstr "No, no queremos meternos en este lío de locos."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC283.rude:17
msgid "Oh what shall I do?!"
msgstr "¡Oh! ¿¡Qué voy a hacer!?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC283.rude:18
msgid ""
"He was one crazy old wizard!  He came down to study a few of the artifacts and relics we have in our possession here at the monastery.  It seems that he made off with one of our more important ones."
msgstr ""
"¡Era un viejo mago chiflado! Vino a estudiar algunos de los artefactos y reliquias que guardamos aquí, en el monasterio. Parece que se largó con una de las más importantes."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC283.rude:18 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC284.rude:6 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC298.rude:3
msgid "What do you know about Ramnivar?"
msgstr "¿Qué sabéis de Ramnivar?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC283.rude:2
msgid "We're here to summon the dragon."
msgstr "Venimos a invocar al dragón."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC283.rude:2
msgid ""
"Well, we seem to be having a problem, one that requires the utmost delicacy.  Could you handle that?"
msgstr ""
"Bueno, parece que tenemos un problema, uno que requiere la máxima delicadeza. ¿Podríais encargaros?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC283.rude:20
msgid ""
"Besides summoning the dragon?  All the great monasteries have a saint's relic.  That is how we attract pilgrims.  Donations from the pilgrims is how we make a living!  Otherwise we are destitute!  Will you help?"
msgstr ""
"¿Aparte de para invocar al dragón? Todos los grandes monasterios tienen la reliquia de un santo. Así es como atraemos a los peregrinos. ¡Vivimos de los donativos de los peregrinos! ¡Sin ellos estaríamos en la miseria! ¿Nos ayudaréis?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC283.rude:20
msgid "What do you need a relic for anyway?"
msgstr "¿Y para qué necesitáis una reliquia?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC283.rude:21
msgid "Actually we're looking for a priest."
msgstr "En realidad buscamos a un sacerdote."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC283.rude:21
msgid ""
"Are you?  I'd say you found one.  Or are you looking for someone in particular?"
msgstr ""
"¿Ah, sí? Yo diría que ya habéis encontrado uno. ¿O buscáis a alguien en concreto?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC283.rude:22
msgid "We've returned for the priest."
msgstr "Hemos vuelto a por el sacerdote."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC283.rude:22
msgid "Yes of course.  He is waiting in the yard."
msgstr "Sí, claro. Os espera en el patio."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC283.rude:23
msgid ""
"That's it!  How did you know we were looking for it?  Oh, thank you!  Here, I prepared a reward for whoever returned it!  Was there anything else you needed?"
msgstr ""
"¡Es esto! ¿Cómo sabíais que la buscábamos? ¡Oh, gracias! ¡Tomad, preparé una recompensa para quien la devolviera! ¿Necesitabais algo más?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC283.rude:23
msgid "We found a bone fragment in the Wizard's Lab."
msgstr "Hemos encontrado un fragmento de hueso en el Laboratorio del Mago."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC283.rude:24
msgid "We've found your relic."
msgstr "Hemos encontrado vuestra reliquia."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC283.rude:24
msgid ""
"You have!  Oh, well done!  We here at the monastery thank you!  Here.  I've prepared a reward for whoever returned it to us."
msgstr ""
"¿De verdad? ¡Oh, buen trabajo! ¡Todos aquí en el monasterio os lo agradecemos! Tomad. He preparado una recompensa para quien nos la devolviera."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC283.rude:25
msgid "Maybe you can help us?"
msgstr "¿Quizá podáis ayudarnos?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC283.rude:26
msgid "Not right now."
msgstr "Ahora no."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC283.rude:26
msgid "Oh dear. Well, if you change your mind we could really use your help!"
msgstr ""
"Vaya por Dios. Bueno, si cambiáis de opinión, ¡nos vendría muy bien vuestra ayuda!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC283.rude:3
msgid ""
"He's a nutter that's what he is!  His name is Ramnivar and he was determined to prove that the relic was a phony!  And currently it IS a phony!  Will you help us?"
msgstr ""
"¡Un chalado, eso es lo que es! Se llama Ramnivar y estaba empeñado en demostrar que la reliquia era falsa. ¡Y ahora mismo SÍ es falsa! ¿Nos ayudaréis?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC283.rude:3
msgid "Who is he?"
msgstr "¿Quién es?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC283.rude:4
msgid ""
"The dragon?  He hasn't been around since....  Well you see, there's the problem.  You need the Saint's Relic to summon the dragon."
msgstr ""
"¿El dragón? No ha vuelto desde... Bueno, veréis, ese es el problema. Hace falta la Reliquia del Santo para invocar al dragón."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC283.rude:4
msgid "Whatever it takes to summon the dragon."
msgstr "Lo que haga falta para invocar al dragón."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC283.rude:15 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC283.rude:5
msgid ""
"We think that a scholar stole it from us and took it back to his laboratory in Yorwick."
msgstr ""
"Creemos que un erudito nos la robó y se la llevó a su laboratorio en Yorwick."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC283.rude:15 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC283.rude:5
msgid "Where do you think the relic is?"
msgstr "¿Dónde creéis que está la reliquia?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC283.rude:6
msgid "Oh thank you!  His laboratory is somewhere in Yorwick.  Please hurry!"
msgstr ""
"¡Oh, gracias! Su laboratorio está en algún lugar de Yorwick. ¡Daos prisa, por favor!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC283.rude:6
msgid "We will retrieve the real relic for you.  Where is this lab?"
msgstr "Os traeremos la verdadera reliquia. ¿Dónde está ese laboratorio?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC283.rude:7
msgid "Come back tomorrow morning.  I will see to it that he is ready to go."
msgstr ""
"Volved mañana por la mañana. Me encargaré de que esté listo para partir."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC283.rude:7
msgid "Sounds great!"
msgstr "¡Perfecto!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC283.rude:8
msgid ""
"Do I?  We've lost our relic!  But keep it quiet.  We've replaced it with a sheep's ankle bone."
msgstr ""
"¿Ah, sí? ¡Hemos perdido nuestra reliquia! Pero no lo digáis a nadie. La hemos sustituido por un hueso del tobillo de una oveja."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC283.rude:9
msgid "How long do you think you can fool these poor pilgrims!"
msgstr "¿Cuánto tiempo creéis que podréis engañar a esos pobres peregrinos?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC283.rude:9
msgid ""
"I don't think we can fool them much longer at all!  That's why we need your help!"
msgstr ""
"¡No creo que podamos engañarlos mucho más! ¡Por eso necesitamos vuestra ayuda!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC284.rude:2
msgid "Alright.  Perhaps we'll see you there.  Farewell."
msgstr "Muy bien. Quizá nos veamos allí. Adiós."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC284.rude:3
msgid ""
"I see.  I know the way.  Please continue with your important work.  I will gather the things I will need and travel there on my own."
msgstr ""
"Ya veo. Conozco el camino. Por favor, seguid con vuestra importante labor. Reuniré lo que necesite y viajaré allí por mi cuenta."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC284.rude:3
msgid "To a new temple we're helping to build in Guberland."
msgstr "A un nuevo templo que estamos ayudando a construir en Guberland."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC284.rude:4
msgid ""
"I just reached the rank of Priest.  Abbot Leffery himself conducted the ceremony!"
msgstr ""
"¡Acabo de alcanzar el rango de Sacerdote! ¡El mismísimo abad Leffery ofició la ceremonia!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC284.rude:5
msgid "Where exactly is it that I am to be going?"
msgstr "¿Adónde exactamente debo ir?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC284.rude:5
msgid "Yes, we are ready to take you if you are ready to leave."
msgstr "Sí, estamos listos para llevarte si tú estás listo para partir."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC284.rude:6
msgid "That dirty rat stole our relic!"
msgstr "¡Esa sucia rata robó nuestra reliquia!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC284.rude:8
msgid "Alright.  I will be here when you are ready to go."
msgstr "Muy bien. Estaré aquí cuando estéis listos para partir."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC284.rude:8
msgid "Not quite yet."
msgstr "Todavía no."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC285.rude:2
msgid ""
"I've heard those soldiers in the Ta'Sar Academy have some really good stuff.  Boy what I wouldn't give to lift a few pieces from their collection!"
msgstr ""
"He oído que los soldados de la Academia Ta'Sar tienen cosas realmente buenas. ¡Lo que daría yo por birlar unas cuantas piezas de su colección!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC285.rude:3
msgid "Sure! Let me know if you have any questions."
msgstr "¡Claro! Avisadme si tenéis alguna pregunta."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC285.rude:3 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC285.rude:4
msgid "We'd like to see what you have for sale."
msgstr "Queremos ver lo que tienes a la venta."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC285.rude:5
msgid ""
"There's really not much here.  Most of the shops that have sprung up here are in support of the monastery or the pilgrims."
msgstr ""
"La verdad es que aquí no hay gran cosa. Casi todas las tiendas que han surgido aquí viven del monasterio o de los peregrinos."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC285.rude:5 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC287.rude:5 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC292.rude:3
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC296.rude:3 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC299.rude:3 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC300.rude:3
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC301.rude:3 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC305.rude:3 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC306.rude:3
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC307.rude:3 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC32.rude:20 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC379.rude:3
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC380.rude:3 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC381.rude:3 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC382.rude:6
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC383.rude:3 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC42.rude:13 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC420.rude:6
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC422.rude:5 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC43.rude:17 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC92.rude:6
msgid "What do you know about Lindisfarne?"
msgstr "¿Qué sabes de Lindisfarne?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC285.rude:6
msgid "Let me know when you are ready. Go with the Gods."
msgstr "Avisadme cuando estéis listos. Id con los dioses."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC285.rude:6
msgid "No. We are not ready to embark upon this journey."
msgstr "No. No estamos listos para emprender este viaje."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC285.rude:8
msgid "Anytime."
msgstr "Cuando queráis."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC285.rude:8 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC76.rude:8
msgid "Nothing, thanks."
msgstr "Nada, gracias."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC286.rude:2
msgid ""
"I'm thinking of selling my store and moving to someplace a little quieter."
msgstr ""
"Estoy pensando en vender mi tienda y mudarme a algún sitio un poco más tranquilo."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC286.rude:3
msgid "Ah yes, I have many good things to sell!"
msgstr "¡Ah, sí, tengo muchas cosas buenas a la venta!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC286.rude:3 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC286.rude:4
msgid "We'd like to see your items for sale"
msgstr "Queremos ver los objetos que tienes a la venta."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC286.rude:5
msgid ""
"It is a great place to study and worship.  It's getting a little to busy for me, personally.  I wish all the pilgrims would stop coming here."
msgstr ""
"Es un gran lugar para estudiar y rezar. Aunque, para mi gusto, se está llenando demasiado. Ojalá los peregrinos dejaran de venir."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC286.rude:5
msgid "What do you know about Lindisfarne"
msgstr "¿Qué sabes de Lindisfarne?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC286.rude:7
msgid "Let me know if I can help."
msgstr "Avisadme si puedo ayudaros."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC286.rude:7
msgid "Nothing thank you."
msgstr "Nada, gracias."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC287.rude:2
msgid ""
"I really don't know why the Ta'Sar Academy doesn't send soldiers to guard the monastery.  It is a war college, after all!"
msgstr ""
"La verdad es que no entiendo por qué la Academia Ta'Sar no envía soldados a proteger el monasterio. ¡Al fin y al cabo, es un colegio de guerra!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC287.rude:3
msgid "Many things, take a look!"
msgstr "¡Muchas cosas, echad un vistazo!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC287.rude:3 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC287.rude:4
msgid "What do you have for sale?"
msgstr "¿Qué tienes a la venta?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC287.rude:5
msgid ""
"Well there's pretty much two things besides this village.  There's the monastery, a popular tourist spot for raiders and pilgrims alike, and there's the Ta'Sar Academy.  That's not so popular."
msgstr ""
"Bueno, aparte de este pueblo, hay básicamente dos cosas. Está el monasterio, un lugar turístico muy popular tanto para saqueadores como para peregrinos, y está la Academia Ta'Sar. Esa no es tan popular."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC287.rude:7
msgid "No, not today."
msgstr "No, hoy no."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC287.rude:8
msgid "Would you like to see my wares?"
msgstr "¿Queréis ver mis mercancías?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC288.rude:1
msgid ""
"Not especially.  I haven't spent enough time in port to pick up on the latest gossip."
msgstr ""
"No especialmente. No he pasado bastante tiempo en puerto para enterarme de los últimos chismes."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC288.rude:2
msgid "Come aboard then! We'll be on our way."
msgstr "¡Subid a bordo, pues! Nos pondremos en marcha."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC288.rude:2
msgid "Yes, we will."
msgstr "Sí, eso haremos."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC288.rude:4
msgid ""
"Ah, there be no information in this here noggin about that then. Wish I could help you."
msgstr "Ah, en esta mollera no hay nada sobre eso. Ojalá pudiera ayudaros."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC288.rude:4
msgid "What do you know about Lindisfarne Monastery?"
msgstr "¿Qué sabes del Monasterio de Lindisfarne?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC288.rude:5
msgid "The next ship will be here soon."
msgstr "El próximo barco llegará pronto."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC288.rude:6
msgid "And what would that be about then?"
msgstr "¿Y de qué se trataría, entonces?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC288.rude:7
msgid "Certainly.  Were you looking to travel today?"
msgstr "Por supuesto. ¿Queríais viajar hoy?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC288.rude:8
msgid "Perhaps another day."
msgstr "Quizá otro día."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC289.rude:1
msgid ""
"I'm just worried about when the next raid is going to come.  They happen so often.  Perhaps this time it will be me that is killed.  I wish they would stop."
msgstr ""
"Solo me preocupa cuándo llegará la próxima incursión. Son tan frecuentes... Quizá esta vez sea yo al que maten. Ojalá dejaran de venir."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC289.rude:3
msgid ""
"Those awful people!  They come here, kill people, and try to steal our valuable artifacts!"
msgstr ""
"¡Qué gente tan horrible! ¡Vienen aquí, matan a la gente e intentan robar nuestros valiosos artefactos!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC289.rude:3
msgid "What do you know about raiders?"
msgstr "¿Qué sabes de los saqueadores?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC29.rude:1
msgid "Good luck"
msgstr "Buena suerte."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC29.rude:2
msgid ""
"I'm a member of the United Group of Thjoradric Miners!  I refuse to work until the conditions in the mines improve!"
msgstr ""
"¡Soy miembro del Grupo Unido de Mineros de Thjoradric! ¡Me niego a trabajar hasta que mejoren las condiciones en las minas!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC29.rude:2
msgid "Why aren't you working?"
msgstr "¿Por qué no estás trabajando?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC29.rude:3
msgid "Go away!"
msgstr "¡Largo!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC29.rude:3 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC32.rude:24
msgid "Sorry.  Goodbye"
msgstr "Lo siento. Adiós."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC290.rude:1
msgid ""
"The last raid killed my brother Wulfgan.  When is the next going to come?  Who will be killed this time?"
msgstr ""
"La última incursión mató a mi hermano Wulfgan. ¿Cuándo llegará la próxima? ¿A quién matarán esta vez?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC290.rude:2
msgid "Oh, very well!  Ask your questions."
msgstr "¡Oh, está bien! Haced vuestras preguntas."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC290.rude:3
msgid ""
"They killed my brother.  I will not ever forgive them for that.  Ever."
msgstr "Mataron a mi hermano. Jamás se lo perdonaré. Jamás."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC290.rude:3
msgid "What do you know about the Chedian?"
msgstr "¿Qué sabes de Chedian?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC290.rude:4
msgid "If you want to help, pick up a rake!  Otherwise, leave me alone!"
msgstr "Si queréis ayudar, ¡coged un rastrillo! Si no, ¡dejadme en paz!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC290.rude:5
msgid "If you want to help, pick up a rake!"
msgstr "Si queréis ayudar, ¡coged un rastrillo!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC291.rude:1
msgid ""
"I'm starting to worry about the relic.  I know Master Leffery told us not to speak about it, but I can't help worrying.  What if we never see it again?"
msgstr ""
"Empiezo a preocuparme por la reliquia. Sé que el maestro Leffery nos dijo que no habláramos de ello, pero no puedo evitar preocuparme. ¿Y si no volvemos a verla nunca?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC291.rude:2
msgid "Sorry.  Can we ask you some questions?"
msgstr "Perdona. ¿Podemos hacerte unas preguntas?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC291.rude:3
msgid ""
"It's missing.  I don't know where it's gone to, but we can't fool these pilgrims like this.  It's absolutely shameful."
msgstr ""
"Ha desaparecido. No sé adónde ha ido a parar, pero no podemos engañar así a los peregrinos. Es absolutamente vergonzoso."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC291.rude:3 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC302.rude:3 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC303.rude:3
msgid "What do you know about the relic?"
msgstr "¿Qué sabes de la reliquia?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC291.rude:4 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC44.rude:13
msgid "No, sorry."
msgstr "No, lo siento."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC292.rude:1
msgid ""
"How long will we let the pilgrims think we still have the relic?  It's a travesty!  I think Master Leffery should just be honest with them!"
msgstr ""
"¿Hasta cuándo vamos a dejar que los peregrinos crean que aún tenemos la reliquia? ¡Es una farsa! ¡Creo que el maestro Leffery debería ser sincero con ellos!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC292.rude:3
msgid ""
"Lindisfarne has been a pillar of honesty and righteousness for years.  People look to us for their example.  We must remember that, and set the best example we can."
msgstr ""
"Lindisfarne ha sido un pilar de honradez y rectitud durante años. La gente nos toma como ejemplo. Debemos recordarlo y dar el mejor ejemplo que podamos."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC293.rude:1
msgid ""
"I've heard rumors that the king of Mendossus to the south has been having troubles keeping himself on the throne."
msgstr ""
"He oído rumores de que el rey de Mendossus, al sur, tiene problemas para mantenerse en el trono."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC293.rude:2 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC38.rude:6 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC39.rude:4
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC39.rude:9 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC410.rude:4 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC99.rude:7
msgid "Go ahead."
msgstr "Adelante."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC293.rude:3
msgid ""
"That's the nation to the south.  I hear there has been some sort of trouble brewing down there."
msgstr ""
"Es la nación que está al sur. He oído que allí abajo se está cociendo algún tipo de problema."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC293.rude:4
msgid "No bother at all."
msgstr "No es ninguna molestia."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC294.rude:1
msgid ""
"The Mendossians have always had a strong government.  There is no way that the king could ever be dethroned.  Why, the Ichvan dynasty has lasted since the Great Cataclysm!"
msgstr ""
"Los mendossianos siempre han tenido un gobierno fuerte. Es imposible que destronen al rey. ¡Vaya, si la dinastía Ichvan dura desde el Gran Cataclismo!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC294.rude:3
msgid ""
"My family was living there when I was born.  They were originally from Framon, but were on a pilgrimage to the University.  We spent ten years there."
msgstr ""
"Mi familia vivía allí cuando nací. Eran de Framon, pero estaban de peregrinaje a la Universidad. Pasamos allí diez años."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC295.rude:1
msgid ""
"I've heard the ships have been getting attacked if they sail too far away from Chedian."
msgstr "He oído que atacan a los barcos si se alejan demasiado de Chedian."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC295.rude:5
msgid ""
"Chances are, you will find a lot of stuff in your adventures.  Do yourself a favor and get your merchant skill as high as you can.  You'll get the best prices for your stuff that way."
msgstr ""
"Lo más probable es que encontréis muchas cosas en vuestras aventuras. Haceos un favor y subid vuestra habilidad de Mercader todo lo que podáis. Así conseguiréis los mejores precios por vuestras cosas."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC295.rude:8 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC310.rude:7 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC336.rude:11
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC382.rude:8 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC382.rude:9 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC393.rude:8
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC395.rude:8 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC404.rude:6 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC407.rude:6
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC410.rude:5 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC412.rude:5 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC52.rude:11
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC73.rude:6
msgctxt "said by the party"
msgid "Farewell."
msgstr "Adiós."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC296.rude:1
msgid "I'm afraid not."
msgstr "Me temo que no."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC296.rude:3
msgid ""
"Are you a pilgrim?  If you are looking for the relic, it's near the altar."
msgstr "¿Sois peregrinos? Si buscáis la reliquia, está junto al altar."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC297.rude:1
msgid "I've heard that we and Thjorgard were once on better terms."
msgstr "He oído que antes nos llevábamos mejor con Thjorgard."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC297.rude:3
msgid "We are a monastery devoted to worshipping Igdra."
msgstr "Somos un monasterio consagrado al culto de Igdra."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC297.rude:3
msgid "What do you know about Linidsfarne?"
msgstr "¿Qué sabes de Lindisfarne?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC298.rude:1
msgid ""
"You're not a pilgrim are you?  Of course not.  Our relic has gone missing.  Abbot Leffery is worrying himself sick over it."
msgstr ""
"No sois peregrinos, ¿verdad? Claro que no. Nuestra reliquia ha desaparecido. El abad Leffery está enfermo de preocupación."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC298.rude:3
msgid ""
"He has come here from time to time to study some of our artifacts.  I think he has a keep in Yorwick."
msgstr ""
"Viene de vez en cuando a estudiar algunos de nuestros artefactos. Creo que tiene un torreón en Yorwick."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC299.rude:1
msgid ""
"I've just come here from Freetown.  Soon I will be taking my vows.  I'm so excited!"
msgstr "Acabo de llegar de Freetown. Pronto haré mis votos. ¡Qué emoción!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC299.rude:3
msgid "Not very much.  I just got here."
msgstr "No mucho. Acabo de llegar."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC3.rude:1
msgid "Gather the army.  We shall make for Frosgard immediately!"
msgstr "Reunid al ejército. ¡Partiremos hacia Frosgard de inmediato!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC3.rude:1
msgid "I will see to it personally!  See you there!"
msgstr "¡Me encargaré personalmente! ¡Nos vemos allí!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC3.rude:10
msgid ""
"There is an artifact that has been in the hands of the Lindisfarne Monastery that belongs to us.  I want you to return it."
msgstr ""
"Hay un artefacto en manos del Monasterio de Lindisfarne que nos pertenece. Quiero que lo recuperéis."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC3.rude:13
msgid "Thank you.  Farewell."
msgstr "Gracias. Adiós."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC3.rude:14
msgid "He is a Beldonian Warlord on his way to conquer the Chedian."
msgstr ""
"Es un Señor de la Guerra beldoniano que está en camino para conquistar Chedian."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC3.rude:14
msgid "What do you want me to do about it?"
msgstr "¿Y qué queréis que haga yo al respecto?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC3.rude:15
msgid "We will retrieve it."
msgstr "Lo recuperaremos."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC3.rude:16
msgid ""
"Against the hordes?  What a noble idea.  And of course you want the Thjorgard Clan to join you."
msgstr ""
"¿Contra las hordas? Qué idea tan noble. Y, por supuesto, queréis que el Clan de Thjorgard se una a vosotros."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC3.rude:16
msgid "We are trying to unite the six Clans of the Chedian."
msgstr "Intentamos unir los seis Clanes de Chedian."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC3.rude:17
msgid "How so?"
msgstr "¿Cómo?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC3.rude:17
msgid ""
"I will send my stand-in to the arena in my place.  I will arrange to have you as the competitors.  During your bout, keep an eye out for someone with a bow.  Do what you can to stop them, but do not kill them.  We need to find out who's behind this."
msgstr ""
"Enviaré a un doble a la arena en mi lugar. Me encargaré de que vosotros seáis los contendientes. Durante el combate, estad atentos a alguien con un arco. Haced lo que podáis para detenerlo, pero no lo matéis. Tenemos que averiguar quién está detrás de esto."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC3.rude:18
msgid ""
"Very well.  I will do this for you.  But only after you do two things for me."
msgstr ""
"Muy bien. Lo haré por vosotros. Pero solo después de que hagáis dos cosas por mí."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC3.rude:18
msgid "Yes.  We need to unite ALL the Clans."
msgstr "Sí. Tenemos que unir a TODOS los Clanes."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC3.rude:19
msgid "Be careful, and good luck."
msgstr "Tened cuidado, y buena suerte."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC3.rude:19
msgid "Sounds like a plan."
msgstr "Buen plan."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC3.rude:2
msgid "Here you are."
msgstr "Aquí tienes."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC3.rude:2
msgid ""
"What a wonderful item this is!  Here is a small token of my appreciation!"
msgstr ""
"¡Qué objeto tan maravilloso! ¡Aquí tenéis una pequeña muestra de mi gratitud!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC3.rude:21
msgid ""
"I have been having trouble with the Thjorad production lately.   I would like for you to go to the Thjorad Mine find out why they have stopped working."
msgstr ""
"Últimamente tengo problemas con la producción de thjorad. Me gustaría que fuerais a la Mina de Thjorad y averiguarais por qué han dejado de trabajar."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC3.rude:22
msgid "We've retrieved it already!"
msgstr "¡Ya lo hemos recuperado!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC3.rude:22
msgid "You have?  Let me see!"
msgstr "¿De verdad? ¡Dejadme verlo!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC3.rude:23 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC3.rude:37
msgid ""
"Ah yes, so you have.  You've proved yourselves both noble and worthy.  I shall be glad to join your coalition of clans."
msgstr ""
"Ah, sí, así es. Habéis demostrado ser nobles y dignos. Será un placer unirme a vuestra coalición de clanes."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC3.rude:23 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC3.rude:37
msgid "We've completed both your quests.  Will you join us now?"
msgstr "Hemos completado tus dos misiones. ¿Te unirás ahora a nosotros?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC3.rude:24 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC3.rude:38
msgid ""
"That is fantastic news!  I shall send word to all the Jarls immediately."
msgstr "¡Es una noticia fantástica! Avisaré a todos los jarls de inmediato."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC3.rude:24
msgid "The clans are united.  It is time for the war council."
msgstr "Los clanes están unidos. Es hora del consejo de guerra."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC3.rude:25
msgid "Certainly, friends."
msgstr "Por supuesto, amigos."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC3.rude:26
msgid ""
"The wind in his lungs bore too much hot air about himself.  It is good that he is dead."
msgstr ""
"El viento de sus pulmones soplaba demasiadas fanfarronadas sobre sí mismo. Mejor que esté muerto."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC3.rude:27
msgid "Perhaps Later."
msgstr "Quizá más tarde."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC3.rude:27
msgid "The offer will remain open until you return.  Farewell."
msgstr "La oferta seguirá en pie hasta que volváis. Adiós."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC3.rude:28
msgid "The offer will remain open until you return."
msgstr "La oferta seguirá en pie hasta que volváis."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC3.rude:29
msgid "That is great news!  Here is a small token of my appreciation!"
msgstr ""
"¡Es una gran noticia! ¡Aquí tenéis una pequeña muestra de mi gratitud!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC3.rude:29
msgid "That is working also."
msgstr "Eso también funciona ya."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC3.rude:3
msgid "Was there something else you needed?"
msgstr "¿Necesitabais algo más?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC3.rude:30
msgid ""
"Fix my mines and get Thjorad back from the monastery!  Now don't dally.  Get moving!"
msgstr ""
"¡Arreglad mis minas y recuperad el Thjorad del monasterio! Y no os entretengáis. ¡En marcha!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC3.rude:30
msgid "We're still working on them.  What did you want us to do?"
msgstr "Todavía estamos en ello. ¿Qué querías que hiciéramos?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC3.rude:31
msgid ""
"It's what has kept Thjorgard the most prosperous clan in Chedian.  I am certain if we didn't have a strong army, someone would try to take it from us."
msgstr ""
"Es lo que ha mantenido a Thjorgard como el clan más próspero de Chedian. Estoy seguro de que, si no tuviéramos un ejército fuerte, alguien intentaría arrebatárnoslo."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC3.rude:32 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC45.rude:49
msgid "Farewell, adventurers."
msgstr "Adiós, aventureros."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC3.rude:33
msgid "About those things you wanted us to do."
msgstr "Sobre lo que querías que hiciéramos..."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC3.rude:35
msgid "Marvelous!  Let me see it!"
msgstr "¡Magnífico! ¡Dejadme verlo!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC3.rude:35
msgid "We've retrieved Thjorad."
msgstr "Hemos recuperado el Thjorad."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC3.rude:36
msgid "Wonderful!  And the Refinery?"
msgstr "¡Maravilloso! ¿Y la Refinería?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC3.rude:36
msgid "Your mine is once again producing Thjorad"
msgstr "Tu mina vuelve a producir thjorad."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC3.rude:38
msgid "The Clans have been united.  It is time for the war council."
msgstr "Los Clanes se han unido. Es hora del consejo de guerra."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC3.rude:39
msgid ""
"Aye, it's good to be seen!  We have no time to waste!  After we were massacred, Tamur Leng's army turned north and is attacking Frosgard as we speak!"
msgstr ""
"¡Sí, me alegro de que me veáis! ¡No tenemos tiempo que perder! Tras masacrarnos, el ejército de Tamur Leng giró hacia el norte y está atacando Frosgard en este mismo momento."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC3.rude:39
msgid "Sven!  It is good to see you!"
msgstr "¡Sven! ¡Me alegro de verte!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC3.rude:4
msgid "We've come to speak to you about Tamur Leng."
msgstr "Venimos a hablarte de Tamur Leng."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC3.rude:40
msgid ""
"Hmm.  Looks like someone doesn't like my leadership.  I was planning on attending tomorrow.  Maybe we can use that to our advantage."
msgstr ""
"Hum. Parece que a alguien no le gusta cómo gobierno. Pensaba asistir mañana. Quizá podamos aprovecharlo en nuestro favor."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC3.rude:40
msgid "We have found a disturbing letter that you need to read."
msgstr "Hemos encontrado una carta inquietante que debes leer."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC3.rude:41
msgid "I see.  Go find him.  I'll not tolerate insurrection in my capital!"
msgstr "Ya veo. Id a buscarlo. ¡No toleraré una insurrección en mi capital!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC3.rude:41
msgid "The assassin fingered a man named Harris Willington."
msgstr "El asesino señaló a un hombre llamado Harris Willington."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC3.rude:42
msgid "Harris Willington is the accountant at the General Store."
msgstr "Harris Willington es el contable de la Tienda General."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC3.rude:42
msgid ""
"What?  I would have thought Hreidmar a better judge of character than that.  Very well.  Thank you for your assistance.  I owe you my life.  Here's a small token of my gratitude."
msgstr ""
"¿Qué? Habría pensado que Hreidmar sabía juzgar mejor a la gente. Muy bien. Gracias por vuestra ayuda. Os debo la vida. Aquí tenéis una pequeña muestra de mi gratitud."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC3.rude:43
msgid "Harris Willington is dead."
msgstr "Harris Willington ha muerto."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC3.rude:43
msgid ""
"Killed him, did you?  Congratulations.  I would have preferred to make an example of him, but perhaps the word on the streets will do that.  Thank you.  I owe my life to you.  It isn't much, but here's a little appreciation."
msgstr ""
"Lo habéis matado, ¿eh? Enhorabuena. Habría preferido darle un escarmiento público, pero quizá los rumores de la calle se encarguen de eso. Gracias. Os debo la vida. No es mucho, pero aquí tenéis una pequeña muestra de gratitud."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC3.rude:44
msgid ""
"So I am told.  Fear not, brave souls.  Perservere and we shall succeed!"
msgstr "Eso me han dicho. No temáis, valientes. ¡Perseverad y triunfaremos!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC3.rude:44
msgid "Sven.  It is our fault you are dead."
msgstr "Sven. Es culpa nuestra que estés muerto."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC3.rude:45
msgid "Sorry to bother you.  Goodbye."
msgstr "Perdona la molestia. Adiós."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC3.rude:5
msgid "That I shall.  See you at the council."
msgstr "Así lo haré. Nos vemos en el consejo."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC3.rude:6
msgid "Certainly, but we have much work to do before then."
msgstr "Claro, pero antes tenemos mucho trabajo que hacer."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC3.rude:6
msgid "I shall see you at the council, then.  Farewell."
msgstr "Entonces nos veremos en el consejo. Adiós."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC3.rude:7
msgid ""
"The preparation for the war council goes well.  Give the word, and Thjorgard will be there."
msgstr ""
"Los preparativos del consejo de guerra van bien. Dad la orden y Thjorgard estará allí."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC3.rude:8
msgid ""
"Yes.  One of my predecessors loaned the Monastery an artifact called Thjorad.  It was the first item found made of Elemental Thjorad.  We and Lindisfarne were on better terms then.  Now is another story.  Getting this item will not be easy."
msgstr ""
"Sí. Uno de mis predecesores prestó al Monasterio un artefacto llamado Thjorad. Fue el primer objeto hallado hecho de thjorad elemental. Entonces nos llevábamos mejor con Lindisfarne. Ahora es otra historia. No será fácil conseguir ese objeto."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC3.rude:8
msgid "You want us to retrieve it?"
msgstr "¿Quieres que lo recuperemos?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC3.rude:9
msgid ""
"My army is at your disposal.  I assume we shall be having a war council when the clans are together?"
msgstr ""
"Mi ejército está a vuestra disposición. Supongo que celebraremos un consejo de guerra cuando los clanes estén reunidos, ¿no?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC30.rude:1
msgid "Fine.  Goodbye"
msgstr "Bien. Adiós."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC30.rude:2
msgid "Glad we could help."
msgstr "Nos alegra haber ayudado."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC30.rude:3
msgid "It's too bad you all can't work together like this more often."
msgstr "Es una pena que no podáis trabajar todos juntos así más a menudo."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC30.rude:3
msgid ""
"Yeah, then we'd really have the linemen sweat..Wait!  Why can't we?  We should form a group!  A miner's group!  The United Group of Thjoradric Miners!  UGTM!  Yeah!  I like that.  Thanks!"
msgstr ""
"Sí, así sí que haríamos sudar a los jefes de línea... ¡Un momento! ¿Por qué no podemos? ¡Deberíamos formar un grupo! ¡Un grupo de mineros! ¡El Grupo Unido de Mineros de Thjoradric! ¡El GUMT! ¡Sí! Me gusta. ¡Gracias!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC30.rude:4
msgid ""
"The linemaster!  They're always telling the foremen and the crew chiefs the crews have to work harder.  They have to meet the quota.  Never mind that the quotas are twice as large as last month's!"
msgstr ""
"¡El jefe de línea! Siempre están diciendo a los capataces y a los jefes de cuadrilla que las cuadrillas tienen que trabajar más. Que tienen que cumplir la cuota. ¡Y da igual que las cuotas sean el doble que las del mes pasado!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC30.rude:4
msgid "Who's fault is it then?"
msgstr "¿Y de quién es la culpa, entonces?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC30.rude:5
msgid ""
"Because all the miners have stopped working.  They can't fire one when all of them are not working, and they can't fire all of us!"
msgstr ""
"Porque todos los mineros han dejado de trabajar. No pueden despedir a uno cuando ninguno trabaja, ¡y no pueden despedirnos a todos!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC30.rude:6
msgid "Have you said this to the linemaster?"
msgstr "¿Le has dicho esto al jefe de línea?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC30.rude:6
msgid ""
"Of course not!  You think I want to get fired?  They already tell all of us that we can easily be replaced!  Why if it weren't for the cave-in threat, the linemasters would have all of our hides!  They're already going crazy as it is!"
msgstr ""
"¡Claro que no! ¿Crees que quiero que me despidan? ¡Ya nos dicen a todos que pueden sustituirnos fácilmente! ¡Vaya, si no fuera por la amenaza de derrumbes, los jefes de línea nos despellejarían a todos! ¡Ya están bastante desquiciados!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC30.rude:7
msgid ""
"The pressure to produce Elemental Thjorad, of course!  They always think we get sadistic pleasure out of telling our crews they have to work twice as hard."
msgstr ""
"¡La presión por producir thjorad elemental, claro! Siempre creen que disfrutamos sádicamente diciendo a nuestras cuadrillas que tienen que trabajar el doble."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC30.rude:7
msgid "What's the foreman's fault?"
msgstr "¿Qué culpa tiene el capataz?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC30.rude:8
msgid "Either put up or shut up!  You're whining won't solve problems."
msgstr "¡O haces algo o te callas! Tus quejas no van a resolver nada."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC30.rude:8
msgid "You're just like them!  I don't want to talk to you anymore."
msgstr "¡Sois iguales que ellos! No quiero seguir hablando con vosotros."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC30.rude:9
msgid "Sorry to hear it.  Goodbye"
msgstr "Siento oírlo. Adiós."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC300.rude:1
msgid "Isham and I just arrived.  I think we'll be taking the vows together."
msgstr "Isham y yo acabamos de llegar. Creo que haremos los votos juntos."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC300.rude:3
msgid "I've wanted to come here all my life."
msgstr "He querido venir aquí toda mi vida."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC301.rude:1
msgid ""
"My wife was killed in Thronheim.  My home was burned in Yorwick.  With that much tragedy, what else am I to do?"
msgstr ""
"Mataron a mi esposa en Thronheim. Quemaron mi casa en Yorwick. Con tanta desgracia, ¿qué otra cosa puedo hacer?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC301.rude:3
msgid "It's a sad end to my miserable life."
msgstr "Es un triste final para mi miserable vida."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC302.rude:1
msgid "Not that you haven't heard elsewhere."
msgstr "Nada que no hayáis oído en otra parte."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC302.rude:3
msgid ""
"We are forbidden to speak of it.  If you wish to see it, it is by the altar."
msgstr ""
"Tenemos prohibido hablar de ello. Si queréis verla, está junto al altar."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC303.rude:1
msgid ""
"That Aikin took my robes this morning, I'm sure of it!  When Abbot Leffery hears of this, Aikin will be doing penance for certain!"
msgstr ""
"¡Ese Aikin se llevó mis hábitos esta mañana, estoy seguro! ¡Cuando el abad Leffery se entere, Aikin hará penitencia, sin duda!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC303.rude:3
msgid "I am sorry, child.  I cannot speak of the relic."
msgstr "Lo siento, hijo mío. No puedo hablar de la reliquia."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC304.rude:2
msgid ""
"I am sorry, child.  I am on penance.  I am forbidden to speak to pilgrims."
msgstr ""
"Lo siento, hijo mío. Estoy cumpliendo penitencia. Tengo prohibido hablar con los peregrinos."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC305.rude:1
msgid "My family disowned me for choosing this path."
msgstr "Mi familia renegó de mí por elegir este camino."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC305.rude:3
msgid "It is all that I know now.  The monks are my family."
msgstr "Es todo lo que conozco ahora. Los monjes son mi familia."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC306.rude:1
msgid ""
"Ezhno is doing penance for sneaking food into his room.  He is forbidden from talking to pilgrims."
msgstr ""
"Ezhno está haciendo penitencia por meter comida a escondidas en su celda. Tiene prohibido hablar con los peregrinos."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC306.rude:3
msgid ""
"It is home.  It is a hard life, but the trials we face in this life will make us stronger in the next."
msgstr ""
"Es mi hogar. Es una vida dura, pero las pruebas que afrontamos en esta vida nos harán más fuertes en la próxima."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC306.rude:4
msgid "No bother."
msgstr "No es molestia."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC306.rude:5 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC86.rude:14 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC86.rude:9
msgid "It was a pleasure."
msgstr "Ha sido un placer."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC307.rude:1
msgid ""
"You look like a strong group.  Abbot Leffery might have a job for you."
msgstr ""
"Parecéis un grupo fuerte. Puede que el abad Leffery tenga un trabajo para vosotros."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC307.rude:3
msgid ""
"If you're looking to earn some money, find Abbot Leffery.  He might have a job for you."
msgstr ""
"Si buscáis ganar algo de dinero, buscad al abad Leffery. Puede que tenga un trabajo para vosotros."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC308.rude:1
msgid "Alright, you're hired!"
msgstr "Muy bien, ¡estás contratado!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC308.rude:1
msgid "You won't be sorry."
msgstr "No os arrepentiréis."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC308.rude:2
msgid "How much are we talking about here?"
msgstr "¿De cuánto estamos hablando?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC308.rude:2
msgid ""
"It's a bargain!  For 2000 gold to start, 1000 gold per month plus 20% of all the gold we find I will heal your parties injuries and conditions once per day!"
msgstr ""
"¡Es una ganga! Por 2000 de oro para empezar, 1000 de oro al mes y el 20% de todo el oro que encontremos, curaré las heridas y los estados de vuestro grupo una vez al día."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC308.rude:3
msgid ""
"Well, I am ready to leave this place.  I have learned all I am going to but I cannot travel alone.  If you will take me with you, I will heal your party for a portion of the gold you find along the way."
msgstr ""
"Bueno, estoy listo para dejar este lugar. He aprendido todo lo que voy a aprender, pero no puedo viajar solo. Si me lleváis con vosotros, curaré a vuestro grupo a cambio de una parte del oro que encontréis por el camino."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC308.rude:4
msgid "Perhaps I can help you then."
msgstr "Entonces quizá pueda ayudaros."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC308.rude:5
msgid "Maybe some other time."
msgstr "Quizá en otra ocasión."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC308.rude:6 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC432.rude:10
msgid "As you wish."
msgstr "Como queráis."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC308.rude:6
msgid "No thanks. Maybe some other time."
msgstr "No, gracias. Quizá en otra ocasión."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC309.rude:1
msgid "Come with us!"
msgstr "¡Venid con nosotros!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC309.rude:3
msgid "That is impossible!  We must get to the bottom of this!!"
msgstr "¡Eso es imposible! ¡Tenemos que llegar al fondo de esto!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC309.rude:3
msgid "WE have a Writ of Fate!!"
msgstr "¡NOSOTROS tenemos un Edicto del Destino!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC309.rude:4
msgid "That cannot be!  We are destined to stop you!"
msgstr "¡No puede ser! ¡Estamos destinados a detenerte!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC309.rude:4
msgid "What!?  How can you stop me when I have a Writ of Fate?"
msgstr "¿¡Qué!? ¿Cómo vais a detenerme si tengo un Edicto del Destino?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC309.rude:5
msgid "Destiny?  What are you talking about?"
msgstr "¿El destino? ¿De qué estás hablando?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC309.rude:5
msgid ""
"It was there Igrid gave me my Writ of Fate.  It told of how I am fated to conquer the world!  That is why you cannot stop me!"
msgstr ""
"Fue allí donde Igrid me dio mi Edicto del Destino. ¡Decía que mi destino es conquistar el mundo! ¡Por eso no podéis detenerme!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC309.rude:6
msgid ""
"Ha!  If you only knew!  Well, I suppose I shall tell you.  You see, I have been to the place you call Arslegard.  I have spoken to Igrid.  It was there she informed me of my destiny!"
msgstr ""
"¡Ja! ¡Si vosotros supierais! Bueno, supongo que os lo contaré. Veréis, he estado en el lugar que llamáis Arslegard. He hablado con Igrid. ¡Fue allí donde ella me reveló mi destino!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC309.rude:6
msgid "You are beaten!  What makes you think you will escape?"
msgstr "¡Estás vencido! ¿Qué te hace pensar que escaparás?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC309.rude:7
msgid ""
"It seems that I underestimated your abilities.  I can assure you that will never happen again!  You may have won this battle, but in time my hordes will overrun Chedian, and I will see you all enslaved!"
msgstr ""
"Parece que subestimé vuestras habilidades. ¡Os aseguro que no volverá a ocurrir! Puede que hayáis ganado esta batalla, pero con el tiempo mis hordas arrasarán Chedian, ¡y os veré a todos esclavizados!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC309.rude:7
msgid "The traitor is finished."
msgstr "El traidor está acabado."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC309.rude:8
msgid "We have come to end this, Tamur Leng!"
msgstr "¡Hemos venido a acabar con esto, Tamur Leng!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC309.rude:8
msgid ""
"You!  Forad had instructions to kill you!  How is it that you are still alive?"
msgstr ""
"¡Vosotros! ¡Forad tenía instrucciones de mataros! ¿Cómo es que seguís vivos?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC309.rude:9
msgid "We will get to the bottom of this!!"
msgstr "¡Llegaremos al fondo de esto!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC31.rude:1
msgid "Tell me about The Great Cataclysm."
msgstr "Háblame del Gran Cataclismo."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC31.rude:1
msgid ""
"The Great Cataclysm is when Verhoffin cast his spell atop his castle in the Isle of Ashes that nearly destroyed us all!"
msgstr ""
"¡El Gran Cataclismo fue cuando Verhoffin lanzó su hechizo en lo alto de su castillo de la Isla de las Cenizas y estuvo a punto de destruirnos a todos!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC31.rude:3
msgid "How do I visit Arslegard?"
msgstr "¿Cómo puedo visitar Arslegard?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC31.rude:3
msgid "The only way to see Arslegard is if you're dead."
msgstr "La única manera de ver Arslegard es estar muerto."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC31.rude:4
msgid ""
"Elemental Thjorad is used by the Thjoradric Smiths to make powerful and magical weapons and items."
msgstr ""
"Los herreros de Thjoradric usan el thjorad elemental para fabricar armas y objetos poderosos y mágicos."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC31.rude:4 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC338.rude:5 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC378.rude:5
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC378.rude:6
msgctxt "said by the party"
msgid "What is it?"
msgstr "¿Qué ocurre?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC31.rude:5
msgid "We are so fortunate to have found Elemental Thjorad in the mountains!"
msgstr ""
"¡Qué suerte tenemos de haber encontrado thjorad elemental en las montañas!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC31.rude:5
msgid "Why are you so happy?"
msgstr "¿Por qué estás tan contento?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC31.rude:8
msgid ""
"Arslegard is the city where the gods live.  It is supposed to be the most beautiful city in the world.  I hope to visit it one day."
msgstr ""
"Arslegard es la ciudad donde viven los dioses. Dicen que es la ciudad más bella del mundo. Espero visitarla algún día."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC31.rude:8
msgid "Where is Arslegard?"
msgstr "¿Dónde está Arslegard?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC31.rude:9
msgid ""
"Verhoffin was an evil, evil man!  He is the one that caused the Great Cataclysm!"
msgstr ""
"¡Verhoffin era un hombre malvado, malvadísimo! ¡Él fue quien causó el Gran Cataclismo!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC31.rude:9
msgid "Who is Verhoffin?"
msgstr "¿Quién es Verhoffin?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC310.rude:1
msgid ""
"Keep your eyes peeled, friend.  That is the best advice anyone can have."
msgstr ""
"Mantén los ojos bien abiertos, amigo. Es el mejor consejo que nadie puede recibir."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC311.rude:1
msgid ""
"I've just returned from Framon.  The conditions there are getting worse by the day!"
msgstr "Acabo de volver de Framon. ¡Allí las cosas empeoran día a día!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC311.rude:2 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC311.rude:4 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC399.rude:4
msgid "If you meet the requirements, I can help you with that."
msgstr "Si cumplís los requisitos, puedo ayudaros con eso."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC311.rude:2 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC399.rude:2
msgid "We'd like to become Experts in Identify Item."
msgstr "Queremos ser Expertos en Identificar Objetos."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC311.rude:3 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC399.rude:6
msgid ""
"In Yorwick, there is an elf named Laina Wilan.  She will be able to help you."
msgstr "En Yorwick hay una elfa llamada Laina Wilan. Ella podrá ayudaros."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC311.rude:3 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC399.rude:6
msgid "Where can we become Grandmasters in Identify Item?"
msgstr "¿Dónde podemos llegar a Grandes Maestros en Identificar Objetos?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC311.rude:4 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC399.rude:4
msgctxt "said by the party"
msgid "We'd like to become Masters in Identify Item."
msgstr "Queremos ser Maestros en Identificar Objetos."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC312.rude:1
msgid "No, we haven't seen him yet."
msgstr "No, aún no lo hemos visto."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC312.rude:1
msgid "Oh OK, thank you for helping me!"
msgstr "¡Ah, vale, gracias por ayudarme!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC312.rude:10
msgid ""
"Mommy says that we are Framish, and no matter how many Thronish settle were we have to remember that!"
msgstr ""
"Mamá dice que somos de Framon, y que da igual cuántos de Thronheim se instalen aquí, ¡tenemos que recordarlo!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC312.rude:10 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC314.rude:5 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC320.rude:2
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC323.rude:3 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC324.rude:3 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC326.rude:3
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC328.rude:3 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC333.rude:3 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC500.rude:5
msgid "What do you know about Yorwick?"
msgstr "¿Qué sabes de Yorwick?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC312.rude:11
msgid ""
"I had him on the east side of the village. I only turned to talk to my friend for one second and when I turned back he was gone!"
msgstr ""
"La tenía en el lado este del pueblo. ¡Solo me giré un segundo para hablar con mi amiga y, cuando me volví, ya no estaba!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC312.rude:11
msgid "Where did you take your sheep?"
msgstr "¿Adónde llevaste a tu oveja?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC312.rude:12
msgid "Oh, what am I going to do?"
msgstr "Oh, ¿qué voy a hacer?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC312.rude:12
msgid "We can't help you right now, little girl."
msgstr "Ahora no podemos ayudarte, pequeña."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC312.rude:13
msgid "We havn't found your sheep yet."
msgstr "Todavía no hemos encontrado tu oveja."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC312.rude:13
msgid "Well Hurry!"
msgstr "¡Pues daos prisa!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC312.rude:14
msgid "Sorry to have bothered you, you old meanie!"
msgstr "¡Perdonad la molestia, viejos gruñones!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC312.rude:14
msgid "We don't have time to go looking for your silly sheep."
msgstr "No tenemos tiempo de ir a buscar tu tonta oveja."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC312.rude:15
msgid "Here's your sheep."
msgstr "Aquí tienes tu oveja."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC312.rude:15
msgid "Thank you!  Thank you!  Oh I thought she never was going to be found!"
msgstr "¡Gracias! ¡Gracias! ¡Oh, creía que nadie la encontraría nunca!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC312.rude:17
msgid "Oh, what will I do!"
msgstr "¡Oh! ¿Qué voy a hacer?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC312.rude:17
msgid "We're sorry, we can't help you right now"
msgstr "Lo sentimos, ahora no podemos ayudarte."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC312.rude:2
msgid "I can't find my sheep! What will mother say?"
msgstr "¡No encuentro mi oveja! ¿Qué dirá mamá?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC312.rude:2
msgid "What's the matter?"
msgstr "¿Qué te pasa?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC312.rude:3
msgid ""
"I was herding him near the old gate. But mother said not to go outside of our village."
msgstr ""
"La estaba pastoreando cerca de la puerta vieja. Pero mamá me dijo que no saliera del pueblo."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC312.rude:3
msgid "Where did you see your sheep last?"
msgstr "¿Dónde viste tu oveja por última vez?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC312.rude:4
msgid ""
"Mother won't tell me. It must be a stupid rule so that I won't get out of her site. I just wanted my sheep to have some fresh grazing! So I took him to the east side of town where no one ever goes, and the grass is fresh and not trampled on."
msgstr ""
"Mamá no me lo quiere decir. Seguro que es una norma tonta para que no me pierda de vista. ¡Yo solo quería que mi oveja comiera hierba fresca! Así que la llevé al lado este del pueblo, donde nunca va nadie y la hierba está fresca y sin pisotear."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC312.rude:4
msgid "Why can't you go outside of the village?"
msgstr "¿Por qué no puedes salir del pueblo?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC312.rude:5
msgid "That's wonderful! Wait until I tell the others!"
msgstr "¡Qué maravilla! ¡Esperad a que se lo cuente a los demás!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC312.rude:5
msgid "You are welcome Mary. Now you can play outside the village."
msgstr "De nada, Mary. Ahora ya puedes jugar fuera del pueblo."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC312.rude:6
msgid "Oh thank you! I will wait here for you."
msgstr "¡Oh, gracias! Os esperaré aquí."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC312.rude:6
msgid "We will try to find your sheep"
msgstr "Intentaremos encontrar tu oveja."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC312.rude:7
msgid "My sheep is missing!"
msgstr "¡Mi oveja ha desaparecido!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC312.rude:9
msgid ""
"Oh you horrible people! You were supposed to save him! My mother's going to make you pay for him!"
msgstr ""
"¡Oh, qué gente tan horrible! ¡Teníais que salvarla! ¡Mi madre os la hará pagar!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC312.rude:9
msgid "We found your sheep, but he was killed by a magic mine."
msgstr "Encontramos tu oveja, pero la mató una mina mágica."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC313.rude:1 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC313.rude:3
msgid ""
"I hear those children have been playing near the magic mines.  Don't they know those things are dangerous?  What's wrong with parents today?"
msgstr ""
"He oído que esos niños andan jugando cerca de las minas mágicas. ¿Es que no saben que esas cosas son peligrosas? ¿Qué les pasa a los padres de hoy en día?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC313.rude:2 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC313.rude:5
msgid "See that you do."
msgstr "Aseguraos de hacerlo."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC313.rude:2 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC313.rude:5
msgid "We will try to find this place!"
msgstr "¡Intentaremos encontrar ese lugar!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC313.rude:3
msgid "We'd like to talk to you about the mines."
msgstr "Queremos hablar contigo de las minas."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC313.rude:4
msgid ""
"We put them in to protect the town.  It was a very necessary safety precaution.  Parents today don't teach their children the proper fear of those pastures!"
msgstr ""
"Las pusimos para proteger el pueblo. Era una medida de seguridad muy necesaria. ¡Los padres de hoy en día no enseñan a sus hijos a tener a esos pastos el miedo que merecen!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC313.rude:4
msgid "What do you know about the mines?"
msgstr "¿Qué sabes de las minas?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC313.rude:6
msgid "Uh, no. We aren't looking for anything like that."
msgstr "Eh, no. No buscamos nada de eso."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC313.rude:6
msgid "You aren't? Oh. Well, I will be on my way then."
msgstr "¿No? Oh. Bueno, entonces seguiré mi camino."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC313.rude:8
msgid "No, none of us are magic beings.  Goodbye."
msgstr "No, ninguno de nosotros es un ser mágico. Adiós."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC313.rude:8
msgid "Pity. Good day then."
msgstr "Lástima. Buenos días, entonces."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC314.rude:3 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC314.rude:4
msgid "Show us what you have for sale"
msgstr "Enséñanos lo que tienes a la venta."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC314.rude:3
msgid ""
"Sure! Sure! I can sell you anything you want. Highest quality, just for my special customers!"
msgstr ""
"¡Claro! ¡Claro! Puedo venderos todo lo que queráis. ¡La mejor calidad, solo para mis clientes especiales!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC314.rude:7 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC500.rude:8
msgid "Nothing, thanks. Just looking."
msgstr "Nada, gracias. Solo estamos mirando."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC315.rude:1
msgid ""
"I'm a fugitive!  I escaped from my captors in Framon who accused me of treason!  Me!  Can you believe that?"
msgstr ""
"¡Soy un fugitivo! ¡Escapé de mis captores en Framon, que me acusaban de traición! ¡A mí! ¿Os lo podéis creer?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC315.rude:2
msgid "Alright, I suppose."
msgstr "Bueno, supongo que sí."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC315.rude:3
msgid ""
"I was about to be promoted to senior hall guard, then the Sergeant of the Watch opened his fat mouth.  He lied to the Queen about me!  He said I snuck into the treasury on my watch.  That I went into the queens chamber!  All lies, every last word!"
msgstr ""
"Estaba a punto de ascender a guardia mayor de palacio cuando el Sargento de la Guardia abrió su bocaza. ¡Le mintió a la Reina sobre mí! Dijo que me había colado en la tesorería durante mi turno de guardia. ¡Que había entrado en los aposentos de la reina! ¡Todo mentiras, de la primera a la última palabra!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC315.rude:4
msgid "Nothing, sorry"
msgstr "Nada, lo siento."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC315.rude:4
msgid "humph."
msgstr "Hum."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC316.rude:1
msgid "Nevermind. Sorry to bother you."
msgstr "Olvídalo. Perdona la molestia."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC316.rude:1
msgid "No trouble."
msgstr "No es molestia."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC317.rude:1
msgid "Ah. That is alright."
msgstr "Ah. No pasa nada."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC317.rude:1
msgid "Didn't mean to interrupt you. Nevermind"
msgstr "No queríamos interrumpirte. Olvídalo."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC318.rude:1
msgid "No trouble at all."
msgstr "No es ninguna molestia."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC318.rude:1
msgid "Oh nothing. Sorry to bother you."
msgstr "Oh, nada. Perdona la molestia."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC319.rude:1 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC85.rude:12
msgid "Alright then."
msgstr "Muy bien, entonces."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC319.rude:1
msgid "We'll leave you to your drink."
msgstr "Te dejamos con tu bebida."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC32.rude:1
msgid "Actually we would like to ask you something else."
msgstr "En realidad queríamos preguntarte otra cosa."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC32.rude:10
msgid "It's not a dish.  It's....  Never mind.  Another question."
msgstr "No es un plato. Es... Da igual. Otra pregunta."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC32.rude:11 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC38.rude:6 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC59.rude:2
msgid "Maybe we can ask you something else."
msgstr "Quizá podamos preguntarte otra cosa."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC32.rude:12
msgid ""
"Yea.  He's the guy who wins the mud shoveling championship every year!"
msgstr ""
"Sí. ¡Es el tipo que gana el campeonato de paleo de barro todos los años!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC32.rude:12
msgid "You've heard of him?"
msgstr "¿Has oído hablar de él?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC32.rude:13
msgid "I think that's someone else."
msgstr "Creo que ese es otro."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC32.rude:13
msgid "No, I wouldn't forget him!  He's my arch enemy!"
msgstr "¡No, no podría olvidarlo! ¡Es mi archienemigo!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC32.rude:14
msgid "Maybe there's something else we can ask you"
msgstr "Quizá haya otra cosa que podamos preguntarte."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC32.rude:15
msgid ""
"Who cares!  If it weren't for him, I wouldn't have a job!  Thank heavens for him!"
msgstr "¡Qué más da! ¡Si no fuera por él, no tendría trabajo! ¡Bendito sea!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC32.rude:15
msgid "You don't even know his name?"
msgstr "¿Ni siquiera sabes cómo se llama?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC32.rude:16
msgid "And what was that?"
msgstr "¿Y qué era?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC32.rude:16
msgid "We wanted to ask you about something"
msgstr "Queríamos preguntarte una cosa."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC32.rude:17
msgid "We'll let you get back to your shoveling."
msgstr "Te dejamos volver a tu paleo."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC32.rude:18
msgid "We'll let you get back to your shoveling"
msgstr "Te dejamos volver a tu paleo."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC32.rude:19
msgid "We won't bother you anymore."
msgstr "No te molestaremos más."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC32.rude:2
msgid ""
"Of course it's important!  Why without any mud shovelers, the mud would just pile up!"
msgstr ""
"¡Pues claro que es importante! ¡Vaya, sin paleros de barro, el barro se iría amontonando!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC32.rude:2
msgid "We didn't realize mud shoveling was so important."
msgstr "No sabíamos que palear barro fuera tan importante."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC32.rude:20
msgid "Isn't that some sort of dish made out of pig's intestines?"
msgstr "¿Eso no es una especie de plato hecho con tripas de cerdo?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC32.rude:21
msgid "It's not a dish, it's a place.  Nevermind.  Goodbye"
msgstr "No es un plato, es un lugar. Da igual. Adiós."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC32.rude:22
msgid "Right.  We'll let you get back to the shoveling."
msgstr "Bien. Te dejamos volver a palear."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC32.rude:23
msgid "We'll let you get back to your mud shoveling."
msgstr "Te dejamos volver a palear barro."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC32.rude:25
msgid "I think I heard of that guy.  He's a real jerk!"
msgstr "Creo que he oído hablar de ese tipo. ¡Es un auténtico imbécil!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC32.rude:26
msgid ""
"I know the guy that did it gave us a lot of shoveling to do.  All hail the Great Cataclysm Maker!"
msgstr ""
"Lo que sé es que el tipo que lo provocó nos dio un montón de barro que palear. ¡Viva el Gran Hacedor del Cataclismo!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC32.rude:26
msgid "What do you know about the Great Cataclysm"
msgstr "¿Qué sabes del Gran Cataclismo?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC32.rude:27
msgid "Sorry, nevermind."
msgstr "Perdona, olvídalo."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC32.rude:3
msgid ""
"Would it be a problem?  Of course it would be a problem!  Don't you know anything?  If the mud were to pile up, there'd be huge piles of mud all over the place!"
msgstr ""
"¿Que si sería un problema? ¡Pues claro que sería un problema! ¿Es que no sabéis nada? ¡Si el barro se amontonara, habría enormes montones de barro por todas partes!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC32.rude:3
msgid "Would that be a problem?"
msgstr "¿Y eso sería un problema?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC32.rude:4
msgid ""
"If the mud piled up, who would shovel it?  No one!  Because there wouldn't be any mud shovelers!"
msgstr ""
"Si el barro se amontonara, ¿quién lo palearía? ¡Nadie! ¡Porque no habría paleros de barro!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC32.rude:4
msgid "So...."
msgstr "Así que..."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC32.rude:5
msgid "And what is that?"
msgstr "¿Y qué es?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC32.rude:5
msgid "We'd like to ask you something"
msgstr "Queremos preguntarte una cosa."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC32.rude:6
msgid "I heard the miners haven't been working lately."
msgstr "He oído que los mineros no están trabajando últimamente."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC32.rude:6
msgid "What do you know about the Mines?"
msgstr "¿Qué sabes de las Minas?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC32.rude:7
msgid "What is it that you're doing?"
msgstr "¿Qué estás haciendo?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC32.rude:7
msgid ""
"What's it look like I'm doing?  I'm shoveling mud!  And I was making good progress before you bothered me!"
msgstr ""
"¿A ti qué te parece que estoy haciendo? ¡Estoy paleando barro! ¡E iba muy bien hasta que me habéis molestado!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC32.rude:8
msgid ""
"How should I know?  I'm a mud shoveler, not a miner!  And I need to get back to it!"
msgstr ""
"¿Y yo qué sé? ¡Soy palero de barro, no minero! ¡Y tengo que volver al trabajo!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC32.rude:9
msgid "No.  It's a place."
msgstr "No. Es un lugar."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC32.rude:9
msgid "Who would name a place after plate of pig intestine?"
msgstr ""
"¿A quién se le ocurre ponerle a un lugar el nombre de un plato de tripas de cerdo?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC320.rude:11
msgid "Yeah, ok."
msgstr "Sí, vale."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC320.rude:12
msgid "Sorry to bother you, nevermind."
msgstr "Perdona la molestia, olvídalo."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC320.rude:12
msgid "You shouldn't bother busy people!"
msgstr "¡No deberíais molestar a la gente ocupada!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC320.rude:2
msgid ""
"I used to live there.  They have those awful magic mines! They were left behind after the Framish wars. Our side thought they would help keep the Framish out and all it does is keep our folk IN!"
msgstr ""
"Yo vivía allí. ¡Tienen esas horribles minas mágicas! Quedaron de las guerras con Framon. Los nuestros creyeron que ayudarían a mantener fuera a los de Framon, ¡y lo único que consiguen es mantener DENTRO a nuestra gente!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC320.rude:3 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC401.rude:2
msgid "We'd like to become Experts in Identify Monster."
msgstr "Queremos ser Expertos en Identificar Monstruos."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC320.rude:3 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC320.rude:7 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC401.rude:2
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC401.rude:3
msgid "You think you fit the requirements?  If so, I can help you."
msgstr "¿Creéis que cumplís los requisitos? Si es así, puedo ayudaros."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC320.rude:4 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC320.rude:8
msgid "What kind of magic was used to make them?"
msgstr "¿Qué clase de magia se usó para crearlas?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC320.rude:4
msgid ""
"You should ask old Forblaith A'Mor, she would remember, she helped make them!"
msgstr ""
"Deberíais preguntar a la vieja Forblaith A'Mor; ella lo recordaría, ¡ayudó a crearlas!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC320.rude:5
msgid "Hasn't anyone tried to remove them?"
msgstr "¿Nadie ha intentado quitarlas?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC320.rude:5
msgid ""
"Well, none of the menfolk around here are brave enough to try! So we have to be so careful if we leave the village. The poor children can't even be allowed to play."
msgstr ""
"Bueno, ¡ningún hombre de por aquí es lo bastante valiente para intentarlo! Así que tenemos que andarnos con mucho cuidado si salimos del pueblo. Los pobres niños ni siquiera pueden jugar."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC320.rude:6 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC401.rude:5
msgid ""
"To become Grandmasters in Identify Monster, you must find Ragfreid Manslayer in Yorwick."
msgstr ""
"Para llegar a Grandes Maestros en Identificar Monstruos, debéis buscar a Ragfreid Matahombres en Yorwick."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC320.rude:6 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC401.rude:5
msgid "Where can we find the Grandmaster in Identify Monster?"
msgstr "¿Dónde podemos encontrar al Gran Maestro en Identificar Monstruos?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC320.rude:7 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC401.rude:3
msgid "We'd like to become Master in Identify Monster."
msgstr "Queremos ser Maestros en Identificar Monstruos."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC320.rude:8
msgid "You should ask old Forblaith, he would remember, he helped make them!"
msgstr ""
"Deberíais preguntar a la vieja Forblaith; ella lo recordaría, ¡ayudó a crearlas!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC320.rude:9
msgid ""
"They've been fighting with Thronheim for centuries.  The Thronish have slowly been settling there for ages."
msgstr ""
"Llevan siglos luchando contra Thronheim. Los de Thronheim llevan muchísimo tiempo asentándose allí poco a poco."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC321.rude:1
msgid ""
"Oh yes, I used to be able to play in the fields outside of the Yorwick when I was a little girl. I remember the joy and happiness of being able to run free with out a care in the world!"
msgstr ""
"Oh, sí, cuando era pequeña podía jugar en los campos de las afueras de Yorwick. ¡Recuerdo la alegría y la felicidad de correr libre sin una sola preocupación en el mundo!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC321.rude:2 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC321.rude:6 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC402.rude:2
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC402.rude:3 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC402.rude:5
msgid "If you think you are qualified, I can help you."
msgstr "Si creéis que estáis capacitados, puedo ayudaros."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC321.rude:2 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC402.rude:2 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC402.rude:3
msgid "We'd like to become Experts in Learning."
msgstr "Queremos ser Expertos en Aprendizaje."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC321.rude:3
msgid "It would be lovely if the children could play as I did."
msgstr "Sería precioso que los niños pudieran jugar como yo jugaba."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC321.rude:3
msgid "Thank you.  We will."
msgstr "Gracias. Lo haremos."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC321.rude:4
msgid ""
"Oh I don't know. If I remember correctly old Forbhlaith A'Mor had to help make the awful things. Maybe you should ask her."
msgstr ""
"Oh, no lo sé. Si no recuerdo mal, la vieja Forbhlaith A'Mor tuvo que ayudar a crear esas horribles cosas. Quizá deberíais preguntarle a ella."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC321.rude:4
msgid "What can be done about it?"
msgstr "¿Qué se puede hacer al respecto?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC321.rude:5 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC402.rude:7
msgid "Where can we become Grandmasters in Learning?"
msgstr "¿Dónde podemos llegar a Grandes Maestros en Aprendizaje?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC321.rude:5 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC402.rude:7
msgid "You must find Jenne Harrise in Yorwick."
msgstr "Debéis buscar a Jenne Harrise en Yorwick."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC321.rude:6 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC402.rude:5
msgid "We'd like to become Masters in Learning."
msgstr "Queremos ser Maestros en Aprendizaje."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC321.rude:9
msgid "You are so kind.  You're welcome.  Farewell."
msgstr "Qué amables sois. De nada. Adiós."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC322.rude:1
msgid "Um. Not really."
msgstr "Eh... La verdad es que no."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC322.rude:1
msgid "What would you know?"
msgstr "¿Y vosotros qué sabréis?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC322.rude:2
msgid "I feel it in my bones. Can't you?"
msgstr "Lo siento en los huesos. ¿Vosotros no?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC322.rude:3
msgid "That's interesting."
msgstr "Qué interesante."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC322.rude:3
msgid "What do you know about it?"
msgstr "¿Qué sabéis de eso?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC323.rude:1
msgid "Do you think you're ready?"
msgstr "¿Creéis que estáis preparados?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC323.rude:1
msgid "We'd like to become Grandmasters in Perception"
msgstr "Queremos ser Grandes Maestros en Percepción."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC323.rude:2
msgid "Yeah!  I got to get back to my plowing!"
msgstr "¡Sí! ¡Tengo que volver a arar!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC323.rude:3
msgid ""
"If you paid more attention, you wouldn't have to ask questions like that."
msgstr ""
"Si prestarais más atención, no tendríais que hacer preguntas como esa."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC323.rude:4
msgid "Alright, but be quick about it!"
msgstr "Está bien, ¡pero sed breves!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC323.rude:6
msgid "See that you don't!"
msgstr "¡Más os vale!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC323.rude:6
msgid "We won't stop you then!"
msgstr "¡Entonces no te entretendremos!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC324.rude:1
msgid ""
"It's terrible about those magic mines!  I wish that someone would do something about them!"
msgstr ""
"¡Esas minas mágicas son terribles! ¡Ojalá alguien hiciera algo con ellas!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC324.rude:3
msgid ""
"I've lived here since I was a child.  We've never had much problem with Framon.  Why do we still need the mines?"
msgstr ""
"Vivo aquí desde que era niño. Nunca hemos tenido muchos problemas con Framon. ¿Por qué seguimos necesitando las minas?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC324.rude:4
msgid "Yes, it is."
msgstr "Sí, lo es."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC325.rude:1
msgid ""
"I think it's high time we sent those Framish settlers back to where they came from!"
msgstr ""
"¡Creo que ya va siendo hora de mandar a esos colonos de Framon de vuelta a su tierra!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC325.rude:3
msgid ""
"Yorwick used to be part of Framon.  It's not anymore!  Why can't those Framish just leave?"
msgstr ""
"Yorwick antes formaba parte de Framon. ¡Ya no! ¿Por qué no se van de una vez los de Framon?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC325.rude:4
msgid "It sure is.  Good day."
msgstr "Desde luego. Buenos días."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC326.rude:1
msgid ""
"I really don't want to thatch the house.  It's a very unpleasant task, but the wife insist that it must be done."
msgstr ""
"La verdad es que no me apetece nada rehacer el tejado de paja de la casa. Es una tarea muy desagradable, pero mi mujer insiste en que hay que hacerlo."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC326.rude:2
msgid "Make it quick."
msgstr "Que sea rápido."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC326.rude:3
msgid ""
"I'm originally from Thronheim.  Things were getting pretty bad there, though when I left.  That was before Kira became a Jarl."
msgstr ""
"Soy de Thronheim. Aunque, cuando me marché, las cosas allí se estaban poniendo bastante feas. Eso fue antes de que Kira se convirtiera en jarl."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC326.rude:4
msgid "Don't suppose you'd help, would ya?  Didn't think so."
msgstr "No me ayudaríais, ¿verdad? Ya me lo imaginaba."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC326.rude:4
msgid "Good luck with the house."
msgstr "Suerte con la casa."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC326.rude:5
msgid "Anything to keep me from thatching the house."
msgstr "Lo que sea con tal de no tener que rehacer el tejado de paja."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC327.rude:1 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC329.rude:1 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC409.rude:2
msgid "Are you skilled enough?"
msgstr "¿Sois lo bastante hábiles?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC327.rude:1
msgid "We'd like to become Grandmasters in Repair Item"
msgstr "Queremos ser Grandes Maestros en Reparación."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC327.rude:2
msgid "The wife will have my hide if I don't fix the chimney."
msgstr "Mi mujer me despellejará si no arreglo la chimenea."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC327.rude:3
msgid "Ask someone else!  I've got to fix my chimney!"
msgstr "¡Preguntad a otro! ¡Tengo que arreglar mi chimenea!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC327.rude:3
msgid "What do you know about Framon."
msgstr "¿Qué sabes de Framon?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC327.rude:4
msgid "Okay, but hurry!"
msgstr "Vale, ¡pero daos prisa!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC327.rude:5
msgid "Good luck with the chimney."
msgstr "Suerte con la chimenea."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC328.rude:1
msgid ""
"I need to get my plowing done, if I want my planting to be ready come harvest."
msgstr ""
"Tengo que terminar de arar si quiero que la siembra esté lista para la cosecha."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC328.rude:2
msgid "Huh?  Oh, all right."
msgstr "¿Eh? Oh, está bien."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC328.rude:3
msgid ""
"The farmlands here are great!  We're not starving like I was in Frosgard."
msgstr ""
"¡Las tierras de cultivo de aquí son estupendas! No pasamos hambre como yo en Frosgard."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC328.rude:4
msgid "Now where does Broccan live again..?"
msgstr "A ver, ¿dónde vivía Broccan...?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC328.rude:5
msgid "I wonder if Broccan will lend me the plow?"
msgstr "¿Me prestará Broccan el arado?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC329.rude:1
msgid "We'd like to become Grandmasters in Merchant"
msgstr "Queremos ser Grandes Maestros en Mercader"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC329.rude:2
msgid ""
"Don't forget that the merchants you deal with also have skills of their own.  You can bet if they have a fancy shop, they know the worth of the stuff their selling."
msgstr ""
"No olvidéis que los mercaderes con los que tratáis también tienen sus propias habilidades. Podéis apostar a que, si tienen una tienda lujosa, saben bien lo que vale la mercancía que venden."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC329.rude:3 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC49.rude:6 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC49.rude:9
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC80.rude:2
msgid "I guess."
msgstr "Supongo."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC33.rude:1
msgid "Whatever you say."
msgstr "Lo que tú digas."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC33.rude:2
msgid "He wouldn't have made an error!  He was too good."
msgstr "¡Él no se habría equivocado! Era demasiado bueno."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC33.rude:2
msgid "Maybe he just made an error."
msgstr "Quizá simplemente cometió un error."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC33.rude:3
msgid "He was a great warrior!  There's no way he could die in battle!"
msgstr "¡Era un gran guerrero! Es imposible que muriera en batalla."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC33.rude:3
msgid "What makes you think that he was murdered?"
msgstr "¿Qué os hace pensar que lo asesinaron?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC33.rude:4
msgid ""
"My great grandfather was murdered so he wouldn't become Jarl of Thjorgard.  Everyone said at the time he died in battle, but I know the truth.  Sven's great-grandpa killed mine."
msgstr ""
"Asesinaron a mi bisabuelo para que no llegara a ser Jarl de Thjorgard. En su momento todos dijeron que había muerto en batalla, pero yo sé la verdad. El bisabuelo de Sven mató al mío."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC33.rude:5
msgid "I should be in the palace with the Jarl."
msgstr "Yo debería estar en el palacio con el Jarl."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC33.rude:6
msgid "Hello.  Goodbye"
msgstr "Hola. Adiós."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC330.rude:1
msgid "Will do."
msgstr "Así lo haremos."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC330.rude:2
msgid "That husband of mine had better come home and fix the chimney!"
msgstr "¡Más le vale a ese marido mío volver a casa y arreglar la chimenea!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC330.rude:4
msgid "I know that whoever built our house here couldn't make a chimney!"
msgstr ""
"¡Os aseguro que quien construyó nuestra casa no tenía ni idea de hacer chimeneas!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC330.rude:5
msgid "We haven't seen him."
msgstr "No lo hemos visto."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC330.rude:5
msgid "Well if you do, tell him to come home and fix the chimney!"
msgstr "Pues si lo veis, ¡decidle que vuelva a casa y arregle la chimenea!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC331.rude:1
msgid "These Thronish invaders are here to stay, I expect."
msgstr "Me temo que estos invasores throneses han venido para quedarse."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC331.rude:3
msgid ""
"My father used to tell me stories of the days when we were really part of Framon.  We had Framish guards here and everything!"
msgstr ""
"Mi padre solía contarme historias de los tiempos en que de verdad formábamos parte de Framon. ¡Hasta teníamos guardias frameses y todo!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC331.rude:4
msgid "Tragic!  Sorry to bother you."
msgstr "¡Qué tragedia! Perdonad la molestia."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC331.rude:5 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC42.rude:12 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC85.rude:9
msgid "See you."
msgstr "Hasta luego."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC332.rude:1
msgid ""
"I came here from Framon expecting to get a job easy.  For a Framish city, there's a lot of people here who don't like me!"
msgstr ""
"Vine desde Framon pensando que encontraría trabajo fácilmente. ¡Para ser una ciudad framesa, hay mucha gente aquí a la que no le caigo bien!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC332.rude:3
msgid "Sorry.  We don't know anyone who is looking to hire you."
msgstr "Lo sentimos. No conocemos a nadie que quiera contratarte."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC332.rude:3
msgid "That's a shame.  I'm a good worker, you know!"
msgstr "Qué lástima. ¡Que conste que soy buen trabajador!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC333.rude:1
msgid "If you have quick fingers, I may teach you."
msgstr "Si tenéis los dedos ágiles, quizá os enseñe."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC333.rude:1
msgid "We'd like to become Grandmasters in Disarm Trap"
msgstr "Queremos ser Grandes Maestros en Desarmar Trampas"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC333.rude:2
msgid ""
"I'm ready to get rid of all these Thronish visitors.  I think they have outstayed their welcome."
msgstr ""
"Estoy deseando librarme de todos estos visitantes throneses. Creo que ya han abusado de nuestra hospitalidad."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC333.rude:3
msgid ""
"It is a part of the nation of Framon.  And it will stay a part of Framon!"
msgstr ""
"Forma parte de la nación de Framon. ¡Y seguirá formando parte de Framon!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC333.rude:4
msgid "I suppose so."
msgstr "Supongo que sí."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC334.rude:1
msgid ""
"On the day Krohn foresaw the coming of the Great Reckoning, he demanded that we all fashion weapons.  Gungnir was the spear I made for myself.  Of course I lost it, and I can't go off looking for it, can I?"
msgstr ""
"El día en que Krohn previó la llegada del Gran Ajuste de Cuentas, nos exigió a todos que forjáramos armas. Gungnir fue la lanza que me hice yo. Por supuesto, la perdí, y no puedo marcharme a buscarla, ¿verdad?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC334.rude:1
msgid "What's Gungnir?"
msgstr "¿Qué es Gungnir?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC334.rude:10
msgid ""
"It's also called The Day of Wrath.  There will come a day when Njam will break out...umm...."
msgstr ""
"También se le llama el Día de la Ira. Llegará un día en que Njam se liberará... eh..."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC334.rude:10
msgid "What's the Great Reckoning?"
msgstr "¿Qué es el Gran Ajuste de Cuentas?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC334.rude:11
msgid "How could you help?"
msgstr "¿Cómo podríamos ayudar?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC334.rude:11
msgid "Maybe we could help?"
msgstr "¿Quizá podríamos ayudar?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC334.rude:12
msgid ""
"Well what do you expect of me?  I sit here day after day after day.  From the beginning of time until the Great Reckoning.  I've seen your kind come through here millions of times."
msgstr ""
"Bueno, ¿y qué esperáis de mí? Me paso aquí sentado día tras día tras día. Desde el principio de los tiempos hasta el Gran Ajuste de Cuentas. He visto pasar por aquí a los de vuestra calaña millones de veces."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC334.rude:12
msgid "You don't seem to like us very much."
msgstr "No parece que te caigamos muy bien."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC334.rude:13
msgid "Does your spear look like this?"
msgstr "¿Tu lanza se parece a esta?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC334.rude:13
msgid ""
"Where did you find that?  Give that here.  No mortal should have the use of that."
msgstr "¿Dónde habéis encontrado eso? Dádmela. Ningún mortal debería usarla."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC334.rude:14
msgid "I trust it wasn't too easy to find.  A fine job.  Here's your reward."
msgstr ""
"Confío en que no fuera demasiado fácil de encontrar. Buen trabajo. Aquí tenéis vuestra recompensa."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC334.rude:14
msgid "We found your spear."
msgstr "Hemos encontrado tu lanza."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC334.rude:15
msgid "What do I look like, a tour guide?  No!"
msgstr "¿Acaso tengo pinta de guía turístico? ¡No!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC334.rude:16
msgid "That's right!  Now get lost!"
msgstr "¡Exacto! ¡Y ahora largaos!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC334.rude:3
msgid ""
"Like I told you!  You're not on my list.  If you want to get in here, you need to visit the Wyrdes and get a Writ of Fate!"
msgstr ""
"¡Ya os lo he dicho! No estáis en mi lista. Si queréis entrar aquí, tenéis que visitar a las Wyrdes y conseguir un Mandato del Destino."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC334.rude:3
msgid "We need to get into Arslegard."
msgstr "Necesitamos entrar en Arslegard."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC334.rude:4
msgid ""
"Perhaps I displeased him once.  But the wrath he has shown me in the past isn't going to match what happens when he finds out I lost Gungnir!  What am I going to do when the Great Reckoning comes?"
msgstr ""
"Puede que alguna vez lo disgustara. ¡Pero la ira que me ha mostrado en el pasado no será nada comparada con lo que pasará cuando descubra que he perdido Gungnir! ¿Qué voy a hacer cuando llegue el Gran Ajuste de Cuentas?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC334.rude:4
msgid "That's unfortunate.  You must have really upset Krohn."
msgstr "Qué mala suerte. Debes de haber enfadado mucho a Krohn."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC334.rude:5
msgid ""
"I mean, there will come a day when Njam will lead a revolt against the gods.  On that day a great battle is fated to be fought.  Krohn demanded that we gods fashion weapons for ourselves.  Of course I lost mine."
msgstr ""
"Quiero decir que llegará un día en que Njam encabezará una rebelión contra los dioses. Ese día está escrito que se librará una gran batalla. Krohn nos exigió a los dioses que forjáramos armas para nosotros. Por supuesto, yo perdí la mía."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC334.rude:6
msgid "We could find it for you."
msgstr "Podríamos encontrarla por ti."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC334.rude:6
msgid ""
"Yes!  I suppose you could.  I think you may want to ask Fre.  She might have some idea where you can start looking.  Now don't dawdle!"
msgstr ""
"¡Sí! Supongo que podríais. Creo que deberíais preguntar a Fre. Quizá ella sepa por dónde podéis empezar a buscar. ¡Y no os entretengáis!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC334.rude:7
msgid ""
"Don't get impertinent with me!  Seeing as how you did find it, however, I will give you a small reward."
msgstr ""
"¡No seáis impertinentes conmigo! Pero, ya que la habéis encontrado, os daré una pequeña recompensa."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC334.rude:7
msgid "Not even a thank you?"
msgstr "¿Ni siquiera un «gracias»?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC334.rude:8
msgid "Maybe we couldn't.  Never mind."
msgstr "Quizá no podríamos. Olvídalo."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC334.rude:8
msgid "That's what I figured.  Goodbye."
msgstr "Eso me imaginaba. Adiós."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC334.rude:9
msgid ""
"Oh yes, you HAVE to wander around and show off your Writ of Fate, don't you?  Very well, I shall let you in."
msgstr ""
"Ah, claro, TENÉIS que pasearos por ahí presumiendo de vuestro Mandato del Destino, ¿verdad? Muy bien, os dejaré entrar."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC334.rude:9
msgid "We want to get in to Arslegard."
msgstr "Queremos entrar en Arslegard."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC335.rude:10
msgid "About Njam again.."
msgstr "Sobre Njam otra vez..."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC335.rude:11
msgid ""
"I am aware.  Congratulations.  I do not have time to speak with mortals.  Farewell."
msgstr ""
"Ya lo sé. Felicidades. No tengo tiempo para hablar con mortales. Adiós."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC335.rude:11
msgid "We have imprisoned Njam."
msgstr "Hemos encerrado a Njam."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC335.rude:12
msgid "Step easy around here, mortals."
msgstr "Andaos con cuidado por aquí, mortales."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC335.rude:2
msgid "What are we to do again?"
msgstr "¿Qué teníamos que hacer?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC335.rude:2
msgid ""
"You are to find a way to lure Njam to the Tomb of a Thousand Terrors and imprison him there."
msgstr ""
"Debéis encontrar la manera de atraer a Njam a la Tumba de los Mil Terrores y encerrarlo allí."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC335.rude:3
msgid "Njam the Meddler?"
msgstr "¿Njam el Entrometido?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC335.rude:3
msgid ""
"Yes.  He is the god of mischief.  It is high time he has paid for the problems he has caused.  You are a brave group.  This task I will give to you."
msgstr ""
"Sí. Es el dios de las travesuras. Ya va siendo hora de que pague por los problemas que ha causado. Sois un grupo valiente. Os encomendaré esta tarea."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC335.rude:4
msgid ""
"Of course you will.  Be wary, Njam the Meddler is a very tricky individual.  Again if you find yourself face to face with him, run.  Remember that he still is a god.  When you are finished return to me, I will have something for you.  Good luck."
msgstr ""
"Claro que lo haréis. Tened cuidado: Njam el Entrometido es un individuo muy astuto. Os repito que, si os encontráis cara a cara con él, huid. Recordad que sigue siendo un dios. Cuando terminéis, volved conmigo; tendré algo para vosotros. Buena suerte."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC335.rude:5
msgid "How are we supposed to get him to follow us?"
msgstr "¿Cómo vamos a conseguir que nos siga?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC335.rude:5
msgid ""
"I don't know.  There must be something you can find.  Go to his house here in Arslegard.  Take this key, you will need it to unlock the door.  But beware of him.  He is certain to know what you are up to.  If you happen to stumble onto him, run."
msgstr ""
"No lo sé. Seguro que podéis encontrar algo. Id a su casa, aquí en Arslegard. Tomad esta llave: la necesitaréis para abrir la puerta. Pero cuidado con él. Seguro que sabe lo que tramáis. Si os topáis con él, huid."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC335.rude:6
msgid "What task?"
msgstr "¿Qué tarea?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC335.rude:6
msgid ""
"You are to get Njam to follow you into the Tomb of a Thousand Terrors.  Once there, lead him to the heart of the tomb and imprison him in it."
msgstr ""
"Debéis conseguir que Njam os siga hasta la Tumba de los Mil Terrores. Una vez allí, llevadlo hasta el corazón de la tumba y encerradlo en él."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC335.rude:7
msgid ""
"Hmmm.  These are obviously not real.  They look to be the work of Njam the Meddler."
msgstr ""
"Hmmm. Está claro que no son auténticos. Parecen obra de Njam el Entrometido."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC335.rude:7
msgid "Yes sir!"
msgstr "¡Sí, señor!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC335.rude:8
msgid "And I see that he has a Writ of Fate also.  Let me see those!"
msgstr "Y veo que él también tiene un Mandato del Destino. ¡Dejadme ver eso!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC335.rude:8
msgid "We have a Writ of Fate!  It says we're supposed to stop him!"
msgstr "¡Tenemos un Mandato del Destino! ¡Dice que debemos detenerlo!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC335.rude:9
msgid ""
"Ah yes, Tamur Leng and the band of noble adventurers!  Just what do you think you are all doing?  Are you trying to make Hallenhalt burst at the seams?!"
msgstr ""
"¡Ah, sí, Tamur Leng y la banda de nobles aventureros! ¿Se puede saber qué creéis que estáis haciendo? ¿Queréis que Hallenhalt reviente por las costuras?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC335.rude:9
msgid "As you have summoned us, so we have come."
msgstr "Nos habéis convocado y aquí estamos."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC336.rude:11 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC336.rude:25
msgid "I shall see you again, mortals."
msgstr "Volveremos a vernos, mortales."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC336.rude:12
msgid ""
" I shall warn you, however.  Should they die again, I will keep them.  You will find their leader, Sven Forkbeard waiting for you outside the gates to Hallenhalt."
msgstr ""
"Pero os lo advierto: si vuelven a morir, me los quedaré. Encontraréis a su líder, Sven Forkbeard, esperándoos fuera de las puertas de Hallenhalt."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC336.rude:13
msgid "Very well.  Let us travel to the Afterworld."
msgstr "Muy bien. Viajemos a El Más Allá."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC336.rude:14
msgid ""
"You need help from me?  Not that I would give it, but what do you need?"
msgstr "¿Necesitáis mi ayuda? No es que vaya a dárosla, pero ¿qué necesitáis?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC336.rude:15
msgid "As I figured."
msgstr "Lo que me imaginaba."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC336.rude:15
msgid "Maybe we'll do this another time."
msgstr "Quizá lo hagamos en otro momento."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC336.rude:16
msgid "Behold, Your Guilt."
msgstr "Contemplad vuestra Culpa."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC336.rude:16
msgid "What do we do now?"
msgstr "¿Y ahora qué hacemos?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC336.rude:17
msgid "Farewell, mortals."
msgstr "Adiós, mortales."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC336.rude:18
msgid "No, it was not our fault."
msgstr "No, no fue culpa nuestra."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC336.rude:18
msgid "Why must you waste my time?  Begone with you!"
msgstr "¿Por qué me hacéis perder el tiempo? ¡Fuera de aquí!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC336.rude:19
msgid ""
"Do not defend your actions, mortals, for that is a certain path to failure.  Now answer me this.  Are you resposible for what we have just seen?"
msgstr ""
"No defendáis vuestros actos, mortales, pues ese es un camino seguro al fracaso. Ahora respondedme a esto: ¿sois responsables de lo que acabamos de ver?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC336.rude:19
msgid "How were we to know that Forad Darre was a traitor?"
msgstr "¿Cómo íbamos a saber que Forad Darre era un traidor?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC336.rude:2
msgid "Yes, but how...?"
msgstr "Sí, pero ¿cómo...?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC336.rude:20
msgid "So you have.  Now go, and suffer."
msgstr "Así es. Ahora id, y sufrid."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC336.rude:20
msgid "We have confessed our guilt."
msgstr "Hemos confesado nuestra culpa."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC336.rude:21
msgid ""
"Perhaps you have.  Scattered here are the soldiers who helped in your betrayal.  Retribution demands that you slay them."
msgstr ""
"Quizá sí. Por aquí están dispersos los soldados que ayudaron en vuestra traición. La Retribución exige que acabéis con ellos."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC336.rude:21
msgid "We have known suffering."
msgstr "Hemos conocido el sufrimiento."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC336.rude:22
msgid ""
"Retribution is yours.  Beware, these were just ghosts, reflections of reality.  Forad Darre still exists.  Your next task is to face your absolution.  Out there is the battlefield.  Find the weapons of the fallen Jarls and bring them back to me."
msgstr ""
"La Retribución es vuestra. Tened cuidado: no eran más que fantasmas, reflejos de la realidad. Forad Darre sigue existiendo. Vuestra siguiente tarea es enfrentaros a vuestra absolución. Ahí fuera está el campo de batalla. Encontrad las armas de los Jarls caídos y traédmelas."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC336.rude:22
msgid "We have slain the soldiers."
msgstr "Hemos matado a los soldados."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC336.rude:23
msgid "We have collected the swords."
msgstr "Hemos reunido las espadas."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC336.rude:23
msgid ""
"You have been absolved.  Out there is a blazing inferno.  Step through to be reborn."
msgstr ""
"Habéis sido absueltos. Ahí fuera hay un infierno en llamas. Atravesadlo para renacer."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC336.rude:24
msgid ""
"I must admit, I had little faith in you, but the Six Fires are blazing.  Very well, I shall let you take your soldiers back to your world."
msgstr ""
"He de reconocer que tenía poca fe en vosotros, pero los Seis Fuegos arden. Muy bien, os permitiré llevaros a vuestros soldados de vuelta a vuestro mundo."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC336.rude:24
msgid "We have lit the Six Fires of Penance."
msgstr "Hemos encendido los Seis Fuegos de la Penitencia."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC336.rude:3
msgid "Our Guilt?!"
msgstr "¿¡Nuestra Culpa!?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC336.rude:4
msgid ""
"They are the fires a soul must light in order to progress to Hallenhalt.  They are Guilt, Confession, Suffering, Retribution, Absolution, and Rebirth."
msgstr ""
"Son los fuegos que un alma debe encender para poder llegar a Hallenhalt. Son la Culpa, la Confesión, el Sufrimiento, la Retribución, la Absolución y el Renacimiento."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC336.rude:4
msgid "What are they again?"
msgstr "¿Cuáles eran?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC336.rude:5
msgid "We've come to ask for the return of our warriors."
msgstr "Hemos venido a pedir que nos devolváis a nuestros guerreros."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC336.rude:5
msgid ""
"You've lost a battle and you want me to return your slain army back to life?  Is that how things are done down there now?"
msgstr ""
"¿Habéis perdido una batalla y queréis que devuelva la vida a vuestro ejército caído? ¿Así se hacen ahora las cosas ahí abajo?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC336.rude:6
msgid ""
"Is that so now?  Well, I could do as you ask, but are you prepared to do what is required?"
msgstr ""
"¿Conque esas tenemos? Bueno, podría hacer lo que me pedís, pero ¿estáis dispuestos a hacer lo necesario?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC336.rude:6
msgid "Our Writ of Fate says it is our destiny to stop Tamur Leng!"
msgstr ""
"¡Nuestro Mandato del Destino dice que nuestro destino es detener a Tamur Leng!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC336.rude:7
msgid ""
"Very well.  The task that will be laid before is to light the Six Fires of Penance."
msgstr ""
"Muy bien. La tarea que se os encomendará es encender los Seis Fuegos de la Penitencia."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC336.rude:7
msgid "We will do whatever is required."
msgstr "Haremos lo que haga falta."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC336.rude:8
msgid ""
"Very well, then.  If you are truly responsible, then find those who you have failed.  Confess to them your guilt.  Go, and return to me."
msgstr ""
"Muy bien, entonces. Si de verdad sois responsables, buscad a aquellos a quienes habéis fallado. Confesadles vuestra culpa. Id, y volved conmigo."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC336.rude:9
msgid ""
"If a soul wishes to progress in the Afterworld and ascend to Hallenhalt, they may try to light the Six Fires of Penance.  These are Guilt, Confession, Suffering, Retribution, Absolution, and Rebirth.  Are you willing to light these in their stead?"
msgstr ""
"Si un alma desea avanzar en El Más Allá y ascender a Hallenhalt, puede intentar encender los Seis Fuegos de la Penitencia. Son la Culpa, la Confesión, el Sufrimiento, la Retribución, la Absolución y el Renacimiento. ¿Estáis dispuestos a encenderlos en su lugar?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC337.rude:1
msgid ""
"I cannot answer that.  Besides, what makes you think he is not acting of his own accord?"
msgstr ""
"No puedo responder a eso. Además, ¿qué os hace pensar que no actúa por voluntad propia?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC337.rude:1
msgid "Who is behind Tamur Leng?"
msgstr "¿Quién está detrás de Tamur Leng?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC337.rude:10
msgid ""
"I have a task for you.  If you can complete the task, I will answer three questions for you."
msgstr ""
"Tengo una tarea para vosotros. Si conseguís completarla, responderé a tres preguntas."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC337.rude:11
msgid "Perhaps we can do your task another time."
msgstr "Quizá hagamos tu tarea en otro momento."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC337.rude:11
msgid "Should you wish your questions answered, return."
msgstr "Si deseáis respuesta a vuestras preguntas, volved."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC337.rude:12
msgid "We have retrieved the Golden Honk."
msgstr "Hemos recuperado el Honk Dorado."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC337.rude:12
msgid "Wonderful.  As a reward, I shall answer three questions."
msgstr "Maravilloso. Como recompensa, responderé a tres preguntas."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC337.rude:13
msgid "If you persevere?  Yes."
msgstr "¿Si perseveráis? Sí."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC337.rude:13
msgid "Will we succeed in stopping Tamur Leng?"
msgstr "¿Lograremos detener a Tamur Leng?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC337.rude:14
msgid "You are welcome children.  Farewell."
msgstr "De nada, hijos míos. Adiós."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC337.rude:15 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC47.rude:14
msgid "Does it look like this?"
msgstr "¿Se parece a esto?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC337.rude:15
msgid ""
"That's it!  You must have read my mind!  Very well.  I shall answer three questions for you."
msgstr ""
"¡Eso es! ¡Debéis de haberme leído la mente! Muy bien. Responderé a tres preguntas."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC337.rude:16
msgid "The answers have not changed, children, but very well."
msgstr "Las respuestas no han cambiado, hijos míos, pero muy bien."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC337.rude:17
msgid ""
"Should you succeed, I see the clans united.  A leader shall emerge, borne of two Jarls.  She shall draw the sword and become Queen of all Chedian."
msgstr ""
"Si lo lográis, veo a los clanes unidos. Surgirá una líder, nacida de dos Jarls. Ella desenvainará la espada y se convertirá en Reina de todo Chedian."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC337.rude:17
msgid "What does the future hold for Chedian?"
msgstr "¿Qué le depara el futuro a Chedian?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC337.rude:18
msgid "You are welcome, mortals."
msgstr "De nada, mortales."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC337.rude:19
msgid ""
"Gungnir?  That old fool lost it!  As if that's a surprise.  Good thing Krohn doesn't know.  I don't envy Hanndl's punishment for that!"
msgstr ""
"¿Gungnir? ¡Ese viejo necio la perdió! Como si fuera una sorpresa. Menos mal que Krohn no lo sabe. ¡No envidio el castigo que le espera a Hanndl por eso!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC337.rude:19
msgid "What happened to Hanndl's spear?"
msgstr "¿Qué le pasó a la lanza de Hanndl?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC337.rude:2
msgid "In western Chedian?  You mean Thronheim?"
msgstr "¿En el oeste de Chedian? ¿Te refieres a Thronheim?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC337.rude:2
msgid ""
"That was before that fool Verhoffin resurfaced the geography.  Who knows where those ruins are now."
msgstr ""
"Eso fue antes de que ese necio de Verhoffin cambiara la faz de la tierra. Quién sabe dónde estarán ahora esas ruinas."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC337.rude:3
msgid "Any idea where it is?"
msgstr "¿Tienes idea de dónde está?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC337.rude:3
msgid ""
"Well, it wasn't that long ago, at least for us, only 800 years ago or so.  Some group of soldiers for the Ursanian Empire picked it up, and took it to their storehouse in the western part of the land you now call Chedian."
msgstr ""
"Bueno, no fue hace tanto, al menos para nosotros: hace unos 800 años. Unos soldados del Imperio Ursanio la recogieron y la llevaron a su almacén, en la parte occidental de la tierra que ahora llamáis Chedian."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC337.rude:4
msgid ""
"There is a new religious group called Honkies, or Honkers or something of that nature.  They have begun to worship Philip, our pet goose."
msgstr ""
"Hay un nuevo grupo religioso llamado honkistas, o honqueros, o algo por el estilo. Han empezado a adorar a Philip, nuestro ganso."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC337.rude:4
msgid "We would be glad to do your task."
msgstr "Estaremos encantados de cumplir tu tarea."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC337.rude:5
msgid ""
"This is becoming a problem, as it is taking their time away from those that they should be worshipping, namely us!  I wish to teach them a lesson.  Go back down there, get into the Temple of Honk, and bring back to me the icon they worship."
msgstr ""
"Esto se está convirtiendo en un problema, pues les roba el tiempo que deberían dedicar a quienes de verdad merecen su adoración, ¡o sea, a nosotros! Quiero darles una lección. Volved allá abajo, entrad en el Templo de Honk y traedme el ídolo que adoran."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC337.rude:5
msgid "We've heard of them."
msgstr "Hemos oído hablar de ellos."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC337.rude:7
msgid "Those are questions I cannot answer."
msgstr "Esas son preguntas que no puedo responder."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC337.rude:7
msgid "What sword?  What two Jarls?"
msgstr "¿Qué espada? ¿Qué dos Jarls?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC337.rude:8
msgid ""
"It is a golden statue of Philip, an artifact which they have named the Golden Honk.  Bring it back to me.  And if they should put up some resistance, give them some divine justice.  Once they get here, they will pay for their neglect."
msgstr ""
"Es una estatua dorada de Philip, un artefacto al que han llamado el Honk Dorado. Traédmelo. Y si oponen resistencia, impartidles un poco de justicia divina. Cuando lleguen aquí, pagarán por su descuido."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC337.rude:8
msgid "What does it look like?"
msgstr "¿Qué aspecto tiene?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC337.rude:9
msgid "See that you do it quickly.  Now be off with you."
msgstr "Procurad hacerlo deprisa. Y ahora marchaos."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC337.rude:9
msgid "Thank you for this opportunity."
msgstr "Gracias por esta oportunidad."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC338.rude:2
msgid ""
"How can you save the world when you can't find your way around a place as simple as this?  Go through the magic portal behind me.  It will take you where you need to go."
msgstr ""
"¿Cómo vais a salvar el mundo si no sabéis orientaros en un lugar tan sencillo como este? Cruzad el portal mágico que hay detrás de mí. Os llevará adonde necesitáis ir."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC338.rude:3
msgid "Stop wasting time with your flowery speeches.  Get on with it!"
msgstr ""
"Dejad de perder el tiempo con vuestros discursos floridos. ¡Manos a la obra!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC338.rude:3
msgid "We will do this.  Thank you for your time."
msgstr "Lo haremos. Gracias por tu tiempo."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC338.rude:4
msgid ""
"It's a convenient place to store it until I need it later.  Take it to Verhoffin's Ruins, and place it on the pedestal in the Lab Room.  Once the Capstone of Order is placed, your Writ of Fate will present itself."
msgstr ""
"Es un lugar cómodo para guardarla hasta que la necesite más adelante. Llevadla a las Ruinas de Verhoffin y colocadla sobre el pedestal del Laboratorio. Una vez colocada la Piedra Angular del Orden, vuestro Mandato del Destino aparecerá."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC338.rude:4
msgid "Why the Isle of Ashes?"
msgstr "¿Por qué la Isla de las Cenizas?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC338.rude:5
msgid ""
"I am rather fond of the Capstone of Order, a magical device that insures orderliness.  It seems to have fallen from Arslegard and landed in Guberland.  Go to The Gathering in Guberland, retrieve the Capstone, and take it to the Isle of Ashes."
msgstr ""
"Le tengo bastante cariño a la Piedra Angular del Orden, un artefacto mágico que garantiza el orden. Parece que se cayó de Arslegard y fue a parar a Guberland. Id a La Reunión en Guberland, recuperad la Piedra Angular y llevadla a la Isla de las Cenizas."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC338.rude:6
msgid "We've come seeking a Writ of Fate."
msgstr "Venimos en busca de un Mandato del Destino."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC338.rude:6
msgid ""
"Yes, yes, I know.  That wort Hanndl won't let you in without one.  I can assure you that there is a Writ of Fate with your names on it.  I shall give it to you.  But first, there is something you will do for me."
msgstr ""
"Sí, sí, ya lo sé. Ese cretino de Hanndl no os dejará entrar sin uno. Os aseguro que hay un Mandato del Destino con vuestros nombres. Os lo daré. Pero antes haréis algo por mí."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC338.rude:7
msgid "Uhh, one more thing?"
msgstr "Eh... ¿una cosa más?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC338.rude:8
msgid "Farewell, Adventurers."
msgstr "Adiós, aventureros."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC339.rude:10
msgid "We'd like a room."
msgstr "Queremos una habitación."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC339.rude:11
msgid "My plans for the bathhouse are going well now, thanks to you."
msgstr "Gracias a vosotros, mis planes para la casa de baños van muy bien."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC339.rude:13
msgid "We cleaned out your bathhouse."
msgstr "Hemos limpiado tu casa de baños."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC339.rude:13
msgid ""
"You succeeded?  You must be very strong!  Thank you.  Here's your reward."
msgstr ""
"¿Lo habéis conseguido? ¡Debéis de ser muy fuertes! Gracias. Aquí tenéis vuestra recompensa."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC339.rude:2
msgid "Thanks!  Come back here for your money!"
msgstr "¡Gracias! ¡Volved aquí a por vuestro dinero!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC339.rude:2
msgid "Why not?  We'd be happy to!"
msgstr "¿Por qué no? ¡Será un placer!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC339.rude:3
msgid ""
"Say, you look like the strong type!  I don't suppose you'd want to go in there and show those monsters who owns that place would you?  I'd pay you well!"
msgstr ""
"Oye, ¡tenéis pinta de ser de los fuertes! Supongo que no querríais entrar ahí y enseñar a esos monstruos quién manda en ese lugar, ¿verdad? ¡Os pagaría bien!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC339.rude:3
msgid "Sounds like you're in a heap of trouble alright."
msgstr "Pues sí que parece que estás metido en un buen lío."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC339.rude:4
msgid "Why doesn't he help you?"
msgstr "¿Por qué no te ayuda él?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC339.rude:4
msgid ""
"You ever try asking a god for anything?  Didn't think so.  Krohn says it's my problem and I have to deal with it.  But I'm not going in there!  That Ebora and her concubines would tear me to shreds."
msgstr ""
"¿Alguna vez habéis intentado pedirle algo a un dios? Ya me parecía. Krohn dice que es mi problema y que tengo que ocuparme yo. ¡Pero yo no pienso entrar ahí! Esa Ebora y sus concubinas me harían trizas."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC339.rude:5
msgid ""
"Well, the guy I bought it from didn't secure the doors before he closed down for good.  Now some creature called Ebora has taken up residence there.  Krohn himself is anxious to take a bath, and wants the thing operational."
msgstr ""
"Pues el tipo que me la vendió no aseguró las puertas antes de cerrar para siempre. Ahora una criatura llamada Ebora se ha instalado allí. El mismísimo Krohn está deseando darse un baño y quiere que funcione."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC339.rude:5
msgid "What sort of problem?"
msgstr "¿Qué clase de problema?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC339.rude:6
msgid ""
"I've got this bathhouse I bought which seems to have a little problem."
msgstr "He comprado una casa de baños que parece tener un pequeño problema."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC339.rude:7
msgid "That old place?  We already cleaned it out."
msgstr "¿Ese viejo lugar? Ya lo hemos limpiado."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC339.rude:7
msgid ""
"You did?  That's wonderful!  Here, I've got a reward for you.  Thank you!"
msgstr ""
"¿De verdad? ¡Es maravilloso! Tomad, tengo una recompensa para vosotros. ¡Gracias!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC339.rude:8
msgid "We're too busy for that sort of thing."
msgstr "Estamos demasiado ocupados para esas cosas."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC339.rude:8
msgid ""
"Well alright.  Maybe you'd like to contribute to my wealth by buying a drink?"
msgstr ""
"Bueno, está bien. ¿Quizá queráis contribuir a mi fortuna comprando una bebida?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC339.rude:9
msgid ""
"You've got to be on your toes around here if you own anything.  If the gods don't like your service, they'll send you to the Afterworld."
msgstr ""
"Por aquí hay que andarse con mucho ojo si tienes un negocio. Si a los dioses no les gusta tu servicio, te mandan a El Más Allá."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC34.rude:1
msgid ""
"Dunno.  Maybe he hasn't found the right group of people to go get it yet."
msgstr ""
"Ni idea. Quizá todavía no ha encontrado al grupo adecuado para ir a buscarlo."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC34.rude:1
msgid "Why hasn't Sven got Thjorad back already?"
msgstr "¿Por qué Sven no ha recuperado aún el Thjorad?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC34.rude:10
msgid ""
"Our Jarl?  His real name is Sven Svenssen.  I heard that he wants to get Thjorad back."
msgstr ""
"¿Nuestro Jarl? Su verdadero nombre es Sven Svenssen. He oído que quiere recuperar el Thjorad."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC34.rude:11 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC426.rude:10
msgid "Nothing.  Goodbye"
msgstr "Nada. Adiós."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC34.rude:2
msgid "How could a bunch of monks steal a precious artifact?"
msgstr "¿Cómo iba un puñado de monjes a robar un artefacto tan valioso?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC34.rude:2
msgid ""
"I don't know, but I think they did!  There's no way we would have let them have it!"
msgstr "No lo sé, ¡pero creo que lo hicieron! ¡Jamás se lo habríamos dejado!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC34.rude:3
msgid "Maybe we could ask you something else"
msgstr "Quizá podríamos preguntarte otra cosa"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC34.rude:4
msgid "Forget it!  I wouldn't want to work there!"
msgstr "¡Ni hablar! ¡No querría trabajar allí!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC34.rude:4
msgid "Maybe you should try to get a job as a foreman."
msgstr "Quizá deberías intentar conseguir un empleo de capataz."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC34.rude:5
msgid ""
"I know those lazy miners have stopped working for some reason!  I tell you, If I was in charge, they would be working as hard as can be!"
msgstr ""
"¡Sé que esos mineros holgazanes han dejado de trabajar por algún motivo! Os lo digo: ¡si yo estuviera al mando, trabajarían tanto como pudieran!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC34.rude:6 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC35.rude:3
msgid "We wanted to ask you about something."
msgstr "Queríamos preguntarte algo."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC34.rude:7 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC35.rude:10
msgid "Nice talking to you."
msgstr "Ha sido un placer hablar contigo."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC34.rude:8
msgid ""
"That is a mighty artifact.  My father used to tell me that once Lindisfarne and Thjorgard were friends!  Ha!  He said that we loaned Thjorad to them.  Personally, I think they stole it!"
msgstr ""
"Es un artefacto poderoso. Mi padre me contaba que hubo un tiempo en que Lindisfarne y Thjorgard eran amigos. ¡Ja! Decía que les prestamos el Thjorad. Yo creo que nos lo robaron."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC34.rude:8 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC421.rude:6
msgid "What do you know about Thjorad?"
msgstr "¿Qué sabes del Thjorad?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC340.rude:1
msgid ""
"I hear Hanndl lost the spear he's supposed to have for the Great Reckoning.  I'm sure Krohn is not pleased with him.  Hanndl can't be happy either!  It's not like he can go out and look for it!"
msgstr ""
"He oído que Hanndl perdió la lanza que debe tener para el Gran Ajuste de Cuentas. Seguro que a Krohn no le hace ninguna gracia. ¡Y Hanndl tampoco debe de estar contento! ¡No es que pueda salir a buscarla!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC340.rude:3
msgid "Watch out for Hanndl.  He's a grump!"
msgstr "Cuidado con Hanndl. ¡Es un cascarrabias!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC340.rude:5
msgid "Come back soon, cheapskates!"
msgstr "¡Volved pronto, tacaños!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC340.rude:6
msgid "Take a look at my weapons!"
msgstr "¡Echad un vistazo a mis armas!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC341.rude:1
msgid ""
"I hear the bartender is having a heck of a time with that new bathhouse he's bought.  I told him he wasn't going to have anything but trouble with it.  But he insisted on buying it, and now he's got Krohn himself breathing down his neck!"
msgstr ""
"He oído que el tabernero lo está pasando fatal con esa casa de baños que se ha comprado. Ya le dije que no le traería más que problemas. Pero se empeñó en comprarla, ¡y ahora tiene al mismísimo Krohn encima!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC341.rude:2
msgid "We'd like to see your armor."
msgstr "Queremos ver tus armaduras."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC341.rude:3
msgid ""
"Well, they generally stay away from us.  We don't really have anything they can't get themselves.  But don't go looking for them.  They might just send you to the Afterworld!"
msgstr ""
"Bueno, por lo general se mantienen alejados de nosotros. En realidad no tenemos nada que ellos no puedan conseguir por sí mismos. Pero no vayáis a buscarlos. ¡Podrían mandaros a El Más Allá!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC341.rude:6
msgid "Have a look at some armor!"
msgstr "¡Echad un vistazo a estas armaduras!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC342.rude:1
msgid ""
"I hear Fre is really upset at the Honkies down in Guberland.  She's upset that they're paying more attention to that goose than to her!  Those poor souls!  I don't envy them when she finds someone to take care of them!"
msgstr ""
"He oído que Fre está muy enfadada con los honkistas de Guberland. ¡Le molesta que le presten más atención a ese ganso que a ella! ¡Pobres almas! ¡No los envidio cuando encuentre a alguien que se ocupe de ellos!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC342.rude:3
msgid ""
"I can't believe they won't let me into Hallenhalt!  I was a brave and noble person in life!"
msgstr ""
"¡No puedo creer que no me dejen entrar en Hallenhalt! ¡En vida fui una persona valiente y noble!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC343.rude:1
msgid ""
"In life, I was one of the greatest mages in all of Chedian.  Look at me now!  I have to sell magic books just to get by!"
msgstr ""
"En vida fui uno de los mayores magos de todo Chedian. ¡Y miradme ahora! ¡Tengo que vender libros de magia para ir tirando!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC343.rude:2
msgid "Of course!  Take a look."
msgstr "¡Por supuesto! Echad un vistazo."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC343.rude:3
msgid "Don't upset the gods."
msgstr "No hagáis enfadar a los dioses."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC344.rude:1
msgid ""
"I saw Fre walk through here the other day as angry as can be.  She was mumbling something about honkies.  I wonder what she was upset about?"
msgstr ""
"El otro día vi pasar por aquí a Fre, furiosa como nunca. Murmuraba algo sobre los honkistas. ¿Qué la habrá molestado tanto?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC344.rude:3
msgid ""
"Fre is the best of the gods.  She always is around whenever I need some help."
msgstr ""
"Fre es la mejor de los dioses. Siempre está ahí cuando necesito ayuda."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC345.rude:1
msgid "I was killed in a storm, when the boat I was on sank."
msgstr "Morí en una tormenta, cuando se hundió el barco en el que viajaba."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC345.rude:2 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC350.rude:2 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC50.rude:8
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC98.rude:3 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC99.rude:3
msgid "Have a look!"
msgstr "¡Echad un vistazo!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC345.rude:3
msgid "It's hard work having a job up here.  Dead people are very demanding."
msgstr "Es duro tener un trabajo aquí arriba. Los muertos son muy exigentes."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC345.rude:5
msgid "See you later!"
msgstr "¡Hasta luego!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC346.rude:1
msgid ""
"When most people arrive here, they're shocked that there's a bank.  I don't know why.  It's not like we don't have an economy or anything!"
msgstr ""
"La mayoría de la gente que llega aquí se sorprende de que haya un banco. No sé por qué. ¡Ni que no tuviéramos economía!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC346.rude:3
msgid "They are the ones who decide the fates of mortals."
msgstr "Son ellas quienes deciden el destino de los mortales."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC346.rude:3 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC367.rude:3
msgid "What do you know about the Wyrdes?"
msgstr "¿Qué sabes de las Wyrdes?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC346.rude:4
msgid "Already got one, thanks!"
msgstr "¡Ya tengo uno, gracias!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC346.rude:7
msgid "A pleasure!  Anything else?"
msgstr "¡Un placer! ¿Algo más?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC347.rude:1
msgid ""
"Is that so?   I think I will be the one who makes the choice of whether or not you are ready."
msgstr "¿Conque sí? Creo que seré yo quien decida si estáis preparados o no."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC347.rude:1
msgid "We'd like to become Blade Grandmasters."
msgstr "Queremos ser Grandes Maestros en Cuchillas."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC347.rude:2
msgid "Waste them on someone else."
msgstr "Malgastadlas con otro."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC347.rude:3
msgid "Yeah.  See you."
msgstr "Sí. Hasta luego."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC348.rude:1
msgid "What sort of news do you think a dead priest has?"
msgstr "¿Qué clase de noticias creéis que tiene un sacerdote muerto?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC348.rude:2
msgid "We'd like some healing."
msgstr "Queremos que nos cures."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC348.rude:3
msgid "It's a wonderful place!"
msgstr "¡Es un lugar maravilloso!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC348.rude:4
msgid "Blessings upon you!"
msgstr "¡Que las bendiciones os acompañen!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC348.rude:7
msgid "A pleasure, my children.  Was there something else you needed?"
msgstr "Un placer, hijos míos. ¿Necesitabais algo más?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC349.rude:1
msgid ""
"The other day, I hear that Hanndl was stomping around complaining about people who aren't dead who keep trying to get in to Arslegard.  He said he finally told them they needed a Writ of Fate just to get rid of them."
msgstr ""
"El otro día oí que Hanndl iba dando pisotones por ahí quejándose de unos que no están muertos y que no paran de intentar entrar en Arslegard. Dijo que al final les contestó que necesitaban un Mandato del Destino, solo para quitárselos de encima."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC349.rude:3
msgid ""
"It's a fine place, as long as you don't talk to the gatekeeper.  He's a little, umm..unpleasant."
msgstr ""
"Es un buen lugar, siempre que no habléis con el guardián de la puerta. Es un poco... eh... desagradable."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC349.rude:6
msgid "Of course!  Anything else you needed?"
msgstr "¡Por supuesto! ¿Necesitabais algo más?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC35.rude:1
msgid "Can we ask you about something else?"
msgstr "¿Podemos preguntarte otra cosa?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC35.rude:11
msgid "Actually, We thought we might ask you about something?"
msgstr "En realidad, ¿podríamos preguntarte algo?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC35.rude:12
msgid "Never heard of that kind of rock."
msgstr "Nunca he oído hablar de esa clase de piedra."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC35.rude:14 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC38.rude:15 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC63.rude:4
msgid "Never mind.  Goodbye."
msgstr "Olvídalo. Adiós."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC35.rude:2
msgid "Nothing, really.  It's just a place where I live, and wash stones."
msgstr "Nada, la verdad. Solo es el sitio donde vivo y lavo piedras."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC35.rude:4
msgid "Instead of waiting for someone to ask me to?  What a brilliant idea!"
msgstr ""
"¿En lugar de esperar a que alguien me lo pida? ¡Qué idea tan brillante!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC35.rude:4
msgid "Perhaps you should sell stones you wash."
msgstr "Quizá deberías vender las piedras que lavas."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC35.rude:5
msgid ""
"Slow.  People have been taking their stones out to the beach, instead of me.  How can I compete with that?"
msgstr ""
"Va flojo. La gente se lleva sus piedras a la playa en vez de traérmelas a mí. ¿Cómo voy a competir con eso?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC35.rude:6
msgid ""
"Some people around here don't like to get their hands dirty.  So I do it for them."
msgstr ""
"A alguna gente de por aquí no le gusta ensuciarse las manos. Así que lo hago yo por ellos."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC35.rude:6
msgid "Why wouldn't they do it themselves?"
msgstr "¿Por qué no lo hacen ellos mismos?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC35.rude:7
msgid ""
"Well, when someone has a stone that's dirty, they bring it to be.  I shine it up real good."
msgstr ""
"Pues cuando alguien tiene una piedra sucia, me la trae. Y yo se la dejo bien reluciente."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC35.rude:7
msgid "Why would anyone want to wash a stone?"
msgstr "¿Por qué querría alguien lavar una piedra?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC35.rude:8
msgid "Beg pardon?"
msgstr "¿Cómo dices?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC35.rude:8
msgid ""
"Stones.  Do you need any washed?  I do the best job in all of Thjorgard"
msgstr ""
"Piedras. ¿Necesitáis que os lave alguna? Soy el que mejor lo hace en todo Thjorgard"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC35.rude:9
msgid ""
"That's some good rock!  What I wouldn't do to be able to wash some of that!"
msgstr "¡Qué piedra tan buena! ¡Lo que daría por poder lavar un poco de eso!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC350.rude:1
msgid ""
"In life I was a mother of six!  I never had time to do anything!  Now, I can do pretty much anything I want.  It's great!"
msgstr ""
"¡En vida fui madre de seis hijos! ¡Nunca tenía tiempo para nada! Ahora puedo hacer prácticamente lo que quiera. ¡Es estupendo!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC350.rude:3
msgid ""
"I try to stay away from them.  They don't seem like they like us very much."
msgstr ""
"Intento mantenerme alejada de ellos. No parece que les caigamos muy bien."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC351.rude:1
msgid ""
"Krohn himself came down here to work out the other day.  It was amazing!  If he comes back, you should stick around and watch him."
msgstr ""
"El otro día el mismísimo Krohn bajó aquí a entrenar. ¡Fue increíble! Si vuelve, deberíais quedaros a verlo."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC351.rude:3
msgid ""
"He's a true warrior-god.  When the Great Reckoning comes, you can bet I'll be by his side!"
msgstr ""
"Es un auténtico dios guerrero. Cuando llegue el Gran Ajuste de Cuentas, ¡podéis apostar a que estaré a su lado!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC351.rude:3
msgid "What do you know about Krohn?"
msgstr "¿Qué sabes de Krohn?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC352.rude:1
msgid ""
"I was killed by a beaten warrior!  He had no more fight in him, and I got sloppy.  I moved in to finish him off, and he stabbed me with his sword!  I don't know where that fight came from, he was beaten!"
msgstr ""
"¡Me mató un guerrero derrotado! No le quedaban fuerzas para luchar y me confié. Me acerqué para rematarlo, ¡y me atravesó con su espada! No sé de dónde sacó esas fuerzas, ¡estaba vencido!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC352.rude:3
msgid ""
"I bet that I would have gone there if I hadn't been so sloppy.  When I tried to get in, Skraelos, he just laughed at me!"
msgstr ""
"Apuesto a que habría ido allí si no me hubiera confiado tanto. Cuando intenté entrar, Skraelos se rió de mí sin más."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC352.rude:3 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC355.rude:3 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC356.rude:3
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC357.rude:3 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC58.rude:3 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC59.rude:7
msgid "What do you know about Hallenhalt?"
msgstr "¿Qué sabes de Hallenhalt?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC353.rude:1
msgid ""
"I was the last survivor on our raiding party when I was killed.  I faced ten Framish swords alone.  I fought them down to four before they finally finished me off!"
msgstr ""
"Era el último superviviente de nuestra partida de saqueo cuando me mataron. Me enfrenté yo solo a diez espadas framesas. ¡Acabé con seis antes de que por fin acabaran conmigo!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC353.rude:3
msgid ""
"He is the god of death.  It's his job to make sure only the worthy get into Hallenhalt."
msgstr ""
"Es el dios de la muerte. Su trabajo es asegurarse de que solo los dignos entren en Hallenhalt."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC353.rude:3
msgid "What do you know about Skraelos?"
msgstr "¿Qué sabes de Skraelos?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC354.rude:1
msgid "Did I ever tell you about how I killed a dragon?"
msgstr "¿Os he contado alguna vez cómo maté a un dragón?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC354.rude:3
msgid ""
"Sweet mercy is it dull around here!  I've been sitting around for like fifty years!  You know what I'm ready for?  I'm ready for a raid!  Yeah!  That's what I need!"
msgstr ""
"¡Santo cielo, qué aburrido es esto! ¡Llevo aquí sentado como cincuenta años! ¿Sabéis para qué estoy listo? ¡Para una incursión! ¡Sí! ¡Eso es lo que necesito!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC355.rude:1
msgid ""
"That infernal Beowulf!  He always claims he was some mighty fighter!  He could barely hold a sword, much less use one!"
msgstr ""
"¡Ese condenado Beowulf! ¡Siempre presume de haber sido un gran guerrero! ¡Apenas podía sostener una espada, y mucho menos usarla!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC355.rude:3
msgid ""
"Beowulf always claims that's where he belongs.  I always have to remind him that we starved to death!  You know why?  Because he could farm a field about as well as he could lasso the sky!"
msgstr ""
"Beowulf siempre dice que ese es su sitio. ¡Y yo siempre tengo que recordarle que morimos de hambre! ¿Sabéis por qué? ¡Porque sabía cultivar un campo tan bien como echarle el lazo al cielo!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC356.rude:1
msgid ""
"This is the worst beer I have ever had!  Why don't the good bartenders ever end up here?"
msgstr ""
"¡Esta es la peor cerveza que he probado en mi vida! ¿Por qué los buenos taberneros nunca acaban aquí?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC356.rude:3
msgid ""
"I know they get all the good bartenders!  Why does Skraelos think those people in Hallenhalt are so special?  Why do they deserve all the good bartenders?"
msgstr ""
"¡Seguro que ellos se quedan con todos los buenos taberneros! ¿Por qué cree Skraelos que la gente de Hallenhalt es tan especial? ¿Por qué merecen ellos todos los buenos taberneros?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC357.rude:1
msgid ""
"I don't know what Mjoll over there is complaining about!  The beer here is fine!"
msgstr "¡No sé de qué se queja Mjoll! ¡La cerveza de aquí está bien!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC357.rude:3
msgid "That's where the really good bars are."
msgstr "Allí es donde están las tabernas buenas de verdad."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC358.rude:1
msgid ""
"What do I look like?  Bother me again, and I'll wallop you a good one!"
msgstr "¿Qué pinta tengo? ¡Molestadme otra vez y os daré una buena tunda!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC358.rude:2
msgid "That's right you are!"
msgstr "¡Y tanto que molestáis!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC359.rude:1
msgid ""
"You see that guy Moyol around here?  I'm the one who killed him.  He keeps trying to start a fight with me."
msgstr ""
"¿Veis a ese tipo, Moyol, por aquí? Fui yo quien lo mató. No deja de intentar buscarme pelea."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC359.rude:3
msgid "It beats being in the Afterworld, that's for sure!"
msgstr "Es mejor que estar en El Más Allá, eso seguro."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC36.rude:10
msgid ""
"Hmmm.  And then I wouldn't have to kill them.  I wouldn't have to risk the lives of my fellow raiders.  Sounds risky."
msgstr ""
"Hmmm. Y entonces no tendría que matarlos. No tendría que arriesgar la vida de mis compañeros de saqueo. Suena arriesgado."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC36.rude:10
msgid "Maybe if you helped them, they could help you become rich."
msgstr "Quizá, si los ayudaras, ellos podrían ayudarte a hacerte rico."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC36.rude:11
msgid "Perhaps you should think about it."
msgstr "Quizá deberías pensarlo."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC36.rude:11
msgid "That I will."
msgstr "Eso haré."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC36.rude:13
msgid "Maybe someone should help them."
msgstr "Quizá alguien debería ayudarlos."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC36.rude:13
msgid ""
"Why would anyone do that?  Then we would lose a prime raiding location!"
msgstr ""
"¿Por qué iba alguien a hacer eso? ¡Entonces perderíamos un lugar de saqueo de primera!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC36.rude:14
msgid "What's so special about the Monastery at Lindisfarne?"
msgstr "¿Qué tiene de especial el Monasterio de Lindisfarne?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC36.rude:14
msgid ""
"You mean besides its riches?  I don't know.  I don't really care, as long as they stay rich!"
msgstr ""
"¿Aparte de sus riquezas? No lo sé. Me da igual, ¡mientras sigan siendo ricos!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC36.rude:15
msgid ""
"If they aren't strong enough to defend themselves, it is our duty to show them the might!"
msgstr ""
"Si no son lo bastante fuertes para defenderse, ¡es nuestro deber demostrarles lo que es la fuerza!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC36.rude:15
msgid "Why would you do such a thing?"
msgstr "¿Por qué ibais a hacer algo así?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC36.rude:16
msgid "I'm sure it is.  Goodbye"
msgstr "Seguro que sí. Adiós"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC36.rude:17
msgid ""
"No!  They have tried to build bigger walls to stop us from entering, but that is the extent of their fortifications!"
msgstr ""
"¡No! Han intentado levantar muros más altos para impedirnos entrar, pero hasta ahí llegan sus fortificaciones."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC36.rude:17
msgid "They haven't built defenses for themselves?"
msgstr "¿No han construido defensas?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC36.rude:2
msgid "And there are still men there?"
msgstr "¿Y todavía quedan hombres allí?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC36.rude:2
msgid ""
"Oh yes!  Lindisfarne is one of the most prestigious schools for monks in all of Framon!  There is a huge waiting list of monks who want to study there."
msgstr ""
"¡Oh, sí! Lindisfarne es una de las escuelas de monjes más prestigiosas de todo Framon. Hay una enorme lista de espera de monjes que quieren estudiar allí."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC36.rude:3
msgid ""
"They seem incapable of the concept of defense!  Perhaps it's part of their monkish vows."
msgstr ""
"¡Parecen incapaces de entender el concepto de defensa! Quizá forme parte de sus votos monásticos."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC36.rude:3
msgid "Why don't they defend themselves?"
msgstr "¿Por qué no se defienden?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC36.rude:4
msgid ""
"Because they're rich!  They always seem to have great treasures!  Why, I've raided the monastery there at least five times!"
msgstr ""
"¡Porque son ricos! ¡Siempre parecen tener grandes tesoros! Vaya, ¡si habré saqueado ese monasterio por lo menos cinco veces!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC36.rude:5
msgid "How do we get in on this raiding action?"
msgstr "¿Cómo nos apuntamos a esos saqueos?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC36.rude:5
msgid ""
"Just take a boat to Lindisfarne!  Most ships would be happy to take you there."
msgstr ""
"¡Basta con coger un barco a Lindisfarne! La mayoría de los barcos os llevarán allí encantados."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC36.rude:6
msgid "Who cares about that stuff!  They have money!  I want to be rich!"
msgstr "¡A quién le importan esas cosas! ¡Tienen dinero! ¡Quiero ser rico!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC36.rude:6
msgid "You don't think they may possess important knowledge?"
msgstr "¿No crees que puedan poseer conocimientos importantes?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC36.rude:7
msgid ""
"Ha!  And I suppose that's why Lindisfarne Monastery is always being raided, right?  Cause they're so smart?"
msgstr ""
"¡Ja! Y supongo que por eso siempre están saqueando el Monasterio de Lindisfarne, ¿no? ¿Porque son tan listos?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC36.rude:7
msgid "Knowledge could make you rich, friend."
msgstr "El conocimiento podría hacerte rico, amigo."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC36.rude:8
msgid "That's right!"
msgstr "¡Así es!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC36.rude:8
msgid "They're raided because they're rich."
msgstr "Los saquean porque son ricos."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC36.rude:9
msgid "Right!  Er, uhh, yeah.  Hmmm."
msgstr "¡Exacto! Eh, esto... sí. Hmmm."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC36.rude:9
msgid "They're rich because they're smart."
msgstr "Son ricos porque son listos."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC360.rude:1
msgid ""
"Nope.  Nothing exciting has happened around here for a long time.  It's terribly boring."
msgstr ""
"No. Hace mucho tiempo que no pasa nada emocionante por aquí. Es terriblemente aburrido."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC360.rude:3
msgid "It's so quiet here.  Too quiet."
msgstr "Esto está muy tranquilo. Demasiado tranquilo."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC361.rude:1
msgid "Would you like to hear how I tamed a dragon?"
msgstr "¿Queréis oír cómo domé a un dragón?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC361.rude:2
msgid "If you are ready, then I shall help."
msgstr "Si estáis preparados, os ayudaré."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC361.rude:2
msgid "We'd like to Grandmaster in Spear."
msgstr "Queremos ser Grandes Maestros en Lanza."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC361.rude:3
msgid ""
"There's an artifact called Einherjar that is rumored to exist.  If you find yourself with it, be careful.  It is said that it can cause you to lose your mind."
msgstr ""
"Se rumorea que existe un artefacto llamado Einherjar. Si llegáis a tenerlo, tened cuidado. Dicen que puede haceros perder la razón."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC362.rude:1
msgid "Do you know where it is?"
msgstr "¿Sabes dónde está?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC362.rude:1
msgid ""
"No.  The time I held it in my hands I was in Guberland.  I heard that someone named the Dook was looking for it, though"
msgstr ""
"No. Cuando lo tuve en mis manos, estaba en Guberland. Pero he oído que alguien llamado el Dook lo andaba buscando"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC362.rude:2
msgid ""
"I once held Everstrike in my hands.  Me!  I held Everstrike!  I should have kept it."
msgstr ""
"Una vez tuve Golpe Eterno en mis manos. ¡Yo! ¡Tuve Golpe Eterno! Debería habérmelo quedado."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC362.rude:3
msgid "If you think you are ready, I can help."
msgstr "Si creéis que estáis preparados, puedo ayudaros."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC362.rude:3
msgid "We'd like to Grandmaster in Bow"
msgstr "Queremos ser Grandes Maestros en Arco"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC362.rude:4
msgid ""
"If you can find it, Everstrike is the best bow that exists!  It never misses!"
msgstr ""
"Si conseguís encontrarlo, ¡Golpe Eterno es el mejor arco que existe! ¡Nunca falla!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC362.rude:6
msgid "I held it in my hands!  Me!  I wish I would have kept it."
msgstr "¡Lo tuve en mis manos! ¡Yo! Ojalá me lo hubiera quedado."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC362.rude:6
msgid "What do you know about Everstrike?"
msgstr "¿Qué sabes de Golpe Eterno?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC363.rude:1
msgid ""
"In life, for a time I followed the Temple of Honk.  When I got here, I actually got to meet The Great Honk.  You can too!  He's in the Hall of the Gods!"
msgstr ""
"En vida seguí durante un tiempo al Templo de Honk. Cuando llegué aquí, ¡llegué a conocer al Gran Honk en persona! ¡Vosotros también podéis! ¡Está en el Salón de los Dioses!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC363.rude:3
msgid ""
"I can't really say much about them, except The Great Honk was a little overrated."
msgstr ""
"No puedo decir gran cosa de ellos, salvo que el Gran Honk estaba un poco sobrevalorado."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC364.rude:1
msgid ""
"What happens now?  I mean what's after death?  Is there anything more to us than this?"
msgstr ""
"¿Qué pasa ahora? Quiero decir, ¿qué hay después de la muerte? ¿Somos algo más que esto?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC364.rude:3
msgid ""
"I often spend my time talking philosophy with the other patrons.  I really would like to discuss it with Skraelos, but he'll never give me any of his time."
msgstr ""
"Suelo pasar el tiempo hablando de filosofía con los demás clientes. Me encantaría hablarlo con Skraelos, pero nunca me dedicará ni un minuto."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC365.rude:1
msgid ""
"I can't believe I'm here!  I thought I was going to have to light the Six Fires!"
msgstr ""
"¡No puedo creer que esté aquí! ¡Pensaba que tendría que encender los Seis Fuegos!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC365.rude:3
msgid ""
"When I was laying on my deathbed I feared that I was going to go to the Afterworld.  That is a horrible place.  I was afraid of lighting the Six Fires of Penance."
msgstr ""
"Cuando yacía en mi lecho de muerte, temía acabar en El Más Allá. Es un lugar horrible. Me daba miedo tener que encender los Seis Fuegos de la Penitencia."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC366.rude:1
msgid ""
"I came here with my father Dain.  We were both taken with the same illness.  I think Skraelos had a reason for bringing us here.  He won't tell us, though."
msgstr ""
"Vine aquí con mi padre, Dain. Los dos nos contagiamos de la misma enfermedad. Creo que Skraelos tenía un motivo para traernos aquí. Pero no nos lo quiere decir."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC366.rude:3
msgid "I'm certain that he has a reason for bringing my father and me here."
msgstr ""
"Estoy seguro de que tiene un motivo para habernos traído aquí a mi padre y a mí."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC366.rude:3
msgid "What do you know about Skarelos?"
msgstr "¿Qué sabes de Skraelos?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC367.rude:1
msgid ""
"I tried to go through the Dark Passageway.  It was too dark for me!  I was afraid of getting eaten!"
msgstr ""
"Intenté atravesar el Pasadizo Oscuro. ¡Estaba demasiado oscuro para mí! ¡Me daba miedo que me devoraran!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC367.rude:3
msgid ""
"I really want to visit them!  They are the ones who decide fate.  I want to know what is my fate?"
msgstr ""
"¡Tengo muchas ganas de visitarlas! Son ellas quienes deciden el destino. ¡Quiero saber cuál es mi destino!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC368.rude:1
msgid ""
"Believe it or not, when I was alive, I was a historian for the Half-Orcs."
msgstr ""
"Aunque no lo creáis, cuando estaba vivo fui historiador de los semiorcos."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC368.rude:3
msgid "Nothing you can't learn from being here for twenty years."
msgstr "Nada que no podáis aprender pasando aquí veinte años."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC369.rude:3
msgid "Nothing.  I was a clerk!"
msgstr "Nada. ¡Yo era escribiente!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC369.rude:5
msgid "My pleasure."
msgstr "Ha sido un placer."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC37.rude:1
msgid ""
"Is that what you think?  IF you think you're ready, Then we shall see."
msgstr "¿Eso creéis? SI creéis que estáis preparados, entonces ya veremos."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC37.rude:1
msgid "We'd like to become Grandmasters in Cudgel."
msgstr "Queremos ser Grandes Maestros en Garrote."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC37.rude:2 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC39.rude:4 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC51.rude:20
msgid "Maybe we could ask you something else."
msgstr "Quizá podríamos preguntarte otra cosa."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC37.rude:2
msgid "Ok."
msgstr "Vale."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC37.rude:3
msgid "Who cares!"
msgstr "¡A quién le importa!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC37.rude:4
msgid "Sorry.  Could we ask you something?"
msgstr "Perdona. ¿Podemos preguntarte algo?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC37.rude:4
msgid "You could ask.  Don't think I'll answer it, though"
msgstr "Podéis preguntar. Pero no creáis que voy a responder"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC37.rude:10 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC37.rude:11 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC37.rude:5
msgid "Shove off!"
msgstr "¡Largo!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC37.rude:6
msgid "That'll make you rich quick!"
msgstr "¡Eso os hará ricos en un santiamén!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC37.rude:7
msgid "None of your business!"
msgstr "¡No es asunto vuestro!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC37.rude:7
msgid "What is it that you have to do?"
msgstr "¿Qué es lo que tienes que hacer?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC37.rude:8
msgid "If you don't leave me alone, You'll be finding all about it!"
msgstr "Si no me dejáis en paz, ¡vais a descubrirlo en carne propia!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC37.rude:8
msgid "What do you know about the Afterworld?"
msgstr "¿Qué sabes de El Más Allá?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC37.rude:9
msgid "Could we ask you something?"
msgstr "¿Podemos preguntarte algo?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC37.rude:9
msgid "You could ask.  Don't expect me to answer!"
msgstr "Podéis preguntar. ¡Pero no esperéis que responda!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC370.rude:1
msgid ""
"I've heard that when Njam is here, most of the gods refuse to talk to him."
msgstr ""
"He oído que, cuando Njam está aquí, la mayoría de los dioses se niegan a hablar con él."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC370.rude:3
msgid ""
"They seem to get along with each other.  All of them except for Njam.  He's rarely here, though."
msgstr ""
"Parecen llevarse bien entre ellos. Todos menos Njam. Aunque casi nunca está aquí."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC371.rude:1
msgid ""
"Do you think Krohn and Fre are married?  I remember my mother saying something about that when I was little.  I don't remember though, and I'm afraid to ask them."
msgstr ""
"¿Creéis que Krohn y Fre están casados? Recuerdo que mi madre decía algo de eso cuando era pequeña. Pero no lo recuerdo bien, y me da miedo preguntárselo."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC371.rude:3
msgid ""
"It's nothing like my mother described.  I looked for her when I first got here, but I never found her.  I wonder if she went to Hallenhalt?"
msgstr ""
"No se parece en nada a lo que describía mi madre. La busqué cuando llegué aquí, pero nunca la encontré. ¿Habrá ido a Hallenhalt?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC372.rude:1
msgid ""
"Oh, I miss the days of battle.  I long for the clang of swords!  Old age didn't treat me well!"
msgstr ""
"Ay, cómo echo de menos los días de batalla. ¡Añoro el entrechocar de las espadas! ¡La vejez no me trató bien!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC372.rude:3
msgid ""
"If you wrote down everything I knew about adventuring in life, the volumes would fill all of Hallenhalt.  Alas, old age caught up with me, and I cannot remember any of it."
msgstr ""
"Si escribierais todo lo que sabía de aventuras en vida, los volúmenes llenarían todo Hallenhalt. Por desgracia, la vejez me alcanzó y no recuerdo nada de nada."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC373.rude:1
msgid ""
"I wrestled with Old Angus last week.  He wupped me good!  I didn't think someone that old could wrestle like that!"
msgstr ""
"La semana pasada luché con el Viejo Angus. ¡Me dio una buena paliza! ¡No pensaba que alguien tan viejo pudiera luchar así!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC373.rude:3
msgid ""
"I was a soldier in life.  I was killed in Lachmon Cove.  I don't know if you want advice from me!"
msgstr ""
"En vida fui soldado. Me mataron en la Cala de Lachmon. ¡No sé si queréis consejos míos!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC374.rude:1
msgid "Not unless you want to hear about the crosshook."
msgstr "No, a menos que queráis oír hablar del garfio cruzado."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC374.rude:3
msgid ""
"I can get a lot of work done now that I don't have my children bothering me every five minutes."
msgstr ""
"Ahora puedo hacer un montón de cosas, ya que no tengo a mis hijos molestándome cada cinco minutos."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC375.rude:1
msgid ""
"I was murdered by my own staff!  Oooh, when they get here, they will pay a lifetime for what they did to me!"
msgstr ""
"¡Me asesinó mi propio servicio! ¡Ooh, cuando lleguen aquí, pagarán toda una vida por lo que me hicieron!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC375.rude:3
msgid ""
"I was a linesman for a Thjorad mine in life.  I've heard that the men who pushed me down the shaft say it gave way and I fell.  Those dirty liars!  I can't wait until they get here!"
msgstr ""
"En vida fui capataz de vía en una mina de Thjorad. He oído que los hombres que me empujaron por el pozo dicen que el suelo cedió y me caí. ¡Malditos mentirosos! ¡Estoy deseando que lleguen aquí!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC375.rude:3
msgid "What do you know about life?"
msgstr "¿Qué sabes de la vida?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC376.rude:1
msgid ""
"I worked in the Refinery in the Thjorad Mine for years.  I still can't get all the soot off my face, and I'm dead!"
msgstr ""
"Trabajé durante años en la Refinería de la Mina de Thjorad. ¡Todavía no consigo quitarme todo el hollín de la cara, y eso que estoy muerto!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC376.rude:3
msgid ""
"I need a good bath!  I wish there was a place to take one around here!"
msgstr ""
"¡Necesito un buen baño! ¡Ojalá hubiera un sitio por aquí donde darse uno!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC377.rude:1 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC377.rude:2 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC377.rude:3
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/TOPBLURB.rude:377
msgid "Honk!"
msgstr "¡Honk!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC377.rude:1
msgid "We'll take that as a yes."
msgstr "Lo tomaremos como un sí."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC377.rude:2
msgid "Are you the Great Honk?"
msgstr "¿Eres el Gran Honk?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC378.rude:2
msgid "Very well.  We shall go."
msgstr "Muy bien. Iremos."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC378.rude:3
msgid ""
"It is not for you to ask why!  Your duty is to go!  From what I understand, however, all of you are to answer to him for what you have done!"
msgstr ""
"¡No os corresponde preguntar por qué! ¡Vuestro deber es ir! Aunque, por lo que tengo entendido, ¡todos vosotros tendréis que responder ante él por lo que habéis hecho!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC378.rude:3
msgid "What?  Why?"
msgstr "¿Qué? ¿Por qué?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC378.rude:4
msgid "Great news!  I will tell her!"
msgstr "¡Excelentes noticias! ¡Se lo diré!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC378.rude:4
msgid "We must stop this!  Tell Kira we'll find a way to stop the war!"
msgstr ""
"¡Tenemos que detener esto! ¡Dile a Kira que encontraremos la manera de detener la guerra!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC378.rude:5
msgid ""
"I've been sent by Kira the Cold.  It's about Sturmford and Drangheim.  They've gone to war against each other."
msgstr ""
"Me envía Kira la Fría. Se trata de Sturmford y Drangheim. Han entrado en guerra entre sí."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC378.rude:6
msgid "Your group and Tamur Leng have been summoned to stand before Krohn."
msgstr "Vuestro grupo y Tamur Leng habéis sido convocados ante Krohn."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC378.rude:7
msgid ""
"They both claim that the other committed acts of war against them while under the guise of uniting against the Beldonian Hordes."
msgstr ""
"Los dos afirman que el otro cometió actos de guerra contra ellos bajo el pretexto de unirse contra las Hordas Beldonianas."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC378.rude:7
msgid "What?!  Why?"
msgstr "¿¡Qué!? ¿Por qué?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC379.rude:1
msgid ""
"I've come here to pray for the release of my family.  The invaders attacked my town and took them captive!  I was lucky to escape!"
msgstr ""
"He venido a rezar por la liberación de mi familia. ¡Los invasores atacaron mi pueblo y se los llevaron cautivos! ¡Yo tuve suerte de escapar!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC379.rude:3
msgid ""
"Nothing!  I just got here!  But I've heard that the things you pray for here often come true."
msgstr ""
"¡Nada! ¡Acabo de llegar! Pero he oído que lo que se pide aquí en las oraciones a menudo se cumple."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC38.rude:10
msgid ""
"Not much of our history is left from before the Great Cataclysm.  Our culture and our clans were all scattered to the Great Winds.  If it weren't for Ekan'dia and the Great Migrations, we probably would have been destroyed."
msgstr ""
"No queda gran cosa de nuestra historia anterior al Gran Cataclismo. Nuestra cultura y nuestros clanes fueron dispersados a los Grandes Vientos. Si no fuera por Ekan'dia y las Grandes Migraciones, probablemente habríamos sido destruidos."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC38.rude:10 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC39.rude:6
msgid "What do you know about the history of the Half-Orcs?"
msgstr "¿Qué sabes de la historia de los semiorcos?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC38.rude:11
msgid ""
"Thjorgard is my home now.  Though once in a while I feel a great longing to be back to the Half-Orc lands."
msgstr ""
"Ahora Thjorgard es mi hogar. Aunque de vez en cuando siento una gran añoranza por volver a las tierras de los semiorcos."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC38.rude:11
msgid "What can you tell us about Thjorgard?"
msgstr "¿Qué nos puedes contar de Thjorgard?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC38.rude:12
msgid "Can we ask you something?"
msgstr "¿Podemos preguntarte algo?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC38.rude:12
msgid "Go ahead"
msgstr "Adelante"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC38.rude:13
msgid "Is that some sort of fish?"
msgstr "¿Es una especie de pez?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC38.rude:3
msgid ""
"Many cultures were destroyed in the Great Cataclysm.  I consider us fortunate to have survived at all."
msgstr ""
"Muchas culturas fueron destruidas en el Gran Cataclismo. Me considero afortunado de que hayamos sobrevivido siquiera."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC38.rude:3
msgid "That is very sad indeed."
msgstr "Es muy triste, sin duda."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC38.rude:4
msgid ""
"Most of what was the Half-Orc lands is now buried under the sea.  The rest is lost.  Even if we knew where our ancestral lands were, I doubt we could live there anymore."
msgstr ""
"La mayor parte de lo que fueron las tierras de los semiorcos está ahora bajo el mar. El resto se ha perdido. Aunque supiéramos dónde estaban nuestras tierras ancestrales, dudo que pudiéramos seguir viviendo allí."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC38.rude:4
msgid "Why don't you go back?"
msgstr "¿Por qué no vuelves?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC38.rude:5
msgid ""
"She is the leader of what was called the Dia Clan.  They were the only clan who's name survived the Great Cataclysm.  She lead us out from the brink of destruction."
msgstr ""
"Es la líder de lo que se llamó el Clan Dia. Fue el único clan cuyo nombre sobrevivió al Gran Cataclismo. Ella nos sacó del borde de la destrucción."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC38.rude:5
msgid "Who is Ekan'dia?"
msgstr "¿Quién es Ekan'dia?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC38.rude:8
msgid ""
"The Great Migration is what we named the exodus from the dying Half-Orcish lands.  After the Great Cataclysm, our farmlands turned to dust, our forests were emptied and our rivers dried up.  Ekan'dia led us out of all of that."
msgstr ""
"La Gran Migración es el nombre que dimos al éxodo desde las moribundas tierras de los semiorcos. Tras el Gran Cataclismo, nuestras tierras de labranza se convirtieron en polvo, nuestros bosques se vaciaron y nuestros ríos se secaron. Ekan'dia nos sacó de todo aquello."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC38.rude:8
msgid "What is the Great Migration?"
msgstr "¿Qué es la Gran Migración?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC38.rude:14 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC38.rude:15 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC38.rude:9
msgid "May your flame never be snuffed."
msgstr "Que tu llama nunca se apague."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC38.rude:9 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC39.rude:7
msgid "Thanks for the chat."
msgstr "Gracias por la charla."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC380.rude:1
msgid ""
"I've heard that the relic can do some miraculous things!  I've seen it, and it's beautiful!"
msgstr ""
"¡He oído que la reliquia puede hacer cosas milagrosas! La he visto, ¡y es preciosa!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC380.rude:3
msgid ""
"I'm here to see the relic.  I've got a bad case of leg cramps, and I hope that the relic will cure me."
msgstr ""
"He venido a ver la reliquia. Tengo unos calambres en las piernas terribles y espero que la reliquia me cure."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC381.rude:1
msgid ""
"That relic just didn't look right.  It's been a long time since I saw it last, but I don't remember it looking like that.  I wonder if I'm going crazy?"
msgstr ""
"Esa reliquia no tenía buen aspecto. Hace mucho que no la veía, pero no recuerdo que fuera así. ¿Me estaré volviendo loco?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC381.rude:3
msgid ""
"This is my third pilgrimage.  I think maybe I should pray to keep my sanity.  I think I'm going crazy."
msgstr ""
"Esta es mi tercera peregrinación. Creo que quizá debería rezar para conservar la cordura. Creo que me estoy volviendo loco."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC382.rude:2
msgid ""
"Wonderful!  Here's your money.  I have it, I have it!  I have the Fizbin of Good Fortune!!"
msgstr ""
"¡Maravilloso! Aquí tenéis vuestro dinero. ¡Lo tengo, lo tengo! ¡¡Tengo el Fizbin de la Buena Fortuna!!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC382.rude:3
msgid ""
"You've got the Fizbin!!  You wanna sell it?  Huh, do ya?  How much?  I'll give you a lot!  I've got some saved up.  How's 40,000 sound to you?  Good?"
msgstr ""
"¡¡Tenéis el Fizbin!! ¿Me lo vendéis? ¿Eh, me lo vendéis? ¿Cuánto? ¡Os daré mucho! Tengo algo ahorrado. ¿Qué tal suenan 40.000? ¿Bien?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC382.rude:4
msgid ""
"I've come from a long way away!  I'm here to pray for the health of my father.  He's been sick, and I don't know what I would do without him!"
msgstr ""
"¡Vengo de muy lejos! He venido a rezar por la salud de mi padre. Está enfermo, ¡y no sé qué haría sin él!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC382.rude:5
msgid "Suit yourself, but I still think it's a lot of money!"
msgstr "Como queráis, ¡pero sigo pensando que es mucho dinero!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC382.rude:6
msgid ""
"My father asked me to come here.  He's very sick, and I am going to pray for him to get well.  He always told me it was beautiful, but his words didn't do it justice.  I think this is the most beautiful place I have ever been to."
msgstr ""
"Mi padre me pidió que viniera. Está muy enfermo, y voy a rezar para que se cure. Siempre me decía que este lugar era precioso, pero sus palabras no le hacían justicia. Creo que es el lugar más bonito en el que he estado nunca."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC383.rude:1
msgid "It's a long trip from Freetown!  I hope this relic is worth it!"
msgstr ""
"¡Es un viaje muy largo desde Freetown! ¡Espero que esta reliquia merezca la pena!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC383.rude:3
msgid "Nothing!  I'm from Framon."
msgstr "¡Nada! Soy de Framon."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC383.rude:4
msgid "Farewell, traveler!"
msgstr "¡Adiós, viajero!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC384.rude:1
msgid ""
"I fought in the arena once.  I was nearly killed!  It would figure that the thing I fought was ten times stronger than me.  The only reason I lived was because I jumped into the stands and ran away!"
msgstr ""
"Una vez luché en la arena. ¡Casi me matan! Cómo no, la criatura contra la que luché era diez veces más fuerte que yo. ¡Si sobreviví fue solo porque salté a las gradas y salí corriendo!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC384.rude:2
msgid "If you are qualified, very well."
msgstr "Si estáis cualificados, muy bien."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC384.rude:2
msgid "We'd like to become Grandmaster in Thrown Weapons."
msgstr "Queremos ser Grandes Maestros en Armas Arrojadizas."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC384.rude:3
msgid ""
"Trolleri is the dagger you want.  It has enchantments on it that the Thjoradric smiths only dream of."
msgstr ""
"Trolleri es la daga que buscáis. Tiene encantamientos con los que los herreros de Thjorad solo pueden soñar."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC385.rude:1
msgid ""
"Fjarkskafinn the Still-alive challenged me to a duel.  Boy is she going to get it!"
msgstr ""
"Fjarkskafinn el Todavía Vivo me ha retado a un duelo. ¡Vaya si se va a llevar su merecido!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC385.rude:2
msgid "If you are worthy, I shall help you with that."
msgstr "Si sois dignos, os ayudaré con eso."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC385.rude:2
msgid "We'd like to become Grandmasters in Unarmed."
msgstr "Queremos ser Grandes Maestros en Desarmado."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC385.rude:3
msgid ""
"The true adventurer needs neither steel nor spell to survive.  What he was born with is enough."
msgstr ""
"El verdadero aventurero no necesita ni acero ni hechizos para sobrevivir. Le basta con aquello con lo que nació."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC386.rude:1
msgid ""
"That Sigre Bjarnidotir said I smelled like a goat!  What else could I do?  I challenged her to a duel.  Boy is she going to pay!"
msgstr ""
"¡Esa Sigre Bjarnidotir dijo que olía a cabra! ¿Qué otra cosa podía hacer? La reté a un duelo. ¡Vaya si me las va a pagar!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC386.rude:2
msgid "If you are worthy, I shall help you."
msgstr "Si sois dignos, os ayudaré."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC386.rude:2
msgid "We'd like to become Grandmasters in Armor."
msgstr "Queremos ser Grandes Maestros en Armadura."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC386.rude:3
msgid ""
"I've heard of this magical armor known as Poltergeist it is said to be made of the chains that bind ghosts to this world."
msgstr ""
"He oído hablar de una armadura mágica conocida como Poltergeist. Se dice que está hecha con las cadenas que atan a los fantasmas a este mundo."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC386.rude:6
msgid "lank"
msgstr "Adiós."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC387.rude:1
msgid ""
"I was in the tavern the other day, and I had some beer from Frosgard.  Boy was it awful!"
msgstr ""
"El otro día estuve en la taberna y tomé cerveza de Frosgard. ¡Vaya si era horrible!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC387.rude:2
msgid "If you are worthy, I can help."
msgstr "Si sois dignos, puedo ayudaros."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC387.rude:2
msgid "We'd like to become Grandmasters in Shield."
msgstr "Queremos ser Grandes Maestros en Escudo."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC387.rude:3
msgid ""
"There is a shield called Arrowfoe that was carried by Hrothgar Krohnssen.  With it, it is said you cannot be harmed by arrows."
msgstr ""
"Hay un escudo llamado Enemigo de Flechas que llevó Hrothgar Krohnssen. Se dice que con él las flechas no pueden haceros daño."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC387.rude:3 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC80.rude:7
msgid "What do you know about artifacts?"
msgstr "¿Qué sabes de artefactos?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC388.rude:1
msgid "Do you really want to know who I was dating last night?"
msgstr "¿De verdad queréis saber con quién salí anoche?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC388.rude:2
msgid "We'd like to become Grandmasters in Dodge."
msgstr "Queremos ser Grandes Maestros en Esquivar."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC388.rude:2
msgid "You think you're quick enough for that, do you?  We shall see!"
msgstr ""
"Conque creéis que sois lo bastante rápidos para eso, ¿eh? ¡Ya veremos!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC388.rude:3
msgid "Stay on your toes, and you will stay alive."
msgstr "Estad siempre alerta y seguiréis con vida."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC389.rude:1
msgid "No kidding."
msgstr "No me digas."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC389.rude:1
msgid ""
"Yeah!  Unless you are modulating, but then you would have to borrow a chord from another key to become the tonic in the new key.  But then you would still resolve to the dominant of the new key!"
msgstr ""
"¡Sí! A no ser que estés modulando, pero entonces tendrías que tomar prestado un acorde de otra tonalidad para que se convierta en la tónica de la nueva tonalidad. ¡Pero aun así resolverías en la dominante de la nueva tonalidad!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC389.rude:2
msgid "Did you learn anything?"
msgstr "¿Aprendiste algo?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC389.rude:2
msgid ""
"Of course!  Did you know that the tonic in its second inversion is supposed to resolve to the dominant?"
msgstr ""
"¡Por supuesto! ¿Sabíais que la tónica en segunda inversión debe resolver en la dominante?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC389.rude:3
msgid ""
"I wanted to be a musician, but my father wouldn't have it.  I snuck out while he was gone and went to music school anyway."
msgstr ""
"Quería ser músico, pero mi padre no lo consentía. Me escapé mientras él estaba fuera y fui a la escuela de música de todos modos."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC389.rude:4 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC389.rude:6
msgid "If you have quick hands and good eyes, I can help you."
msgstr "Si tenéis manos rápidas y buena vista, puedo ayudaros."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC389.rude:4 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC394.rude:2
msgid "We'd like to become Experts in Thrown Weapons."
msgstr "Queremos ser Expertos en Armas Arrojadizas."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC389.rude:5 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC394.rude:3
msgid "Find Thorfinn Quickeye in Thjorgard.  He will help."
msgstr "Buscad a Thorfinn Ojovivo en Thjorgard. Él os ayudará."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC389.rude:5 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC394.rude:3
msgid "Where can we become Grandmasters in Thrown Weapons?"
msgstr "¿Dónde podemos llegar a Grandes Maestros en Armas Arrojadizas?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC389.rude:6 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC394.rude:4
msgid "We'd like to become Masters in Thrown Weapons."
msgstr "Queremos ser Maestros en Armas Arrojadizas."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC389.rude:7
msgid ""
"It gets lonely out there.  If I were you, I'd hire a musician to keep me company."
msgstr ""
"Ahí fuera uno se siente muy solo. Yo que vosotros contrataría a un músico para que me hiciera compañía."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC39.rude:1
msgid "Do you think you're ready?  If so, I can help."
msgstr "¿Creéis que estáis preparados? Si es así, puedo ayudaros."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC39.rude:1
msgid "We'd like to become Grandmasters in Armsmaster."
msgstr "Queremos ser Grandes Maestros en Maestro Armero."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC39.rude:10
msgid ""
"They resent the people of Thronheim for invading their lands.  I have a cousin who lives in Thronheim.  She says the Framish are trying to push out all the Thronish out of Framon and back to Thronheim."
msgstr ""
"Les guardan rencor a los de Thronheim por invadir sus tierras. Tengo una prima que vive en Thronheim. Dice que los frameses intentan expulsar a todos los throneses de Framon y devolverlos a Thronheim."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC39.rude:11
msgid "May your flame never die."
msgstr "Que tu llama nunca muera."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC39.rude:2
msgid ""
"I don't know.  Maybe they have richer lands there.  My father always said that the Pa'pans were farmers before the Great Cataclysm.  I'm not sure I believe him, though."
msgstr ""
"No lo sé. Quizá allí tengan tierras más ricas. Mi padre siempre decía que los Pa'pan eran granjeros antes del Gran Cataclismo. Aunque no estoy seguro de creerle."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC39.rude:2
msgid "Why are the Thronish moving into Framon?"
msgstr "¿Por qué se están trasladando los throneses a Framon?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC39.rude:3
msgid "Further than Thronheim?  I've got a cousin who lives in Thronheim."
msgstr "¿Más allá de Thronheim? Tengo una prima que vive en Thronheim."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC39.rude:3
msgid "It's a place far to the west."
msgstr "Es un lugar muy lejano, al oeste."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC39.rude:5
msgid ""
"She taught them to survive without their farmlands.  She taught them their native tongue.  If it weren't for her, the flame of the Half-Orc would have been snuffed forever."
msgstr ""
"Les enseñó a sobrevivir sin sus tierras de labranza. Les enseñó su lengua materna. Si no fuera por ella, la llama de los semiorcos se habría extinguido para siempre."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC39.rude:6
msgid ""
"Most of their culture has been destroyed.  They are blessed to have Ekan'dia, who led them out of the dying Half-Orc lands."
msgstr ""
"Gran parte de su cultura ha sido destruida. Tienen la bendición de contar con Ekan'dia, que los sacó de las moribundas tierras de los semiorcos."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC39.rude:7
msgid "May your flame never go out, friend."
msgstr "Que tu llama nunca se apague, amigo."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC39.rude:8
msgid "Never heard of it.  What is it?"
msgstr "Nunca he oído hablar de eso. ¿Qué es?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC39.rude:9
msgid "We'd like to ask you about something."
msgstr "Queremos preguntarte algo."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC390.rude:1
msgid ""
"I've heard that you can use grapes to fight nagate.  Apparently they can't really digest the grape seeds."
msgstr ""
"He oído que se pueden usar uvas para luchar contra los nagates. Por lo visto no consiguen digerir las pepitas de uva."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC390.rude:2 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC390.rude:4
msgid "You think you are ready?  Very well."
msgstr "¿Creéis que estáis preparados? Muy bien."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC390.rude:3
msgid "Where can we become Grandmasters in Armsmaster"
msgstr "¿Dónde podemos llegar a Grandes Maestros en Maestro Armero?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC391.rude:1
msgid "Stay away from those sewers!  There's nasty stuff down there!!"
msgstr ""
"¡No os acerquéis a esas cloacas! ¡¡Ahí abajo hay cosas muy desagradables!!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC391.rude:2 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC391.rude:4 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC396.rude:2
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC396.rude:4
msgid "If you are skilled enough."
msgstr "Si tenéis la habilidad suficiente."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC391.rude:5
msgid ""
"Plenty.  I can show you how to make your fists as powerful as someone else's swords!"
msgstr ""
"Muchísimo. ¡Puedo enseñaros a hacer que vuestros puños sean tan poderosos como las espadas de otros!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC392.rude:1
msgid ""
"When I woke up yesterday, there was a snake in my bed.  I picked it up and put it in my brother's bed.  He screamed like a baby!!"
msgstr ""
"Cuando me desperté ayer, había una serpiente en mi cama. La cogí y la metí en la cama de mi hermano. ¡¡Gritó como un bebé!!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC392.rude:2 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC392.rude:3
msgid "If you are skilled, I shall help you."
msgstr "Si sois hábiles, os ayudaré."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC392.rude:2 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC395.rude:2
msgid "We'd like to become Experts in Armor."
msgstr "Queremos ser Expertos en Armadura."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC392.rude:3 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC395.rude:4
msgid "We'd like to become Masters in Armor."
msgstr "Queremos ser Maestros en Armadura."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC392.rude:4 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC395.rude:3
msgid "Go to Thjorgard and find Fjarkskafinn the Still-alive."
msgstr "Id a Thjorgard y buscad a Fjarkskafinn el Todavía Vivo."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC392.rude:4 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC395.rude:3
msgid "Where can we become Grandmasters in Armor?"
msgstr "¿Dónde podemos llegar a Grandes Maestros en Armadura?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC392.rude:5
msgid ""
"The more you practice in your armor, the more it will become like a second skin."
msgstr ""
"Cuanto más practiquéis con la armadura puesta, más se convertirá en una segunda piel."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC393.rude:1
msgid ""
"I heard that the docks were built by giants!  Do you think that's true?"
msgstr ""
"¡He oído que los muelles los construyeron gigantes! ¿Creéis que es verdad?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC393.rude:2 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC393.rude:4
msgid "If you meet the qualifications."
msgstr "Si cumplís los requisitos."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC393.rude:2 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC396.rude:2
msgid "We'd like to become Experts in Shield."
msgstr "Queremos ser Expertos en Escudo."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC393.rude:3 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC396.rude:3
msgid "Halfdan the Hidden in Thjorgard will help you."
msgstr "Halfdan el Oculto, en Thjorgard, os ayudará."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC393.rude:3 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC396.rude:3
msgid "Where can we become Grandmasters in Shield?"
msgstr "¿Dónde podemos llegar a Grandes Maestros en Escudo?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC393.rude:4 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC396.rude:4
msgid "We'd like to become Masters in Shield."
msgstr "Queremos ser Maestros en Escudo."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC393.rude:5
msgid ""
"Don't waste your time putting a weapon in your off hand.  It makes your attacks too slow."
msgstr ""
"No perdáis el tiempo llevando un arma en la mano secundaria. Hace que vuestros ataques sean demasiado lentos."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC393.rude:7
msgid "Farwell."
msgstr "Adiós."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC394.rude:1
msgid "You make fun of my height and I'll wallop you one."
msgstr "Burlaos de mi estatura y os daré una buena tunda."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC394.rude:2 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC394.rude:4
msgid "I might be able to help."
msgstr "Puede que pueda ayudaros."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC394.rude:5
msgid "Attacking from range is the safest way to fight."
msgstr "Atacar a distancia es la forma más segura de luchar."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC395.rude:1
msgid ""
"I fought against Sturmford's General Ivsar during the war.  I think it's a shame that we've kept such an able soldier in prison for so long."
msgstr ""
"Luché contra el general Ivsar de Sturmford durante la guerra. Me parece una vergüenza que hayamos tenido a un soldado tan capaz en prisión durante tanto tiempo."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC395.rude:2 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC395.rude:4
msgid "I can help you, if you possess the skill."
msgstr "Puedo ayudaros, si tenéis la habilidad."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC395.rude:5
msgid "If you want to stay alive, get the best armor you can afford."
msgstr ""
"Si queréis seguir con vida, conseguid la mejor armadura que podáis pagar."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC396.rude:1
msgid ""
"Keep that shield between you and your opponent.  It doesn't do you any good on the ground."
msgstr ""
"Mantened ese escudo entre vosotros y vuestro adversario. En el suelo no os sirve de nada."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC396.rude:6
msgid "Certainly.  Farewell."
msgstr "Por supuesto. Adiós."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC396.rude:7
