#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/events/maps/anskramkeep.lua:416
msgid ""
"Memorandum to all Soldiers\n"
"\n"
"The Drangheim threat has not been abated.  We need to keep to our watches in case they rise up again.  Just because we've sent General Ivsar's army out to meet the Drangheim army does not guarantee that we'll be successful.  Anyone caught sleeping on duty will receive a public beating from me personally!\n"
"\n"
"Captain Wilhem"
msgstr ""
"Memorándum para todos los soldados\n"
"\n"
"La amenaza de Drangheim no ha remitido. Debemos mantener las guardias por si vuelven a alzarse. Que hayamos enviado el ejército del general Ivsar al encuentro del ejército de Drangheim no garantiza que vayamos a tener éxito. ¡Todo aquel que sea sorprendido durmiendo durante su guardia recibirá una paliza pública de mi propia mano!\n"
"\n"
"Capitán Wilhem"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/events/maps/anskramkeep.lua:417
msgid ""
"Letter to Captain\n"
"\n"
"Captain Wilhem,\n"
"As you know, I was ordered to bunk with Sergeant \"Stinky\" Wilans.  I beg that you have a shred of mercy in your soul and order my sleeping arrangements to be reassigned.  I will even sleep in the storage room!\n"
"\n"
"Corporal Smit"
msgstr ""
"Carta al capitán\n"
"\n"
"Capitán Wilhem:\n"
"Como sabéis, se me ordenó compartir catre con el sargento Wilans, alias \"el Apestoso\". Os suplico que tengáis una pizca de piedad en el alma y ordenéis que me asignen otro lugar para dormir. ¡Dormiría incluso en el almacén!\n"
"\n"
"Cabo Smit"

