# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/events/maps/guberlandcity.lua:220
msgid ""
"Letter to Sevanna\n"
"\n"
"My dearest Sevanna,\n"
"I had the most wonderful time last night.  Maybe I'm too soft for a warrior, but I have always been fond of the moonlit walks on the sand.  I hope it wasn't too much of a bother that I had to unlock my eyes from yours to slay that sea monster.  I'm also sorry I accidentally landed some of its ichor on your dress.  \n"
"\n"
"With all the hope in the world that I shall see you tomorrow,\n"
"Nurtigan"
msgstr ""
"Carta a Sevanna\n"
"\n"
"Mi queridísima Sevanna:\n"
"Anoche lo pasé de maravilla. Quizá sea demasiado tierno para ser guerrero, pero siempre me han gustado los paseos a la luz de la luna por la arena. Espero que no te molestara demasiado que tuviera que apartar mis ojos de los tuyos para matar a aquel monstruo marino. También siento haberte manchado sin querer el vestido con su icor.\n"
"\n"
"Con toda la esperanza del mundo de verte mañana,\n"
"Nurtigan"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/events/maps/guberlandcity.lua:221
msgid ""
"Letter to Nurtigan\n"
"\n"
"Sweet Nurtigan,\n"
"Our date yesterday was wonderful.  I really loved the way you dispatched that Nagate without even having to draw your sword.  Your skill with the sword is unmatched.  Please, feel free to call on me at any time.\n"
"\n"
"Your sweetkins,\n"
"Loriana"
msgstr ""
"Carta a Nurtigan\n"
"\n"
"Dulce Nurtigan:\n"
"Nuestra cita de ayer fue maravillosa. Me encantó cómo despachaste a aquel Nagate sin tener siquiera que desenvainar la espada. Tu habilidad con la espada no tiene igual. Por favor, ven a visitarme cuando quieras.\n"
"\n"
"Tu dulzura,\n"
"Loriana"

# machine translation (Claude), review
