# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/events/maps/tasaracademy.lua:192 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/events/maps/tasaracademy.lua:193
msgid ""
"Challenging Students\n"
"\n"
"As it has been said time and again, the unchallenged student will get lazy.  The way to prevent this is to keep the student from idleness.  A good instructor will surprise the student with tests, additional work, and failing all else, a good solid beating.  These forms of motivation have been proven time and again successful in creating a disciplined and hardy student."
msgstr ""
"Estimular a los alumnos\n"
"\n"
"Como se ha dicho una y otra vez, el alumno al que no se pone a prueba se vuelve perezoso. La forma de evitarlo es no dejar que el alumno caiga en la ociosidad. Un buen instructor sorprenderá al alumno con exámenes, trabajo adicional y, si todo lo demás falla, una buena paliza. Estas formas de motivación han demostrado una y otra vez su eficacia para formar alumnos disciplinados y resistentes."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/events/maps/tasaracademy.lua:194
msgid ""
"Student Memo\n"
"\n"
"To All Students:\n"
"The books on the pedestals are for instructors only!  If you attempt to read these books without knowing the proper sequence, you will be severely punished!\n"
"\n"
"Signed,\n"
"Willian J. Nortley\n"
"Headmaster"
msgstr ""
"Aviso a los alumnos\n"
"\n"
"A todos los alumnos:\n"
"¡Los libros de los pedestales son solo para los instructores! ¡Si intentáis leer estos libros sin conocer la secuencia correcta, seréis severamente castigados!\n"
"\n"
"Firmado,\n"
"Willian J. Nortley\n"
"Director"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/events/maps/tasaracademy.lua:195
msgid ""
"Artair Ordway\n"
"\n"
"..As Artair Ordway was the founder of the Ta'Sar Academy, it is only fitting that his statue is displayed prominently in the Trophy Room.  According to the documents, drinking from his cup will provide the warrior with his strength, but alas there are many cups in the Trophy Room.  It is also been said that woe be the soldier who tries, for drinking from the wrong cup will bring death a-knocking."
msgstr ""
"Artair Ordway\n"
"\n"
"...Como Artair Ordway fue el fundador de la Academia Ta'Sar, no es sino justo que su estatua ocupe un lugar destacado en la Sala de Trofeos. Según los documentos, beber de su copa otorgará al guerrero su fuerza, pero, por desgracia, hay muchas copas en la Sala de Trofeos. También se dice que ay del soldado que lo intente, pues beber de la copa equivocada hará que la muerte llame a su puerta."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/events/maps/tasaracademy.lua:196
msgid ""
"Gavin's Instructions\n"
"\n"
"Gavin,\n"
"I have pressing matters to attend to.  If you wish to see the Book of War Rules, please put these books back where they belong.  Once you have completed that, finding the Book of Rules should not be difficult.\n"
"\n"
"Sergeant Magnus"
msgstr ""
"Instrucciones para Gavin\n"
"\n"
"Gavin:\n"
"Tengo asuntos urgentes que atender. Si deseas ver el Libro de Reglas de la Guerra, vuelve a colocar estos libros en su sitio. Una vez hecho eso, encontrar el Libro de Reglas no debería ser difícil.\n"
"\n"
"Sargento Magnus"

