# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/events/maps/thjorgardcity.lua:235
msgid ""
"Invoice for services\n"
"\n"
"Brevan Ketilssen agrees to pay the sum of 400 gold for transportation of 10 lbs. of Elemental Thjorad."
msgstr ""
"Factura por servicios\n"
"\n"
"Brevan Ketilssen se compromete a pagar la suma de 400 monedas de oro por el transporte de 10 libras de Thjorad Elemental."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/events/maps/thjorgardcity.lua:236
msgid ""
"Letter to Eloise\n"
"\n"
"My dearest Eloise,\n"
"I know your father forbids our relationship, but I find myself thinking of you day after day.  Please, I implore you.  Meet me at our field in Thjorgard.  I have made plans to spirit away to Sturmford to be married.\n"
"My undying love,\n"
"Hrolf"
msgstr ""
"Carta a Eloise\n"
"\n"
"Mi queridísima Eloise:\n"
"Sé que tu padre prohíbe nuestra relación, pero me descubro pensando en ti día tras día. Por favor, te lo imploro. Reúnete conmigo en nuestro prado de Thjorgard. He planeado que huyamos en secreto a Sturmford para casarnos.\n"
"Mi amor eterno,\n"
"Hrolf"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/events/maps/thjorgardcity.lua:237
msgid ""
"Invoice\n"
