# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/events/maps/wizardslab.lua:427
msgid ""
"To All Wizards Studying Here\n"
"\n"
"I have, for the last time, woken up to a pile of deformed frogs in my washbasin.  Will whoever is responsible for these foul creatures please take care of their behavior?  I would hate for my Giant Magreeb to end up in your washbasin.  He doesn't like these frogs, and who knows how he will react to a constant stream of them.\n"
"\n"
"Hallin, Mage"
msgstr ""
"A todos los magos que estudian aquí\n"
"\n"
"Esta es la última vez que me despierto con un montón de ranas deformes en mi palangana. ¿Podría quien sea responsable de esas repugnantes criaturas hacer el favor de controlar su comportamiento? No me gustaría que mi Magreeb Gigante acabara en vuestra palangana. No le gustan esas ranas, y quién sabe cómo reaccionará ante un flujo constante de ellas.\n"
"\n"
"Hallin, Mago"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/events/maps/wizardslab.lua:428
msgid ""
"Formula\n"
"\n"
"16 toads, boiled.\n"
"27 lbs insect eyes (doesn't matter which insect)\n"
"4 gallons worm blood.\n"
"\n"
"Mix this mixture well while reciting the following chant, \"Ahal Natrax\".  Continue for four hours.  When complete, pour mixture into cube mold, and chill for four hours.\n"
"\n"
"Your Colloidal Cube should be then enchanted with the \"Restore Life\" spell."
msgstr ""
"Fórmula\n"
"\n"
"16 sapos, hervidos.\n"
"27 libras de ojos de insecto (da igual qué insecto)\n"
"4 galones de sangre de gusano.\n"
"\n"
"Remuévase bien esta mezcla mientras se recita el siguiente cántico: \"Ahal Natrax\". Continúese durante cuatro horas. Al terminar, viértase la mezcla en un molde cúbico y déjese enfriar durante cuatro horas.\n"
"\n"
"Después, el Cubo Coloidal deberá encantarse con el hechizo \"Restaurar Vida\"."

